window.AKK_HER_KINDERGARTEN_IS_FULL_OF_VILLAINOUS_STUDENTS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_HER_KINDERGARTEN_IS_FULL_OF_VILLAINOUS_STUDENTS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201: Refunded","paragraphs":["Shen Wei exchanged an exorbitant amount of points for the blueprint.","This blueprint was hidden in her spatial storage.","After the banquet ended, everyone was quite drunk.","It was Gu Qingyan who arranged for a driver to take everyone to a nearby hotel.","It had been a long time since she had seen Gu Qingyan; he had gotten darker and thinner.","But he also brought good news.","The second store was working overtime to catch up on progress.","It would be completed ahead of schedule.","The former young master of Gu Corporation had become more adept at dealing with people.","This time was just like that.","Originally, the old professors had invited everyone to the banquet, which Shen Wei had mentioned in the group chat.","Gu Qingyan hadn't participated in this dinner.","But he had thoughtfully prepared a driver and booked rooms. As soon as the banquet ended, he arranged for their accommodation.","Shen Wei didn't have to worry about a thing.","Seeing Shen Wei was somewhat touched, Gu Qingyan couldn't help but raise an eyebrow, and anyone could see that he was very satisfied with his arrangements.","But he still pretended to be nonchalant: \"It's nothing, that hotel belongs to my family anyway.\"","This time, he had reserved all the suites and the most expensive king-size rooms for hospitality.","To avoid having these people travel back to Starry Sky Kindergarten after dinner.","The other colleagues from the kindergarten also went to the hotel Gu Qingyan had arranged.","After all, it was the only five-star hotel in the city.","It was said that even during the off-season, the cheapest room was still over 2,000 yuan per night.","During peak season, the price would double or even triple.","This time, they also wanted to take advantage of the opportunity to experience it.","It was said that the bathroom brands inside were top-of-the-line in the industry.","Those kindergarten staff who lived in the city politely said: \"We won't go!\"","But Gu Qingyan directly said: \"The rooms have already been booked, you can just go directly.\"","Gu Qingyan's hospitality was hard to refuse, and they themselves were a bit eager to go. So they half-heartedly agreed.","Only Doctor Lu gave Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei an extra glance. He wanted to see if there was any gossip.","But he had drunk a bit too much.","Feeling dizzy, he could barely hold on.","Now he just wanted to find a warm place to sleep.","He left with regret.","The driver took everyone away.","Only Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan were left here.","Shen Wei had only had a few sips, feeling slightly tipsy.","The night was deep, and the lights were just coming on.","The warm light seemed to add a filter to Gu Qingyan's face.","Gu Qingyan was originally a very handsome type of man.","Now the light favored him even more.","After adding a layer of soft haze to his face, it became even more enchanting.","Shen Wei said: \"Why don't we take a walk along the street?\"","The gentle breeze caressing their cheeks felt quite comfortable.","Gu Qingyan had originally wanted to spend more time with Shen Wei, so he readily agreed to her suggestion.","The two of them walked along the street, the combination of a handsome man and a beautiful woman really catching people's eyes.","Shen Wei asked: \"Is it very hard for you over there?\"","\"It's alright!\" Gu Qingyan had indeed suffered quite a bit.","He was originally the youngest son in the family, the most pampered.","Moreover, with capable older brothers and sisters above him, if he were in ancient times, he would have been the type of wastrel son. It was only after meeting Shen Wei that he started wanting to strive for success.","He didn't know how to do anything.","Fortunately, he received strong support from his family.","His brother lent him this special assistant, who was very high-ranking.","If no one from the Gu family was present, he could act as the CEO.","Both his ability and tactics were top-notch.","Sending him to supervise Gu Qingyan was somewhat of a waste of talent.","But Gu Qingyan had really learned a lot from him.","Including breaking bad habits like not being able to get up early in the morning.","It was very difficult to start changing a habit formed over decades.","Moreover, he realized there was still so much he needed to learn.","It was certainly tough.","But Gu Qingyan never mentioned this in front of Shen Wei.","However, Shen Wei knew: \"When Starry Sky Kindergarten's second store opens, I'll give you shares.\"","Since Starry Sky became popular, many industry bigwigs wanted to throw money at her.","As long as Shen Wei was willing, with one word,","These bigwigs could even develop this brand into the largest chain of kindergartens in the country.","But Shen Wei had refused them all.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was absolutely controlled by Shen Wei.","Other bigwigs could sense Shen Wei's intentions, so they changed to making donations and providing support without compensation.","This time Shen Wei was willing to give out shares.","Gu Qingyan was also surprised.","He originally wanted to say something witty, but swallowed his words at the last moment.","What he wanted to say was: \"Could this be a betrothal gift?\"","But he was afraid she would deny it. So he casually talked about something else.","In the night, the two walked side by side.","After walking for two blocks, Shen Wei bought a drink from a vending machine by the road, took a few sips and said to Gu Qingyan: \"I'll head back first then, you should rest early too!\"","Gu Qingyan gave a soft \"Mm\" in response, his tone gentle.","When Gu Qingyan returned home and lay on his bed, he punched the air fiercely a couple of times, lamenting why he didn't have the courage earlier.","He kept muttering to himself.","Saying all the things he had wanted to say.","But in front of Shen Wei, he didn't dare say a word. Secret love was truly a tormenting thing.","...","Early the next morning, the science bigwigs woke up in the magnificent hotel.","The last scene they remembered was in the restaurant.","When they went out, they found that all their old friends were staying here too.","They visited each other's rooms.","Each had a different decoration theme, and every one was luxurious.","They usually didn't care much about clothing, food, accommodation or transportation. Even when they went out to give lectures, the hotels others booked for them were just ordinary standard rooms or deluxe standard rooms.","They had never stayed in such high-end presidential suites before.","And there were meeting rooms inside, with projectors and such that could be used.","Breakfast was in buffet style, very rich.","Any type of food you could think of, they had it here.","\"Goodness, how much does one night cost here?\" When the scientists heard the price at the front desk, they couldn't help but wince.","Oh my, they had really enjoyed a luxurious experience this time.","It was said that even the bathtubs here were massage bathtubs, costing hundreds of thousands.","Hearing this, the old professors collectively went back to their rooms to take a bath.","Might as well use it since it's free.","They never had the chance to use such things before.","By the time they came out, it was already noon.","Afterwards, the colleagues from Starry Sky Kindergarten all returned to work.","Only Doctor Lu was left to entertain the group.","They were all elderly, and the old professors asked Doctor Lu one after another: \"Can you help us book tickets?\"","They had to rely on young people to fiddle with smartphones.","Doctor Lu said: \"Sure, but you need to go back to the kindergarten first, Shen Wei has something to discuss with you.\"","\"What is it? Didn't we already have the farewell dinner?\" Everyone thought Starry Sky Kindergarten was going to treat them to another meal.","It wouldn't be interesting to keep inviting them for meals. Moreover, they had already imposed too much during this period.","Now that it was time to leave, they shouldn't linger anymore.","Otherwise, they really feared they wouldn't want to leave Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Doctor Lu said: \"It seems there's been some leads regarding the gaming pods.\"","\"What?\"","The old professors exclaimed in surprise.","Then they looked at each other and immediately stood up: \"Then let's go back now!\" They didn't want to wait even a minute longer."]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202: Dependence on Mountains","paragraphs":["The mad scientist who created the game pod disappeared and was never seen again.","Many people thought he had died.","After all, the last stretch of his disappearance led to a lake.","The search and rescue team dredged for a month without results.","This gave everyone a glimmer of hope.","But the person still couldn't be found.","When everyone had given up hope, they abandoned the pursuit of the creator.","Instead, they turned their attention to studying the game pod.","However, this device was incredibly intricate.","And they couldn't violently dismantle it without damage.","They were all elites in their field.","If they couldn't figure it out, no one else could.","This was a great regret for them.","Even the wonderful Starry Sky Kindergarten couldn't make up for it.","But just as they were about to leave, joyous news arrived.","This made them immediately restless, and they rushed back to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Several of the younger scientists, who had already booked their tickets, now canceled them and decided to stay!","They wouldn't leave no matter what!","They wanted to see what was really going on.","The older professors, after getting in the car, frantically urged the driver to hurry.","They were as anxious as ants on a hot pan.","The drivers floored the gas pedal and the cars sped off.","They quickly arrived at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","These old professors rushed, half-running and half-stumbling, to Shen Wei's office.","When they got in, they were so out of breath they had to pant heavily for three or four minutes before they could speak.","Shen Wei was about to open her mouth.","But one of the old professors, very security-conscious, refused to let Doctor Lu in.","He raised his hand, and the others seemed to understand.","They quickly handed over all their devices like phones and tablets, including Shen Wei's.","Once entering the realm of high technology, they absolutely couldn't risk being monitored.","A small step in researching this device would be a giant leap for mankind.","And as far as they knew, no research institutes abroad had managed to develop a holographic game pod.","They had all deeply experienced the capabilities of this game pod during this period.","They had already raised the level of secrecy to the highest degree.","All the old professors looked at Shen Wei with serious expressions.","Several of them were even trembling slightly.","They didn't notice it themselves.","But Shen Wei was a bit worried.","After all, these old professors were quite elderly, and if they got too excited, wouldn't there be other problems?","Shen Wei then took out an entire book, very thick, like a medical textbook.","The cover read: Game Hardware and Software System.","Just seeing these words excited the old professors.","Then Shen Wei briefly explained.","The game pod and the book were mailed separately. And this inconspicuous book was mixed in with the kindergarten's deliveries.","After Starry Sky's good deeds became famous, many kind-hearted people donated things, and they also bought their own deliveries.","Shen Wei had specially found a room to store the packages.","Some had even been stored for as long as half a year.","The old professors had heard about this during their month-long stay.","They just didn't expect the precious design blueprints to be among them.","Upon hearing this, the old professors hurriedly opened and took a look.","It had everything from materials to blueprints.","Just one glance and they knew the value of this thing.","They all couldn't bear to look any further.","The groundbreaking item was right before their eyes, but they felt a nervousness akin to homesickness.","One of the younger scientists said, \"It's fortunate you opened it, otherwise it would have been a great loss to the scientific community.\"","An old professor surnamed Li couldn't help but tear up: \"The original creator is truly a good child. He even wrote such a detailed manual. If only we could find him, I'd be willing to recommend him to a research institute.\"","Others said, \"Old Li, you must be confused. With his academic credentials, he wouldn't need recommendations. Those research institutes would be fighting to recruit him.\"","\"In my opinion, the one we should thank the most is Shen Wei. She had the foresight to support this rising star in the scientific world.\"","\"Yes, I will remember your contribution.\"","\"This matter is of great importance, we need to return immediately to study these blueprints in detail.\"","They were truly too excited.","But they felt awkward just leaving like that. They asked Shen Wei, \"Is there anything you want?\"","Shen Wei said, \"As long as this is useful to you, that's enough.\"","The old professors looked at Shen Wei, speechless, their lips trembling.","Their interactions over this period had shown them that Shen Wei was a good person.","But they hadn't expected her to be willing to give them such a high-level gift.","It was as weighty as a mountain.","At this moment, any words would be pale in comparison. They said to Shen Wei, \"Don't worry, we've got your back! We won't let you suffer any loss.\"","Finally, they left. They awkwardly split the entire book into two halves.","Professor Li's group took the upper half, and the others took the lower half.","The two groups took separate flights.","The level of this item had made them vigilant.","These blueprints absolutely couldn't have any mishaps.","Even if something happened, at least part of it would remain in the world.","Soon they were gone!","Shen Wei knew they would take it very seriously once she handed it over to them.","Her task was complete, and she breathed a sigh of relief.","Life would go on as usual.","But two days later, Professor Li called her specifically.","\"I've reported this matter for you. From now on, for every game pod sold, you will receive 10% of the profits. Also, if that young scientist contacts you, you must tell me!\"","Actually, with these blueprints, the urgency to find the mad scientist had lessened.","In this matter, Shen Wei had made the greatest contribution.","She had given these blueprints to the country, a spirit that many couldn't achieve.","10% was already the maximum he could negotiate.","It might not sound like much, but for something of this level, it was beyond what a mere scientist like him could influence.","Moreover, the new game pod had already hit the market and its popularity was predictable.","Even 1% of the profits would be a terrifying fortune.","Initially, the higher-ups only agreed to 2%.","It was several old scientists pounding the table with the leaders that finally settled it at 10%.","For the game pod's interviews, those who could enter the final round were already super capital.","And it was foreseeable that what those super capitals could get might not exceed 10%.","Professor Li didn't tell Shen Wei about the difficulties involved in this.","But one thing was certain, Shen Wei and Starry Sky had gained recognition from the top.","Since handing over these blueprints to the country, it was equivalent to becoming \"royalty.\"","As long as she didn't break the law in the future, she could basically walk with her head held high.","And her spirit of selfless dedication had already spread throughout the scientific community.","It could be said that now, in the scientific world, they were all Shen Wei's big brothers.","Several old professors had silently found such a big backer for Shen Wei."]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203: Points Debt Issue","paragraphs":["After the scientists left, life gradually returned to normal.","However, Shen Wei was feeling a bit anxious.","The system's cold, mechanical voice was nagging incessantly.","\"Since you borrowed 60,000 points, please repay within one month, or you will receive the system's electric shock punishment.\"","\"Now entering countdown: 29 days, 23:59.\"","Shen Wei was speechless. When did the system become such a loan shark?","When it initially persuaded her to borrow points, it never mentioned that the points had to be repaid within a month.","Now that the points were borrowed, it was too late to say anything.","Shen Wei had previously used the system's electric shock to deal with villains when in danger.","She had witnessed the power of the shock firsthand. It could instantly incapacitate a person, causing unbearable pain.","She certainly didn't want to experience that herself.","Shen Wei was at a loss for words.","Unless she issued tasks herself, the system would only release new tasks when triggered.","Moreover, previous reward points were only 10,000 or 20,000.","Each of these tasks took at least half a month to complete, making the return on investment seem too low.","The fastest way to acquire points was to gain reputation online.","During peak popularity times, she could earn up to 5,000 points daily online.","If this continued,","It would take half a month to accumulate the necessary points.","But previously, it had all been unintentional.","There was no real marketing involved. Now their kindergarten was already quite popular, with many people watching and waiting for them to make a mistake.","Under such scrutiny, trying to create hype would be extremely difficult.","More and more competitors would be watching them, and if any problems arose, this popularity could become a double-edged sword.","Plus, she was in the basic education field after all.","Constantly using children for publicity would eventually make long-time livestream followers feel disgusted.","Shen Wei tapped her fingers lightly on the table, making a crisp \"tock-tock\" sound.","There was still one avenue she hadn't explored, which was incredibly popular right now – livestream selling.","Even celebrities of all kinds were getting involved.","No matter how new streamers started out making skits, they all eventually became product-selling streamers.","Because it was just too lucrative.","But Shen Wei didn't lack money.","Livestream selling would only consume her fanbase.","After all, many people were there for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","As she was torn between options, she suddenly received a phone call.","The caller was Qin Shu.","Qin Shu was Shen Qingqing's right-hand man in the original book.","He was very capable, previously going door-to-door to recruit contestants and judges for the culinary competitions.","The high popularity was due to his tremendous efforts.","Now Starry Sky Kindergarten was about to open its second branch.","Shen Wei had already discussed with him about becoming the principal of the second branch.","But he declined, not wanting a desk job, preferring freedom instead.","Shen Wei had agreed to this as well.","Qin Shu never called without a reason, so Shen Wei felt suspicious. She finally answered, saying, \"Hello, Qin Shu, what's the matter?\"","Qin Shu said, \"I know people at Apple TV. They're planning to record a variety show. They're very interested in our He Lingfeng and want to invite us as guests for one episode.\"","He Lingfeng's reputation as a child prodigy had spread, and what was even more intriguing was his tragic background from years ago.","He was the perfect embodiment of the handsome, talented, but unfortunate character that people loved.","His online popularity was very high.","Apple TV happened to be organizing a parent-child themed show and wanted Shen Wei to bring He Lingfeng along as guests.","He thought this would also be a good way to promote the kindergarten.","Having fame in their city was nothing special; it would be better to be famous nationwide.","Shen Wei's eyes lit up when she heard this, thinking, \"Points, here come the points!\""]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204: Rich People Are Amazing","paragraphs":["The matter of participating in the show couldn't be explained clearly in just a sentence or two over the phone.","Qin Shu came back specifically to discuss it in detail with Shen Wei.","Originally, only Shen Wei and Qin Shu were in the office.","However, Shen Wei, as the kindergarten principal, usually didn't put on airs.","Many people would come to her office to report work or just chat when they had nothing to do.","Gradually, the office became full of people, including Liu Chef, Doctor Lu, and Lin Rui.","After hearing about it, Lin Rui's eyes lit up: \"Can I go with Shen Wei?\"","Taking children on variety shows had been popular for a while before.","But later, as various media outlets rushed to imitate, it gradually lost its original flavor.","Plus, with the constant drama stirred up in post-production, even the kids started playing mind games, which felt very jarring to watch.","Moreover, netizens formed fan clubs and latched onto trivial matters, leading to mutual attacks.","It had a negative impact on the children.","Later, the authorities put a stop to it for a while.","Now the policies have relaxed, but the enthusiasm has passed. Few stations continue to produce kid-centric variety shows.","But taking children on variety shows used to be a trump card program with very high ratings, so it has a viewer base.","And the lineup already announced for this episode includes a film emperor and his daughter.","A young music superstar and his ill-tempered son.","It's said that a total of 5 guest teams will be announced.","Now if Shen Wei could bring He Lingfeng.","It would at least be a fresh character setting, after all, He Lingfeng is currently popular. Many people want to see what differences there are between a genius and ordinary people.","A variety show Lin Rui had done before was taken away by the TV station, and various troubles occurred in between, leaving her physically and mentally exhausted.","She had heard about recording variety shows before but had never been to one.","And it's said that they're going to a remote place to experience life.","For her, isn't this just a free vacation?","She was really tempted.","Lin Rui admired Qin Shu: \"How do you get to know all these connections?\"","By rights, Qin Shu's status was far below Lin Rui's.","But Qin Shu just had some strange friends and could connect with anyone.","But Apple TV was different, it was one of the top three TV stations in the country.","Both their program processes and post-production were very powerful.","Qin Shu said: \"I met them at an offline music concert.\"","Lin Rui couldn't help but give a thumbs up, truly you can't judge a book by its cover.","She had heard rumors about Qin Shu in high society before, thinking he was a very reclusive and eccentric person, an unapproachable illegitimate child.","After getting to know him, she found out he was really a case of actions speak louder than words.","Shen Wei was eager to earn these points. She asked: \"How long does it take from production to broadcast?\"","Qin Shu said: \"This is just a trial run, they're only doing one episode, live broadcast plus edited variety show going online. It can all be seen on the internet the same day!\"","This was just an experiment by Apple TV, if the effect was good they would continue broadcasting, if not they would cut it.","The competition for time slots on big stations was very fierce, and factional struggles were even more terrifying than in other places.","The ins and outs of it all were not something an outsider could easily explain.","Shen Wei said: \"Alright!\" Then she went to find He Lingfeng.","She explained the situation to He Lingfeng.","Although He Lingfeng was a child, he had gained knowledge from Professor Liu and others every time, and had been to various high-end summits.","This resulted in the child becoming less and less childlike, more like an adult.","His opinion still needed to be considered on this matter.","He Lingfeng's eyes were bright. Looking at Shen Wei, he said: \"Sure!\"","He agreed very quickly.","Shen Wei was quite surprised.","She wanted to persuade him, but before she could say a word,","He Lingfeng said: \"I want to travel with you.\"","He Lingfeng had a kind of imprinting on Shen Wei.","It's just that Shen Wei was usually too busy with too many things, and the time she could spend with him was very limited.","This time, hearing that he could go out and travel with Shen Wei, shoot some programs and such, he was one hundred percent willing.","Shen Wei said: \"The conditions might be quite harsh.\"","He Lingfeng looked at Shen Wei and said word by word: \"As long as I can be with you, I'm not afraid of anything else.\"","For a moment, Shen Wei was really shocked by He Lingfeng's boyfriend energy. For a little kid, he was quite smooth.","After agreeing on this side, the TV station immediately had them sign the contract.","The appearance fee for guests in this episode was not low, 300,000 yuan for one episode.","Shen Wei specially opened a separate account for He Lingfeng.","She deposited all his money here.","When he wants to spend it, he can.","Shen Wei also gives him pocket money, but the child is quite frugal, maybe it would be different if he earned the money himself.","This matter wasn't widely publicized. But the teachers all knew about it.","Mu Zhixing usually had a pretty good relationship with He Lingfeng.","When he heard that He Lingfeng could go out to travel and shoot a program with Shen Wei, there was some envy on the child's face.","Qi Zhong sighed, if he had been more capable, he could have taken the child out to play together.","Unfortunately, he gets airsick.","He could only suppress this thought.","He could argue forcefully for his little disciple on other matters, but for something already settled, no matter how arrogant he was, he couldn't go against the contract they had already signed.","So he had to pretend not to see, but he was very heartbroken.","Shen Wei's side signed the variety show contract.","Soon, Shen Qingqing and Boss Lu's side found out about it.","The two of them were currently going through a relationship crisis.","But they hadn't publicly broken up yet.","After all, their high-profile declaration of love was still fresh in memory, if they fell out now, it would be like a joke. Boss Lu couldn't afford to lose face like that.","He could only keep up appearances.","But both of them felt increasingly awkward.","Boss Lu felt that he must have been blind to choose someone like Shen Qingqing,","But Shen Qingqing had a different perspective.","She used to be from a moderately wealthy family.","After experiencing the life of the rich with Lu Zheng, she could no longer accept returning to her previous ordinary life.","She wanted to hold on tightly to this golden bachelor.","Compared to other rich men, Lu Zheng was young and handsome, a famous second-generation rich young master in the city.","It was quite prestigious to be seen with him.","One wanted to let go, one desperately held on, the two were very tired of accommodating each other.","Just at this time, they suddenly learned of unexpected news that Shen Wei and Lin Rui were going to take the children to record a show.","It really infuriated Shen Qingqing.","Now Starry Sky Kindergarten already had such high popularity online.","Once they go out to record a show, it's hard to imagine how much their prestige would increase.","Shen Qingqing said to Lu Zheng: \"I want to go record this show too. Our kindergarten is about to open anyway, let them see how we treat children.\"","Since Shen Wei could go, she had to go too.","Her jealousy towards Shen Wei had now become distorted.","Whatever Shen Wei wanted, she had to get it.","Ever since Shen Wei brought Qin Shu under her wing, she had been very angry.","She always felt that Qin Shu should be her person.","The last time she invited him, Shen Qingqing even wore a revealing spaghetti strap top.","The Shen family produces beauties. Her intentions in doing this were already clear as day.","But he still remained unmoved.","After inquiring in detail this time, she found out it was Qin Shu who helped make the connection again, she was really about to die of anger.","Lu Zheng was disgusted by Shen Qingqing's constant focus on Shen Wei, and instinctively wanted to refuse, but when he heard that Lin Rui was also among the list of participants, he inexplicably agreed.","Since they were recording a show, Lin Rui would probably be more polite to him in daily life.","Maybe the two of them could break the ice because of this show.","After all, they had been childhood sweethearts for so many years.","As long as Lin Rui still cared about him, he was confident he could win Lin Rui back.","The two harbored their own ulterior motives as they went to talk with Apple TV.","But Apple TV's list of participants had actually been finalized long ago.","They didn't want to add people midway at all.","Although Shen Wei was also an ordinary person, He Lingfeng wasn't, he was currently the most popular genius child.","Even for just one trial episode, Apple TV wouldn't let just anyone appear.","Seeing them brazenly wanting to join the show, the liaison person's disdain was written all over their face.","\"Sorry, our program needs to go through layers of review.\"","\"20 million,\" Lu Zheng didn't waste time with them, directly naming a price.","The other party was stunned for a moment.","They originally had advertisers investing.","But when they heard that this could be cut at any time, not wanting their money to go down the drain, they quietly withdrew their investment.","The sudden investment of 20 million allowed these amateurs to have a taste of luxury.","After all, it was just an online live streaming show.","With this in mind, they immediately called the director and producer.","The director agreed instantly upon hearing about the 20 million.","Just like that, he became the fourth group of guests.","Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng chose a chubby young man.","This chubby guy was also an internet celebrity, who usually made TikTok videos and short sketches, and his lip-syncing was incredibly lifelike.","Moreover, his chubby appearance made him very popular with the audience.","This time, Shen Qingqing carefully selected him after several rounds of interviews before making the final decision.","As soon as Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng signed the contract, Qin Shu immediately found out and reported back to Shen Wei and Lin Rui.","Shen Wei was speechless, while Lin Rui bluntly said, \"Why can't these people just leave us alone?\"","They even follow us to other places to record shows. It's really too much.","We open a pop-up store for Starry Sky, they open a game arcade.","We open a kindergarten, they also open a kindergarten.","Now they're even following us to record shows. Are these people sick?","\"Imitate me and prosper, copy me and die.\" Don't they understand such a simple principle?","Maybe they're just using this method to annoy us.","Thinking about this made Lin Rui even angrier. She had long since grown tired of Boss Lu.","But who knew he had even more outrageous moves up his sleeve.","When Gu Qingyan heard that the fourth group of guests was Shen Qingqing and Boss Lu, she couldn't sit still.","It's all about the power of money, isn't it? As if they were the only ones who had it.","So with a little scheming, she became the officially announced fifth group of guests, and the child she brought was none other than Mu Zhixing.","Thus, what should have been a simple show","Inexplicably turned into a gathering of acquaintances.","And it came with its own dramatic conflicts.","Shen Wei was speechless. She just wanted to earn some points, why was it so difficult?"]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205: Women Prefer Handsome Men","paragraphs":["The official announcement of participating in the variety show indeed caused a stir online.","\"I always knew Shen Wei was just an internet celebrity. Can't she stop ruining the kindergarten? Her mind is always on how to become famous. How can such a person properly take care of children? To be honest, she's no match for elite kindergartens.\"","\"How much does the elite kindergarten above cost? I'll pay triple for Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"Besides, Shen Wei is the principal and doesn't usually work as a teacher. What's wrong with her going out to have some fun?\"","\"I really want to see the kids. I'm excited just thinking about them participating in the show.\"","\"I never thought my treasure of a kindergarten would be on TV. And it's the baby show I've been wanting to watch the most.\"","\"It's Apple TV's show. Apple TV really struck gold this time.\"","\"I really can't wait to watch it.\"","People were saying all sorts of things.","But after all the guests were announced, fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten felt a bit awkward.","Oh my, what a battlefield of relationships! Some people even drew mind maps.","\"Lu Zheng and Lin Rui are childhood sweethearts.\"","\"Lu Zheng abandoned his childhood sweetheart for Shen Qingqing.\"","\"Shen Qingqing was the main force behind criticizing Shen Wei. Back when Starry Sky Kindergarten was still developing, she almost ruined it.\"","\"Shen Qingqing and Shen Wei are cousins.\"","\"Lin Rui now works at Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"Shen Qingqing has also opened a kindergarten and an arcade, clearly intending to compete with Starry Sky.\"","\"Gu Qingyan has a marriage agreement with Shen Wei and has subtly shown off their relationship multiple times.\"","Without some mental acuity, one couldn't possibly figure out how complicated the relationships between these people were.","Even netizens were amazed after seeing this. Good grief, it's like they're raising venomous creatures in there.","What to do when you want to watch it even more?","\"Do you want to see a catfight or our dear Gu's guide to winning his wife back?\"","\"I want to see both.\"","\"Me too.\"","The Apple TV production team was also monitoring public opinion.","At first, they thought it was just a rich young master wanting to have fun filming a variety show.","After all, over the years, wealthy young men have made all sorts of outrageous requests.","The show's team didn't take it seriously at first.","But after netizens provided background information and the team did some deeper research, good heavens!","It was just as people had said.","Suddenly, the post-production team got excited.","They didn't even need to create drama; it was already there.","Not to mention these people came with the intention of stirring things up. How could they worry about not having topics to hype?","Even the director was overjoyed.","It would be a waste not to accept such a huge wave of traffic.","Even people from other departments couldn't help but congratulate him when they saw him.","The director had originally planned to premiere on Saturday but couldn't resist moving it up by two days.","The online buzz was at its peak now.","The network executives had already talked with the show's director. As long as the cumulative daily views exceeded 50 million,","they could continue production.","If the results were good, they might even get a prime-time slot on the network.","It was said that this season's male and female talent shows weren't doing so well.","The network had rushed through them, and now they were in an awkward transition period.","Several S-level projects needed too much preparation time.","They were worried about what to fill the slot with.","This show was like picking up a bargain.","The director felt more and more like he should go to a temple to pray.","It truly was heaven-sent.","Who would have thought that using \"reheated leftovers\" would receive such attention from network executives?","It made his rivals look at him with some displeasure these days.","Apple TV was professional at making baby shows.","Every department could do it.","This wave of traffic was picked up by their team. Others were dying of envy.","Their year-end bonuses would definitely be higher now.","Two days passed in a flash.","Shen Wei hurriedly watched all the previous episodes.","Although they had done live streams before,","it wasn't 24-hour live streaming after all.","It was said that variety show live streams could reveal one's true nature to the greatest extent.","Many big-name celebrities who came to record shows couldn't hide their tempers.","Shen Wei was both excited and nervous.","Finally, the day arrived.","On the day of filming, Shen Wei and Lin Rui brought He Lingfeng off the plane and took the production team's car to the designated location.","When they came out, they were in an open space.","A bus was parked there with \"Vacation with Baby\" written on it, which was the name of their episode.","The male host, Dalin, was already there to welcome them.","The video was simultaneously broadcast online.","Many fans had already come to watch.","Long-time fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten knew Shen Wei was beautiful.","But they were used to seeing her.","However, her beauty actually held up under Apple TV's high-definition cameras.","Fair-skinned and beautiful, she was extremely pretty.","Perhaps it was because since Shen Wei got the system space, the system automatically added a layer of beauty maintenance.","There were no visible pores at all. Without makeup, she had a pure and beautiful look. With just a bit of makeup, she would be a dazzling beauty.","The male host was a bit surprised when he saw Shen Wei.","However, this surprise was quickly concealed.","Dalin was a host who had seen many celebrities in the entertainment industry. Shen Wei was just the first one who dared to appear on camera without makeup.","The key was that she looked so good without makeup, which was truly impressive.","Beside her, Lin Rui was dressed to the nines, wearing a sparkly dress.","Netizens couldn't help but point out that the dress was a custom-made piece from this season's luxury brand.","And she was wearing seven-centimeter high heels.","Her hair was styled in big waves, her look exquisite, like a fashion icon.","Moreover, Lin Rui had studied abroad, and she had an especially healthy and sunny smile.","He Lingfeng, standing between these two beautiful women, still looked incredibly cute.","The child was wearing trendy brands.","He Lingfeng was naturally good-looking, and with careful styling,","his hair had been permed with tinfoil before coming, a style Lin Rui had taken him to get.","He looked even more adorable.","Fans in the live stream couldn't take it and screamed, \"The baby is too cute!\"","\"They really know how to dress him up.\"","Yesterday in the live stream, He Lingfeng didn't look like this. The thought that they had seriously dolled him up for the show made people want to laugh.","Shen Wei and her group were the first to arrive.","The second to arrive were Best Actor Song and his daughter Song Xiaoxue.","The actor was in his forties and somewhat past his prime.","Now he was known as a good family man.","He had previously been on a variety show with his wife.","It had decent popularity.","His daughter Song Xiaoxue was a beautiful little princess.","Wearing a pretty dress, as soon as she arrived, Song Xiaoxue enthusiastically greeted He Lingfeng: \"Hello, little handsome boy.\" Her eyes were sparkling.","Netizens saw that familiar look in her eyes and all burst out laughing, saying it was the same look as Niu Niu's.","\"I've watched Best Actor Song's couple variety show before. Xiaoxue is usually very polite, but she's never been this enthusiastic!\"","At this moment, Song Xiaoxue was like a butterfly fluttering around He Lingfeng, greeting him repeatedly.","Even the actor felt a bit embarrassed and called out, \"Xiaoxue, come back here.\"","Only then did Song Xiaoxue reluctantly return to her father's side.","But when she saw He Lingfeng glance at her, she immediately blew him a kiss, while wearing her princess dress.","It was precisely captured by the camera.","A group of single brothers and sisters in the live stream couldn't help but cry out, \"Oh my god, kids these days are too smooth!\"","\"With her smooth little combo, she could hook my five-year-old brother easily.\"","\"Indeed, women of all ages like handsome guys.\""]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206: Shura Field","paragraphs":["The third duo to arrive was Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng, accompanied by a chubby lad, Guo Wei.","Shen Qingqing had done her homework before arrival.","She knew that children's variety shows enjoyed bringing kids to somewhat challenging places to reveal their contrasts.","That's why she specifically wore her casual sportswear, ready for climbing mountains and competing in games.","Shen Qingqing had initially wanted to wear couple outfits with Lu Zheng.","However, she was mercilessly rejected by him.","Lu Zheng also had his own plans coming here, hoping to reconcile with his ex-girlfriend.","Naturally, he wasn't thinking of wearing couple outfits with other women.","But he couldn't resist Shen Qingqing's cunning.","From the clothes she had given him, Lu Zheng chose a black sportswear. Shen Qingqing specifically wore a white set.","Black and white did look like couple outfits.","Lu Zheng had a grumpy face all morning.","But with cameras rolling as soon as they arrived, he could only swallow his displeasure.","Shen Qingqing's little scheme had succeeded, and she thought she had won a total victory.","She was extremely delighted.","However, her smile froze on her face when she caught sight of Lin Rui.","Lin Rui was decked in full armour, she looked like a female celebrity walking down the red carpet.","Comparing their looks, she instantly felt like a countryside bumpkin.","The contrast was just too much.","Even when the PD was filming Lin Rui, the corners of his mouth were curled upwards with a smile. Who wouldn't like filming a beautiful woman?","Shen Qingqing's complexion changed instantly.","The live stream's netizens immediately sat up straight, excitedly chattering, \"Here it comes, here it comes.\"","They were waiting for a fight scene, didn't expect it to come faster than they had anticipated.","The host, Da Lin, sighed. Ordinary people couldn't hide their reactions.","Unlike celebrities who can pretend in front of the camera, he said, \"Congratulations to the third group of guests on arrival, I hope you all have fun!\"","Soon, Best Actor Song came over and exchanged a few words with Lu Zheng.","Best Actor Song was truly amiable and could chat with anyone.","He had been informed beforehand by his manager.","Everyone here was a rich second generation.","He too wanted to network. But Lu Zheng was currently stealing glances at Lin Rui, how could he be still enough to chat?","Lu Zheng's attitude couldn't help but feel a little distracted.","Best Actor Song's fans were not happy, \"When a senior comes to chat with you, you should at least be polite!\"","\"Lu Zheng's aloof attitude is truly irritating.\"","\"God, where in the world can you find such a pretentious brother? I feel like vomiting out my leftovers.\"","\"Donning a stern face daily, as if everyone owes him 200 dollars.\"","Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng hadn't expected to be criticised as soon as they appeared on screen.","Little did they know, this chubby kid was likable.","Upon arrival, he introduced himself and even pulled out a Chinese paddle drum from his pocket to perform on the spot.","The netizens in the live stream showered Guo Wei with praise.","\"I really like these straightforward kids.\"","\"I'm already in my twenties yet I don't have a kid as talented, when can I have such profuse social skills?\"","\"This chubby kid just caught my attention this year. It's worth it to be his fan, plus he's really funny and always makes me laugh during his live streams.\"","\"So, Shen Qingqing's greatest contribution in this duo is finding Guo Wei as a partner.\"","When Group 4 arrived, they brought along the Little King of Entertainment, who had lost quite a few fans when he secretly married and had a child.","Even up to now, no one in the entertainment industry knows who the biological mother of the child is.","However, upon seeing five-year-old Zhou Junyan's pretty face, handsomely similar to the Little King, everyone couldn’t help but be fascinated. It's as if he had created his own cute little figurine.","Except he seems to have a bit of a temper.","Everyone else looked at Song Xiaoxue.","Little did they know, Xiaoxue only greeted them in passing.","Which was really quite polite of her.","But having seen how warm Song Xiaoxue was towards He Lingfeng, netizens couldn't help but laugh, it was too realistic.","The Little King of Entertainment just greeted everyone and didn't seem to enjoy conversing much,","Since his debut, people have criticized his behavior, stating he didn't care about others.","But over time, people got used to it.","Whenever someone criticized him, his fans defended him by saying: he's been like this since his debut.","The last one to appear was Gu Qingyan.","The moment Gu Qingyan arrived with Mu Zhixing, the live broadcast room erupted into a frenzy.","Mu Zhixing had a big fan base; she was a very well-behaved and cute child. Netizens were enthusiastically cheering her on, as if she was a close friend.","Regardless of the warm welcome, the way the audience responded was quite shocking to the ordinary onlookers.","Seeing Gu Qingyan's superior look, people couldn't help but think, is he some kind of runaway prince of the entertainment industry?","He's too good-looking,","Even standing next to others in the entertainment industry, well-known for their good looks like the Little King Zhou, he still overshadowed them slightly.","However, such words were definitely not appropriate, and people didn’t dare to say it.","But when the two of them were standing together, Gu Qingyan seemed more like an idol.","At this moment, Gu Qingyan looked at Shen Wei without blinking an eye.","The old fans of Muzhixing laughed uproariously, creating another iconic moment: ‘Gu Qingyan gazing at his wife’ was confirmed yet again.","“I still remember when he had his first live broadcast, he was going to give up his bachelor status.”","“Please, don't say that, let the child be happy for a few more days. Gu Qingyan might really be bullied to death by you guys!”","Every time people discussed such topics, it would specifically strike Gu Qingyan’s most sensitive points.","“Gu Qingyan really acts like a proud little cat. Poke him and he'll jump.”","At this moment, everyone has arrived. The host, Da Lin, said, “Welcome everyone. We’re starting a five-day journey and hope everyone has fun!”","“The first thing I think everyone knows about.”","“Hand over all electronic devices like phones and computers. In addition to that, bringing your own food is also not allowed.”","Everyone swiftly handed over their personal devices.","However, when it came to snacks...","The chubby kid really felt torn.","This time he brought a lot of snacks.","After opening the case, even the netizens in the live broadcast room were astonished: “Who would pack roast chicken and pig trotters when going on an outing?”","“No wonder he’s this chubby.”","“To be honest, he brought all my favorite snacks! Aren’t potato chips and roast chicken delicious?”","“No matter how delicious, you still have to hand it over. I see that he’s on the verge of crying. I feel a little sympathy for him all of a sudden.”","Shen Wei and Lin Rui brought a lot of suitcases.","The search was particularly meticulous, but found nothing more than clothes and cosmetics stashed within three large suitcases, all perfectly organized right down to shoes and accessories.","Most of this was Lin Rui's. Shen Wei traveled light, in comparison.","Even the bullet screen comments pointed out, \"Are they here for fun? How can they work with so much stuff?\"","\"Why do you need to bring so many things?\" asked Shen Qingqing.","Lin Rui shot her a glance, \"Looking good is all that matters.\"","This remark left Shen Qingqing blushing in an instant.","She had kept it simple and casual today, not expecting to run into Lin Rui in all her glory.","Now, hearing Lin Rui say, \"Looking good is all that matters.\"","It felt like a slap on the face, Lin Rui was too hateful."]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207: Tendency to Explode in Popularity","paragraphs":["The ratings for the premiere were climbing steadily.","Apple TV had assigned dedicated staff to monitor the backend data.","Looking at the current numbers, unable to contain their excitement, the staff called the producer and director.","\"Director, it's in the bag!\" The 50 million views milestone was definitely secure.","Just one hour after going live, they had already exceeded 5 million views.","This terrifying speed was on par with even S-class variety shows.","The director and producer were overjoyed. Indeed, opportunity favors the prepared.","Apple TV had always demanded innovation.","Previously, the team had meticulously planned 4-5 shows, all of which were passed on.","With no other options, they decided to rehash the idea of bringing children onto variety shows.","It happened to coincide with He Lingfeng's viral fame as a child prodigy.","So they found him.","Who would have thought, they found one that came with two financial backers.","Suddenly, they had both money and buzz.","For the director and producer, this was a windfall of traffic.","The director also got excited, demanding that they stay on top of the trending topics.","Stirring up more hype, this show might just explode in popularity.","After all, bringing children on variety shows had an existing audience base.","Additionally, the director requested the operations team to search through the live stream chat and online discussions, recording all the topics.","The director wasn't quite clear on the grudges and entanglements between Shen Wei and the others.","But it seemed rather intriguing.","They wanted to tease out more details through the netizens' comments.","This would give everyone a direction for promotion.","Everyone was gearing up, and the director couldn't help telling his staff to make sure they get the renewal contracts signed.","When they came, they only signed for one episode.","They weren't sure how this pilot would turn out.","Unexpectedly, the results were fantastic.","They needed to finalize the contracts before the guests realized what was happening.","The signs of this child-centric variety show becoming a hit were evident.","Not only could they see it.","Their competitors at Apple TV could see it too.","Although they were usually at odds, when faced with others' success, they would still offer insincere congratulations.","The producer had received no less than thirty or forty congratulatory messages just this morning.","The show indeed lived up to expectations, with viewership soaring.","Fans in the live chat couldn't help but joke: \"Although I've never been to Starry Sky Kindergarten, I've been following them for over half a year. It feels like watching acquaintances on a variety show. Why does it feel both cringy and watchable?\"","\"I always thought there was a barrier between internet celebrities and mainstream media. Now that they're on an Apple TV show, it feels a bit surreal.\"","\"But when Lin Rui brought out those three suitcases of clothes, I really laughed out loud. This must be what they mean by the undefeated Chinese woman.\"","\"As long as she outshines everyone else.\"","\"By the way, did anyone see the moment she opened the suitcase? A fashion industry friend next to me let out a sharp squeal. Her personal taste is excellent, with many pieces from niche clothing brands.\"","\"I've already started searching for similar items. Those vibrant clothes that flashed by earlier are exactly my style, but I couldn't get a clear look.\"","\"I'm so excited to see what outfits she'll wear next.\"","\"Shen Qingqing's expression earlier nearly killed me with laughter. 'What to do when your love rival is prettier than you?'\"","\"I can answer that question. Once, I was taking out the trash, looking like a mess, when I ran into my ex-boyfriend with his new girlfriend. In that moment, I really wanted to die.\"","\"I was just planning to watch casually, but it turned out to be quite entertaining. Unscripted shows with ordinary people are indeed more fun. Nobody hides their true colors. There are already memes of Shen Qingqing's jealous expression.\"","\"But I want the meme of Lin Rui rolling her eyes, with the caption: 'Being beautiful is enough.'\"","\"Big sis is truly the main character. I want to buy her photo cards, her cotton dolls, I want to spend money on her.\"","\"Feels like we'll have some digital pickled vegetables for a while.\"","\"I'm a new fan, want to start from the beginning. Can someone guide me on where to start? Should I start from the live stream or somewhere else?\"","\"For new fans, I recommend following the 'That Starry Sky' account. The account owner is a long-time fan of the kindergarten. They have many interesting cuts and compilations. You must watch the segment on Starry Sky Kindergarten's recruitment and the dance teacher's performance. Starry Sky Kindergarten is an absolute treasure trove, their teaching staff is incredibly strong, each one a top performer in their field. To make adults cry out, 'I want to go to kindergarten!' - that's quite an achievement for Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"The person above said so much in one go, must be a true fan.\"","\"Isn't anyone paying attention to Best Actor Song and Superstar Zhou?\"","\"Best Actor Song's daughter is such a cutie with an eye for beauty, and as for Superstar Zhou, forget about being his biological child, I'd believe it if you said he gave birth to him himself.\"","\"Seeing Superstar Zhou's son, I finally understand why in those CEO novels, when the female lead returns to the country with a genius baby, the male lead recognizes them at a glance. Who wouldn't recognize this? It's like the DNA sequence is written on his face.\"","\"I bet a spicy strip: this show will definitely be a hit.\"","\"Isn't that obvious? Your bet is too small. I bet a whole pack of spicy strips that this show will definitely reach the Top 1 this month.\"","\"Sister, you're too confident.\"","The netizens were chattering away, and the comment section was quite harmonious.","Although everyone was shocked by the thought processes of these ordinary people from Starry Sky Kindergarten.","It was a bit scene-stealing.","They had taken some of the spotlight away from Best Actor Song and Little Superstar Zhou.","But Best Actor Song's fans tended to be older and generally didn't control the narrative online.","As for Little Superstar Zhou, now that was interesting.","Since his debut, he had been plagued by scandals.","Coupled with his difficult personality, his fans had become very laid-back.","As long as he wasn't being criticized, it was fine.","Losing a bit of attention was no big deal.","Usually, when a new variety show premieres, it's a battleground for fans to fight tooth and nail.","But here, everyone was just having fun.","The atmosphere was so friendly that new fans integrated very quickly.","The fan who asked for a catch-up guide an hour ago was now able to educate newer fans.","The old fans were laughing.","A big fan couldn't help but say: Investing in this fandom is worth it.","It made people even more curious about what kind of organization Starry Sky Kindergarten really was.","The fans were quite interesting.","For the old fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten, although Shen Wei was forced to bring He Lingfeng and Lin Rui on the show, it felt strangely fitting.","Only through Apple TV's high-definition cameras could their stunning beauty be fully captured.","Even He Lingfeng, such an adorable little cutie, was pressured by Lin Rui to get a perm.","One of Lin Rui's three suitcases of clothes was specially prepared for He Lingfeng.","The fire burning in her eyes made the other mothers laugh with delight.","They were all too familiar with that look.","Under their styling, no one could win. A child's fashion sense was a mother's battleground.","Lin Rui had money and good taste herself. She took this show very seriously.","Three large suitcases of clothes, a year's worth of cultivation, excellent fashion sense. Of the three suitcases, one was for Shen Wei, one for He Lingfeng, and the remaining one for herself.","Everything was planned out meticulously."]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208: Electronic Pickled Vegetables","paragraphs":["Online, everyone was enjoying the show.","In Starry Sky Kindergarten, Doctor Lu was seen holding his phone, smiling brightly.","It truly was a turn of fortune.","In the past, Starry Sky Kindergarten was often criticized.","Now, hearing that they were going to be on a TV show, Doctor Lu was anxious, worried that netizens might say something unpleasant.","But when he checked the comments, they were all harmonious and playful. Doctor Lu even managed to save several emojis of Lin Rui and Shen Qingqing.","He secretly joined a fan group using an alternate account.","He was like a fish in water there.","His high-quality posts, combined with occasional insider information about Starry Sky Kindergarten, even earned him a moderator position.","This made Doctor Lu even more excited.","He absolutely wouldn't allow anyone to criticize Shen Wei and Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Meanwhile, he collected their emojis, impressed by how creative the netizens were.","Those emojis were incredibly cute.","Doctor Lu was delighted to see the new fans showing such affection for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","As Doctor Lu was joking around, he heard someone in the group say: \"They're here.\"","The group suddenly quieted down.","Doctor Lu quickly switched from the small window back to the main screen.","Sure enough, when he looked, their car had arrived at the designated location.","The downside of live streaming is that it can be quite long.","During the boring parts, the fans in the live stream chat keep themselves entertained by joking around.","Once they arrived, the familiar routine began: room selection.","Room 1 was a seaside room.","It was like a grand villa, very relaxing.","Everyone, adults and children alike, would love to have such a house in a place like this. The interior was decorated in a modern artistic style.","They could even take hot showers, which was loved by everyone present!","The male host, Da Lin, seeing how satisfied they were, couldn't help but smile and say, \"I wonder who'll be lucky enough to get Room 1!\"","Everyone's eyes lit up.","Guo Wei, the chubby boy brought by Shen Qingqing, immediately asked, \"What do we need to do to get this room?\"","The little chubby one was very interested, as this room had a large refrigerator full of delicious food.","Thinking about his confiscated roast chicken and pork trotters, his heart ached.","Now the big refrigerator could compensate for his inner fragility.","Moreover, he had secretly discovered that there was ice cream inside.","The chubby boy's eyes were full of anticipation.","The netizens were dying of laughter.","Especially when the chubby boy was examining the refrigerator earlier, his exclamations of admiration were endless.","At that time, netizens said that the chubby boy must truly love this room.","Sure enough, while others liked the romantic atmosphere or the beautiful decor,","only the chubby boy had his gaze fixed on the food in the refrigerator.","His expression just now was really similar to Song Xiaoxue's when she looks at He Lingfeng.","When it comes to people or things they like, those little thoughts simply can't be hidden.","Host Da Lin said, \"We need to see all the rooms before announcing the rules!\"","The second room was a luxurious bedroom.","The mattress was extremely soft.","It felt like sitting on it would make you bounce up and down.","It had a very guesthouse-like feel.","Although not as grand as the seaside room, it was still very nice.","The chubby boy, however, was a bit disappointed because this one didn't have a refrigerator.","So he urged everyone to quickly move on to the next one.","Best Actor Song couldn't help but joke, \"Your production team has had a change of heart. When I watched other shows before, it was quite miserable. I even did some mental preparation before coming here.\"","Sincerity is indeed the ultimate killer move.","His casual remark was exactly what the netizens were thinking.","After all, the previous seasons of the child-focused variety shows had been quite tough on both the guests and the children.","Especially when many kids would burst into loud cries after getting bad rooms.","All of it was captured by the cameras.","It's normal for children to throw tantrums.","But the way it was presented only gave people an extremely irritating feeling.","Because of this, one child suffered long-term cyberbullying, and the parents even sued the production team.","It was only then that they put a stop to these child-focused shows.","After all, these shows that took pleasure in tormenting people were unacceptable.","They were boycotted by fans, cursed by the entire internet. With constant complaints and reports, the show completely flopped.","Best Actor Song felt that either of these two rooms would be fine. Xiaoxue liked them too.","Then they saw the director give an awkward smile.","Best Actor Song felt something wasn't quite right.","After seeing the third room, they finally understood why.","Because this room was called the chicken coop room.","It was right next to a chicken coop.","Not only was there a pervasive stench, but the constant clucking from the chicken house was incessant.","It's safe to say that if one were to spend a night here, there'd be no chance of a good sleep.","Actually, the room itself was clean and tidy, a rather nice forest cabin.","This time, everyone wanted to walk a bit further.","They only relaxed their breathing after going quite far, as that smell was not something an ordinary person could endure.","The fourth room gave them a bit of comfort.","It was an ordinary room, a bit small, but cozy. And there were no disturbances from neighbors.","The fifth room.","When they went in, they were stunned. It was called the classroom bunk room.","The front was a classroom with a huge blackboard and rows of desks and chairs.","It had the feel of a rural school.","The sleeping area was next door, very small, with four bunk beds.","The windows creaked.","When a gust of wind blew, it made a terrifying squeaking sound.","Even though they were indoors, the wind felt unusually strong.","Sleeping here for a night would likely result in a cold.","\"This counts as a room?\" Shen Qingqing couldn't help but ask.","This room was basically just a school dormitory, it seemed too perfunctory.","All the rooms had been seen.","The chubby boy liked the first room the best.","Besides that, none of the other rooms had refrigerators.","Nor did they have his beloved ice cream.","As for the adults, anything would do as long as it wasn't the chicken coop room or the classroom bunk room.","\"So how do we get our rooms?\" someone asked.","In the past, there had been room-grabbing, where the first to grab got the room.","There were also games to choose rooms.","But this time.","They used a simpler, more direct method.","The host said, \"There are 5 numbers, each corresponding to a different room. We've already told you the order. It's all about who's lucky.\"","Song Xiaoxue said she wanted room number one. After all, everyone likes a seaside room.","Shen Wei told He Lingfeng, \"Any room is fine.\"","If they were unlucky enough to get the chicken coop room, she would just exchange for an odor-eliminating item from the system.","With such a cheat item in hand, Shen Wei naturally had no fears.","As for the others, they were all nervously watching.","The chubby boy, at this moment, had his hands clasped together, muttering and bowing repeatedly.","He was only five or six years old, and with his overly round figure, it was quite a comical sight.","\"This is exactly like me during my final exams,\" netizens joked.","\"I believe his heart is truly sincere at this moment.\"","\"What to do? I'm getting nervous too, I really want to know who ends up with the chicken coop room.\"","\"You're so mean, but I like it.\"","\"I want to know too!\"","As everyone watched with bated breath, all the children went to draw lots."]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209: Choosing a House","paragraphs":["The children began selecting their rooms.","The online viewers watching the livestream became tense.","They desperately wished they could see through the host's paper with X-ray vision, gaining a god's-eye view.","Once everyone had chosen their rooms, they all revealed their selections at once.","In an instant, some were delighted while others were disappointed.","The room selection was done by the children drawing lots.","Shen Qingqing watched intently without blinking.","She didn't want the chicken coop room or the classroom-converted room. Any of the other three rooms would do, but preferably room number 1.","However, who could have guessed their luck would be so bad?","Little Fatty drew the chicken coop room, number 3.","But looking at what others had chosen, the Little Superstar's son got room 2, the luxurious king-size bed room.","Best Actor Song and his daughter got room 4, the cozy room.","Most frustratingly, He Lingfeng got room 1, the sea view room.","Mu Zhixing got room 5, the classroom-converted room.","At that moment, Shen Qingqing could barely maintain her composure.","She almost screamed out loud, her eyes filled with disbelief.","The PDs recording the show had been warned by the director beforehand.","So at this moment, they zoomed in to capture their facial expressions.","Seeing the camera's eerie glow, Shen Qingqing's face paled as she struggled to regain her composure.","But her expression was so awful that she couldn't even manage basic politeness.","Lu Zheng, like Shen Qingqing, was furious.","Out of 5 rooms to choose from, they ended up with the worst one.","He was on the verge of losing his temper.","Their reactions were clearly visible to the online viewers.","Viewers couldn't help but comment: \"The way his face darkened in an instant really scared me.\"","\"If he can act like this in front of cameras, it's hard to imagine what kind of person he is in private.\"","Little Fatty also didn't want to draw such a room and was at a loss.","It was as if he had made a mistake, and he kept stealing glances at his two \"temporary parents.\"","Both Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng noticed Little Fatty's uneasiness but had no desire to comfort him.","They had never stayed in such a room in their entire lives.","They couldn't even force a smile.","The five or six-year-old Little Fatty could only try to comfort them: \"It's okay. There are chickens over there, and we'll have eggs.\" Little Fatty said, trying to please them.","At this moment, the online viewers really felt sorry for Little Fatty.","He originally had such a lively and likeable personality.","Although the viewers somewhat looked down on Shen Qingqing and CEO Lu, most of them were mainly teasing.","But seeing the little baby trying to comfort them while these two adults still wore sour expressions really touched a nerve.","\"Are you serious? What are these two being so high and mighty about?\"","\"Not getting the room you want is just a matter of luck. Why blame Little Fatty?\"","\"I'm really suffocating here. If someone treated my child like this, I'd rush over and tear them apart.\"","\"If you can't handle hardship, why come on this kind of show? Did you come to enjoy luxury?\"","Their negative energy was so intense it affected the other children as well.","Zhou Junyan, the Little Superstar's son, had gotten the second-best room and was originally a bit happy.","But seeing Little Fatty so upset, he didn't dare to show his joy.","As for Best Actor Song's daughter, she was pouting.","Best Actor Song said, \"Our room is very nice. Dad will make you a swing in the yard later.\"","The little girl was immediately attracted by the idea of a swing and happily said, \"Okay!\"","As for He Lingfeng, who had the best luck, he quietly went over to talk to Shen Wei and Lin Rui.","No one else knew what he said.","But everyone was observing the children's reactions.","They saw He Lingfeng go to Mu Zhixing and say, \"This is for you!\" He directly exchanged rooms, giving the sea view room to Mu Zhixing.","He chose the classroom-converted room for himself.","Although He Lingfeng didn't talk much, he had a very sensitive personality.","When viewing the rooms, he was indifferent, but when he saw the sparkle in Mu Zhixing's eyes, he knew she liked it.","Mu Zhixing was studying art.","The sea view room was designed by an interior designer, and the little girl really liked it.","Mu Zhixing said, \"No need, I'll stay over there.\"","Shen Wei came over and said, \"It's He Lingfeng's goodwill, and you're a little girl with a weak constitution. It's easy to catch a cold over there.\"","Mu Zhixing was reluctant to accept this kindness, after all, the difference between the two rooms was too great.","A child who has never been pampered, when suddenly favored, first reacts with discomfort.","Shen Wei said, \"Be a good girl and listen.\"","Mu Zhixing uneasily looked at Gu Qingyan.","Gu Qingyan said, \"Since He Lingfeng wants to give it to you, just accept it.\"","Mu Zhixing still didn't want to, but He Lingfeng resolved it with one sentence.","He said, \"I saw some easels and paintbrushes over there.\"","In an instant, Mu Zhixing's eyes lit up with such intensity.","Even the fans watching through the livestream could feel how much she truly loved painting.","Mu Zhixing went to record the show.","The teachers at Starry Sky Kindergarten were also watching.","At this moment, seeing this scene, Qi Zhong should have felt gratified, but his eyes stung, and he nearly shed tears.","Fortunately, he hadn't missed out on nurturing such a talented genius.","And he had laid a solid foundation for Mu Zhixing.","Allowing her to move freely in the world of painting.","At this moment, the online viewers were summarizing:","\"Little Fatty loves eating the most.\"","\"The actor's daughter loves handsome guys the most.\"","\"Mu Zhixing loves painting the most.\"","\"He Lingfeng loves Mu Zhixing the most.\"","\"So it seems only the Little Superstar's son is just passing through everyone else's world.\"","\"This kind of shipping everything really gives me a balanced diet. I can't believe I'm shipping pure love in a child's world.\"","\"After researching Starry Sky Kindergarten, I found that Mu Zhixing and He Lingfeng both lived there, which means this is childhood sweethearts, right?\"","\"Isn't this too exaggerated? The little girl is holding national painting exhibitions abroad, while the little boy is studying computers at home. I wouldn't dare to imagine this even in my dreams.\"","\"I'm not surprised that He Lingfeng would give this room to Mu Zhixing, but I'm amazed that Lin Rui agreed.\"","After all, Lin Rui looked like the type of strong, dazzling person who doesn't like to be bothered.","Who wouldn't want to stay in a spacious, bright sea view room?","Now they've exchanged it for a drafty iron bunk bed.","Anyone would feel the difference, right?","Moreover, Lin Rui was also born into wealth and had never seen such a poor room in her life.","After they exchanged rooms,","The host announced this news to everyone.","Shen Qingqing's face was full of envy, jealousy, and hatred. She really wanted the sea view room.","Seeing what she desperately wanted being casually given away by Lin Rui, she couldn't help but think of her own love life.","She resented Little Fatty even more.","Did this stupid child not wash his hands before coming to draw lots?","But CEO Lu was looking at Lin Rui with tender, lingering eyes.","Lin Rui seemed to sense the gaze.","Lin Rui glared back.","Seeing CEO Lu's expression, she almost vomited up her dinner in disgust.","She really didn't understand why he was so slimy now.","Thinking about how she had cried over him several times in the past, she wanted to slap herself on the beach.","It was truly youthful ignorance.","Now it's all just embarrassing history."]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210: Improving Accommodation with Cutting-Edge Technology","paragraphs":["After everyone had chosen their rooms, it was time to return and rest. After all, it had been a very tiring day.","Throughout the process, there were occasional mini-interviews to add some entertainment for the fans watching the live stream online.","Mu Zhixing returned to her room and, upon seeing that there were several rooms on this side, immediately became excited. Her eyes sparkled as she asked, \"Can I invite them to come and stay here?\"","There was plenty of room, after all, with several rooms upstairs and downstairs.","Gu Qingyan said, \"You can ask the host.\"","The child then bounced off happily to ask the host. She was truly delighted.","The innocence and kindness of children touched even the viewers behind the screens: \"My internet daughter is so well-behaved.\"","Mu Zhixing asked the male host. But the host regretfully told her, \"I'm sorry, but that's not allowed.\"","If they were really to live there, everyone could fit in one room.","But if they did that, where would the fun be? Rules were rules.","The little one deflated instantly, looking particularly pitiful.","The online viewers were almost moved to tears by her: \"This child really has a strong sense of unworthiness. If it were any other little girl, she'd be over the moon to stay in such a nice room, exploring each room for secrets. But she's thinking about everyone being able to stay here.\"","\"Don't you know about Mu Zhixing? She's truly beautiful, strong, but has suffered. She was almost molested by her stepfather before.\"","\"What?!\"","The news spread rapidly online, covering up the initial messages.","Few people knew about the original news anymore.","Upon hearing that such an adorable little girl had almost experienced such a thing, everyone immediately became enraged.","They searched for keywords and indeed found the news.","The more they read, the more shocking it became.","\"How can there be a birth mother like that!\"","\"Only a beast would have those thoughts about a child of just a few years old!\"","\"If it weren't for the hacker who appeared online and exposed his information, the consequences would have been unimaginable.\"","\"Wait, a hacker???\"","For some reason, everyone first thought of He Lingfeng, but quickly dismissed the idea.","He was only a few years old at that time, he couldn't have been that skilled. They just felt grateful that she had encountered a kind-hearted person.","Everyone returned to their respective rooms.","The production team had already tidied up a bit.","At least the walls had been newly painted.","The iron beds were a bit old, but still stable when sat upon.","However, there was a draft from the window. Shen Wei said, \"Why don't we seal up the windows? We'll leave just one that can be opened at any time!\"","This suggestion was quickly approved.","They got tape from the production team.","They sealed the windows tightly, leaving only one open, which greatly reduced the draft in the room.","But Lin Rui, being a young lady from a wealthy family, couldn't tolerate how unattractive the room looked.","She opened her suitcase.","It was full of clothes and accessories.","She then neatly folded the clothes and pants, shaping them into various forms, and stuck them on the wall.","They looked like a series of exquisite murals.","Her choice of clothing colors was very bold.","Many of them were contrasting colors.","Adult clothes and children's clothes were intricately arranged.","There were also beautiful dresses.","Suddenly, the room was filled with an artistic atmosphere.","Lin Rui, as expected of a child carefully nurtured in a wealthy family, had excellent aesthetic taste.","Shen Wei, on the other hand, picked up some old pottery from outside.","The villagers never threw anything away.","Broken bowls and pottery were all stored in sheds in the courtyard. Shen Wei and He Lingfeng rummaged through them like treasure hunters.","They quickly picked out a few items that looked somewhat pleasing to the eye.","Shen Wei and He Lingfeng's faces were covered in dust, almost looking like little raccoons.","Shen Wei was stunningly beautiful.","Even covered in dust, she was incredibly pretty, and the same went for He Lingfeng.","He carried a unique air of nobility about him.","Shen Wei cleaned all the bottles, jars, and pots thoroughly.","Then she built a small shelf with wooden boards.","This was simple, just needing to be nailed together.","The small shelf was a bit rough, but it matched the style well.","They picked some wildflowers from the roadside to decorate.","The room became full of life, completely different from its initial dilapidated state.","The online viewers were all amazed.","\"I never thought they were part of a renovation team!\"","After all, neither Shen Wei nor Lin Rui looked like people who had lived difficult lives.","And the wealth of Starry Sky Kindergarten had already become a meme.","How could such luxurious internet celebrities do these things?","But when they transformed, turning this place into something so artistic,","That moment truly gave everyone a lot to ponder.","\"No wonder they're rich, they really can live well in any situation.\"","\"And Shen Wei's aesthetic is really on point, even putting clear water in a broken black pottery bowl makes the crack look artistic!\"","First, she inserted a small tree branch across it, making a notch. Then she arranged flowers and grasses.","This created a water ripple display.","These were things that could be seen everywhere on the hillside. But now they looked clear and lively.","Indeed, the world doesn't lack beauty, it lacks eyes that can discover beauty.","The netizens said, \"If the clothes knew they were hanging on the wall, they'd cry!\"","\"And I searched for these clothes, the cheapest one costs at least 50,000 yuan.\"","\"But it really looks good, this room is so cozy.\"","\"Even a broken bowl can be arranged to show character. It's given me a new perspective on my messy life.\"","\"No wonder everyone likes Starry Sky Kindergarten so much. From top to bottom, the children are humble and polite, the boys know to be considerate to the girls, and the girls love the boys.\"","\"The teachers have an eye for discovering beauty, and all these people were originally rescued by Shen Wei. Without her as a talent scout, these children's fates would have been very miserable.\"","After decorating, Shen Wei specifically exchanged points from the System for a virtual mattress.","It didn't look like much. But when everyone lay on the bed, that instant feeling of sinking into the mattress was like being embraced by cotton candy.","Everyone felt particularly relaxed and destressed. This was also a credit point loan, but Shen Wei wasn't worried about having too much debt.","This set of three beds cost 100 points each.","Although it wasn't visible, she could truly enjoy it.","She had exchanged for the top-configured version of the mattress.","Shen Wei only exchanged for 5 days of the virtual mattress, which is why it was so cheap.","If she wanted to buy a permanent virtual mattress, it would cost over 10,000 points.","It was a genuine high-end product.","Lying on the bed, everyone fell asleep in a second. Even the cameraman felt drowsy looking at it. Their ability to adapt to any situation was truly healing.","No one wanted to disturb this tranquility.","Even the speed of the danmu slowed down a bit.","But when the camera turned to Shen Qingqing's area, it became chaotic again."]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211: Dirty, Messy, and Poor","paragraphs":["Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng were on the verge of a breakdown.","They had never been in such a filthy, chaotic environment in their lives.","It was hard to believe that people could actually live in this place.","In reality, the room was quite cozy, a standard two-bedroom apartment.","However, the smell was overwhelming. They could detect a pungent odor from 50 meters away.","As they got closer, the smell grew more intense, and in the last 10 meters or so, the nauseating stench hit them like a wall.","Shen Qingqing kept reminding herself that cameras were rolling and she needed to be more gentle, but she couldn't help it - her face was as cold as frost.","Lu Zheng was even more direct, telling the PD beside him: \"Let's pause for a moment, I have something to take care of!\"","The online viewers in the livestream room immediately perked up with interest.","\"Don't cut it off, I want to hear this part!\"","\"Looks like Lu Zheng is about to use his money power!\"","Shen Qingqing felt slightly relieved when she saw Lu Zheng speak up.","Perhaps it was because when she looked at Little Fatty, her eyes seemed to contain daggers.","Even the online viewers found that look a bit unsettling.","\"What on earth are these lovebirds trying to do? Little Fatty is so unlucky to be grouped with them, this is clearly mental pressure.\"","\"Yeah, you have to accept the outcome of the draw.\"","\"If you don't want to live there, who does? Since you drew it, find a way to improve your living environment.\"","\"Earlier, Shen Wei made that run-down little room look beautiful, that's the right way to handle it.\"","\"How can Shen Qingqing compete with Shen Wei like this? Their mindsets are completely different.\"","\"Am I the only one who feels sorry for Little Fatty? He's so pitiful.\"","\"Yeah, he was happily entertaining everyone with his clapper talk earlier, and now he looks so nervous. It really hurts my heart to imagine being in his shoes.\"","Lu Zheng wanted to negotiate with the director about not wanting to stay here, but the director deliberately ignored him, saying it wasn't possible and that they had to follow the rules.","The director's stubbornness infuriated Lu Zheng: \"How much money do you want? This place is unlivable.\"","The director pretended not to hear, which almost drove Lu Zheng mad.","Lu Zheng then reached out to grab the camera, furious at the thought of his angry outburst being broadcast live.","Cameras are always the most important property in a production team.","As soon as he tried to snatch it, others rushed in to protect it.","Lu Zheng was already exhausted, and being provoked repeatedly, he wasn't known for his good temper. He punched the cameraman in the face.","The live broadcast caught it all.","This was a major live streaming incident.","The screen immediately switched to the seaside room of Gu Qingyan and Mu Zhixing.","But the audio was out of sync.","The sounds of fighting and angry shouting could still be heard from the other side.","Lu Zheng had become the first person to fight on a variety show.","In the past, even if artists were dissatisfied, they would just pretend.","At most, they would argue or throw a tantrum.","But who would resort to physical violence on a live show?","Sure enough, as soon as he got physical, word spread quickly, and his popularity soared.","Everyone had thought that Lu Zheng, as a rich second-generation, would at least be graceful and elegant.","They never expected him to be so volatile.","Many people went to Lu Group's official Weibo account to hurl abuse, wanting to know why the chairman would raise such a child.","Lu Group's stock immediately dropped two points.","Billions in assets vanished in an instant.","When Old Man Lu learned about this, he nearly had a heart attack from anger.","He immediately called his son, but Lu Zheng's phone was with the director's team.","There was no way to contact him at all.","Old Man Lu was about to be killed by his foolish son.","Why on earth did he agree to go on this show when everything was fine?","He heard that his son had volunteered for it.","And now that he was on it, he couldn't behave himself and had to cause trouble.","Old Man Lu was furious beyond measure, regretting why he had such a son in the first place.","Thinking about what his son had done, which had clearly become a laughingstock in their elite circles, even he as a father couldn't hold his head high anymore.","The reason Lu Zheng could be so reckless was that he was the sole heir to Lu Group.","There was no one else to compete with him.","The more Old Man Lu looked at his son, the more incompetent he seemed. To be so bewitched by a woman to this extent.","Moreover, Lu Zheng was impulsive and quick-tempered, with no brains when facing problems. Handing over such a large corporation to him in the future would be a waste.","It would be better to make plans early.","Seeing his son being so unfilial, he had no choice but to find another way.","He decided to have another child, to prevent his vast empire from being ruined by his unworthy son.","When he was younger, he never thought about having more children.","Now at this age, having another child was truly being forced by circumstances.","At this moment, Lu Zheng was still unaware that his father had given up on him.","He was still dealing with the situation. Because of his attempt to snatch the camera and his assault on the cameraman, his behavior was so egregious that the entire crew came to mediate.","Lu Zheng initially wanted to leave on the spot, at most paying the breach of contract penalty.","But when he saw the figure for the penalty, he was shocked.","The breach of contract penalty was actually 300 million yuan.","Even though Lu Zheng was rich, he couldn't just throw away hundreds of millions of yuan like it was nothing.","With people constantly trying to persuade him, he finally calmed down reluctantly.","At this point, the live broadcast cameras were mostly focused on the others.","Mu Zhixing and Gu Qingyan were choosing their rooms.","The online viewers couldn't help but sigh: \"It's feast or famine - some people are crammed into one room, while they each have a room to spare.\"","Mu Zhixing was very considerate and chose a room in a corner.","But Gu Qingyan insisted she take the largest room.","The largest room had floor-to-ceiling windows with a view of the sea.","And the sunlight streaming in was truly beautiful.","Mu Zhixing liked it very much.","But she was used to being cautious and felt embarrassed.","Gu Qingyan said, \"It's fine, I've often stayed in rooms like this before.\"","He said it casually, but the online viewers were envious.","\"Jealous to the point of distortion.\"","\"The young master of Gu Corporation. His family has so many hotel businesses, he must always stay in five-star hotels or large suites when traveling.\"","\"What we envy is already commonplace for them.\"","Gu Qingyan didn't know what the bullet comments were saying. He just told Mu Zhixing, \"I'm a guy, I can stay in any room. You take this one!\" Then he chose another room for himself.","\"I want to go see Sister Principal,\" said Mu Zhixing.","Gu Qingyan replied, \"Then let's go take a look.\"","\"Okay!\" Mu Zhixing took Gu Qingyan's hand of her own accord.","Gu Qingyan was a bit surprised by the honor.","When they arrived at the classroom shared room, they were stunned by the sight before them as soon as they entered.","It had looked dilapidated before.","Now it was decorated with bonsai plants and ornaments, looking very pretty, a world apart from before.","Mu Zhixing's eyes lit up: \"So cool!\"","Everyone was sleeping soundly.","Mu Zhixing wasn't very sleepy at first, but seeing others fast asleep,","She started to yawn softly.","Shen Wei forced her eyes open slightly, and seeing that Mu Zhixing was there, she waved her hand groggily.","Mu Zhixing immediately ran over to snuggle with Shen Wei.","The online viewers were melting from the cuteness.","Shen Wei took off the little one's shoes and hugged her onto the bed. The baby happily lay down next to Shen Wei.","As soon as she lay down, she felt the mattress was exceptionally soft.","Even children who weren't sleepy would feel drowsy, and in such a warm, comfortable, and safe environment, Mu Zhixing fell asleep instantly.","Gu Qingyan never expected that they came together, but he left alone.","The online viewers were still laughing.","\"Did you see Gu Qingyan's envious look just now? He also wants to sleep in the same bed with Shen Wei.\"","\"How inappropriate!\"","\"I feel like Gu Qingyan's inner monologue is that he really wants to switch souls with Mu Zhixing.\"","\"The person above is talking as if nobody else wants that.\"","\"Everyone's discussing them, but is no one curious about what happened after Lu Zheng hit someone? I saw that it's already reached the top of the entertainment hot search list.\"","\"I can't believe it, so this side is like an art film, while that side is an action movie?\"","\"What the hell do you mean by action movie? I've only seen people hitting others on camera in law enforcement shows before.\"","\"So what happened in the end? Can someone release an official video explaining it? I'm dying to know.\""]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212: Stronger than the Rich Second Generation","paragraphs":["Netizens were all talking about the incident of Lu Zheng hitting someone. The topic was trending hot.","The production team, upon receiving the news, had no choice but to resume the live broadcast.","When the cameras cut back to the chicken coop room, they found Little Fatty with red-rimmed eyes, looking as if he had been crying.","Lu Zheng and Shen Qingqing were also in this room.","An air purifier had been added to the room.","The three of them were living together. Due to limited conditions, there was only this one air purifier, which was quickly spotted by sharp-eyed netizens.","\"That air purifier is from the sea view room, right? I noticed it earlier when they panned across the room because it's the same brand as the one I use at home.\"","\"It must be. Money really does talk!\"","\"This world is just a big sham. With money, you can break all the rules.\"","\"I feel sorry for the award-winning actors who had to suffer in the past.\"","\"Without rules, there's no order. They're really arrogant.\"","\"I'm not Little Fatty's fan, but seeing him cry makes me feel so bad. The kid came here to have fun, and now he's depressed. Shouldn't the production team take some responsibility?\"","\"Just thinking about all the unethical things these people have done makes my blood boil.\"","At this moment, Shen Qingqing was also furious. Even though there was an air purifier here, whether it was psychological or not, she still felt the smell was strong.","Moreover, the chickens outside were clucking, which was very annoying and made it impossible to sleep.","Not resting well, coupled with the small accident that had just happened, left them all looking terrible.","Next, they saw the PD hand them the production team's task.","It was a cue card stating that they needed to make their own dinner. There were ingredients in the kitchen.","The two of them quickly went to the kitchen, but as soon as they opened the door, the smell of chicken droppings wafted up again.","Shen Qingqing was so angry she was about to curse.","But seeing the dark cameras, she swallowed the words that were about to come out.","They searched the kitchen and found only a gas stove, but there were some vegetables and eggs.","Shen Qingqing said, \"Shall we have noodles for dinner?\"","Noodles were the simplest and most convenient option.","She hadn't eaten dinner the night before to look good on camera.","At this moment, although she didn't want to eat, she really couldn't hold out anymore. So she decided to make tomato and egg noodles. It had been so long since she cooked that her hands were clumsy.","But at least she had done it before, so the steps and process were correct.","Finally, she brought the noodles to the table. Shen Qingqing kept a cold expression, as if everyone owed her money.","Little Fatty took one bite and almost spat it out: \"It's too salty.\"","Shen Qingqing was about to explode. She had forced herself to cook despite her annoyance, and now someone was complaining about the taste: \"How is it salty!\"","But when she took a bite herself, she couldn't help but spit it back into the bowl: \"Forget it, let's not eat this.\"","For dinner, they just found two cucumbers among the vegetables, washed them, and ate them plain, considering it as dieting.","Shen Wei's mattress was a piece of high-tech equipment brought by the system.","Although she only slept for an hour, it was extremely refreshing.","When Shen Wei woke up, she found that she had a soft, cute little thing in her arms.","Upon closer inspection, it turned out to be Mu Zhixing.","Mu Zhixing also opened his doe-like eyes following Shen Wei's movement.","The others were also stirring and rustling about.","Seeing that they were awake, the PD quickly gave them their task cards.","Since they didn't have a stove on their side, they could only choose to team up with others for cooking.","Naturally, they decided to team up with old acquaintances, so after a brief discussion, they all decided to go to Sea View Room No. 1.","Everyone had changed into sportswear.","Shen Wei, who was already very beautiful, looked even more radiant after a good sleep.","Lin Rui also felt refreshed: \"Am I too tired, or did that nap feel exceptionally good?\" Indeed, all the fatigue in her body had disappeared.","He Lingfeng felt the same way. He had slept well, his little face rosy, looking adorable.","The originally dilapidated room had been beautifully decorated by them.","Mu Zhixing said, \"You guys are amazing.\" He didn't know a room could be made so pretty.","Shen Wei was happy to be praised: \"It's not bad, right?\"","After they finished tidying up, they all walked out together.","That's when they heard about Lu Zheng's bold act of hitting someone in front of the cameras.","They were all shocked.","Television stations are known for their solidarity.","He really hadn't considered the consequences of his actions at all.","Lin Rui was speechless when she heard about it.","She knew Lu Zheng was stupid before, but seeing him being this stupid left her at a loss for words.","She increasingly felt that she must have been blind to have liked him before.","The group, dressed similarly, stood out in the village.","Not far away, they heard a tinkling sound.","Following the sound, they saw Best Actor Song making a small swing for his daughter.","Seeing them, he greeted the two children: \"Would you like to come over and play later?\"","Mu Zhixing said, \"Thank you, uncle, but no need.\" They had swings and big slides at kindergarten, which they had played on before.","Shen Wei made small talk: \"Have you made dinner yet?\"","Best Actor Song said, \"Not yet. I just fixed a tractor for a local, and he said he'd take us for dinner later.\"","\"You can even fix tractors?\" Shen Wei was surprised.","Best Actor Song said, \"I once played a repairman in a film and spent a solid six months learning in a repair shop.\"","The bullet screen comments were full of praise for his dedication.","\"Nowadays, actors often take on multiple projects at once. It's rare to see young actors truly experiencing life for their roles.\"","After a brief chat, they went to Room No. 1.","As soon as they entered, they saw Gu Qingyan coming out. He was holding a glass of ice water. He was wearing gray lounge pants, which toned down his refined look, but he was still handsome, making people want to sigh in admiration.","Shen Wei subsequently went to the kitchen.","As expected of a sea view room.","Inside, there was an abundance of chicken, duck, fish, and meat, as well as dozens of types of vegetables.","But at this moment, everyone was gathered around the kitchen, looking at each other in bewilderment: \"We don't know how to cook!\"","Netizens were dying of laughter: \"Oh my god, what a bunch of comedians!\"","\"As an old fan of Starry Sky, let me enlighten everyone. Shen Wei is the principal of Starry Sky Kindergarten, known to be well-off.\"","\"Gu Qingyan is the youngest son of Gu Corporation, born with a silver spoon in his mouth.\"","\"Lin Rui, the ex-girlfriend of CEO Lu, has a net worth no less than his. They all have housekeepers at home who cook for them, so this is their first time ever cooking for themselves!\"","Netizens couldn't help but say, \"I finally know where I'm better than these rich kids.\"","Chef Liu, who had been watching on his phone, was getting increasingly anxious.","Seeing that none of them knew how to cook, he was scratching his head in frustration.","He wished Starry Sky could \"airdrop\" him over there to cook for them.","This was ridiculous. None of them knew how to cook. What were they going to eat?"]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213: All Ordinary People","paragraphs":["The long-time fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten believed that Shen Wei was capable of anything.","After all, Shen Wei's talent for recruiting people was unparalleled.","If you were to look at the resumes of the staff at the original Starry Sky Kindergarten, each one would be an intimidating presence.","For example, Zhang Daming, the school bus driver, used to be one of the top drivers within the system.","He could navigate all kinds of S-curves with ease. If he were to go to a driving school, he'd be the instructor's instructor.","Liu Chef used to be the head chef at Jiangbei Grand Restaurant. Although the restaurant later went out of business, it was once a luxury dining establishment.","The dance teacher, art teacher, and music teacher were even more impressive.","Every day, their inboxes were flooded with private messages.","Many training institutions were even willing to offer six-figure monthly salaries to poach them.","There were also numerous art exam candidates with deep pockets, just hoping to attend one of their short classes.","Talent of this caliber was actually teaching at a kindergarten. The tuition was only 1,600 yuan.","The children at Starry Sky Kindergarten were all independent and confident.","With such excellent teachers accompanying the children's growth, their progress was visible to the naked eye.","Later, they even invited scientists to give the children an introduction to science.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was a treasure trove.","The more you learned about it, the more impressive it seemed.","In the end, people became devoted fans of this place.","Shen Wei was the pillar of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Even Liu Chef said that although she was young, Shen Wei's position in the team was like a stabilizing force.","As long as Shen Wei was there, everything seemed to be under control.","But what did the long-time fans of Starry Sky see at this moment?","Shen Wei was looking worried because she couldn't cook, while Lin Rui and Gu Qingyan looked at each other helplessly.","Three adults, and not one of them could cook.","Lin Rui said, \"I know how to make instant noodles, but we don't have any right now.\"","Gu Qingyan's face was even redder.","He had grown from a spoiled rich kid to someone who could supervise work now, and he felt he had made great progress.","But at this moment, he finally realized that he couldn't cook.","If he could, it would have scored him so many points with Shen Wei. He was still too young. He hadn't learned such an important skill. Now five people were going to go hungry here.","Liu Chef, watching from behind the screen, was pacing back and forth anxiously.","If he had known that going out to film a reality show would involve cooking, he would have volunteered.","But distant water can't quench a nearby fire.","Everyone had been busy all day. They hadn't eaten much, and now their stomachs were growling.","What to do now?","Shen Wei said, \"Before I came, I saw Best Actor Song taking Little Xue to eat at a local's place. Why don't we go over and ask?\"","As soon as she said this, Shen Wei felt someone gently tugging at her sleeve.","She looked down and saw it was Mu Zhixing.","Mu Zhixing said, \"I can cook.\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Wei was a bit surprised.","Mu Zhixing was just over 6 years old when she arrived.","Now, after more than half a year, she had just turned seven.","Now that all the adults were at a loss, could a child really cook?","But they really couldn't get any food right now. Shen Wei had no choice but to say, \"Alright, let's do this. We'll cook together. You tell us the steps, and we'll do it together.\"","They couldn't really let a child cook for them.","Fire, oil, and such things were all too dangerous for a child.","The other two agreed when they heard Shen Wei's suggestion: \"Yes, let's do it together.\"","Mu Zhixing really did know how to cook.","She directed everyone to chop the chicken.","First, they fried scallions, ginger, and rock sugar to create a caramel color. Then they put in the chicken pieces and stir-fried them. The aroma immediately filled the air.","Then they added hot water and started to braise it.","Throughout the process, not a single drop of salt was added.","But judging by the color, it looked like it was going to be successful.","Soon, under Mu Zhixing's instruction, those who needed to cut did so, those who needed to stir-fry did so, and even He Lingfeng was assigned to wash vegetables.","The kitchen was bustling with activity.","But they were all novices.","They tried to cut each piece of vegetable to the same size, and being afraid of cutting themselves, they all cut very slowly.","This made Liu Chef, watching from behind the screen, very anxious.","It's a good thing they didn't come to the back kitchen to help.","Otherwise, it might have given someone prone to anxiety a heart attack.","However, Doctor Lu came to find Liu Chef with his phone: \"Mu Zhixing really knows how to cook!\" This was the first time he had heard about this.","Mentioning this, Liu Chef's face showed a hint of warmth: \"Indeed, all the steps are correct.\"","Thanks to Mu Zhixing, otherwise they really might not have been able to eat.","\"How did she learn?\"","\"Maybe it's because the little one often came to the back kitchen to watch.\"","Before, they thought Mu Zhixing came to the kitchen because she was hungry. Everyone would give her food, but she wouldn't eat.","Later, they heard Qi Zhong say that this was called \"observing characters.\" It was an important part of sketching from life.","He didn't understand those art terms.","Anyway, Mu Zhixing's time wasn't wasted. Although it was just theory, it was still better than the others.","The online viewers were praising Mu Zhixing like crazy.","\"Oh my god, the baby is so amazing. She really knows how to cook.\"","\"Watching them cook really made me laugh. Gu Qingyan was stir-frying, but he was standing two meters away from the stove, just afraid of getting splashed by oil.\"","\"The other two were cutting vegetables like they were carving flowers. Just chop it, what's there to hesitate about?\"","\"This family can't do without Mu Zhixing.\"","Although people were mocking these rich kids for never having done a day's work in their lives, most of the comments were full of affectionate smiles.","\"Everyone is doing what they can.\"","\"I was laughing at first, but by the end, I was actually a bit moved.\"","With Mu Zhixing's instructions, the group managed to make four dishes and a soup: braised chicken, stir-fried cucumber slices, cold Chinese cabbage salad, stir-fried potato strips, and a celery soup.","When all the dishes were ready, Shen Wei couldn't help but pick up Mu Zhixing and give her a kiss: \"Thank you, we wouldn't have been able to eat this meal without you.\"","Everyone had secretly tasted the food, and it was quite good.","Although it couldn't compare to Liu Chef's level, at least it was edible.","Just as they were about to dig in, there was a knock at the door. Shen Wei immediately said, \"Come in.\"","To their surprise, it was Superstar Zhou and his son Zhou Junyan.","At this moment, Zhou Junyan was holding a bouquet of wildflowers. As soon as they entered, they smelled the rich aroma of food and swallowed: \"Um... we can't cook. Can we join you for dinner?\"","They had tried in the kitchen earlier.","But everything either burned or smoked.","The small kitchen was filled with thick smoke.","In the end, they had no choice, and the production team suggested they go and share a meal with someone else.","As a man, Superstar Zhou had originally wanted to go to Best Actor Song.","But he heard that Best Actor Song had gone to eat at a local's house, and he didn't want to impose.","That left Shen Qingqing and the Starry Sky group.","He wasn't surprised that Shen Wei and her group went to the sea view room.","Because there was no kitchen in the classroom area.","The chicken coop area smelled too strong.","There was no choice but to come here.","He had originally wanted to bring some ingredients from the kitchen, but unfortunately, the father and son had already messed everything up. Now they could only go up the mountain to pick some wildflowers.","Shen Wei said, \"We haven't started eating yet, please join us.\"","They had cooked a whole chicken.","And there was also a pork trotter in the fridge, as well as a pre-prepared grilled fish.","Seeing the two arrive, they quickly took out the things from the fridge to serve them.","Mu Zhixing specially brought a chair for Zhou Junyan: \"Little brother, sit here.\"","Zhou Junyan immediately handed the flowers to Mu Zhixing.","Mu Zhixing said, \"Thank you,\" and put the flowers in the vase on the table.","To be honest, with flowers in the room, it immediately became different, very cozy.","Their food turned out to be quite good.","Everyone was hungry.","They all started wolfing down the food.","In total, four adults and three children ate more than 5 jin (2.5 kg) of chicken.","All the other dishes were completely finished.","The grilled fish and pork trotters were all eaten up.","Fortunately, they had steamed enough rice.","After the last grain of rice was eaten, everyone looked deeply satisfied.","The online viewers were a bit surprised. Seeing how clumsy they were when cooking, they didn't think it would taste good.","Unexpectedly, they ate so much and seemed to enjoy it so much.","\"Watching them eat this visually unappealing food actually made me hungry.\"","Zhou Junyan had been criticized by his father for being picky with food before. But now he had turned into a little glutton. The way he ate showed that he had been hungry for a long time.","The long-time fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten couldn't help but laugh: \"If Zhou Junyan came to Starry Sky Kindergarten, his picky eating habit would be cured without treatment. He might even gain thirty jin (15 kg).\"","\"That's right, our Liu Chef is a professional at fattening people up.\"","\"Chubby baby, chubby baby...\""]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214: Shen Qingqing Won Once","paragraphs":["After finishing their meal, everyone received their assignments.","They gathered in the open space in front of the village to play games.","This was a classic routine for the variety show.","The first game was a three-legged race, with adults and children's legs tied together.","It was an out-and-back race to a target. The pair with the shortest time would win.","The second round was a quiz competition for the children.","Whoever won would earn a point.","The third event was a treasure hunt in the forest.","The team that found the most treasure chests would earn a point.","The team with the highest total score would have their meals prepared by others the next day.","When the host explained these rules, everyone became serious.","Few people present knew how to cook well.","When it came to the question of what they'd eat tomorrow, everyone suddenly became very focused.","For the three-legged race, Shen Wei and He Lingfeng were sent out, as they usually had good chemistry.","The other team sent out Shen Qingqing and Little Fatty.","At the starting signal, they began to compete fiercely.","Perhaps because Shen Qingqing was so determined, they started running while others were still walking.","If they didn't use their strength properly, they could fall and get hurt badly.","Shen Wei couldn't take that risk.","But when He Lingfeng saw the others running, he got a bit anxious.","He was a very competitive child.","He couldn't help but try to walk faster, almost tripping Shen Wei.","The two stumbled along, falling behind.","The remaining teams had three people each. In the end, Superstar Zhou and his son won.","Both teams added one point.","The second competition was a quiz.","Each person was given a completely different question.","For example, Song Xiaoxue was young, so her task was to match similar items, all using pictures.","She just had to connect six types of fruits, vegetables, and animals.","He Lingfeng was given a high school physics problem.","Mu Zhixing's task was to draw a small house.","Zhou Junyan had simple math addition and subtraction.","As for Little Fatty, he had to fill in idioms, and could use pinyin for characters he couldn't write.","The three fastest to complete their tasks would earn points.","He Lingfeng hadn't scored in the last round, so he was determined this time.","The questions were tailored to each person's level.","But the online audience wasn't happy about it.","\"That's so unfair, Song's team got an easy question,\" they complained. The matching game was really quick.","The variety show fans discovered that the question given to He Lingfeng was so difficult that even high school students might struggle with it.","\"If you don't want him to pass, just say so.\"","\"You shouldn't bully children like this.\"","\"Even if He Lingfeng knows the answer, it would take him a while to write it out.\"","Everyone had something to say.","Soon, the staff handed out whiteboard markers to the children.","According to everyone's understanding, Xiaoxue should be the fastest.","But the show required 100% accuracy.","As soon as they said \"start,\" He Lingfeng took off the fastest, followed by Mu Zhixing.","Mu Zhixing only needed to draw a simple house.","But with a few quick strokes, she left the live stream audience stunned. She had drawn a detailed classroom building.","This child had only been there once.","Yet she could draw out every detail.","And on a plain whiteboard, without colors, she managed to create a 3D effect.","Mu Zhixing's perspective was incredible.","Her talent amazed even her fans. It was truly impressive.","The drawing was vivid and lifelike.","While everyone was marveling at Mu Zhixing's talent, the camera switched, and the comment section exploded again.","Following the comments, they saw that He Lingfeng was on a rampage.","He was rapidly writing out various steps with quick strokes.","His speed was incredible.","In the blink of an eye, he had filled half the whiteboard.","Finally, he put down his pen and quickly said, \"I'm done.\"","All his steps were correct.","Song Xiaoxue finished almost at the same time as him. But she had made one wrong connection, so her result was disqualified.","The second to finish was Mu Zhixing. After she finished drawing, the online audience wished they could preserve the whiteboard in resin.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had always been in the spotlight, with many people accusing them of hyping up \"child geniuses\" and such.","But when Mu Zhixing and He Lingfeng demonstrated their true talents in front of everyone, people realized that calling them geniuses before had been an understatement. These kids were prodigies.","The third to finish was Little Fatty. This time, Shen Qingqing was carried by Little Fatty's performance. They had already won, even without the third round.","During the third round, while others were hunting for treasure,","Mu Zhixing couldn't help but take out a pocket notebook and pen to draw.","He Lingfeng was searching for treasure chests nearby, and when he found them, he shared half with Mu Zhixing.","The online fans went crazy: \"Oh my god, what kind of childhood sweetheart romance is this?\"","\"I know I shouldn't ship kids, but I can't help it.\"","\"I declare He Lingfeng the most manly person in my heart.\"","\"Seriously, this little boy is better than my ex-husband.\"","\"If your ex can't even compare to a kid, I need to know more. Did you break up?\"","\"We've been separated for a while now.\"","The host congratulated Little Fatty and Shen Qingqing's team for winning first place. Shen Qingqing's expression improved slightly.","She cast a proud glance at Shen Wei. But Shen Wei didn't even look at her.","It felt like punching a pillow.","Shen Wei of course knew that Shen Qingqing wanted to show off. But in variety shows, it's not just about winning. It's about being \"interesting.\" Losing audience favor for the sake of winning would be counterproductive.","Unfortunately, this was a lesson Shen Qingqing didn't understand."]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215: Ways to Make Money","paragraphs":["Day 1 of the game ended quickly, and the production team conducted an indoor interview focusing on the children.","The first few questions were normal, asking whether they preferred their dad or mom at home, and which kid they liked best here.","When it came to Little Fatty, they asked an additional question: \"Why were you so intense during the game?\"","Everyone expected Little Fatty to say something dramatic, but he responded with a pitiful: \"I'm hungry.\"","Upon hearing this, the bullet screen comments froze for a few seconds, then exploded.","\"I really feel bad for him. You can tell from Little Fatty's build that he loves food. Shen Qingqing just ate a cucumber herself, which might be fine for an adult, but how can a child endure that?\"","\"No wonder tomorrow's reward is a day's worth of food.\"","\"He just wanted to eat his fill, what's wrong with that?\"","\"I'm so done with Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng. If you can't take care of children, don't bring them! The kids are suffering and being tormented with you.\"","\"When Little Fatty first arrived, he was an extrovert, lively and cheerful. Now, after just over a day, he's become timid and withdrawn.\"","\"This proves that even kids are afraid of being psychologically manipulated.\"","\"It's suffocating. Can't they change the temporary guardian for the child? If this continues, I'm really going to report it.\"","Even the recording PD felt sympathy and gave Little Fatty one of his own boxed meals.","Although this wasn't allowed, who could bear to let a child go hungry?","The boxed meal had already cooled down.","The braised pork was a bit tough.","But Little Fatty ate it with gusto, taking big bites.","When it came time to interview He Lingfeng, everyone recalled his incredible speed and accuracy in solving problems.","No wonder he could teach middle and high school students; he really had skills.","Now, even a university admissions director had taken notice of him.","It seems the next step is to see who can snatch him up.","\"The annual battle for talents among universities is always my favorite spectacle to watch. But I never imagined it would extend to a 6-year-old child this time.\"","\"What's wrong with being 6? After evaluation, this is a true prodigy.\"","\"If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes, who would believe it?\"","\"And his problem-solving approach is really correct. To be able to answer so quickly in such a short time, I'm tired of praising him.\"","The Chinese people's inherent admiration for excellence was on full display at this moment.","When Mu Zhixing came out, the production crew asked: \"What did you draw in the mountains?\"","The netizens immediately got excited; this was exactly what they wanted to know.","The cameras hadn't captured it at the time.","Mu Zhixing shyly took out her little notebook.","As the host flipped through it, others looked through the camera, and everyone was stunned.","\"Is Mu Zhixing some kind of reincarnated printer?\"","Although she had only used a ballpoint pen to draw, the pictures were incredibly lifelike.","Even the serrated edges of the grass leaves and insect holes were drawn perfectly.","Some plant experts could even identify the grass species based on this drawing, providing a detailed explanation in the bullet screen comments.","\"This could totally be used as an illustration in textbooks.\"","\"To think it was drawn on the spot, no wonder she can hold art exhibitions abroad.\"","\"Princess, your servant has arrived late. This is my long-lost art princess.\"","\"Every time I see her draw, I'm amazed at the disparities in this world.\"","When Zhou Junyan came out and shyly said that all five children liked Mu Zhixing best and wanted to marry her, the netizens went wild.","\"I ship it! I ship it!\"","The little guy looked just like the Zhou superstar, with a cool face, but when talking about Mu Zhixing, he became a bit shy.","\"I really want to ship them, but I can't help but tell him that Mu Zhixing already has a very impressive childhood sweetheart.\"","\"Hahaha.\"","\"Who would have thought we'd get to ship little sister and little brother romance on a variety show?\"","Day 1 of the live broadcast ended.","The guests thought they would get their phones back once the live broadcast was over.","These days, people's dependence on phones makes it nearly impossible to accept being without them for more than 24 hours.","But the production team refused to return them, saying it was written in the rules that they must stay for the full 5 days.","On one hand, it was indeed written in the contract.","On the other hand, the online uproar had become too intense, and they were worried that Lu Zheng, the problematic father, would cause more trouble.","Although the kid-focused variety show had some popularity before, it was generally moderate.","Even on the Apple official website, the entry was small and hard to find.","It required detailed searching to locate.","But after the incident of Lu Zheng hitting someone in front of the camera, it suddenly became a hot topic. It had been years since a guest on a show had hit someone.","Then there was the issue of Little Fatty going hungry.","Shen Qingqing rolled her eyes; these topics were already trending online.","The criticism was overwhelming.","All the guests' phones were ringing.","Especially Lu Zheng's.","His family's company wanted to contact him, hoping he could behave better.","Because of him, the Lu Group's stock had started to plummet.","But since it had started, it couldn't end; they had to finish recording the first episode.","Early on the second day, as soon as everyone opened the live broadcast, they saw that everyone was still sleeping.","The netizens were amazed.","Is this the advantage of having ordinary people on the show?","They truly weren't acting.","Most people who want to be on shows would try to perform a bit.","Guests usually try to appear hardworking, capable, and understanding – these are all ways to score points.","But these people truly didn't care.","Especially Shen Wei, who had a high-tech invisible mattress.","Lying on it for an hour felt like a full recovery.","She had slept soundly for 10 hours here.","Not only was she full of energy, but her appearance was also well-maintained.","When she woke up, the benefits of Lin Rui's three large suitcases of clothes became apparent. She personally selected outfits.","Her aesthetic sense was on point, and she looked truly beautiful.","Today, Shen Wei wore a little dress.","Lin Rui wore black wide-leg pants, a trench coat, and a white shirt underneath. She applied sexy red lipstick,","Looking beautifully aggressive.","She put a small vest over He Lingfeng's trench coat, making him look like a trendy street dance kid.","When they appeared, they all looked very stylish, unlike the others who were still disheveled from sleep.","Today's task was for the adults to record in-studio advertisements and short clips. The children had to figure out how to earn money, which would be used to buy food.","As for how the children would earn money, the production team didn't specify.","The netizens were once again speechless: \"It's not easy for adults to come up with money-making ideas. They're just children.\"","\"These people are really pushing it to the extreme.\"","Probably due to the criticism, the production team had to provide some fruits and vegetables for the children to sell on the street.","But in this small village, every household had their own vegetables, so no one would buy them.","Vegetables weren't anything special here.","After a full hour, they hadn't sold anything.","The five children were starting to feel discouraged.","At this moment, He Lingfeng came up with an idea.","He borrowed paper and pen from someone and made a sign that read: \"Tutoring for high school students, 30 yuan per hour.\""]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216: All Live Broadcasts Are Out","paragraphs":["Although this place is small, the importance of education has already been deeply ingrained in people's minds, thanks to the science popularization efforts of the village cadres. Add to that the children's tutoring sessions, which carry a hint of curiosity.","Before long, someone really came to him for tutoring. So He Lingfeng led the person back to his classroom.","The internet users were all stunned!","\"Previously, everyone didn't want to share rooms for classrooms, but now they're being put to use.\"","\"He Lingfeng is so clever.\"","\"Shen Wei and the others who got less desirable rooms can make them look brand new through their own decorating, and the kids around them learn by example. So guardians are indeed the best teachers for children.\"","\"To be honest, through this show, I've become a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten and want to go study there.\"","\"Don't even think about it, even we locals can't get in line.\"","The internet users were also drooling over the tutoring fee of thirty yuan per hour.","\"30 yuan an hour, what a conscience in the industry.\"","\"I also want the little boy to tutor me, I'm willing to pay 50 yuan.\"","\"I'll pay 100.\"","\"This is one-on-one tutoring, you can't even get a college student tutor for this price nowadays.\"","The high school student who came to He Lingfeng for lessons initially just wanted to test him. But He Lingfeng's explanation was very detailed.","The high school student was amazed.","Not only was his explanation of the problems good, but even his handwriting on the board was impressive.","Long-time fans of Starry Sky couldn't help but explain: \"Because they have a calligraphy teacher there.\"","He and Mu Zhixing live in the kindergarten, which is equivalent to having private lessons every weekend.","The high school student started off joking around, but gradually became engrossed in the lesson.","In the end, he really brought out the problems he couldn't solve.","The moment he took them out, he felt stupid.","Why would he expect a child to know something he himself didn't understand?","But surprisingly, this person really could explain it, and did so very clearly and thoroughly.","He Lingfeng was trained by Professor Liu. His foundation was very solid.","Professor Liu had previously done a lot of desk work to teach well at a Third-tier university.","He knew these children had some weak foundations, so his lectures were always profound yet easy to understand.","He would break down and thoroughly explain even the tiniest details.","He Lingfeng, having learned from Professor Liu, actually started at a very high level.","The high school student listened in fascination.","In their village, it was difficult to get extra tutoring like city kids.","It was also hard to find high-quality teachers.","Meeting He Lingfeng was like an unexpected joy.","He took five hours of lessons in one go.","The internet users were initially just watching for fun. But as they watched longer, a hint of complexity arose in their hearts.","A 6-year-old child actually gave a solid 5-hour lecture.","\"Can someone give the child a glass of water? I'm feeling thirsty just watching.\"","\"This must be the kind of teacher schools want to hire. Twenty-five years old with twenty-six years of work experience.\"","\"Really, I'm about to cry. This child is so sensible.\"","After finishing the tutoring session, he received 150 yuan and handed it to the director's team, asking them to help buy groceries.","The internet exploded with angry comments: \"That's the hard-earned money the child worked for, and the heartless production team even wants to take this money away.\"","Little Fatty had food to eat.","The others had to cook for themselves.","...","Speaking of Little Fatty's side.","Yesterday everyone went hungry, but today the production team finally arranged for delicious food.","The rest of the people all gathered in Room One.","Yesterday, the three adults didn't know how to cook, only Mu Zhixing could describe the cooking steps, and they had already been mocked in various ways.","Today, two more joined them.","Best Actor Song also didn't know how to cook.","They still had to rely on Mu Zhixing.","The internet users were both amused and annoyed.","Five adults couldn't produce one person who knew how to cook.","They joked that this home couldn't do without Mu Zhixing.","However, they were chatting and laughing together, the atmosphere seemed quite relaxed.","Soon the scene changed to Shen Qingqing and Boss Lu taking first place.","They were quite proud of having specially provided meals.","\"I don't know why, but I just dislike these two people.\"","\"Can you stop torturing my eyes?\"","\"I'm leaving first, you guys do as you please.\"","The operations team was also stunned, seeing that everyone really disliked this group of guests.","When the camera switched to the two of them just now, they lost more than 200,000 followers.","The atmosphere at their dinner table was also very silent.","The production team was stirring up trouble, deliberately setting their dining table outside Room One.","From inside, you could faintly hear everyone's laughter.","Feeling inexplicably isolated, Lu Zheng darkened his face: \"I'm not eating anymore.\"","Shen Qingqing also stopped eating.","Little Fatty had just brought a hamburger and taken a bite, but seeing them leave, he didn't know whether to continue eating or not.","\"If you don't want to participate, just get lost, can you not harm the child?\"","\"Really, that's enough, Little Fatty is suffering being with you.\"","Lu Zheng came for Lin Rui.","But he hadn't even spoken a word to her in two days.","When it was time for the evening bonfire party, he secretly went to find Lin Rui. He grabbed her hand and desperately tried to pull her away.","The PD following Lu Zheng had been keeping an eye on him.","Ever since being punched earlier, he had been holding a grudge.","But he couldn't do anything to the guests.","He was just worrying about not having a way to get revenge.","Who knew Lu Zheng would also be such a troublemaker.","This kind of thing was bound to cause problems.","He immediately followed.","He originally wanted to privately record some footage, but the director thought it was a deliberately arranged script and actually used his camera footage.","This made the live stream viewers feel super excited.","\"Oh my god, first-person perspective of witnessing drama, why am I feeling nervous?\"","\"My heart is pounding now. I declare you guys the most dramatic production team ever.\"","Finally finding a quiet place, Lu Zheng said to Lin Rui: \"We had some misunderstandings before, can you give me a chance to get to know you again? I've realized that you're the one I truly love.\"","Lin Rui was speechless: \"Brother, you have a girlfriend, what exactly do you think other people's feelings are? When you were with me, you started cheating. Now that you're with her, you want to cheat with me, are you just despicable? Whoever doesn't like you, you like them?\"","He was really speechless.","Every time Lu Zheng harassed him during this period, it made him extremely annoyed.","Fortunately, Starry Sky Kindergarten was in a period of rapid development.","She had a lot of things to do.","Otherwise, being pestered by this idiot every day with his whims would be incredibly irritating just to think about.","Internet users couldn't help but laugh: \"Sister is so cool.\"","\"That's right, this kind of person deserves to be scolded.\"","Lu Zheng looked at Lin Rui: \"How can you say that about me? I didn't understand my own feelings before, I was also deceived by her!\"","The internet users were furious when they heard this: \"Typical scumbag's excuses! Every time he cheats, he's the most pitiful and innocent one.\"","\"We're all adults, if you didn't want to, who could force you to do this? You're just trying to have it both ways.\"","Lin Rui said: \"Let me state this once again, there is no possibility between us, seeing you makes me sick.\"","\"After leaving you, I realized how much better other men are. At least they're normal.\"","\"Stay away from me, if you dare to pester me again, I guarantee you'll face consequences.\"","With these words, Lu Zheng looked hurt, but Lin Rui turned and left.","They talked too quickly, and the PD nearby didn't have time to hide, so the PD was exposed to the public.","Lu Zheng's originally hurt face immediately turned angry.","These people actually secretly filmed him and live-streamed it.","However, after fighting once before, he wasn't so impulsive this time.","He just coldly looked at him and said: \"Wait for the legal summons.\"","These words were directed at the cameraman. But his expression was all live-streamed, facing the camera, inexplicably making the internet users stunned, as if he was threatening the viewers.","Who exactly gave him this courage?","The internet exploded with criticism."]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217: Someone Takes Care of It","paragraphs":["The netizens were given a fierce glare by Boss Lu.","In that instant, even through the screen, it sent a chill down their spines.","Then, as they realized what happened, anger erupted: \"Who does he think he is?\"","\"That glare just now could be recorded for film textbooks, it was truly terrifying.\"","\"He's quite handsome, but why is he so suffocating?\"","\"Watching this show, the most annoying ones are Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng. Can't you two just get lost? Looking at you just irritates everyone else.\"","Various insults started appearing.","Soon the comments section was in complete chaos.","At that moment, all signals suddenly cut off.","The screen went black, displaying \"No Signal.\"","The netizens looked at each other in confusion.","They exited and tried to access other live streaming programs, which were all working fine.","But this particular show couldn't be accessed.","Nobody knew what had happened.","People took to various social media and short video platforms to inquire, but no one had any answers.","\"Well, you live and you learn. Never encountered anything like this before.\"","\"So what exactly happened just now?\"","\"I've heard before that Boss Lu is worth a fortune. Could he have used his family's influence?\"","\"A net worth of over 100 million is indeed substantial, but to make a TV station stop broadcasting? That kind of power is terrifying.\"","Soon, the discussion veered towards the frightening capabilities of the wealthy.","This topic quickly rose to 15th place on the trending list.","Even though the topic had over 200 million views, it remained stuck at that position, clearly being suppressed intentionally.","Modern netizens are characterized by their rebelliousness - the more you try to stop them, the more determined they become.","Since social media platforms were restricting discussion, they turned to short video platforms.","After all, short videos spread information quickly.","There's strength in numbers. An information cocoon quickly formed, pushed out through preference-based recommendations.","This led to many netizens seeing this information when they went online.","All sorts of conspiracy theories began to emerge.","Meanwhile, the production team was still filming, completely unaware of what was happening.","The signal on the mountain was intermittent, making it difficult to contact people.","But to prevent emergencies, they had been equipped with satellite phones worth tens of thousands.","The TV station urgently called on the satellite phone, telling them to pack up and return immediately, as the show was being suspended.","The director had no idea what was going on, dazedly packing up equipment and notifying the guests.","They hurried down the mountain, thinking some disaster had occurred.","When they got back to the city and searched online, the director broke out in a cold sweat.","He never thought they'd be overwhelmed by their own popularity one day.","Due to Lu Zheng's repeated misconduct - first hitting someone on camera, and second being caught cheating on camera - all of which had been broadcast live.","This led to the Lu Group sending out their strongest legal team to cancel the show.","The TV station had also received numerous complaints and had no choice but to temporarily suspend the program.","Initially, they thought they were fortunate to have gained such a large viewership.","But now they realized that fortune and misfortune are closely linked.","No one knows what will happen until the very end.","Their parenting show had been on the rise, seemingly about to replace the station's flagship program.","The envious looks from their rivals had given him a secret thrill.","But now it had all turned into a complete joke.","The show couldn't continue, ending before even the first episode had finished airing. It was the biggest flop in his professional history.","The director wasn't one to take things lying down.","The root cause of all this was Lu Zheng.","If he's so rich, he can use that money to compensate the production team.","The contract they signed initially stated that in case of any negative behavior, the penalty would be 300 million.","If the Lu Group wants to go to court, so be it.","He's ready for the challenge.","This sudden halt in live streaming due to external forces had caused the greatest loss to Best Actor Song and Pop Star Zhou.","According to their contracts, if the show encountered problems, the production team would have to compensate them 50 million each.","They had cleared their schedules specifically to record this variety show.","And now it was suddenly cancelled.","Wasn't this just toying with people?","Initially, to show how much they valued Shen Wei and the others, the director had signed the same contracts with them.","This meant that Shen Wei's team and Gu Qingyan's team would also need to be compensated 50 million each.","These losses would naturally have to be covered by Lu Zheng.","But Lu Zheng had already been kicked out of the Lu family.","How could he possibly pay 300 million?","The bigwigs at Lu Group couldn't help but lose their temper whenever they saw Lu Zheng.","If it weren't for this fool, how could they have ended up in such a predicament?","The initial estimate of the reputation and business losses had already reached over a billion.","When the board meeting comes, the bigwigs would have to answer to his father one by one.","On his way back, Lu Zheng saw the overwhelming abuse directed at them online.","He was furious.","But when he saw clips from the live stream, even Lu Zheng hadn't realized how ferocious he looked on camera.","In his circle of wealthy friends, he used to be among the top tier.","He had quite a few fair-weather friends.","Since this incident occurred,","Everyone's parents forbade their children from associating with such a person.","Lu Zheng had a volatile temper, lacked responsibility, and was muddle-headed.","This was evident from his decision to abandon Lin Rui for Shen Qingqing.","The rich in their circle face many temptations, leading to generally low moral standards.","But no matter how they play, taking care of family matters first is the real skill.","Lu Zheng's behavior only proved his immaturity and incompetence.","Lu Zheng was about to explode with anger.","When things went wrong, he wanted to find someone to drink with. He called his best friend, hoping to meet up.","But he couldn't reach him at all.","He had other friends too.","So he started calling them one by one, but they either didn't answer,","Or if they did, they said they were busy.","At this point, Lu Zheng couldn't help but understand.","He had been abandoned by these people.","This stark contrast was hard for him to accept.","In the past, when they were together, everyone subtly treated him as the center of attention.","Now that trouble had come, they all flew away. It was truly disheartening.","With no other option, he had to call his father first. He needed to get through this immediate crisis.","The production team had quite a bit of Lu Zheng's on-screen misconduct in their possession. It would be better to pay the 300 million quickly.","Use money to avert disaster. Prevent them from coming after him.","The phone rang twice before his father finally answered.","As soon as he picked up, there was a fit of coughing.","He could also hear his father's life assistant saying, \"Chairman, please don't get angry. The doctor said your blood pressure is dangerously high.\"","Old Boss Lu said, \"From now on, you are not allowed to participate in any shows. I've indulged you in your desire to make it on your own, I didn't even object to you being with that woman. But look at what you've done now?\"","Lu Zheng was already aware of the company's losses. For once, he lowered his proud head and said, \"I'm sorry.\"","Old Boss Lu said, \"At my age, I still have to apologize to each member of the board. How can you face me? From today, all your cards will be cancelled. Take your love and get out. In the future, you'll have no place in the Lu family.\"","Lu Zheng inwardly disagreed. He was the only child in the Lu family.","His father was just saying these things in anger.","Everyone knew how stingy his father was.","He would absolutely never hand over such a large family business to others.","Lu Zheng made a few perfunctory responses and then hung up the phone."]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218: The Terrifying Backlash","paragraphs":["Old Boss Lu was right; Shen Qingqing really wasn't a suitable match.","She offered no support at crucial moments. If he had chosen Lin Rui instead, he would have had the backing of not only the Lu family but also the Lin family. Everything would have been much better than it was now.","Given the situation, he no longer had any feelings for Shen Qingqing. He turned to her and said, \"Let's break up.\"","Shen Qingqing had become immune to hearing these words.","The first time she heard them, she was terrified, but after hearing them so many times, she became indifferent.","\"We're making dumplings at home today. Do you want to come over and eat?\"","Ever since Lu Zheng had a falling out with his family, Shen Qingqing had brought him to her own home.","Shen Qingqing's parents were warm and caring, providing Lu Zheng with emotional comfort. They truly made it feel like home.","For a moment, Lu Zheng felt a tinge of guilt.","He had angrily suggested breaking up, yet she didn't seem to care and was still offering to make him dumplings.","But his softened heart hardened again in a second, and he said, \"Sorry. I don't want to eat anything. We're breaking up.\"","Seeing the determination in his eyes, Shen Qingqing suddenly felt panicked.","The two argued on the street, and not far away, people who had seen the livestream whispered among themselves.","\"Ah, isn't that the little green tea and Lu Zheng from the reality show? He looks decent, but who knew he was actually like this on the inside.\"","He had always been a golden boy; he had never experienced such a scene before.","The two had to temporarily cease fire and return to the car.","Before they could discuss their future together in detail, Shen Qingqing received a phone call.","The arcade and the kindergarten under construction were facing a catastrophic situation.","The previous arcade had been boycotted and vandalized with paint.","The arcade they had invested heavily in was consistently losing money.","Now they couldn't even pay their suppliers or their employees' wages.","There were also some issues with the construction of the kindergarten. The problem facing them now was money.","But all of Lu Zheng's cards had been suspended.","He was now penniless.","Where could he get that much money?","His father had money, but it seemed he wouldn't be willing to help.","Now there was also the 300 million debt from the TV show. They had no way to pay it.","For poorly managed businesses, there were agencies that could directly acquire the entire operation.","But the price would be only 1/10 of what they had invested.","For example, if they had invested 100 million, they would get at most 70 or 80 million in return.","The same applied to the kindergarten.","If they did that, they would suffer huge losses. But if they didn't, they wouldn't have money to pay others.","Lu Zheng thought about calling his close friends for help to tide them over, but he couldn't reach anyone.","Just like that, their relationship issues were put aside. They were completely inseparable when it came to money.","Initially, to get a larger share of the profits, Shen Qingqing had also invested, mortgaging her family's house and using up all their savings.","They were waiting to poach Shen Wei's business to make more money. No one had anticipated this outcome.","This time, Shen Qingqing was truly panicked.","For seven whole days, both of them lost ten pounds and received a court summons.","With no other choice, they gritted their teeth and sold these two businesses at a loss to the acquiring company, getting back 10 million. This money was barely warm in their hands before it was paid out to the employees.","There was no other way. The company had been sold, the business entity had changed, and they were afraid the workers' hard-earned money would go down the drain.","Everyone had gathered to cause trouble and had applied for labor arbitration because there were some irregularities in their social security.","So between compensation and wages, the 10 million was just barely enough.","After all this, the two of them were left with only 1 million in their accounts.","For ordinary people, 1 million might mean financial freedom.","But they really couldn't accept it. 1 million wasn't even enough for a high-end diamond necklace.","So they ended up fighting bitterly over money.","Lu Zheng was entangled in debt and lawsuits. Shen Qingqing was not only abused online but had also invested all of her family's savings and property.","Her parents were panicked.","Previously, they had been gleefully boasting to Shen Wei's parents about how their daughter had found a rich second-generation boyfriend and would surely be better off than Shen Wei.","Ending up like this, those words felt like a slap in the face, stinging hot.","They started contacting Shen Wei's parents again.","Everyone knew Shen Wei's parents were soft-hearted.","If they just apologized, they might be able to restore their relationship as relatives.","After all, it was Shen Wei's father who had led them to buy stocks before, earning them their first bucket of gold.","At that time, Shen Qingqing's entire family relied on Shen Wei's family for support.","But Lu Zheng's relationship with Shen Qingqing had given them some unrealistic fantasies.","Unfortunately, now everything was gone.","When the old couple tried to contact Shen Wei's parents again, they found they couldn't reach them at all.","All their accounts had been blocked.","When they tried to confront them at the kindergarten, they found that there were now very capable security guards who wouldn't let them in.","Moreover, as Starry Sky Kindergarten was an internet sensation, small-time streamers often came to livestream.","As soon as they thought about making a scene, cameras would precisely focus on them.","After Shen Qingqing had been cyberbullied, her parents became very afraid of cameras, fearing these people would expose them again.","Seeing this, they immediately turned tail and left sheepishly.","Unable to repay according to the terms, their house was taken by the bank.","The family of three had to rent a two-bedroom apartment.","With no money at home, they relied on selling Shen Qingqing's luxury goods to get by.","Lu Zheng had bought her quite a few before, mostly bags that girls love.","But when they tried to sell them, they realized luxury goods were indeed a tax on intelligence.","Things they had bought for tens or hundreds of thousands now couldn't even fetch half the price.","She had treated luxury bags as daily consumables, using them without the care that others showed. She had never taken them for maintenance. She even used to mock those who carefully nurtured their bags as country bumpkins who couldn't afford to use them properly. She had fully assumed the role of a wealthy young madam.","Her bags were scratched and severely worn. At the time, she had been proud of this, thinking it showed she could afford to not care.","The resale prices were even lower.","The most extreme case was a bag that cost over a hundred thousand, which was now only bought back for 8,000.","This was only enough for two months' rent. Life suddenly became tight.","...","When Shen Wei returned, she was attracted by a table full of delicacies prepared by Liu Chef.","Doctor Lu said, \"Ever since Liu Chef found out you hadn't been eating well, he's been so worried that his lips have broken out in blisters!\"","Everyone was incredibly happy to eat Liu Chef's food again.","They finally got to taste the delicious food they loved. Liu Chef had thoroughly spoiled their palates.","They couldn't get used to eating anything else outside anymore."]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219: Receiving Compensation","paragraphs":["Almost all the staff from the old location of Starry Sky Kindergarten were here.","Watching everyone eat with gusto, Liu Chef felt deeply gratified. How would the kindergarten manage without him in the future?","Liu Chef truly considered Starry Sky Kindergarten his home.","These past few days, with Shen Wei and the others away participating in the show, no one knew how to cook, which had worried him terribly.","The online variety show's live broadcast being suspended and their return came as quite a surprise to Liu Chef.","But he quickly whipped up six dishes and a soup using what was available in the kitchen.","Everyone ate with great relish.","The rest of the staff gathered around to watch them eat.","Liu Chef had found a fan from somewhere and was fanning himself.","Seeing them enjoy the food gave Liu Chef more pleasure than eating himself.","Doctor Lu asked, \"So how did that show end up?\"","There were all kinds of rumors online.","The officials hadn't made any statements, and the trending topics kept getting suppressed.","Shen Wei said, \"It might just be cancelled.\" They were also surprised when they received the notice.","This time, Lin Rui had been full of expectations for a free trip. She had even packed three large suitcases of clothes.","Having to pack up after just a few days was quite troublesome, especially since there was dust on the walls.","She had to take down all her clothes and send them to the dry cleaners for maintenance.","Shen Wei thought she would be furious.","Unexpectedly, Lin Rui was even more eager to return than she was.","They didn't know what was going on until they got back and could use their phones again.","This time, the live broadcast incident was due to Lu Zheng confessing his feelings to her.","Fortunately, Lin Rui's outright rejection gained her a wave of fans online.","If she had shown even a little consideration for his feelings, netizens would have accused her of ruining someone else's relationship. Thinking about it now still made her nervous.","However, compared to Lin Rui's trivial matters, the Lu Family's situation was clearly worse.","Being in the same wealthy circle, they received numerous calls upon their return.","Rumors were rampant that the Lu Family had fallen on hard times.","The three hundred million yuan compensation paid by Lu Zheng was actually from his father, who had declared that he would use this money to sever their father-son relationship.","From now on, Lu Zheng would have no connection to the Lu Family.","People in their circle, knowing Lu Zheng's unreliable character, were all trying to distance themselves from him.","After all, they were still father and son, so Lu Zheng's father was still trying his best to suppress the trending topics, spending another 20 million yuan on this effort.","Shen Wei and the others were collateral damage, but they had just received information that the show's production team had received Lu Zheng's compensation and planned to give them the 50 million yuan compensation as agreed. Suffering for two days in exchange for so much money wasn't bad at all.","The staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten were overjoyed to hear that they wouldn't be going on the show anymore.","Mainly because they saw how grueling it was to be on the show.","For instance, He Lingfeng had to teach continuously for 5 hours.","This intensity would be exhausting even for a young teacher, let alone a child.","It was even worse for Mu Zhixing.","Changing living environments is very unsettling for young children, and she still had to complete tasks for the show, like verbally explaining cooking methods.","Speaking of which, Liu Chef also expressed on the spot that Mu Zhixing could come to him anytime if she wanted to learn cooking in the future.","But the child was too young. She couldn't handle kitchen equipment now.","Otherwise, Liu Chef would have liked to take her as his apprentice.","Qi Zhong, who had been smiling and giving Mu Zhixing extra food, immediately disagreed when he heard Liu Chef's words.","\"She should learn painting!\" he emphasized.","Liu Chef smiled and said, \"I understand, it depends on what the child is interested in!\"","Ever since Liu Chef was betrayed by his former apprentice Liu Ming, he had given up on taking new apprentices.","Although he taught Jiang Xun, whom he had picked up from the culinary competition, to cook,","There was no formal master-apprentice relationship.","Both of them had reservations in their hearts.","They just got along as half-teacher, half-friend.","But Liu Chef's statement just now had opened a backdoor for Mu Zhixing.","Someone of Liu Chef's caliber held a very high position in the culinary world. If Mu Zhixing became his apprentice, she would be considered part of the inner circle in the culinary world.","Moreover, given how much Liu Chef liked Mu Zhixing, he would spare no effort in nurturing her in the future.","This would be an incredible opportunity for anyone interested in culinary arts.","Qi Zhong was very nervous.","Mu Zhixing seemed to sense her art teacher's unease and even poured him a glass of juice.","Qi Zhong had always treated Mu Zhixing like his own daughter. He was displeased just a moment ago, but upon receiving the juice, his face lit up with a smile.","Shen Wei had just sent over her bank account number when the other party transferred the 50 million yuan.","They had already discussed how to divide this money in the car.","The money would be split equally.","The two groups totaled 100 million yuan, and there were exactly five people. Each person would get 20 million yuan.","Lin Rui, who didn't lack money, immediately said she didn't want it and suggested giving her share to the children.","But Shen Wei refused.","Twenty million yuan was not a small amount. Moreover, He Lingfeng had strong principles and wouldn't accept money that wasn't his.","Hearing this, Lin Rui agreed.","Even though she didn't lack money, the idea of getting 20 million yuan in two days, and from the person she disliked the most, Lu Zheng, made her happy.","It felt like sweet revenge.","But they had agreed in the car on the way back to the kindergarten not to tell the other staff about this money.","Shen Wei discreetly transferred the received money to various accounts.","Before they left, they had already set up personal ID cards and bank accounts for the children.","With this money, even just earning interest would provide a significant monthly income.","Twenty million yuan is not a small amount for anyone.","They had dinner, and the two children, unable to stay up, went to rest first.","The adults gathered around the table to chat.","At this moment, a phone rang. It was Best Actor Song calling.","Shen Wei was a bit surprised.","Although they had exchanged contact information before, it was just out of courtesy.","She thought there wouldn't be much interaction after the show ended.","But Best Actor Song had called specifically, and after exchanging pleasantries, he finally expressed his thoughts.","\"My daughter Xiaoxue is a rather well-behaved child. Would it be possible for her to attend Starry Sky Kindergarten in the future?\"","After finishing the recording, he realized that veteran celebrities like them didn't have a kindergarten that stood out.","After searching online, he discovered how impressive Starry Sky Kindergarten was.","Moreover, having interacted with Shen Wei, he knew she genuinely cared for children.","They would feel at ease if their child attended this kindergarten.","The love of parents for their children is truly touching!","Ever since Song Xiaoxue was ready for kindergarten, Best Actor Song's whole family had been anxious. They had looked into many private kindergartens both domestically and abroad but couldn't make up their minds.","Seeing Shen Wei was like finding new hope.","Shen Wei said, \"But isn't the child in The Capital? There are quite a few good kindergartens there too.\"","Best Actor Song said, \"That's not a problem, I can buy a house there!\"","Shen Wei replied, \"Well, we can't add her to the current class, but we can wait for the second branch to open. I'll send you an electronic invitation now.\"","Although spots were precious, they had reserved some. They had previously given 200 spots to the new district. Shen Wei still had 50 spots in reserve for unexpected needs.","Best Actor Song was immediately overjoyed.","He quickly said, \"I really don't know how to thank you enough.\"","\"I quite liked little Xiaoxue when she was here too,\" Shen Wei said.","After hanging up, Best Actor Song sent the gift he had prepared long ago to Shen Wei.","It was a brand new luxury handbag in elephant gray.","The bag cost 300,000 yuan, and it wasn't even guaranteed you could buy one. It required additional purchases.","Shen Wei had just hung up when Pop Star Zhou called, also inquiring about kindergarten spots.","He was willing to buy a house in the area for his child's education.","Since Shen Wei had already agreed to Best Actor Song, she naturally couldn't treat them differently, so she agreed to Pop Star Zhou as well.","From this variety show appearance, Best Actor Song and Pop Star Zhou both received 50 million yuan in compensation.","Shen Wei gained two excellent students and also received compensation.","The only ones who got hurt were Lu Zheng and Shen Qingqing.","This variety show appearance.","It was worth it."]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220: The Easy Moments of a School Bus Driver","paragraphs":["Lu Zheng is in quite a pitiful state now.","He's been abandoned by the entire upper class society, with only a million or so left in his pocket, yet he despises the snobbery of the rich young masters. He keeps trying to use this small amount of money to start a big business venture.","But is it really that easy?","Just when the last million in his hands was swindled away by con artists, Shen Qingqing approached him once again.","Isn't it said that they're fated rivals?","When he had money before, Lu Zheng was very loyal to her.","Now that he's penniless, they seek comfort in each other.","Neither knows who suggested it, but once they got together, passion ignited between them.","Shen Qingqing said to Lu Zheng, \"Don't think your father is heartless now, he's just too angry. If we have a child, it will be the first grandchild of the Lu Group. We'll surely be accepted back then.\"","Lu Zheng thought this made sense.","So, he reluctantly agreed.","...","The driver Zhang Daming had been acting strange all day today.","Liu Chef even said, \"Daming, I fried some skewers today, take some home for your wife and child.\"","These things use a lot of oil, so they usually make extra.","But it's usually just for the staff to eat, rarely does anyone take it home.","Liu Chef had noticed Zhang Daming's oddness, but couldn't pinpoint exactly what was strange. It was just a feeling.","Zhang Daming said, \"Thanks, brother.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Keep up the good work, there's still the year-end bonus to be distributed this year.\"","Speaking of hard work, the most unsung hero would be the driver Zhang Daming.","He works from dawn to dusk, picking up and dropping off students, driving all over the city.","He arrives the earliest and leaves the latest.","And he's never taken a day off.","If he were to take a leave, no one could fill in for him.","After doing this job for so long, he knows which parents are impatient and wait early, and which are more laid-back and arrive a bit late. It's all within his planning.","So when his bus arrives, the children are just right there on the roadside.","This is a rare talent, he was born to be a school bus driver.","Now that there are more children, he's still the only driver.","He makes a few extra trips every day.","After hiring Zhang Daming, it became difficult to use anyone else. Who else could drive so smoothly?","Now Zhang Daming has finished work, the bright yellow school bus parked downstairs.","He even rented a parking space specially.","This way he won't waste time when starting work early tomorrow.","Time in the morning and evening is extremely precious.","Now, as soon as he returns home, there's a table full of dishes.","It's just a family of three, yet there are seven or eight dishes.","And they're all holiday foods like ribs, chicken, and fish - everything you could want. To prepare such a feast would take at least half a day.","As soon as Zhang Daming enters, his son timidly calls out \"Dad.\"","Ever since this child racked up 800,000 in online loans, he's always had a mouse-seeing-a-cat feeling when he sees Zhang Daming.","Zhang Daming grunted in response, then sat down at the table.","Today his wife is happy, she bought the best baijiu from the corner store. She also bought two bottles of beer for herself.","The beer cap makes a popping sound as it's opened.","His daughter-in-law smiles broadly, saying, \"Come on, Daming, I'll drink a bit with you.\"","His daughter-in-law used to never touch a drop of alcohol.","This time she wants to drink with him, she must be really happy.","The reason is simple, the 800,000 in online loans their son owed, after going to court, some of the irregular ones were reduced.","But there were still several hundred thousand in regular loans.","Now they've paid off all of this money.","Zhang Daming and his wife have been honest all their lives, never borrowing money from others.","This number weighed heavily on his heart, keeping him awake day and night.","Finally, it's been paid off.","He sat at the table and poured himself a small jug of baijiu.","He took a sip, the mellow aroma spreading in his mouth.","In an instant, the 56-proof baijiu made his eyes sting.","Zhang Daming's eyes turned red.","The child had been on leave from school this whole time, not allowed to return to the dorm.","They were afraid he'd start borrowing money again if he went back to that environment.","Tian Tian stayed sweetly at home, tempering his character.","Now seeing his father's reddened eyes, he felt extremely guilty: \"Dad, I did wrong in this matter. Don't worry, I'll never use online loans again in my life.\"","This child used to be quite sensible.","But after entering university, his roommates were all rich kids.","The vanity of youth.","Add to that a girlfriend, and money flowed like water.","As the debts piled up, he became numb to it.","It wasn't until it all exploded that the family knew such a big problem had occurred.","At that time, his father was just a chauffeur earning a little over 2,000 a month.","His wife hadn't worked for years due to poor health.","But since this incident happened, his father quit his stable job in the system.","His mother also went out to work as a cleaner.","Both of them were extremely tired.","Seeing his parents' haggard appearance, there were moments when he felt he wasn't human.","Fortunately, after the bitter comes the sweet, and all this is over now.","Zhang Daming, as the head of the family, rarely smiles or speaks.","At this moment he wanted to say something, but as soon as he opened his mouth, a sob came out, and he increasingly lost control. Slowly it turned into loud weeping.","As a man who married and supported a family in his twenties, he had never cried like this before.","It was a wail coming from his throat, hearing it made everyone's eyes sting, and the whole family burst into tears.","If not for the grievance, he wouldn't have cried like this in his life.","Before, he had to grit his teeth, he was the pillar of the family, he couldn't fall.","But this time he truly felt the fatigue of more than a year.","At this moment, it was finally released.","The child was stunned, then raised his right hand and slapped himself hard, falling to his knees with a thud: \"Mom, Dad! I'm sorry!\" He kowtowed repeatedly.","Making money isn't easy. But he had spent so much.","And it was all on meaningless things.","It's fortunate that Starry Sky Kindergarten paid such high wages.","Otherwise, with just the debts he owed, it would probably take 8-10 years to pay off.","All three of them would have had to struggle under the pressure of enormous debt.","At this moment, he finally understood that for ordinary people, taking out high-interest online loans is a dead end.","No wonder, now that they've finally paid off the last bit, the whole family feels relieved, and they've made so many dishes.","It's like celebrating the New Year.","After crying, Zhang Daming said to his son, \"Go back to school, join the next year's class.\"","During this time, he had also consulted education experts. Away from that environment, perhaps he could start anew.","After crying, Zhang Daming felt the depression that had built up over more than a year completely dissipate.","The whole person was left with unprecedented lightness and gratitude towards Starry Sky Kindergarten."]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221: The Child is Jealous","paragraphs":["Shen Wei agreed to participate in the show because she was forced by the System's points.","She had previously owed the System 60,000 points for buying blueprints.","The System set a deadline of one month to repay the points, or else she would be electrocuted.","Apart from System rewards, the main way to obtain points was through online reputation.","Shen Wei was initially heartbroken when she was forced to terminate her participation after just one episode.","What would happen to her reputation now?","No one wanted to experience the consequences of being electrocuted.","Thankfully, Lu Zheng's series of actions frequently made it to the trending topics.","More and more people began to pay attention to this episode. After the show was discontinued, it couldn't be found online.","But that's how Chinese people are - the more you try to hide something, the more popular it becomes.","So people started searching extensively.","This episode had never been fully released online.","There were only a few screen recordings.","And even those were reported and complained about by the show's production team.","So this episode was cut into pieces.","It was posted on different accounts, with viewers having to search for ten minutes here, another ten minutes there, like picking through scraps.","After watching all the videos, people hurled various insults at Lu Zheng.","But they also became intrigued by Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The more they learned, the more they felt Shen Wei was legendary.","Fresh out of college, she had so many industry top talents willingly working for her.","And there was even a former small-time celebrity working as a street dance teacher at Starry Sky.","No wonder Shen Wei seemed destined for trending topics.","The small-time celebrity who had never trended in the entertainment industry for years suddenly started trending frequently for his outstanding dance skills after joining Starry Sky.","His personal account had already grown to over 800,000 followers.","Although his account started late, it far surpassed those of other staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Starry Sky Kindergarten seemed like an endless treasure trove.","As a result, Shen Wei gained over 100,000 points in the shortest time possible.","After deducting the 60,000 owed to the System, Shen Wei now had 40,000 points left.","Shen Wei never imagined that the problem troubling her for some time would be solved so easily.","The System also congratulated her.","But then it added, \"From now on, rewards will be sought elsewhere, and System points will no longer be issued.\"","Shen Wei nearly coughed up blood; the System was truly heartless.","It had let her experience the wonder of points.","It had opened a complex points mall, a lucky wheel, and a customization area.","Now it wouldn't give points anymore. Everything would depend on gaining traffic online.","No matter how you looked at it, the System seemed like a cunning merchant.","There were many benefits to having points, and she planned to use them wisely in the future.","Although buying the blueprints for 1 million points earlier was a bit impulsive, she still didn't regret it.","After calming her inner turmoil, she came out and saw Song Ping An.","Song Ping An's eyes lit up when he saw Shen Wei.","Shen Wei had truly become the darling of Starry Sky Kindergarten. No matter how old the children were, they would be happy to see her and want to cuddle with her.","Many teachers at the kindergarten envied this natural ability to attract children.","Shen Wei greeted Song Ping An.","This child was rescued by Shen Wei from another city.","Previously, when he was with the education expert, the child was very dependent on her.","Shen Wei had even fed him, changed his clothes, and personally bathed him.","Now, as Shen Wei reached out to Song Ping An with a smile, the little fellow remained unmoved.","He even turned his face away angrily, as if he hadn't seen her.","Shen Wei forcefully took the little one into her arms.","But he had a kind of unyielding quality, his little neck proudly turned away.","He looked everywhere but at Shen Wei.","\"What's wrong?\" Shen Wei's voice was surprisingly gentle.","Song Ping An snorted and struggled to get up.","Under the careful nurturing at Starry Sky Kindergarten, he had gained quite a bit of weight.","He was much chubbier than before.","And some time ago, Dr. Lu had specially taken him to the hospital for a check-up.","The little fellow's physical deficiencies had been mostly made up.","It wouldn't affect his lifespan in the future.","He was truly the child who had suffered the most in the kindergarten.","So the news of his recovery also excited everyone else at the kindergarten.","But now that the little fellow had gained weight, Shen Wei couldn't control him when he wanted to struggle.","Afraid of hurting him, she put him on the ground, and the little one ran away with quick steps.","Education expert Weng Lan had been personally taking care of Song Ping An and Cheng Wen, the developmentally delayed eldest son of the Cheng family.","Now, seeing Shen Wei, she said, \"The child is angry!\"","When Shen Wei participated in the variety show, everyone at Starry Sky Kindergarten paid close attention.","Earlier, when Weng Lan was watching on her phone, the little fellow had even pressed his face against the phone screen, wanting to cuddle with Shen Wei.","He looked very dependent.","But when they saw He Lingfeng and Mu Zhixing, everyone immediately became jealous, and there was no way to console them.","The little ones all had their own sense of possessiveness.","Moreover, he was certified by the System as an antagonist.","Having experienced such a turbulent childhood at a young age.","His need for emotional connection was much higher than that of ordinary children.","After hearing Weng Lan explain the cause and effect, Shen Wei had to change her approach to interacting with little Ping An.","Shen Wei didn't say anything, just followed the little fellow, quietly watching him from the side.","Song Ping An was playing in the ball pit, pretending not to see Shen Wei when she was around.","But every time he slid down the slide, he would unconsciously look at Shen Wei.","The little fellow thought he was being casual, but it was actually very obvious.","He was blatantly jealous, which was too adorable.","At Starry Sky Kindergarten, Shen Wei was the absolute core. Even Gu Qingyan wouldn't dare treat Shen Wei like this, openly giving her the cold shoulder.","Only this little fellow could.","So the little fellow played for an entire morning.","Shen Wei patiently accompanied him.","Finally, Song Ping An cheered up.","For the first two hours of play, he had kept a straight face.","He looked very serious when sliding down the slide.","But now, after finishing playing, he took the initiative to reach out his little hand, reluctantly running over and throwing himself into Shen Wei's arms, finally accepting her embrace.","Shen Wei said, \"This was a special situation. Next time we go out to play, will you let Sister Principal take you?\"","Although the child was too young, and most people would think there was no need to explain such things to a child.","But Shen Wei still patiently explained.","Little Ping An snorted, then buried his face deeper.","But Weng Lan, standing nearby, clearly saw the little fellow's obviously happy smile.","Although she was an education expert, she also greatly admired Shen Wei in some aspects.","With just a few words, she had managed to win over a stubborn little troublemaker."]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222: Lu Family's Wonderful Life","paragraphs":["The system played back all of Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng's actions during this period like a movie for Shen Wei to watch.","Shen Wei was stunned after seeing it all.","It was one thing for Shen Qingqing to be brainless.","But how could Lu Zheng be just like her?","With the final 1 million, they could have lived frugally for a long time.","Instead, they foolishly believed the words of those scammers.","The 1 million was gone. Lu Zheng, with all his pride and arrogance, had to move into Shen Qingqing's rented apartment and live with Shen Qingqing's parents.","They even focused all their energy on trying to have a child to ask the Lu family for money.","This idea not only gained the support of Shen Qingqing's parents,","But also received Lu Zheng's tacit approval.","They said only the arrival of a golden grandson could allow Lu Zheng to return to the Lu Corporation, after all, such a large enterprise should be handed down to one's own descendants.","The two of them lost their careers and their reputations.","Now Lu Zheng had been ostracized from his social circle.","He had become a laughingstock, and even the employees of Lu Group couldn't hold their heads up high. They wished they could change bosses, not wanting to be mocked online along with him.","Shen Qingqing's time with Lu Zheng used to be so glamorous, but now they were utterly destitute.","But all of this was their own doing.","The system's mechanical voice came through: \"Inform Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng about Old Boss Lu having another child.\"","System reward: \"Keep it confidential, choose 1 of 2 options when distributing.\"","\"Reward: 15% chance to change the original book's plot.\"","If not for the system's information, Shen Wei wouldn't have known that Uncle Lu, at such an advanced age, had a new child. Calculating the timing, it was exactly when Lu Zheng was acting crazy.","These wealthy families were truly unpredictable.","As soon as the older heir faltered, they immediately started training a new one.","Shen Wei subsequently inquired a bit.","Old Boss Lu's new wife was one of his young secretaries, who had just graduated from university this year.","She was about the same age as Shen Wei. The two had already gotten their marriage certificate.","Old Boss Lu was really too old, unable to perform in certain matters, so they used the marriage certificate to arrange for IVF at the hospital!","The young woman was very healthy, so everything went very smoothly.","Now she was already over a month pregnant.","She was being kept at Old Boss Lu's private villa.","The entire Lu Group, plus Old Boss Lu's private assets and collections accumulated over the years, added up to over 10 billion.","The child in Old Boss Lu's new wife's belly was destined for greatness.","When born, it would directly inherit a mountain of gold and silver.","And it coincided with Lu Zheng's desperate self-destructive behavior.","Shen Wei laughed and called Shen Qingqing directly. After just two sentences, the other party rudely hung up the phone. She thought Shen Wei was calling as a victor to humiliate her, not realizing the big news hadn't even been revealed yet.","When Lin Rui pushed open the door and came in, she saw Shen Wei had just been hung up on but was still smiling.","Lin Rui raised an eyebrow: \"What's going on?\"","Shen Wei told her what happened.","Lin Rui burst out laughing.","The old one wants to make a baby, the young one also wants to make a baby.","It's like their lower halves are controlling their brains.","This is going to be interesting.","\"You don't mind if I tell Lu Zheng this news, right?\" Lin Rui inquired.","That idiot Lu Zheng still doesn't know he's been abandoned.","Shen Wei said: \"Go ahead.\"","Ever since Lin Rui was dragged into trending topics by that fool, she had been thoroughly disgusted.","Especially since he clearly had a girlfriend but still came to confess to her and whatnot.","And it was even broadcast live on the radio.","Lin Rui was also someone who cared about face.","It was disgusting enough to have dated him before. Now she had to be hit by this boomerang again.","She didn't know where to vent all her anger. Lu Zheng was truly toxic, anyone who had any connection with him ended up in a bad situation. Just look at Lu Group - their business was doing well before, but because of his appearance on that variety show, they evaporated over a billion in market value.","While Lu Zheng may not be good at making money, he was excellent at offending people.","By association, she couldn't even hold her head up high because she had dated him before. Many good friends asked how she ever saw anything in him.","Lin Rui resentfully thought, how did I see anything in him? I must have been blind.","She hadn't even gotten revenge for what happened before, and now that she learned this news, she had to ruthlessly mock them.","She took the initiative to call Shen Qingqing.","In the past, it was always Lu Zheng unilaterally contacting Lin Rui.","Although Shen Qingqing had never dialed this number herself, she knew it by heart.","Now seeing this number calling her, Shen Qingqing didn't know how to feel as she answered the phone.","At this moment, the phone she was holding felt like a hot potato in her hand.","Lu Zheng had already fallen asleep due to their baby-making efforts.","But the phone sound made Lu Zheng frown in dissatisfaction. He then glared at Shen Qingqing.","Shen Qingqing put the phone on silent and took it outside.","It wasn't until she reached the cramped bathroom that she answered: \"Hello, what do you mean by calling me?\"","With the first sentence, Shen Qingqing was already on the verge of breaking down.","Recently, she and her parents had been too conspicuous. Now their house was gone, savings were gone, and the whole family was squeezed into a rented apartment.","The cramped rented apartment felt especially humiliating.","The entire family's food, clothing, and daily expenses relied on her selling second-hand luxury goods to survive.","Faced with a call from her former love rival, Shen Qingqing was truly on the edge of collapse.","Lin Rui's nonchalant voice came through: \"Nothing, just wanted to ask how you've been doing lately?\"","Anyone who didn't know better would think they were close friends.","But in reality, they were bitter enemies.","Shen Qingqing snorted: \"Stop pretending. Aren't you just here to laugh at my misfortune?\"","\"Back then when Lu Zheng confessed to you, it was just because he lost a bet. Don't really think he would like you. If he liked you then, he wouldn't have abandoned you and chosen me.\"","If it was about killing with words, Lin Rui could do it, but so could Shen Qingqing.","Before Lin Rui could continue speaking, Shen Qingqing said: \"Yes, Lu Zheng is having some difficulties now, but I believe he will definitely return to his peak!\"","As for the news about the two of them trying for a baby, it wasn't yet at the stage to openly display to a love rival.","Shen Qingqing held back her anger, but whether it was from too much pressure, she touched her belly.","It felt stuffy and uncomfortable.","While speaking, she went to the bathroom, only to find her period had started.","The pregnancy attempt had failed again.","Anxious and angry, coupled with the discomfort in her belly, she completely lost patience with Lin Rui.","Lin Rui said: \"How is he going to make a comeback? His abilities are simply not enough. Without the Lu family name, he has nothing!\"","The wealthy circles only respect strength.","They like people like Shen Wei who climbed up step by step from the bottom of the circle.","Seeing a former golden child now reveal his true foolish self, they were happy to kick him while he's down.","Shen Qingqing was somewhat irritated: \"No matter what, he is still Uncle Lu's only child. He will inherit Lu Group in the future. Don't laugh, that's an asset worth tens of billions. The final victor is yet to be determined.\"","Lin Rui couldn't help but laugh out loud.","She hadn't realized before that Shen Qingqing was such a comedienne.","What a joke about the final victor being undetermined.","At this moment, hearing Lin Rui's laughter, Shen Qingqing became even more furious.","She wanted nothing more than to hang up the phone directly.","But Lin Rui suddenly spoke from the other end: \"Let me tell you some major news. Lu Zheng's rich family subsidy is probably gone. Uncle Lu already has a new woman, and she's pregnant. Think about it - will he prefer this son who has embarrassed him, or the little son still in the womb? Some people really shouldn't think too highly of themselves.\"","As soon as Lin Rui finished speaking, Shen Qingqing was struck by lightning: \"What did you say?\" she asked through gritted teeth."]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223: The Test of the Aristocracy","paragraphs":["Shen Qingqing couldn't remember her final emotional state when she hung up the phone.","She immediately returned to the room.","Looking at the still sleeping Lu Zheng, she felt an inexplicable anger bubbling inside her, devoid of her usual gentle demeanor.","She hurriedly nudged Lu Zheng with her arm, \"Wake up, something big has happened.\"","Lu Zheng hadn't been in a deep sleep.","Earlier, Shen Qingqing's phone had been ringing constantly.","She had mysteriously gone out to answer it.","Since Lu Zheng had fallen out of love with Shen Qingqing, he hadn't been interfering much in her affairs.","He had just rolled over and gone back to sleep.","In his drowsy state, before falling into a deep slumber, he heard a voice nearby and opened his eyes with annoyance, \"What's the matter?\"","Shen Qingqing said, \"Your father has another child now.\"","\"Impossible,\" Lu Zheng scoffed.","Back in the day, his father and mother were known for their loving relationship. His mother had passed away over twenty years ago, and his father had never remarried.","Even their friends in the wealthy circles would say, \"We envy him.\"","At the time, he had felt a sense of pride.","After all, compared to other wealthy families with dozens of illegitimate children, being an only child naturally meant he enjoyed unique privileges.","So in some matters, he had the capital to be willful.","Lu Zheng asked, \"Who told you this?\"","Shen Qingqing replied, \"Your ex-girlfriend said so, how could it be false?\"","The smile on Lu Zheng's face froze, \"Lin Rui?\"","He immediately found his phone and called Lin Rui.","Lin Rui hung up, but Lu Zheng persisted and called again. On the second attempt, she finally answered.","This time, Lu Zheng didn't dwell on matters of love or not.","At this moment, all his attention was on the news he had just learned, \"What's going on? My dad has another child, how come I don't know about this?\"","Lin Rui said, \"Isn't this normal? When the main account is defunct, naturally you'd consider starting a new one.\"","Lu Zheng said, \"I'm not joking with you.\" He emphasized once more.","Lin Rui replied, \"I'm not joking either.\"","Lu Zheng's brows furrowed deeply, forming a crease between them.","This kind of thing was absolutely impossible.","But he also knew that Lin Rui wasn't the type to speak nonsense.","So he hung up and immediately called his father.","His father answered his call, which made Lu Zheng feel a little better.","Then Lu Zheng's anger erupted, and he fired questions like a machine gun, \"What's the meaning of this? You had another child? You betrayed my mother?\"","Old Boss Lu didn't know where his son had gotten this information from.","But faced with the questioning, he said, \"Yes, so what? I've been a widower for so many years, remarrying is perfectly legal and reasonable, isn't it?\"","Lu Zheng felt dizzy. An illegitimate child was already unacceptable to him.","But his father's implication wasn't about an illegitimate child; he had remarried.","Originally, everything was supposed to be his. But if this old man had a new wife and child, the share of the fortune falling to him would be reduced to just twenty-five percent.","\"When did this happen? Those people are just after your money,\" Lu Zheng couldn't accept it.","Old Boss Lu wanted to say it was none of his business. But hearing these familiar words, he instead said, \"It's true love between us, stop meddling in my affairs.\"","These were the exact words Lu Zheng had thrown back at Old Boss Lu in the past.","Back then, Old Boss Lu had said that this Shen Qingqing was of dubious origin and not a suitable match.","Lu Zheng, putting love above all else, had spouted this same nonsense.","Now the tables had turned. It let him experience the feeling of being rendered speechless.","Old Boss Lu, having a new heir now, no longer needed to be manipulated by this ungrateful son.","Lu Zheng immediately hung up the phone, grabbed his clothes, and headed out.","Shen Qingqing followed him, asking, \"Where exactly are you going?\"","\"Home!\" Lu Zheng had been at odds with his father for a while and hadn't mentioned going home, but now he couldn't care less about that.","If he didn't go back now, his home would be stolen from under his nose.","He never imagined that his father, at such an advanced age, would want to have a second child.","He had enjoyed the privileges of being an only child for over 20 years, and now this news was something he absolutely couldn't accept.","They took a taxi to the high-end villa complex.","The security guard recognized him.","However, given the widespread online gossip, he wasn't sure whether to let this esteemed guest in.","He even made a special call to the Lu family's housekeeper.","Lu Zheng's face was extremely sour.","For the first time, he was being stopped by a security guard from entering his own home. It was a great humiliation.","After a while, the security guard hung up the phone, and his gaze towards Lu Zheng changed, \"I'm sorry, your father specifically said not to let you in.\"","Lu Zheng kicked the guard booth door heavily, \"That's my home, why can't I go back?\"","Just as he was about to make a scene regardless of his image, he saw his former fair-weather friends driving back. The cars all had privacy film on the windows. He couldn't see inside, but he recognized the license plate numbers.","Lu Zheng's desire to make a scene cooled once again.","He angrily left the place, pretending that he was leaving of his own accord, not being driven away.","After leaving the villa area, Lu Zheng immediately tried to call his father, but this time he couldn't get through at all.","Now he understood everything clearly.","His father had blocked his number.","Lu Zheng was truly panicking now.","Shen Qingqing had been by Lu Zheng's side the whole time, witnessing firsthand the Lu family's attitude. She felt both terrified and nervous.","Remembering that she hadn't answered Shen Wei's earlier call, she immediately dialed the number, \"What did you want earlier when you called me?\"","At present, Lu Zheng was like a stray dog.","In contrast, Shen Wei had everything – wealth, status, career, and even a former fiancé who had always pursued her.","Shen Wei was calling about the same matter.","Shen Qingqing gritted her teeth in hatred, \"You're just here to gloat.\"","\"Correct!\" Shen Wei agreed readily. Thinking about how in the original story plot, she would have been driven to death by these two people hand in hand.","The vast family fortune would have benefited them, how sickening!","Shen Wei might show a bit of leniency towards others, but towards them, she wouldn't at all.","Shen Qingqing was furious, \"Don't be too smug for too long! Be careful not to sour relationships, lest it backfires on you in the future.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Isn't that what you said last time too?\"","Shen Wei felt an unprecedented sense of satisfaction from verbally sparring with Shen Qingqing.","It turned out that even predetermined fates could be changed.","If Shen Qingqing hadn't relied on men and had only depended on herself, she wouldn't have lost so miserably.","When Shen Qingqing first heard that Old Boss Lu had a new child, her heart sank.","But she was also afraid it might be a test among the wealthy families.","Now, calling Shen Wei, she stubbornly said with a lump in her throat, \"No matter what, I love him, and no one can take him away. So what if you have money? You don't have this kind of deep, unforgettable love.\"","Shen Wei laughed, \"Then you can spend your whole life clinging to your love.\"","Just as Shen Qingqing was about to curse, Shen Wei hung up the phone.","Shen Qingqing felt like she had punched a cotton ball, leaving her furious.","Initially, Shen Qingqing had wanted to get more money to help her family become wealthy. Instead, she had lost both money and property.","But she could still work. There was still a chance to turn things around.","However, having tasted the good life, she now only wanted to become the Lu family's daughter-in-law again, not wanting to start from scratch.","At this moment, Shen Qingqing was momentarily at a loss,","unsure whether to proceed with the original plan of having a child to force their hand.","When she mentioned this to Lu Zheng, he said viciously, \"Have the child. I don't believe that old man will ignore us.\"","Seeing Lu Zheng say this, Shen Qingqing finally felt reassured.","Indeed, she knew these wealthy families were full of tricks.","She and Lu Zheng had been on-again-off-again for so long, perhaps this was the final hurdle to becoming Mrs. Lu.","If she didn't overcome it, wouldn't all her previous efforts be in vain?","So Shen Qingqing angrily returned to the rented apartment with Lu Zheng, planning to continue trying to have a child to shock everyone."]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224: The Delicious Pig","paragraphs":["Shen Wei heard the cold, mechanical voice of the system.","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for successfully completing the main quest. The plot element has been altered by 15% and has broken free from the original book's control.\"","Shen Wei had already completed 50% before.","Now, with this additional 15%, she had altered 65% in total.","What excited Shen Wei the most was the system's phrase: \"broken free from the original book's control.\"","She felt genuinely relieved from the bottom of her heart.","This time, the system reward was different from before.","Two options appeared: either 100 piglets or 10 million yuan.","Shen Wei wasn't short on money at the moment.","She had recently participated in a variety show.","The compensation alone brought in over 20 million yuan, and with all of Shen Wei's businesses making money, she wasn't lacking in funds.","Of course, she chose the 100 piglets.","But this time, she wouldn't be as reckless as the last time.","When the squealing piglets suddenly appeared in her office.","Her heart had nearly jumped out of her chest, but now, after the system's training,","She could maintain her composure, not showing any emotions on her face.","Shen Wei immediately went to rent a truck for transporting pigs. She had the driver take it to a designated location.","In the warehouse, she released the 100 piglets.","She and the driver began catching the pigs and loading them into cages, then drove majestically to the pig farm.","When Shen Wei arrived with the pigs, she saw the couple who ran the farm rushing over excitedly: \"You've caught so many again this time?\"","They had never seen such good pigs before.","Eating seven or eight times a day, they grew plump quickly, and they rarely got sick.","The pigs seemed to inflate like balloons, changing visibly day by day.","They were truly lovable.","The pigs brought over last time had already gained several dozen kilograms.","The piglets grunted and called out when they saw people.","They looked lively, and it was clear they were the same kind of good pigs.","However, it was too much work for just two people.","With so many pigs, they had to cook pig feed daily, clean the pig pens, and couldn't keep up with the work.","Shen Wei said, \"Later, you should hire two more workers, paying 5,000 yuan a month.\"","The couple was immediately delighted upon hearing this.","Everyone has a few relatives.","Earning 5,000 yuan here was quite good.","Moreover, Shen Wei entrusted everything to them, not interfering at all.","Having such a boss was truly fortunate.","\"I'll definitely find someone very reliable!\" After discussing, the couple decided to invite the wife's elder sister and her husband to come work together.","These two were honest and straightforward people.","They were especially hardworking.","Previously, one of them worked at a construction site, while the other cooked at the site.","Construction sites often withheld wages, and there were always issues with getting paid at the end of the year.","Coming here would certainly be much better than going to a construction site.","Shen Wei couldn't help but look at the three large pigs she had sent the first time.","The biggest one was already nearly 500 pounds.","Apparently, it could still grow more. The other two were a bit smaller, around 400 pounds each, with round, plump bodies that were a pleasure to see.","The pig-farming couple said, \"Some people from the slaughterhouse came to look at the pigs earlier, and they were interested in buying them right away!\"","They offered 12 yuan per pound for live pigs, which was quite reasonable.","Because the pig's blood and internal organs all count towards the weight.","When buying other pigs, they usually only offer six or seven yuan per pound.","This time they were so generous because they truly thought the pigs were excellent.","Having handled many pigs at their slaughterhouse, they knew at a glance that these were premium pigs. When they heard the pigs were fed purely on grain, they became even more enthusiastic.","Shen Wei had come.","If she hadn't, the farm was planning to ask Shen Wei if she was interested in selling.","This time they really liked the pigs, but Shen Wei said no.","She wanted to keep raising these pigs slowly.","She still wanted to taste what the system called \"premium pork.\"","The more she looked, the more she craved it. So she made a bold decision. She planned to slaughter the largest pig and take it back home to eat.","The pig farm had connections with pig butchers.","They quickly invited two men over.","These butchers were efficient, killing the pig in no time.","They also cleaned it, making it very tidy.","In the end, the butchers looked at the pork with wide eyes, saying they didn't want money, just a set of pig offal and half a basin of pig blood would do.","The butchers' eyes were gleaming as they looked at the pig.","In all their years of butchering, they had never seen such a good pig.","When cut open, it had three-inch thick layers of fat, snow-white in color.","They heard that all the pigs here were fed purely on grain.","Not a bit of commercial feed was mixed in.","Usually, only pigs raised for personal consumption would be fed this way.","Free-range pork now sells for over 30 yuan per pound in the market, approaching the price of beef.","Pig offal and other parts that people used to dislike have now become delicacies.","Shen Wei agreed.","The butchers happily took their share.","The blood and such were inconvenient to take, so it was left at the pig farm, and they also cut a large piece of good meat for the farm couple to take home and stew.","The rest was divided into two halves, one sent to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The other was sent to the pop-up store.","Shen Wei had almost become a master at balancing things.","She specifically instructed that this was free-range pork she had raised herself.","Shen Wei had just returned to Starry Sky Kindergarten when she saw Liu Chef waiting for her.","Chef Chen was with him as well.","Shen Wei asked, \"What's the matter?\"","Liu Chef was somewhat excited: \"Is that pig really raised by us?\"","With his years of experience, he could tell at a glance that this was top-quality pork.","Shen Wei said, \"Yes, I started a pig farm a while back, but I've been so busy I forgot to mention it.\"","Liu Chef, sharp-eyed, asked: \"What about the pig offal?\"","Shen Wei said, \"I gave a whole set of pig offal to the butchers!\"","Liu Chef slapped his thigh: \"Those people really know their stuff!\"","Then he asked Shen Wei how many pigs she had.","His eyes were shining brightly.","Chef Chen said from the side: \"What difference does it make how many there are?\"","Earlier, when they were dealing with the vegetable garden, they discovered that Liu Chef was too vain.","All for a few words of praise.","Some vegetables were given away, some were sold, and now there were comments under the official account asking for Starry Sky Kindergarten's vegetables.","Now that they had pork, what did he want to do?","Liu Chef's intentions were guessed, so he didn't dare to say.","\"I was just asking casually!\"","Upon learning that there were 202 such pigs,","And that these pigs could grow to 800 pounds in a year, he was truly excited.","That evening, they made braised pork.","Liu Chef used all his skills.","The pork was already particularly fragrant, without any strange smell. Even the fat wasn't greasy when eaten, and it was especially satisfying.","Braised pork had never been popular at Starry Sky Kindergarten before.","They had tried various ways of cooking it. People's tastes had become picky.","But this time, the braised pork was the first dish to be finished.","Even the sauce was used to mix with rice. Everyone ate with gusto, exclaiming how delicious it was.","Every household knows how to make braised pork. But how did Starry Sky Kindergarten make it?","It was so fragrant that they almost bit their tongues off.","There was even a hint of sweetness, and when mixed with rice, even the gods wouldn't trade it for anything else.","Doctor Lu ate three large bowls, and finally said, patting his belly, \"I really need to hold onto the wall to walk now.\"","Others praised Liu Chef to the skies.","Liu Chef said, \"It's just that the pig is good.\" No one believed him, thinking he was being too modest.","The next day, everyone strongly requested to eat braised pork again.","Liu Chef cooked it again.","This time, the pork was bought from the market.","When they tasted it, it wasn't as fragrant as yesterday's.","When asked, it really was because the pork was different.","\"What kind of pig is it? Where did it come from?\" everyone asked.","Liu Chef said proudly, \"We have our own pig farm. Yesterday was just a taste test. The big pigs taste even better!\"","He also said he would make stir-fried pork intestines, fried liver tips, braised pig's trotters, and three ways of cooking pig's head, among other dishes.","He successfully made everyone at Starry Sky Kindergarten drool with anticipation."]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225: Chef Liu's Attention to Detail","paragraphs":["Everyone couldn't stop thinking about the delicious pork they had eaten.","Liu Chef was puzzled that the pork he bought from the market just wasn't as tasty as the one they had that day.","Fortunately, they still had some ribs, pork knuckles, and trotters left. Next time, he'd have to prepare them carefully.","Liu Chef said to Shen Wei, \"Can you take me to see the pig farm?\" Chef Chen happened to overhear this.","Chef Chen said, \"Let's go together,\" with a hint of caution.","After all, there was the precedent of the vegetable garden.","Liu Chef really liked to show off his things.","The vegetables were one thing; they'd grow back after being picked, and they had more than they could eat. They could give the excess to fans or students' parents.","Liu Chef meant well, but who knew this would unleash such trouble.","Ever since people had tasted their vegetables, they became fixated, constantly wanting to buy them.","The more they couldn't buy them, the more people wanted them.","Over time, it became like a luxury item.","Colleagues in the culinary world had heard about it and jokingly asked if they could send them some.","The vegetables weren't that precious.","They could be sent.","But the quality of their vegetables was undeniable.","They were afraid people would get addicted and want more.","What started as a kind gesture had created countless troubles.","Liu Chef and Shen Wei left when it was only 8 o'clock.","Jiang Xun was keeping an eye on things in the kitchen. His cooking was also delicious, so Liu Chef felt at ease leaving him in charge.","Liu Chef was now preoccupied with the pig farm.","After eating the pork, he increasingly felt that Shen Wei was really onto something.","Previously, a single vegetable garden had already won over so many people.","Now there was a pig farm too.","Liu Chef couldn't keep the corners of his mouth from turning up.","Shen Wei took Liu Chef and Chef Chen to see the farm together.","These two were the people most interested in the pig farm.","Previously, when Shen Wei wanted to set up a pig farm, it was Chef Chen who had made connections, finding his own relatives to help out.","Now the pigs were being raised in excellent condition.","Just by looking at how fat the pigs were, you could tell they had found the right people for the job.","This also put Shen Wei's mind at ease.","On the way, Shen Wei had already told them that the pig farm was quite substantial, with 202 pigs.","These pigs could mate and produce even more piglets.","Liu Chef's heart was burning with excitement, wishing he could teleport to the pig farm instantly.","The farm was located in the suburbs, about an hour's drive away.","When they arrived, they headed straight for their destination.","The two chefs found that the place was built very nicely and was quite large.","It was also very clean, so while there was some smell, it was tolerable.","Not at all the overpowering stench they had imagined.","The feeding system was very modern.","There was even straw bedding where the pigs could roll around.","As soon as they entered, they saw pigs of all sizes crowding around their food troughs, eagerly burying their snouts in the feed.","The couple running the farm saw Shen Wei and Chef Chen arrive and immediately came over to greet them.","Shen Wei said, \"We're just here for a casual look, please carry on with your work.\"","They were still holding large pots of cooked pig feed, which made it inconvenient to come over.","Cooking food for so many pigs was quite tiring.","However, the couple running the pig farm were both capable workers. Cooking pig feed was laborious, but the pigs ate well and were less likely to get sick.","Seeing the pigs grow fatter day by day, the couple was satisfied.","Liu Chef's eyes were fixed on the pigs.","He looked at one, then another, thinking all the pigs were wonderful.","Remembering the taste of the pork they had eaten yesterday, he became increasingly excited.","He even started salivating as he thought about various specialty dishes.","Chef Chen didn't miss a single one of Liu Chef's reactions.","Chef Chen said from the side, \"You won't be sending these out to people left and right this time, right?\"","Liu Chef replied, \"Of course not, don't worry about that.\"","Now Liu Chef was regularly receiving all sorts of calls from people asking for vegetables.","Many were old customers or people he couldn't afford to offend.","He had gradually realized the trouble his impulsive actions had caused.","For good vegetables like tomatoes, Chef Chen would freeze any excess.","Tomatoes were sweet and sour, easily releasing juice when stir-fried, and no matter how they were prepared, they tasted more like real tomatoes than those sold in the market.","Even freshly picked tomatoes could be eaten as fruit, full of juice, quenching thirst and refreshing.","Other vegetables had their unique uses too.","In Chef Chen's view, Liu Chef's habit of giving them away was simply wasteful.","This time, Liu Chef apologized sincerely.","Chef Chen gave a cold snort without answering, clearly not believing him.","Liu Chef felt embarrassed.","Afterwards, Chef Chen chatted with his relatives for a while about the pigs. He said if they couldn't reach Shen Wei, they could contact him instead.","Initially, when Shen Wei wanted to build the pigsty, it was Chef Chen who had taken the lead.","Chef Chen felt an inexplicable sense of responsibility.","Seeing Chef Chen say this, the relatives immediately agreed.","They were earning several hundred thousand a year here, all thanks to Chef Chen.","They also had two helpers working under them, earning more than before and with less effort.","They were certainly committed to doing a good job.","So the couple running the pig farm thumped their chests, promising to take good care of the pigs.","As they walked out, they saw the big pigs, and Liu Chef wanted to eat pork again.","But remembering what Shen Wei had said, these pigs could grow up to 800 jin (400 kg).","They were only halfway there now, still half-grown pigs?","The meat wouldn't be as flavorful as that of fully grown pigs.","If he wanted to eat it, he'd have to wait a while longer.","Calculating the days, those two big pigs would need another half year before they could be slaughtered.","Liu Chef repeatedly reminded Chef Chen's relatives to call him when it was time to slaughter the pigs.","This time, he said, they must pay the butcher.","They couldn't let him take away the offal.","With pigs this delicious, the offal would be top-notch too.","Moreover, the pig's blood could be used in cooking.","There were many ways to prepare it, making it neither fishy nor greasy.","The dishes made from freshly slaughtered pigs were truly priceless.","Just seeing the pigs, he had already thought of countless ways to cook them.","He was still excited on the way back.","Even Chef Chen couldn't help but smile.","This showed how well Shen Wei could manage her subordinates.","A vegetable garden and a pig farm were enough to captivate two master chefs.","After all, cooking was easy, but finding suitable ingredients was difficult.","At Starry Sky Kindergarten, they could freely exercise their culinary skills and be praised by everyone.","Chefs who came to Starry Sky Kindergarten easily became immersed in their work.","They wouldn't want to leave even if offered higher salaries elsewhere.","Here, chefs were given the utmost freedom.","As long as they cooked well, everything else was taken care of.","When Liu Chef returned, he washed his hands and went back to the kitchen to help. To his surprise, Jiang Xun had already taken care of everything.","Liu Chef took a look and frowned, \"Red-braised pork again!\"","They usually varied their menu every day.","Now they had made red-braised pork for two consecutive days.","Yesterday was unavoidable.","Everyone had been clamoring for red-braised pork, so they made an exception.","Even the most delicious dish would become tiresome if eaten for three days straight.","The reason the pop-up restaurant didn't change its menu was that it had different customers every day.","Few people would buy tickets for two consecutive events.","So they could get away with it there.","But at Starry Sky Kindergarten, there was no way to slack off.","Jiang Xun said everyone wanted to eat red-braised pork.","Liu Chef tasted what he had made.","It was fatty but not greasy, neither dry nor tough, very delicious.","But he repeatedly instructed the kitchen staff that no matter what anyone said, they couldn't make this dish again tomorrow.","Among the staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten, some were outgoing and spoke their minds about what they wanted to eat.","Others were introverted but had their own preferences.","They couldn't just cater to the outspoken ones.","And ignore the silent majority.","This was Liu Chef thinking of everyone's interests."]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226: Teacher Tang is Pregnant","paragraphs":["Jiang Xun nodded after hearing this.","His cooking skills were indeed excellent.","He had now become the leading young chef at the kindergarten.","Moreover, Liu Chef valued him greatly, almost to the point of publicly announcing that Jiang Xun would inherit his legacy.","Everyone praised Jiang Xun's cooking profusely.","Now they had added desserts after meals, including various puddings, mousses, and small cakes, all in one or two-bite portions.","Though small, they were exquisitely made.","The chef was the young girl they had recruited from a culinary competition.","The jams were all freshly made.","The sweet and sour taste left people wanting more.","Especially the yogurt mousse.","The children couldn't stop praising it.","Every time it was served, not only the children but also the adults would finish it all.","As usual, the teachers without classes ate lunch first this time.","Then the children ate, and finally, another wave of staff members ate.","Liu Chef liked to worry about everything, so he kept everything in mind.","At this moment, he said, \"Why hasn't Teacher Tang come? According to the schedule, Teacher Tang should be eating in the first wave.\"","The teaching assistant Tang Xiaowan said, \"Hasn't Teacher Tang come? I thought she was here.\" The two of them were partners and were getting along better and better now.","She then said, \"I'll go find her now!\"","Just as she finished speaking, Teacher Tang arrived.","Teacher Tang had a gentle personality and never argued with anyone. All the teachers and students at the kindergarten liked her very much.","Liu Chef said, \"Why didn't you come to eat? Is the food not to your liking these days?\"","Teacher Tang smiled, \"No, I was just organizing some teaching materials and lost track of time.\"","Liu Chef breathed a sigh of relief, \"Oh, then hurry up. I saved you some braised pork. And there's your favorite smoked pork, roast duck pancakes, and yogurt mousse!\"","As Liu Chef spoke, the teaching assistants nearby started to feel hungry.","Even though they had been here for a long time, they still found the food at Starry Sky Kindergarten delicious.","Teacher Tang smiled and said, \"That's great!\"","There were soups and dishes here.","The staff had an unspoken agreement not to post about it on social media, fearing it would make others envious.","All these dishes were Teacher Tang's favorites.","Liu Chef was very attentive.","Although others didn't say what they liked to eat,","He could figure it out through long-term observation.","Some people liked sweeter food, some preferred saltier dishes.","Some favored certain dishes.","Liu Chef kept a mental note of everything, with eyes and ears everywhere.","But at this moment, he encountered a setback in his life. Just as Teacher Tang was about to start eating, she retched.","Instantly, everyone looked over.","Liu Chef's face turned pale.","The hygiene in their kitchen was impeccable.","They wiped the stoves more than ten times a day.","There wasn't a single unsanitary corner, so how could she retch?","However, the other teaching assistants present looked a bit shocked, then said to Teacher Tang, \"You're not pregnant, are you?\"","Liu Chef slapped his forehead, almost forgetting about this big possibility.","He had thought there was a problem with his food, which had scared him pale.","Hearing this, instantly a circle of people surrounded Teacher Tang: \"Is it true?\"","Teacher Tang was also confused.","After hearing clearly what everyone was talking about, Teacher Tang's face turned red: \"I don't know.\"","Doctor Lu, thinking to use his professional advantage, squeezed in. He said, \"Buy a pregnancy test, go try it quickly.\"","Liu Chef urged him to check her pulse.","Doctor Lu felt a bit embarrassed: \"I'm a Western medicine doctor.\"","The young teaching assistant ran out quickly.","She immediately ran to the nearest pharmacy to buy a test.","The others were asking questions left and right.","Teacher Tang really hadn't thought about it.","The class she was teaching was quite busy.","Usually, she had to plan some activities and hadn't paid much attention to her own body.","Moreover, her menstrual cycle was irregular to begin with. Being a few days early or late was common.","Soon, the young girl brought back the test. Everyone urged her to go test quickly.","After a while, Teacher Tang came out with a dreamy look on her face.","Everyone hurried over to look. The test strip clearly showed two lines: \"Really pregnant?\"","Pregnancy was good news.","Moreover, Teacher Tang and the security guard Li Yi were the first couple brought together by Starry Sky Kindergarten, which was particularly meaningful.","Liu Chef, being a big mouth, immediately posted this news to the group chat.","Instantly, everyone in the group got excited.","Shen Wei was originally putting Song Ping An to sleep.","The little one had just fallen asleep when she picked up her phone. Seeing so many congratulatory messages in the group, she scrolled up to find out why.","Shen Wei's parents were frantically sending red envelopes into the group, throwing in four or five thousand yuan. Everyone could get over two hundred yuan each.","Shen Wei was almost overwhelmed by the red envelopes.","She immediately got up and tiptoed out of Song Ping An's room.","When she arrived at the cafeteria, Li Yi had already been called over.","Li Yi had never thought he would get married in this life, let alone have a child. Now he was a bit emotional.","After all, at 40 years old, his eyes immediately reddened.","This was his first child, and this feeling was particularly strong at his age.","Teacher Tang was surrounded tightly in the middle, like a protected animal.","Teacher Tang blushed a bit: \"It's just a pregnancy, nothing special. You don't need to be like this!\" She felt a bit embarrassed, but more touched.","After Shen Wei arrived, she said, \"Teacher Tang, why don't you rest first?\"","All the people present were young girls who only knew that pregnant women needed to protect their bodies.","They were worried that the children might not be careful, and the babies at the kindergarten loved Teacher Tang and might want hugs and such.","Bumping or knocking was no joke.","Teacher Tang laughed and cried, saying, \"It's not even a month yet, there's no need for this. If you say it like this, does that mean people who are pregnant can't do anything?\"","Shen Wei said, \"How about we temporarily move you to the office for desk work, and let the teaching assistant take over for now!\"","Tang Xiaowan, who was nearby, immediately expressed her determination: \"That's right, Master, you must listen to the principal on this matter. Besides, I'm about to lead a class on my own soon!\"","When the second branch opened, she would be leading a class independently.","This meant she could take this opportunity to practice in advance.","Teacher Tang knew the teaching assistant said this to put her mind at ease.","But seeing everyone around her looking so concerned, Teacher Tang's eyes also reddened: \"You all... thank you.\""]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227: The Family of Stars","paragraphs":["Teacher Tang's pregnancy was a big event at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","No one had experience taking care of pregnant women, so Doctor Lu successfully used his position to become Teacher Tang's exclusive doctor.","Doctor Lu was beaming with joy, walking with a spring in his step, carrying a stack of brick-like objects in his hands.","Liu Chef, holding a basket of vegetables, asked, \"Hey, what are you carrying?\"","Doctor Lu smiled and replied, \"These are obstetrics and gynecology books.\"","He had studied all specialties before, but later focused on pediatrics. He hadn't brushed up on his past knowledge for a long time, so he needed to review a bit more.","Liu Chef said, \"I'm planning to make some light and refreshing dishes recently.\"","This was a special menu for pregnant women, something not everyone could enjoy.","As soon as Doctor Lu heard about the special menu, he became envious: \"Can you make an extra portion? I'd like to try some too.\"","Liu Chef nodded, agreeing quite readily.","After all, Doctor Lu now held an important position, and as the exclusive doctor, he had some privileges.","Early this morning when Teacher Tang arrived, everyone followed her closely, asking about her well-being.","Someone even offered to carry her bag.","Their fear of her getting tired made Teacher Tang both amused and touched.","Yesterday, when they first got the news, everyone was quite excited.","Seeing how excited everyone else was, her initial feelings of becoming a first-time mother easily settled down.","Noticing that everyone was being a bit over the top, she smiled and said, \"My health has always been good, don't worry everyone.\"","Moreover, she was still concerned about her students in Class One and planned to work normally until she gave birth.","The people around her looked around and asked, \"Where's your husband?\"","Yesterday, Shen Wei personally told the security guard, Li Yi, to take time off with Teacher Tang to look after her.","It was normal for both of them to be a bit nervous as first-time parents.","Teacher Tang said, \"I sent him to work his shift. After all, now that we're having a baby, we need to earn money for milk powder!\"","She made a joke.","Their combined salaries were quite high.","It was enough to raise a child in this city.","Moreover, with Starry Sky Kindergarten taking such good care of them, they wanted to give back to the kindergarten.","Teacher Tang certainly wouldn't lack for care.","Li Yi, being a grown man, didn't feel right about taking paternity leave, so after discussing it, he decided to work and take his shifts as usual.","Everything here was taken care of by Starry Sky Kindergarten, so there shouldn't be any problems.","Shen Wei also came to work early today and mentioned that she had ordered some cribs and baby supplies for them.","Shen Wei bought all luxury custom-made items, not the kind found in department stores. From ordering to delivery, it would take more than a month, so these things were prepared early.","Teacher Tang was overwhelmed and said, \"You really don't have to.\"","Shen Wei replied, \"This is the first baby of a staff member at Starry Sky Kindergarten, everyone's little darling.\"","Teacher Tang blushed and said to everyone, \"Thank you.\"","She felt these two words were too plain, but apart from a heart full of gratitude, she didn't know what else to say.","At noon, Liu Chef specially prepared a meal for her, and everyone was all smiles.","Seeing that Teacher Tang had a good appetite, they felt slightly relieved.","But then they saw Doctor Lu eating the same special meal for pregnant women, feeling both sour and envious. It was quite a privilege indeed.","He was the only one present who had this honor.","Even Gu Qingyan heard about Teacher Tang's pregnancy at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He specially sent a small golden lock for the child.","It was small and exquisite.","Made entirely with gold filigree craftsmanship, the workmanship was more expensive than the gold itself.","This brand catered to the wealthy. Each piece was exquisite and could be passed down through generations.","Gu Qingyan ordered this as a gift for the child.","When Gu's Father found out, he called to tease: \"I wonder who's having a baby now?\"","Upon hearing it was Teacher Tang from Starry Sky Kindergarten, he also offered his congratulations.","They often watched Starry Sky Kindergarten's live broadcasts.","Among them, their favorites were Teacher Tang and Liu Chef.","The last time they heard about Teacher Tang was when she got married. How much time had passed? And now Teacher Tang was pregnant.","Their progress was indeed fast.","Because of Gu Qingyan's close relationship with the kindergarten, they knew about everything happening there.","Teacher Tang and Li Yi's love story was somewhat unexpected.","But now that they were married and having a child, it seemed particularly perfect and made everyone happy to hear about it.","Gu's Father asked, \"How are things going with you and Shen Wei?\"","This foolish boy's little crush, chasing after Shen Wei at Starry Sky Kindergarten, was clear as day.","But Shen Wei's excellence wasn't just visible to him; others could see it too.","During this time, many suitors came with bouquets of flowers to pursue Shen Wei.","Among them were many second-generation rich kids. Being able to marry Shen Wei would be quite an achievement, as people from wealthy families admire strength. Moreover, many people coveted the brand appeal of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Once married to Shen Wei, with her abilities, she could really help a lot of people.","In comparison, how could Gu Qingyan, who hadn't even dated during his school years, compete with these experienced players in the field of romance?","Gu Qingyan said, \"Don't worry about my affairs! Is there anything else? If not, I'm hanging up.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, he quickly hung up the phone as if being chased by a tiger.","His parents were beside each other and couldn't help but say, \"Who does this child take after?\"","Seeing that he had hung up, they shook their heads helplessly, \"He's too embarrassed to even answer a question.\"","Gu's Mother had been listening to their conversation and said, \"Children have their own fate, let's not interfere in this matter.\"","\"I'm just concerned,\" Gu's Father replied.","\"I think our son is quite special to Shen Wei, after all, she even gave him that special gaming pod!\" Gu's Mother said.","The gaming pod incident had caused quite a stir at the time, as there was only one in the whole world.","And Shen Wei had given it to Gu Qingyan.","Every time Gu Qingyan mentioned it at home, his eyes would well up with tears.","There were also the shoes Shen Wei gave him, diamond-studded trendy brands.","Gu Qingyan constantly talked about these things.","At first, everyone mocked him.","But after hearing it so many times, they really began to feel that there was something unique between Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei.","Gu's Father said, \"If the two kids have feelings for each other, they should settle it quickly!\" After all, a daughter attracts many suitors. Especially someone like Shen Wei.","Gu's Mother said from the side, \"Let's not pressure the kids. We'll take it one step at a time for everything else!\"","Both children were quite decisive.","As they were talking, the butler led in a guest from outside. It was the head of the Liao family.","He was of the same generation as Gu Qingyan's parents.","Only he was a bit younger.","They were considered friends despite the age difference.","Chairman Liao was the head of a leading enterprise in the city, covering all aspects of daily life, especially in the real estate industry. During the most prosperous years, his net worth had skyrocketed.","He was a notch above other established enterprises.","Now he came over smiling and said, \"Brother Gu, what were you discussing?\"","He had overheard a bit earlier that they were talking about Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei.","He smiled, having some connection with Shen Wei himself. He had insisted on donating 50 million to Shen Wei before, regardless of whether she wanted it or not.","For him, money was just a number.","It had been a long time since he had encountered such a capable young person.","Moreover, Shen Wei had an excellent reputation among the higher-ups.","Others might not know, but he had some special channels to learn that the gaming pod project was now accelerating its development, with the next step being production.","This was a national-level project, and Shen Wei even had shares in it.","Even he couldn't get involved.","Only super capital could enter.","This matter was still in the confidential stage. Once Shen Wei completed her initial capital contribution,","It was possible that even the old-established wealthy families would have to reshuffle.","He held such a big secret, but at this moment, he smiled and didn't say anything to anyone.","Now, Chairman Liao looked at Gu's Father and couldn't help but sigh, \"It was your keen eye back then, able to arrange a childhood engagement with Shen Wei in advance.\"","After all, the Gu family was much stronger than the Shen family at that time.","Gu's Father said, \"At that time, I just felt that Shen's father was a straightforward person.\"","Among the wealthy families, all kinds of schemes and tricks were emerging endlessly, and he had long been tired of it all.","Suddenly seeing someone like Shen's father who was so direct, he couldn't help but want to befriend him.","Then looking at Shen Wei, who showed signs of becoming a beauty from a young age.","He naturally felt a flutter in his heart and quickly arranged the engagement for his youngest son.","Gu's Father still felt proud of this decision now.","Indeed, his foresight was several years ahead of others."]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228: The Mother Tree Tea is Being Targeted","paragraphs":["It's just that his own good-for-nothing son lacks ambition.","He had a perfectly good fiancée, but he just had to clarify things in public.","Now it's too late for regrets.","That embarrassing history is now in high definition, easily searchable at any time.","I heard that foolish boy is privately messaging everyone, begging them to delete it.","He even got screenshot and mocked for it.","What a vivid example of a conspicuous fool.","Even Gu's Father sighed, lamenting that among all their children, each one was more scheming than the last.","How did they end up with a naive simpleton like Gu Qingyan?","Gu's Father's criticism of Gu Qingyan was harsh.","After all, he was his own flesh and blood.","He didn't hold back when laying into him.","Chairman Liao laughed and said, \"It's thanks to his personality that he might even have a chance with Shen Wei. An ordinary person might not even get her attention!\"","He was worldly-wise. Someone like Shen Wei was clearly a person with her own ideas and opinions.","The dynamic of a strong woman and a weaker man was evident.","Shen Wei might not even be interested in the typical domineering, obsessive type who tries to forcefully intervene in her life.","Just look at Lu Zheng, currently the laughingstock of the entire upper class, as a living example.","Gu's Father let out a hearty laugh, \"You're right. Seeing how clumsy he is just makes me anxious and angry.\"","Chairman Liao's eyes suddenly narrowed as he spotted an exquisite box next to the teacup. \"Da Hong Pao mother tree tea leaves,\" he uttered.","Gu's Father's heart skipped a beat. He glanced over; this was the gift Shen Wei had given him.","After drinking it once, Gu's Father had wanted to lock these tea leaves in a safe.","It was too fragrant, with an endless aftertaste.","He had been drinking tea his whole life but had never tasted anything so good.","He even scolded his son when he wanted to use it as a gift.","Good things, of course, should be kept for family to share.","Today, he had originally planned to have a small cup, using just a few buds.","He couldn't bear to use tongs to grab a large amount.","But in the midst of conversation, he had forgotten that he had a guest today.","Now that he'd been caught red-handed, he had no choice but to share.","Chairman Liao said, \"As expected of the Gu Corporation, the heritage is evident. These mother tree Da Hong Pao tea leaves only produce a few jin each year. I've only heard of it, never tasted it.\"","Gu's Father's heart was bleeding, but he smiled and said, \"Then you're in luck today! Let me brew you a cup!\"","He added a few leaves and steeped them. As soon as the hot water was poured in, a rich aroma filled the air.","Chairman Liao couldn't stop praising it: \"I used to hear that the scent of tea could cure illnesses, and I thought it was an exaggeration!\"","\"But now, just smelling it makes me feel refreshed all over, even my headache is gone.\" After saying this, he was even more eager to taste the mother tree Da Hong Pao.","Even just one sip would be enough to brag about for a year.","Even someone as wealthy as him had never tasted it before.","Chairman Liao, rarely impatient, took a sip. As the tea spread in his mouth, waves of freshness washed over him.","A very special sensation lingered in his mouth.","Then, as he swallowed the entire mouthful, it was sweet and clear. Chairman Liao rarely inquired about valuable things he encountered.","After all, everyone has their own connections.","But this mother tree Da Hong Pao had truly captured his heart.","Although it was somewhat taboo, he couldn't help but ask, \"Where can one buy this tea?\"","He was wealthy; even if it cost millions per kilogram, he would be willing to pay.","Gu's Father said, \"This isn't something you can buy.\"","He wanted to boast that it was a gift from Shen Wei, but feared causing trouble for others.","He vaguely said, \"Someone procured it for me.\"","The implication was clear: don't ask further.","Chairman Liao was shrewd and naturally understood the meaning behind the words.","He felt a bit disappointed.","After tasting this tea, he feared other teas would no longer satisfy him.","\"Why don't we have friends like that? If someone could give me a jin of mother tree Da Hong Pao tea, I'd do anything they asked!\" Tea lovers who have tasted it once feel their life is complete.","Chairman Liao was too wealthy; compared to others, he felt an extra bit of greed, believing that if this item could be bought and sold,","he would truly be willing to pay a hefty price.","Money can't buy true desire.","Gu's Father chuckled.","But inwardly, he was making a firm decision. He had been too careless. Now this man had his eye on it.","He'd probably come to their house every day to drink tea from now on.","Sure enough, Chairman Liao's next words were: \"I'll come again tomorrow. Didn't you want that deal with Yang City Group last time? We can drink tea and discuss it then.\"","Gu's Father was speechless.","He had retired, and this matter had long been handed over to his son and daughter.","But he also knew the importance of the Yang City deal.","After all, their company hadn't yet expanded to Yang City.","This could help them gain a foothold there.","It was more important than anything else.","It could be said to be a strategic move.","But the thought of someone coveting his precious tea made his heart bleed.","This tea was meant to be savored slowly, a little at a time.","He didn't even use much for himself, but he had just given the guest a few extra buds.","Now the other party was proposing to come drink it every day - wasn't that like asking for his life?","It was too much.","After some thought, he said, \"Alright!\" Even though his heart was bleeding.","But business was also very important.","They say wealth doesn't last beyond three generations.","They needed to spread their wealth across various cities.","He was the first generation, Gu Qingyan was the second, and Gu Qingyan's future children would be the third.","At the very least, they had to ensure that when his first grandchild was born, their family would still be among the top echelon of the upper class.","For the sake of this unborn grandchild, he felt he had sacrificed a lot."]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229: The Connections in the Entertainment Industry","paragraphs":["Almost everyone at Starry Sky Kindergarten was buzzing about Teacher Tang's pregnancy.","Teacher Tang and the gatekeeper Li Yi were both founders of the kindergarten.","Given their age, this baby was not easy to come by.","So, the colleagues at Starry Sky Kindergarten immediately elevated her to the highest care level.","Liu Chef was constantly coming up with delicious meals for her.","Doctor Lu was even seen carrying obstetrics books around as if he were preparing for a major exam.","Street dance instructor Qi Yuan noticed everyone bustling about, a slight smile curling at the corners of his mouth.","But soon, his thoughts turned to his own troubles, and his smile quickly faded.","He thought about hurrying back to the dance studio.","But just as he took a few steps, Liu Chef called out to him, \"Hey, do you want something light today?\" Qi Yuan and the classical dance instructor Wu Feng needed to maintain their figures.","They would go running after eating every day.","They were particularly diligent about it, prompting Liu Chef to prepare diet meals for them every now and then, sparing them the daily runs.","Liu Chef said, \"You're so busy with all these classes and the pop-up store lessons. What would you like to eat? I'll make it for you!\"","Qi Yuan was the only one Liu Chef would offer to cook for.","Qi Yuan was pleasantly surprised, \"No need, I'll eat anything. You already have to cook for so many people, and making special meals is too much work.\"","Liu Chef replied, \"Hey, it's no trouble at all. I enjoy cooking, and as long as you're eating well, that's what matters.\"","After a pause, Liu Chef added, \"Young man, you're so handsome, don't be unhappy.\"","Qi Yuan was taken aback, then looked at Liu Chef and simply nodded, exchanging a few more words before almost fleeing the scene.","He had long been accustomed to responding to life with silence.","It was the first time someone close to him showed concern.","It almost made him cry.","He had been a trainee for many years, used to being alone.","A little bit of kindness was enough to overwhelm him.","But he always wrapped himself up too tightly.","At Starry Sky, everyone frequently responded to him with kindness.","He was somewhat at a loss.","All he could do was dance even harder.","But he was actually very anxious, not expecting Liu Chef to notice even these subtle changes in his mood.","After a while, he returned to the dance studio.","He shared a large dance studio with Wu Feng, the classical dance instructor.","Although there were smaller studios available,","Having gotten used to the large studio, the smaller ones always felt too constricting.","He arrived just in time to see Wu Feng dancing in a long robe, his movements embodying the essence of traditional Chinese dance.","Every smile and gesture seemed naturally elegant.","Watching Wu Feng dance was always a special treat.","The two of them also partnered for runs.","Both had a need to stay fit, and somehow, their relationship had grown closer.","In the entire kindergarten, they had the best relationship.","However, their schedules often conflicted.","So, it was rare for them to be together in the dance studio.","Qi Yuan hadn't expected him to be there and paused briefly in surprise.","But he sat quietly on the side, not wanting to disturb, simply enjoying the performance.","Though his background was different, having seen classical dancers since his trainee days,","He knew those dancers were nowhere near Wu Feng's level.","After the dance, Qi Yuan handed Wu Feng a towel.","Wu Feng wiped off his sweat with the towel.","Qi Yuan took a few light breaths before speaking, \"What's wrong with you? You seem a bit down lately.\"","Startled, Qi Yuan realized this was the second person to comment on his mood. Was it really that obvious?","After a moment of silence, Qi Yuan replied, \"It's not that I'm unhappy.\"","Such things shouldn't be discussed with colleagues.","It could lead to rumors that he was disloyal.","Yet, his colleagues cared so much that they even noticed the slightest changes in his mood.","Brushing them off felt somewhat dishonest.","He truly wanted to be part of this big community.","Finally, Qi Yuan decided to share his recent troubles: \"I've been contacted by a show recently. It's a street dance program!\"","He had been dancing street dance for over ten years and had been a lead dancer in his team.","With some fame online, the show invited him to compete as a contestant.","The street dance show was already in its fifth season.","Among enthusiasts, it was highly regarded.","Securing a good position could mean recognition as a top dancer in the street dance community.","This opportunity was offered by an old entertainment industry contact.","The old contact hoped he would return to the entertainment scene.","The current buzz was fleeting.","And with his fanbase, the monetization was still minimal.","With some management, he could even earn millions per month.","But it required signing with an agency and a financial contract.","The old contact hadn't expected to catch a big fish by releasing a batch of unprofitable small fries.","The old contact was very enthusiastic, even bringing up contract dissolution.","He mentioned how they had hired professional dance instructors and invested a lot in them.","And it was a free contract dissolution, a rather conscientious practice in the entertainment industry.","If he returned, it would be better than starting anew, continuing with their company.","Wu Feng listened intently and asked, \"So, do you want to go?\"","\"I don't want to.\"","It was Starry Sky Kindergarten that had brought him such fame and fortune.","If he left now, they wouldn't even have a backup teacher.","He couldn't just walk away after everything they had given him.","Moreover, the people at Starry Sky Kindergarten were really good to him.","This familial feeling made it hard for him to leave.","Wu Feng said, \"Then don't go.\"","A simple statement made Qi Yuan smile, \"Right! It's such a simple decision. Go if you want, stay if you don't.\"","Yet, it had become a heavy burden, circling in his mind for days.","He didn't want to go, but he also feared offending people. In the entertainment industry, you never know when you might need someone. It was really troubling him.","After Wu Feng spoke, Qi Yuan finally relaxed, \"Alright, I know now. I don't even know what to eat for lunch today.\"","Wu Feng's expression changed, \"I really can't keep gaining weight. I'm planning to increase my running from 5 kilometers to 10.\"","Qi Yuan laughed, \"Count me in.\"","With that, the conversation opened up, and Qi Yuan flatly refused to participate in the show.","But he had a group chat with former teammates.","Since everyone had gone their separate ways, it had been a long time since anyone had spoken in it.","The last time they spoke was two years ago, and just now, a message popped up in the group chat: \"Are you guys going to the street dance? Brother Li contacted me.\"","Qi Yuan didn't respond, but he was quickly tagged.","After all, his dance skills were among the best in the entire team.","Qi Yuan said, \"I was invited, but I didn't go.\"","\"Why not go?\"","Everyone else chimed in. After all, the entertainment industry is really lucrative.","It's no wonder everyone is trying their hardest to get in.","Fame and fortune are truly enticing.","And many idols have gone there. Maybe a comeback could make one famous.","Qi Yuan remained silent; what he had achieved was beyond anything he had ever imagined.","But soon, a former teammate got in touch, saying, \"Lin is planning to go.\"","He just responded with an \"Oh.\"","Lin had recently been to a nightclub to dance, performing those sexy, borderline dances quite well.","He was quite famous in the circle.","But if he went back,","That past little circle would become his dark history.","The group initially wanted to gossip, but seeing his lack of interest, they shifted the conversation to other topics, even proposing a get-together for a barbecue.","Back when they were a group, there were some disagreements among the team members.","But as time passed, everyone went their separate ways, and now they found themselves nostalgic for the old days."]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230: Fortunately, I Didn't Go","paragraphs":["Qi Yuan's former teammate participated in a street dance competition show.","As a result, he paid extra attention to this episode.","The show was indeed a golden age for street dance, with top dancers from both domestic and international scenes gathering together.","The group dance performances were jaw-dropping.","Despite the dancers' varying heights and builds, their uniformity could be described in two words: stunning.","Solo performances were particularly challenging on camera. One had to dance exceptionally well to create an impact.","Many dance masters fell short in this aspect.","Some subtle musical cuts that might not be noticeable on camera could be incredibly impressive when seen live. Once they advanced, they would face criticism from the audience.","Qi Yuan was completely engrossed in watching, but when his teammate took the stage, their dance seemed to pale in comparison.","Street dance heavily relies on natural talent.","One needs to be a well-rounded performer in terms of stamina and various other aspects to achieve a good result in such a prestigious event.","His teammate was eliminated after the first round.","After it ended, Lin sent him a WeChat message: \"You're lucky you didn't come. After this experience, I've completely given up.\"","Even ordinary talents pale in comparison to absolute geniuses.","Let alone those who can't even reach the level of ordinary talent.","For this opportunity, he had even signed a new contract with an agency.","But he was eliminated in the first round, having sold himself to the agency.","No matter how you look at it, it wasn't worth it.","Compared to this, he'd rather dance in smaller circles.","Now he's stuck with a 5-year contract.","The more Lin thought about it, the more he felt he had lost out, and he started talking more with Qi Yuan: \"How were you so wise back then to give up?\"","They had failed in their attempt to break into the entertainment industry, so they always had that lingering desire.","Whenever an opportunity arose, they would want to try again.","Moreover, others would speak so highly of it, boosting their confidence.","Qi Yuan said, \"Because I'm very happy where I am now.\" He loved Starry Sky Kindergarten too much.","The thought of returning to the unpredictable life in the entertainment industry made him feel exhausted.","The stability of the kindergarten had saved him once again.","At lunchtime, Liu Chef came over to greet Qi Yuan: \"What would you like to eat today, young man?\"","Qi Yuan said, \"A scoop of egg custard and a scoop of braised pork, please.\"","Ever since the braised pork became legendary last time, everyone had been craving it.","Trying to recapture that unforgettable taste.","\"Okay!\" Liu Chef gave him a generous scoop of braised pork and then asked with a smile, \"Not on a diet anymore?\"","\"Nope!\"","Liu Chef said with a smile, \"That's more like it. You're young, it's good to have some energy.\"","Qi Yuan enjoyed his meal.","After finishing, he went to the playground to run.","In the afternoon, fans in the livestream saw Qi Yuan dancing at the pop-up store. He used to be always serious-faced.","But when he danced, he looked incredibly handsome.","Since everyone found out that he used to be an idol in the industry, albeit not a famous one,","This background added another layer of appeal to him.","Whenever he appeared on camera, there would be people excitedly cheering.","\"If only we had met when you debuted.\"","\"How did such a handsome guy not make it big when he debuted?\"","Their debut was so low-key that they barely had any live performances.","The few they had were all poorly filmed, leaving fans to desperately search for any scraps of content. Unfortunately, no matter what, these idols would never reunite.","Now, if they want to see him, they can only come to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This place really delivers fan service, especially when he got hot from dancing and took off his jacket, revealing a tank top.","It was a standard tank top, but when he took off his jacket, it rode up slightly, revealing a glimpse of his abs.","This brief moment left the livestream viewers swooning.","\"Licking the screen.\"","\"My husband is so handsome.\"","\"Oh my god, baby, mommy doesn't allow you to show your abs, they're only for mommy to see.\"","\"So handsome!\"","Qi Yuan actually couldn't see the comments in the livestream.","Because he was focused on teaching.","Many girls in the livestream were blushing, truly captivated by his powerful pheromones.","\"My husband is at Starry Sky Kindergarten, do they need a janitor there? I'm willing to go, I'll do anything for my lifelong happiness.\"","\"I want to go too. Going there could also solve the problem of my child's education, killing two birds with one stone.\"","\"You're thinking too far ahead. I'm different, as long as I win Qi Yuan's heart, he comes with a guaranteed spot.\"","\"Thanks for asking, he's lying next to me right now. Thank you all for your blessings.\"","\"What nonsense? That's my husband, please show some respect.\"","\"I don't admire anyone now except Shen Wei. How does she choose people? Starry Sky Kindergarten's aesthetic standards are really too good, almost all of them are my 1.85m tall husbands.\"","\"Shen Wei must be obsessed with looks.\"","\"I love this kind of boss, going to work every day and seeing so many handsome faces makes me so happy haha.\"","\"This livestream is really addictive. I was just going to watch for a bit, but four hours have passed in the blink of an eye.\"","They had originally planned to watch for a while and then clean the house. Now the livestream is being cast to the TV for a clearer view, and the house remains untouched.","\"I'm also a new fan. I just want to ask one question: do Starry Sky Kindergarten fans always eat this well?\"","\"This is nothing. If you can grab a ticket to the pop-up store and interact with them up close, that's the real treat. I can't imagine how happy I'd be surrounded by so many 1.8m tall handsome guys. Plus, you get to enjoy such delicious food, all for just 400 yuan.\"","\"Let's all petition for the pop-up store to come to my city!\"","\"Don't be fooled by the livestream, folks. They're not actually that enthusiastic, otherwise why wouldn't they come to pick me up from my place?\"","\"By the way, when is Starry Sky Kindergarten opening a second location? I might not be able to experience this service myself, but I want my daughter to attend. I'd even be willing to move for her.\"","\"Please, everyone, stop fighting over it. We can't even get spots in our own city anymore. Who's been promoting Starry Sky Kindergarten? People from other provinces are trying to get in too? It's really too much.\"","\"Why can't we try to get in? Starry Sky Kindergarten belongs to everyone.\"","\"Are the handsome guys for everyone too?\"","\"At least Qi Yuan is mine.\"","\"The handsome guys in the security team might be mine.\"","\"I'm not here to break up this family, I'm here to join it.\"","\"Every time I read the comments, I blush. You guys are too much.\"","When Qi Yuan finished his class, he took a break to check the livestream, scrolling up a bit, and happened to see those comments. His cheeks turned red.","The livestream data showed that most of the viewers were young women, with an average age of 20-25.","These kids, always saying such audacious things."]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231: Cooperation Request from the Welfare Institute","paragraphs":["After Starry Sky Kindergarten became popular, various collaborations came knocking.","Including some co-branding opportunities.","Especially local businesses, who really wanted to cash in on the kindergarten's fan base.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's fans were the most targeted audience in the market.","Moreover, they were predominantly female, who happened to be the main consumer force.","Unfortunately, while their intentions were good, Shen Wei would never agree to such blatant profiteering.","As a result, hundreds of these collaboration contracts were delivered to their hands through various channels.","There were far too many to even look through.","They were all piled up on Lin Rui's desk.","Some of them were quite good, with significant commercial value.","But they absolutely couldn't collaborate in the way Starry Sky would.","Lin Rui and Qin Shu mainly handled this, as they were both ambitious, and even roped Shen Wei into setting up an angel investment group.","They would identify these opportunities and invest in other ways. After all, none of the three lacked money.","Currently, this small company had already invested in three projects!","With so much material at hand, if they could find a dozen or so investable projects, that would really be striking gold.","They all came from business backgrounds.","This kind of investment was like letting others make money for them.","It would be great if the investments succeeded, but even if they didn't, a round of funding wouldn't cost much.","However, among them was a special collaboration proposal.","It came from a welfare institute, hoping to cooperate with them.","They wanted a few children to attend Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This would make it easier for these children to be adopted.","They could also do some appropriate promotion.","The welfare institute was calling for public attention to vulnerable groups.","When Shen Wei heard about this proposal, she asked Lin Rui to bring it out for her to look at.","Lin Rui said, \"It was just here, where did it go?\"","While they were searching high and low, Shen Wei's brain suddenly heard the system start to issue new tasks.","\"Please rescue antagonists number 4, 5, and 6.\"","Shen Wei was somewhat surprised.","Because previously, the system had always issued tasks one by one.","Now, how come it was issuing so many at once?","After such a long period of adaptation, Shen Wei had also noticed some patterns.","Once the system notified Shen Wei to go rescue someone,","It must be at a critical moment for the antagonist.","Sure enough, it showed only 10 days rescue time.","Then the system released the background of antagonists 4, 5, and 6.","These few children all came from the welfare institute.","Antagonist 4 was the oldest at fourteen years old. But his personality was too weak, and he was often bullied.","In any environment, there exists evil.","Antagonist 4 was bullied daily, and antagonists 5 and 6 also suffered along with him.","This time, they were even falsely accused of theft and taken to the police station.","After antagonist 4 was released, 5 and 6 were adopted by separate families.","They were two adopting families.","Their feelings for each other were deep, and being forcibly separated like this was a huge trauma for all three children.","Antagonist 4 was already weak-willed.","After his \"family\" was forcibly taken away, he became completely twisted.","The child didn't go to school and didn't learn anything good. He quickly fell into society's melting pot!","Later he engaged in the adult entertainment industry, while the other two children, being so old when entering adoptive families, found it hard to integrate.","Add to that the gossip from relatives and neighbors, which also caused the sensitive children to fall.","The few who originally relied on each other for survival unexpectedly had no more interaction in the future.","In the end, they spent the rest of their lives in different prisons.","The system also released photos. These few children were all good-looking.","The oldest one called Lin Zhi had a delicate temperament, with a faint air of melancholy always lingering on his face.","A pair of younger siblings. The sister called Yu Fei was 7 years old this year.","With straight bangs, she was a pretty little girl.","The brother called Shi Xiaohu was also 7 years old.","Only he looked about 5 years old, not developing well.","And at this moment, Lin Zhi had been falsely accused and had been in the police station for a day and a night.","The welfare institute where these people were staying had once reached out to Shen Wei for cooperation, but it had sunk like a stone.","Just as she finished receiving the task from the system,","She heard Lin Rui say, \"Ah, I found that cooperation document and took it out.\"","It looked like a PowerPoint presentation, but it was very simple.","Much of what was written were very idealistic words.","Among them was the desire to send children over to attend school. In fact, they also wanted to use Starry Sky's popularity to make these children internet celebrities.","So after a glance, it had been put aside. This time when Shen Wei came looking, it was finally found among hundreds of documents.","Shen Wei said, \"I'm going over there this afternoon.\"","Lin Rui, who usually loved to join in on the excitement, immediately said, \"I'll go too,\" at the prospect of some action.","In the end, the two of them went to the welfare institute.","This welfare institute was quite well-known in the city.","There were always volunteers coming to donate rice, noodles, oil, and other supplies.","Occasionally, some college student volunteers would come to tutor the children.","But now, very few people donate money.","The children's food, clothing, and daily necessities all had to come from the welfare institute.","With so many children, they were really struggling to support them.","So the welfare institute could only rely on donations from caring businesses in society, but a million yuan wasn't enough for two years of expenses for such a large welfare institute.","They had absolutely no income.","They relied entirely on these charitable aids.","It was said that to raise these children, the director auntie had sold her own house for several million yuan and invested it all.","When Shen Wei arrived, the director was still out fundraising.","Hearing that people from Starry Sky Kindergarten had come for an inspection, she immediately returned.","The director was afraid they would leave, so she even ran a few steps.","She was out of breath and not at all composed.","But she knew that Starry Sky Kindergarten was a major guest for the welfare institute.","Shen Wei had arrived early, and volunteers helped receive her.","Soon, Shen Wei had looked through the materials here.","Besides donations from caring people, there were also preferential policies given by higher departments.","When the director arrived, Shen Wei asked, \"What are the current difficulties of the welfare institute?\"","The director was a woman in her 60s, with a kind and gentle appearance.","But perhaps due to having many worries, she looked 10 years older than her actual age.","She originally wanted to say something roundabout, but swallowed her words as they reached her lips.","She could only tell Shen Wei some real situations.","After all, as the helm of Starry Sky Kindergarten, Shen Wei faced too many things every day.","If she glossed over things, Shen Wei might not have the patience to listen.","She could only be more sincere.","The director auntie said, \"Our biggest problem now is that we have too many children.\"","Initially, the welfare institute only had over 60 children.","Because of the support from higher departments, 95% of the children's medical expenses were covered by insurance when they got sick.","Schooling was also free.","Along with donations from caring people, it was completely sufficient.","But the welfare institute had been on some TV shows, hoping to expand their influence a bit.","As a result, their influence did expand, but difficulties also increased.","Many people abandoned babies in front of the welfare institute.","Many were girls, and there were also many sick children.","In this way, they could pick up forty to fifty children a year.","Every year there were new additions.","This was a welfare institute, so even if they reported to the police, in cases where parents couldn't be found after investigation,","The police would eventually send the children here to be raised.","With more children came more issues.","They needed more canteen aunties, cleaners, nursery teachers to look after the children, etc., all of which required money.","Moreover, the social model has also changed now.","In the past, if there were unmarried or childless people in a family, they would think of adopting a child to leave an heir.","But now people would rather not have children and live their own exciting lives.","Gradually, no one was adopting the children.","Their model relied too heavily on charitable donations from society, and they were always running a deficit.","Now they could only cooperate with some caring enterprises to make some handicrafts for the children to complete.","To supplement a bit.","But children are different from adults, and many products were wasted.","So enterprises stopped cooperating with them.","Now they really had no way out.","This time contacting Starry Sky Kindergarten was entirely because of a volunteer.","He was a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He spoke these words. He made the proposal. The director sought help from higher-level leaders.","Begged quite a few people, just to get this document delivered."]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232: Release New Task","paragraphs":["Shen Wei said, \"I'd like to see the list of children available for adoption.\"","The director immediately handed the list to Shen Wei.","Each child's details were thoroughly documented, complete with photos. There were hundreds of files in total.","Shen Wei began searching for the three individuals the system had suggested.","However, after scanning through, she only found No. 5 Yu Fei and No. 6 Shi Xiaohu.","She singled out these two.","After flipping through the entire book, she couldn't find any trace of No. 4 Lin Zhi.","The director, noticing Shen Wei's selection, furrowed his brow.","He had something he wanted to tell Shen Wei.","But after pondering for a while, fearing it might influence her decision, he swallowed his words.","Just as the director was caught in this dilemma, a phone call came through.","The director's face turned grim as he listened. After hanging up, Shen Wei instinctively asked, \"Who was that?\"","The director replied, \"It was about Lin Zhi. The call came from the police station.\"","Wasn't that No. 4?","Speak of the devil, and he shall appear.","Shen Wei, using curiosity as an excuse, suggested accompanying the director to the station.","Shen Wei, along with Lin Rui, the director, and a volunteer, rushed to the police station.","Upon entering, they saw Lin Zhi, dressed in tattered clothes. The 14-year-old boy was as thin as a rail.","He was good-looking but had a fragile air about him.","In an environment like the orphanage, it was survival of the fittest.","Although the director genuinely cared for the children, with hundreds to look after and daily fundraising to manage, some inevitably fell through the cracks.","Most children had to grow up tough. The weak ones were easily bullied.","Upon inquiry, they learned he had been caught up with a gang of hooligans who targeted elementary school students. They extorted protection money along the routes children took to school.","Notorious for their actions, they sometimes even resorted to outright robbery.","Some children became too frightened to go to school.","Accustomed to their tyranny, they had started collecting protection fees.","The students' parents banded together and organized a group to corner and intercept the gang.","The young troublemakers fell into the ambush. Upon realizing adults were involved, they scattered immediately. Only Lin Zhi, who had been shoved hard, was caught in the chaos.","Robbery has always been a serious crime.","And these kids had been at it more than once or twice.","Naturally, there was a desire to teach them a harsh lesson.","The director said, \"Lin Zhi is a child I raised myself. He's not a bad kid; there must be some misunderstanding.\"","The police officer replied, \"We know that. Our staff have found the surveillance videos. The boy indeed didn't participate in the robbery, but he was seen talking to those people, clearly acquainted with them. Now he's not cooperating in identifying the others!\"","The director said, \"Let me try!\"","Upon seeing the director, Lin Zhi lowered his head in shame, not uttering a word, wishing he could disappear into thin air.","The director asked, \"Tell me, what exactly happened?\"","Shen Wei suggested, \"Are you afraid of being threatened?\"","Children have their own social circles.","Hooligans have their own code, and betraying it could lead to retaliation.","Given his weak nature, he was particularly afraid.","Adults often don't understand the fear of being threatened by social delinquents.","Hearing this perspective, the police immediately assured him, \"Don't worry, if you tell us and any retaliation occurs, we'll definitely protect you!\"","With this assurance, Lin Zhi hesitantly revealed the identities of the dozen or so individuals.","These kids hung around nearby internet cafes and nightclubs. Many even carried knives. It was truly frightening.","This was exactly the information the police needed. Now armed with reliable intel, they immediately moved to arrest the suspects.","Upon investigation, they found that all were 13 to 14-year-olds. Many were already repeat offenders.","They showed no signs of nervousness when brought to the police station.","Lin Zhi was released into the director's custody after some paperwork.","As soon as they exited, two children who had been waiting rushed towards him.","The two kids were dirty and disheveled.","It was Yu Fei and Shi Xiaohu – numbers 4, 5, and 6 were now united.","They all returned to the orphanage together.","The director heaved a deep sigh, \"I'm so sorry you had to see that.\"","He had hoped today would lead to some cooperation, either adoption or sponsorship.","He hadn't expected Shen Wei to witness the children's darker side.","Shen Wei asked, \"Have these three children been adopted?\"","The director paused briefly. Lin Zhi was too old, not the age adopters preferred, and had been removed from the list.","Yu Fei and Shi Xiaohu were attractive, and there were already people interested in them.","But these children were close and didn't want to be separated.","However, no family could adopt three children at once.","Lin Zhi had stopped schooling after elementary school.","He planned to work in a factory after coming of age.","At least he'd have some way to earn money.","But the other two children were very attached to Lin Zhi, following him wherever he went.","The director didn't know what to do.","Shen Wei said, \"I'm going for a walk.\"","As soon as she stepped out, she saw Lin Zhi lingering outside. Seeing Shen Wei's elegant attire, he felt self-conscious.","His voice trembled as he spoke, mustering great courage: \"Are you an adopter? Could you adopt both of them together? I'm afraid they might get bullied.\"","Shi Xiaohu's fierce personality made him less vulnerable. But Yu Fei was a girl, beautiful and as soft-natured as himself.","She didn't know how to stand up for herself.","What if she faced mistreatment?","\"What about you?\" Shen Wei asked with interest.","\"I'll manage,\" he replied, his eyes filled with resignation.","He had been returned to the orphanage two or three times.","He was frequently mocked at the orphanage for this.","The first time, his adoptive parents had their own biological child and returned him.","The second time, his adoptive father was an alcoholic who became violent when drunk, so he ran back to the orphanage.","When the director learned of this situation, he actively sought to reverse the adoption.","The third time was a similar scenario. After so many experiences, he had completely given up on adoption.","He didn't want his younger siblings to endure this pain. If only he had the ability to care for them himself."]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233: Heart Donation","paragraphs":["Shen Wei fell silent for a rare moment upon hearing his words.","Finally, she asked, \"So what do you want to do?\"","The little one's hand clenched tightly as he replied, \"In just four years, I'll be an adult. Then I'll have money and can take care of my younger siblings.\"","\"But you don't have an education. Even if you find work, it might not be enough money.\"","\"As long as I can earn something, it's better than now.\"","He had already tried so hard, wanting to find a job.","But due to his age, no one dared to hire him.","Plus, this child had stopped going to school.","Wandering the streets every day, he was at high risk of falling into bad company.","Becoming an adult was something he had always longed for.","But now someone was telling him that even as an adult, making money would be difficult.","It truly shook him. Lin Zhi struggled to maintain his composure in front of others.","Not wanting to let anyone see his vulnerability, he put on a brave face and said, \"It's none of your business.\"","Lin Zhi was a fragile soul, and he immediately regretted his harsh words. Realizing the woman might be his siblings' potential adoptive parent, he softened his tone and added, \"I'm sorry.\"","Then Lin Zhi ran away.","Shen Wei walked side by side with Lin Rui.","Lin Rui asked, \"Do you really want to adopt them?\"","Shen Wei no longer met the adoption criteria.","The policy didn't allow adopting too many children, fearing potential ill intentions.","Shen Wei replied, \"What should we do? We need to hear what the two little ones want!\" She then called the two children into the room.","These two children were among the better-looking ones in the orphanage.","Being young, potential adoptive families often preferred to raise children from an early age.","This way, they could form a deeper emotional bond.","At this moment, the children looked at Shen Wei with wary eyes. \"I'm not leaving,\" the Little Boy declared first.","The Little Girl peeked out from behind her brother, only her small face visible.","These children's clothes were somewhat worn and dirty.","In the orphanage, one volunteer had to care for dozens of children.","There were bound to be times when not everyone could be looked after properly.","The conditions here weren't ideal.","But it was already the best home these homeless children could hope for.","Moreover, the orphanage director was doing her utmost to care for these children.","The children, being young, were innocent.","They simply said they wanted to stay with their big brother.","Though their brother was fragile, he still looked after and protected them.","\"What if you could stay together with your brother?\" Shen Wei asked.","The little girl's eyes immediately lit up. \"Ah!\"","It was her dream come true.","Recently, hearing that a family was interested in adopting her, the little one had cried several times.","Everyone around envied her.","The children believed that being adopted meant a better life.","But she didn't want a better life; she just wanted to stay with her siblings.","Even the Little Boy didn't dare blink, staring at Shen Wei. \"Do you really mean it?\"","Shen Wei nodded, \"Of course I do.\"","The two children immediately brightened up, their faces breaking into smiles as they exclaimed, \"Okay!\"","Afraid that Shen Wei might change her mind, they eagerly tried to sell themselves: \"We can help with chores too! Sweeping, mopping, cleaning windows!\"","Shen Wei gently stroked the children's soft cheeks and said, \"Alright then, I'll go talk to your orphanage director!\"","Upon receiving this news, the two little ones joyfully rushed to Lin Zhi, saying, \"That kind lady wants to take all of us together!\"","Lin Zhi was stunned, then asked, \"Really?\" It felt like a blessing falling from the sky.","How could such good fortune befall him?","He felt happy but didn't dare let himself get too excited.","Shen Wei and Lin Rui went to the director's office.","The director was also a bit bewildered when she heard the news.","Shen Wei wanting to take all three children didn't comply with adoption rules.","Shen Wei proposed, \"How about this? I'll make a targeted donation for these three children, covering all their expenses from elementary school through age 18. They can be fostered with me for now.\"","\"If they ever want to come back, they can return anytime. Don't look for other adoptive families for them. I promise to take good care of them.\"","With Shen Wei's assurance, the director naturally agreed wholeheartedly.","After all, Starry Sky Kindergarten was incredibly famous.","It was said that the tuition for their elite class was 20,000 yuan a month.","Even at that price, demand exceeded supply.","They were professionals at caring for children.","The director immediately drafted an agreement and filed it with the police station.","The director said, \"Please treat these children well. I might drop by for home visits every now and then!\"","She said this to intimidate adoptive families a bit.","In reality, she had never actually done a home visit.","Finding opportunities and ideal families for these children, seeking social donations – these tasks already consumed all her energy.","As for home visits, she simply lacked the capacity.","But these words could serve as a warning to adoptive families with ill intentions.","Shen Wei replied, \"Of course, you're welcome anytime.\"","This time, Shen Wei left a donation of 100,000 yuan.","This targeted donation was meant for volunteers to buy some snacks for the orphanage children.","Most donations typically went towards solving basic needs like food and clothing.","Snacks were rarely bought.","These young children, at an age when they craved treats, didn't have such luxuries. Only the sweetest-talking kids occasionally managed to get some goodies from volunteers.","Shen Wei's donation was enough to ensure every child in the orphanage could enjoy these delicious snacks.","The director looked at Shen Wei with gratitude in her eyes.","Only a woman's heart could be so thoughtful.","The director said, \"On behalf of the children, thank you.\"","Shen Wei also offered to donate some art supplies to the orphanage.","When Mu Zhixin had come to their kindergarten, her tragic background had touched many netizens who wanted to donate things to her.","This included clothes, books, and art supplies.","Learning of her love for drawing, people had bought her a complete set of art materials.","Now that Starry Sky Kindergarten supplied her art materials, Shen Wei had made a video asking how to handle the excess donations.","The top comments all supported Shen Wei using them for charity.","And so, Starry Sky made monthly donations to poor villages and hope primary schools.","After doing so much charity work elsewhere, they discovered that the local orphanage was in such dire straits.","Many children lacked these cherished possessions.","Shen Wei had the resources, and the children needed them. It was a perfect match.","Shen Wei promised that if the accumulated donations weren't enough, she would make up the difference out of her own pocket.","For the orphanage director, this was like a godsend.","The director was so moved she didn't know what to say, repeatedly thanking Shen Wei: \"Thank you. On behalf of the children, I also thank all the kind-hearted people in society.\"","These were all things the children loved, and receiving such donations was truly wonderful."]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234: Small Team","paragraphs":["After Shen Wei had finished all of this, she brought villains number four, five, and six back to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Upon arrival, Shen Wei still had other matters to arrange, and rooms needed to be prepared.","For now, she took the children to the storage room.","It was filled with packages sent by kind-hearted people. The cardboard boxes hadn't even been opened yet, so she had the children unpack and sort the items.","It was like opening mystery boxes. The three children were overjoyed.","Especially when they learned that these things were meant for the orphanage, essentially for their brothers and sisters.","They became even more enthusiastic about the task.","Yu Fei opened one package containing bread and placed it in the food section.","Nearby, others unpacked dolls, footballs, and paintbrushes.","There were Ultraman toys that boys like, and rag dolls that girls prefer.","There were also various new clothes with tags still attached.","The children were having the time of their lives.","Although they were meant to be doing a simple task,","For them, it wasn't work at all — it was play.","Shen Wei gave some instructions to the staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","When the kindergarten learned that these were children from the orphanage, and that Shen Wei had made a targeted donation, their hearts melted.","Shen Wei had someone prepare a room.","Their kindergarten was very large, with many empty rooms.","Some people lived in the kindergarten, but most of it was quite spacious.","Now these three children would be staying. They directly ordered three loft beds with desks underneath from a store.","From ordering to installation, it was all done in two hours.","They were spacious and stylish solid wood beds, and the mattresses were wide and long enough for the children to use even as they grew older.","The room was already there, and after a bit of tidying up, it looked great.","When Shen Wei brought the children to the room, they were all stunned.","They never imagined they could live in such a nice place.","In the orphanage, they could only sleep in metal bunk beds.","Sixteen people shared one room.","They had always dreamed of having their own little cabinet.","But they didn't have one; they could only keep their belongings in a cardboard box under the lower bunk.","Here, they not only had a room, but also their own small cabinets and desks. It was like a dream.","Not only were the two younger ones amazed,","Even Lin Zhi, the 14-year-old teenager, looked around excitedly.","Shen Wei asked, \"Do you still want to go to school? If you want to study, I can continue to support you.\"","He had already been out of school for over a year.","Shen Wei could directly enroll him in middle school.","Although he would be a year older than his classmates, the overall difference wasn't significant.","Lin Zhi thought for a moment and said, \"But going to school costs money.\"","Children from poor families grow up fast.","They understand the importance of money.","If there was only one opportunity for schooling, he would be willing to give it to his younger siblings.","But Shen Wei said it wasn't a problem: \"Nine years of compulsory education doesn't cost much.\"","She told the child to prepare for future middle school studies.","The orphanage and kindergarten were quite far apart.","He had moved to a different district.","He had once been bullied by some hooligans and had reported their names, fearing retaliation.","But now, having moved to a new place, he didn't need to worry about past troubles. Moreover, many of those kids had been sent to juvenile detention centers for repeat offenses.","Lin Zhi nodded, and that evening, the children met Mu Zhixing, He Lingfeng, Song Ping An, and the local genius Zhao Jie.","Both groups curiously observed each other.","He Lingfeng was very aloof, maintaining a stern expression towards everyone except Shen Wei.","This demeanor was interpreted by the orphanage children as unwelcoming.","Shi Xiaohu angrily glared at them. Mu Zhixing became nervous and hid behind He Lingfeng.","But no trouble occurred.","That day, Doctor Lu examined the children. Apart from mild malnutrition, they had no other issues.","They all ate together.","The orphanage children were amazed. Every dish here was delicious.","There was even high-quality bottled yogurt, and they could take as much as they wanted.","They all ate voraciously until they couldn't eat anymore before getting up. But when they returned to their rooms, they started having stomach aches.","Fortunately, Doctor Lu was still there. Upon learning of the children's stomach pains and diarrhea, he prescribed some medication.","Their fragile digestive systems, used to irregular meals, protested against the sudden feast.","He then went to the pharmacy to buy some medicine and told the children, \"From now on, there will always be food when you're hungry. Don't harm your stomachs like this.\"","He continued to care for them late into the night.","After the children had all recovered and fallen asleep, Doctor Lu quietly left.","The next day, the kindergarten children went to school, and the newcomers could hear the sound of reading lessons and the laughter of children during physical education classes from outside.","Children ran happily in the sunshine.","Everything was as beautiful as a dream.","The three children's envy was particularly obvious. Shen Wei took them to play in the outdoor playground.","There were big slides, ball pits, trampolines, and more.","The other children played with these every day, but these three had never experienced them before.","They had a lot of fun.","Shen Wei's free-range approach, along with the three children being together, gave them a great sense of security.","However, Shen Wei wanted them to adjust for a while first.","The students would soon be on winter break.","It might be better to start first grade directly when school reopens in spring.","This period would allow them to relax a bit.","But all the children were very eager to help.","Since falling in love with Starry Sky Kindergarten, they were afraid of being sent away.","They ran to help in the kitchen every day.","The kitchen staff found the children to be very industrious.","Especially Shi Xiaohu, who came from the orphanage, was particularly good at reading people's expressions and would say auspicious things.","He stood out at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Everyone treated him quite well.","But Song Ping An didn't like him very much. Whenever Shi Xiaohu showed any sign of dominance,","Song Ping An, though small, would always trip him up.","For a three-year-old child, he truly lived up to his system-certified villain status.","He was so formidable that even Shen Wei noticed.","Every time Shi Xiaohu provoked him, he couldn't beat Song Ping An.","So he would always sulk afterwards.","But he would try again next time.","As the children interacted and competed like this, they gradually got along well and became familiar with each other.","Both Shi Xiaohu and Song Ping An were children who had grown up wild, with animal-like instincts. They would fight whenever they met.","But Lin Zhi, being older, would always step in to mediate. They were now living under someone else's roof, eating and living well, and didn't want to cause trouble for Shen Wei.","The little girl, Yu Fei, got along very well with Mu Zhixing, especially after seeing Mu Zhixing's drawings. She followed Mu Zhixing around all day, wanting to learn how to draw.","He Lingfeng, the computer genius, found their constant fighting too annoying and developed a small game. The two finally settled down, each playing on their own tablet.","Shen Wei smiled, realizing that as long as adults don't interfere, children can resolve small conflicts on their own.","But this peace only lasted for a day. Soon, Song Ping An and Shi Xiaohu started competing over who could get more points in the small game.","Lin Zhi said, \"Can't you go easy on your little brother? He's several years younger than you.\"","Shi Xiaohu was so frustrated. Although he was older than Song Ping An, he had never gained the upper hand when dealing with him. He wondered how Starry Sky Kindergarten raised such smart children.","Shi Xiaohu realized he was far behind Song Ping An in terms of intelligence and wit. So he turned his attention to the security guard, Li Yi, who occasionally taught the children some martial arts moves. Shi Xiaohu decided to learn kung fu instead.","If he couldn't match wits, he'd make up for it with his fists."]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235: Former Employee","paragraphs":["Ever since a few children from the welfare institute joined the kindergarten, Qin Shu developed a strong interest in the welfare institute.","According to the original book, he was Shen Qingqing's right-hand man, very capable.","On Shen Wei's side, there were many talented people, making his abilities seem ordinary.","But he performed excellently in several tasks,","Including the culinary competition.","Now a local TV station's variety show is in full swing.","It was recently reposted by the national TV station.","It has become this year's most popular program, reigniting the culinary craze.","Shen Wei's wealthy class was initially Qin Shu's concept.","His reasoning was that even if Shen Wei didn't lack money, such unhealthy subsidies shouldn't exist.","At that time, Starry Sky Kindergarten had a great reputation, and the wealthy class was filled within two days.","Now Starry Sky Kindergarten is truly doing well.","Not only do they have various interesting activities within the campus,","They also take talented children to participate in competitions.","Starry Sky Kindergarten is like a one-stop solution.","It's a dream come true for parents hoping for their children's success, offering both fun and education.","Those who initially hesitated and didn't enroll their children now regret it terribly.","Now Qin Shu has set his sights on the welfare institute.","He proactively told Shen Wei he wanted to handle the business connections there.","By business, he mostly meant the various ways the kindergarten could help the welfare institute.","After going there and meeting the director, he found her to be truly compassionate.","It was because of her persistence that many homeless children found a warm home.","She had truly dedicated her life to this cause, now living in poverty.","All her life's work had been poured into the welfare institute.","However, the institute's model was too simple, relying entirely on donations, which were unpredictable.","Each year, the amount of money they could use was limited.","Some businesses donated for tax deductions.","Some were purely out of kindness.","But none of these were sustainable.","This led to many children in the welfare institute having irregular meals.","He had many ideas, and finally approached Shen Wei: \"I want to go to the welfare institute.\"","If Qin Shu went to the welfare institute, it would certainly improve their financial situation.","But it meant he would have to resign from Shen Wei's organization.","The employees of Starry Sky Kindergarten were under public scrutiny.","So far, no employee had left.","Many were offered high salaries to be poached.","Qin Shu wanting to go to a run-down welfare institute was beyond Shen Wei's understanding. She asked, \"Why are you thinking of going there out of the blue?\"","\"I just want to do something meaningful,\" he said. In the past, his identity was awkward, being the illegitimate child of a wealthy family.","And he was bullied as a child, which made him dislike children.","Coming to work at a kindergarten had already exceeded many people's expectations.","Being surrounded by children didn't seem like something he could do.","Shen Wei said, \"If you've thought it through, go ahead. We'll keep your position open here at Starry Sky, you can come back anytime. And if the welfare institute needs investment, just let us know. This will always be your home.\"","Qin Shu felt a surge of emotion and chuckled lightly, \"I knew you'd say that.\" His face bore a smile that seemed to say he had won a bet.","It was precisely because Starry Sky Kindergarten gave him this confidence,","That he dared to propose such an idea.","Although his time at Starry Sky Kindergarten wasn't particularly long,","Seeing Liu Chef happily making delicious food for them every day in various ways,","And all the children hugging and cuddling, there was a moment when he truly wanted to work there for life.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had an unimaginable charm.","However, he didn't crave comfort, he still liked challenges.","Originally, he was supposed to manage the second branch.","But Lin Rui was ahead of him.","Lin Rui's abilities were not inferior to his.","Now, going to the welfare institute was actually avoiding direct competition.","Moreover, a place with a lower starting point had more room for improvement.","The welfare institute still had to worry about basic needs like food and warmth every day, which to him was extremely exciting and challenging.","Qin Shu had also spoken with the welfare institute's director.","The director welcomed such a high-level talent with open arms.","Qin Shu felt a bit embarrassed.","Shen Wei had shown him great kindness. It didn't feel right to just leave like this.","Shen Wei seemed to see through his thoughts and said, \"Then I ask you to take someone with you, Lin Zhi.\"","That child was the rescued Villain No. 4, usually quiet and reserved, with a somewhat feminine personality.","Always yielding and modest.","Completely different from Qin Shu's \"fight if you don't agree\" personality.","She wanted Qin Shu to guide him a bit.","Besides, Lin Zhi had deep feelings for the welfare institute and could also help out.","Qin Shu said no problem.","He agreed very quickly.","Then Shen Wei brought Lin Zhi to Qin Shu.","Qin Shu said, \"From now on, you'll be my teaching assistant. I'll pay you 1000 yuan a month!\" He understood money matters best. He couldn't give too much at once.","Lin Zhi was stunned.","All these years he had been longing to work and earn some money, but due to his young age, no one would hire him.","Now someone was offering him 1000 yuan.","Lin Zhi's cheeks flushed slightly. He clenched his fists, determined to work hard once he got there.","......","Qin Shu went to the welfare institute.","He was already very skilled at internet promotion.","Combined with the kindergarten's collaboration,","A video quickly went viral online.","People actually don't lack compassion.","They just didn't know how to help before.","Now that they knew what the children needed,","Packages started pouring in from all over, heading to the welfare institute like snowflakes.","After gaining some online popularity, more families interested in adoption came to visit.","The next step was how to make the welfare institute profitable.","Qin Shu had come from Starry Sky. Many industry leaders were paying attention. Seeing him doing well, they called Shen Wei to congratulate her.","Shen Wei was surprised and flattered, not expecting her small business to attract the attention of big shots.","They exchanged a few casual words.","But what the big shots actually envied wasn't her talented employees.","It was Shen Wei's ability to identify talent.","It seemed that everyone working under Shen Wei was productive.","If they could apply this talent-spotting ability in their companies, breaking into the Fortune 500 wouldn't be difficult.","The big shots felt conflicted.","Shen Wei only running a kindergarten was their luck as businessmen; facing such an opponent would be terrifying."]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236: Too Curly","paragraphs":["Music teacher Song Panpan came to find Shen Wei and asked, \"Are there any more promising talents?\" She also wanted to nurture a personal disciple from start to finish.","She was quite jealous of Qi Zhong, not understanding why that guy was so impressive.","He already had Mu Zhixing, and now this newcomer Yu Fei was drawing with Mu Zhixing every day.","Qi Zhong had discovered that this child had a talent for painting.","Her gift lay in color mixing.","Previously, when Qi Zhong was teaching Mu Zhixing about color mixing, the little girl listened very attentively.","For these young children, mixing colors was like concocting magical potions in a fairy tale world. It was all play to them.","At first, the little one just played by herself. But later, he came to watch.","Qi Zhong was stunned.","Goodness, give her a color, and she could mix an identical one.","She could accurately judge from a pile of paints what colors to add to create another color.","This was practically a master of color. For painting, this talent was also incredibly impressive.","Qi Zhong was particularly delighted.","So he brought the little girl over to learn painting as well.","Both painting and calligraphy involve the beauty of lines.","So the calligraphy teacher also took the opportunity to give her some extra lessons in calligraphy.","This made Song Panpan feel a bit itchy with desire.","Like painting, piano also belongs to the arts.","They all require learning foundational skills from a young age.","Building a foundation at this age is extremely important.","Seeing that Qi Zhong had already taken on two beloved disciples, while she still had none, she became anxious.","Shen Wei couldn't help but laugh.","The teachers were getting competitive, and she didn't need to worry about it. They were comparing themselves to each other on their own.","Shen Wei said, \"So Yu Fei has talent too.\" As expected of an antagonist the System wanted to save.","This time, saving three antagonists together, the System rewarded her with ten million. No points.","Originally, ten million was quite generous.","But Shen Wei was so rich that she only had money left, which was of no use to her. What she wanted were the System's points.","The System had been stingy last time, and this time it didn't give any at all.","But there was also good news. It said that the original story plot had been altered by fifteen percent. With this, the original story plot had already been altered by eighty percent.","It could be said that it had completely derailed.","Now, the influence of the plot could be ignored.","...","At this moment, Song Panpan said, \"There are many benefits to learning piano. It can improve a child's concentration, and when they grow up, they can perform at various events.\"","Shen Wei asked, \"So who have you set your sights on?\"","Since the other party had come to find her, they must have come prepared.","Song Panpan glanced at Shen Wei and said, \"Indeed, I can't hide it from you. I've got my eye on Song Ping An! That child can sit still, and he's very smart.\"","People think that playing an instrument just requires rigid practice at first, without needing to use one's brain, but that's not actually the case.","Song Ping An and Shi Xiaohu playing mind games with each other, the adults had seen it all.","Song Ping An was just over three years old, turning four soon, and already so clever. He was definitely a good candidate for learning piano.","Song Ping An was initially rescued by Shen Wei.","This little baby who fought with wild dogs for food had a beastly nature, and at a few years old, he still couldn't speak much.","After coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten and being in this language environment, suddenly one day he exploded. He could say many words.","But he rarely spoke in daily life, so everyone had overlooked his clever little mind.","If it weren't for this time when Shi Xiaohu went against him, the little one would still be playing dumb.","Shen Wei said, \"Alright then.\"","After that, Song Panpan left jubilantly. She just couldn't believe she couldn't teach a prodigy.","She went back and told Song Ping An.","Song Ping An thought he was going to play and happily agreed.","And so, the child fell into the spell of practicing piano for two hours every day.","But this child truly had some temperament. No matter how long he had to sit, he could endure it.","Unlike other children who would start crying after sitting for a while.","Playing a simple tune, he was already showing promise after just a month.","Now the music teacher walked around with a spring in her step.","This made the teachers of other art classes also want to find promising talents.","Mainly because they were stimulated by Qi Zhong and Song Panpan.","Especially Qi Zhong, he loved showing off his disciples too much.","Every day his social media was full of posts about what his disciples had painted.","When he had his incident before, he had been blocked by many peers.","Now those people were thick-skinned enough to add him back.","After all, Mu Zhixing's abilities were there for all to see.","At such a young age, she had already held an exhibition abroad, and some were even willing to pay high prices of 500,000 for her paintings.","She was just a little child, with a promising future ahead.","Qi Zhong's newly accepted little disciple was just like ordinary children.","She started learning from the most basic lines. At first, the painters in Qi Zhong's social circle didn't think much of it.","Peeking at his social media had become a habit, and they finally saw a normal child, thinking they could breathe a sigh of relief.","How could it be possible to encounter geniuses every time?","But once Yu Fei got into colors, she showed her talent.","The painting masters couldn't sit still.","Being able to mix accurate colors with just a glance, this ability... displayed by a child? It was too enviable.","These big names in the painting world organized a small gathering privately.","When they met, they didn't even exchange pleasantries, but couldn't help saying, \"How come all the geniuses are in Starry Sky Kindergarten?\"","\"For Qi Zhong to get one disciple like Mu Zhixing was already lucky enough. To have two disciples with such talent is too much.\"","\"I heard before that students at Starry Sky Kindergarten all have to go through an interview. They must have picked out the talented kids at that time.\"","Those present were all veteran painters.","Who doesn't yearn to teach a genius?","The art world really depends on innate talent, there's a barrier between geniuses and others.","Over the years, they had taught many smart and talented students.","But they hadn't come across a once-in-a-century young prodigy.","Since Mu Zhixing's sudden rise to fame, who hadn't dreamed of having such a disciple?","But alas, others had beaten them to it.","A group of people sighed there: \"When can we find a young prodigy?\"","\"First, they need to be young, and second, they need to be a genius.\"","\"If it doesn't work out, why don't we go to Starry Sky Kindergarten to pick?\"","\"Wait a minute, I want to ask, is Starry Sky Kindergarten still recruiting painting teachers?\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the others were shocked.","Right, there was still this method.","Why hadn't they thought of it before?","So everyone called Qi Zhong.","They asked if he was still recruiting teachers, saying they wanted to go.","These people were all top veterans in the painting world.","If they could come to Starry Sky Kindergarten, it would undoubtedly add prestige to the kindergarten. Qi Zhong said one word: \"Yes!\"","Everyone was in a hurry to go.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's second branch was about to open, and there were also many children who loved painting in the first branch, not to mention the pop-up stores.","They had always had a demand for teachers.","With such an outstanding precedent, those not as good as Qi Zhong simply couldn't be selected.","But teachers of Qi Zhong's caliber were rare in the painting world. The addition of these people undoubtedly solved Starry Sky Kindergarten's urgent need.","When Starry Sky Kindergarten announced the list of new teachers.","The small forum in the painting circle exploded.","\"What's going on? These big names are usually impossible to invite, how come they've all gone to teach at a kindergarten now?\"","\"These people have gone to teach at Starry Sky Kindergarten. In the future, why bother applying to art academies? Just apply to Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"What kind of magic does Starry Sky Kindergarten have? It's too attractive to the big names.\"","One after another, they marveled."]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237: Advance Preparation","paragraphs":["Several months passed in the blink of an eye. As the new year turned, this spring was incredibly important for everyone at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Lin Zhi was being sent off to start middle school, while Mu Zhixing was beginning first grade in elementary school.","The Starry Sky Kindergarten Second Branch was about to open. The construction had been completed for quite some time, and the building had been left vacant long enough for any odors to dissipate.","Internet users were speculating that enrollment would begin soon.","Every day, the comment sections and private messages were flooded with inquiries about when enrollment would start.","These were all locals, who had access to more information.","Some well-informed individuals already knew that Starry Sky Kindergarten had hired a batch of new teachers at the end of the previous year.","This was clearly in preparation for the second branch.","After more than a year, Starry Sky Kindergarten had undergone a glamorous transformation.","Originally, their enrollment process was conducted quietly, and this time they didn't poach teachers from other institutions on a large scale.","The list of teachers was provided by the system.","Shen Wei had even spent 10,000 points for this.","She suddenly realized that the system's previous generosity was merely new user protection.","Now, the rate at which points increased had slowed down. She was earning a few hundred to a thousand points daily.","But the points were incredibly valuable. These teachers were all certified by the system as having excellent character and abilities.","Initially, not many people knew about this.","However, somehow, a post from several months ago on an art forum was dug up again.","At first, it had only caused a stir within the small circle of artists.","Now, it had spread far beyond that community.","It had reached a point where even casual fans were shocked.","\"Their art teachers are university professors, and several of them are honorary vice-chairmen of various art associations.\"","These people would typically use such titles as selling points when collaborating with artists.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten hadn't advertised this at all.","It was an attentive netizen who traced the information back to the art forum and reposted it online.","\"Good heavens, the teachers at Starry Sky Kindergarten are terrifyingly impressive!\"","\"I was a casual fan of Starry Sky, but now I'm turning into a die-hard fan. How can I enroll in this kindergarten? It's urgent.\"","\"I'd like to ask, what's the college entrance exam score requirement for Starry Sky Kindergarten? I'm currently in my second year of high school and plan to apply it as my first choice.\" This comment received over 10,000 replies and surpassed 500,000 likes.","Everyone else was stunned.","What exactly was Starry Sky Kindergarten up to?","Those who had tried to copy Shen Wei's approach by throwing money at the problem, hoping to replicate Starry Sky Kindergarten's success, had all been crushed to dust.","Now, seeing the trending topics, they deeply regretted their actions!","They should have started something different instead. Where could they possibly find so many excellent teachers?","During the recent New Year period, Shen Wei was incredibly busy, receiving countless invitations to various gatherings.","Everyone insisted on her attendance.","Whenever she showed up, she would be immediately surrounded.","Usually, it was people with children.","Previously, when the Liu Family's third young master sent his child there, everyone thought it was a joke.","They speculated about family feuds, but now they realized how truly impressive it was.","He had gotten in before Starry Sky Kindergarten became famous, and now his child was thriving there in every aspect.","Coupled with the teaching capabilities at Starry Sky Kindergarten, it was truly enviable.","Wealthy families placed great importance on nurturing the next generation.","Many began elite education from as young as a few years old.","Some started later, but no later than elementary school.","In recent years, they had adopted the foreign approach of hiring private tutors. Sending children to kindergarten was considered somewhat beneath them.","But now, their perspective had changed.","In kindergarten, children could interact with more peers their age, developing more outgoing and cheerful personalities.","Moreover, children could learn to manage relationships with others.","They were already from wealthy families.","How else could so many out-of-touch romantics emerge?","They had too little exposure to different people.","Influenced by various media, they easily became stubborn. Letting children interact with diverse groups was the best approach.","Now, everyone was clamoring for a spot at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Shen Wei had instantly become a top influencer among the wealthy second generation.","Other rich kids looked at Shen Wei with utmost admiration.","At least when they looked at Shen Wei's resume, they knew they couldn't match it.","But Shen Wei hadn't agreed to their requests for guaranteed spots.","Mainly because it would be too eye-catching at this crucial moment.","She just said that Starry Sky Kindergarten would be enrolling soon, and told them to keep an eye out for announcements.","If news of pre-arranged spots got out now,","it would hurt many loyal fans of Starry Sky.","Many parent fans had discovered Starry Sky Kindergarten as a hidden gem from the first recruitment.","Some had even started teaching their children various skills half a year in advance, just to perform better in the interviews.","These people didn't mind.","But one by one, they went to buy houses in the new district.","This had the real estate agents in the new district laughing with joy.","Previously, no one had shown interest in the new district, but now it was showing signs of becoming a hot property market.","Who could have imagined that a kindergarten would bring about such a big change?","If someone had said this in the past, he would have scoffed at them. But now, he couldn't wait to elevate Starry Sky Kindergarten to the highest pedestal.","How could it be called just an internet-famous kindergarten?","It was a veritable cash cow.","Even the young man who had initially proposed bringing Starry Sky Kindergarten to the new district had received a promotion and a raise.","This shows what a beautiful turnaround this move was for the entire new district's development.","Almost everyone was busy with the enrollment issues of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They needed to ensure smooth enrollment while also maintaining normal classes for the current students without disruption.","Other core members, like Liu Chef, had been pulling strings and had already found twenty to thirty renowned chefs to lead the kitchen.","After all, Starry Sky Kindergarten first gained fame for its food.","The last time Starry Sky Kindergarten went viral, it was because they provided boxed meals.","Everyone was showing them off on social media.","For a while, these boxed meals dominated the internet, with many people curious about how delicious they must be to receive such praise.","Moreover, the kindergarten's daily menu for the children was published online.","The menu never repeated in a day.","Initially, the boxed meals were just a temporary measure.","They didn't expect it to become so popular.","This time, boxed meals were a must. So they needed more manpower.","Liu Chef had already requested 100 kitchen assistants from the agency.","But he still felt it wasn't enough, as they didn't know how many people would apply this time.","It was said that people from other provinces were coming to apply.","Liu Chef approached Shen Wei to express his concerns.","Shen Wei said, \"If we don't have enough people, we'll hire another 100.\"","Liu Chef said, \"I'm worried that with too many people, it will be hard to manage.\"","Liu Chef had previously managed at most a few dozen people.","Now, hearing that he would have to coordinate two to three hundred people simultaneously,","He had no experience in this area and was very anxious.","He hadn't slept well for several days, and his previously chubby cheeks had thinned noticeably.","Shen Wei said, \"I believe you can do it.\"","As for Liu Chef's concern about some people slacking off, Shen Wei directly said, \"We've installed 360-degree cameras with no blind spots over there. If any problems occur, we'll be alerted immediately.\"","The 360-degree live streaming cameras Shen Wei mentioned were actually the system.","Of course, using the system wasn't without cost - 1000 points per day.","Originally, she had painstakingly saved up to 70,000 points, used 10,000, leaving 60,000. This enrollment period was expected to last 10 days, which would leave her with only 50,000 points.","But she wasn't thinking about points now, her main concern was anxiety over this situation.","Moreover, the level of attention they were receiving was simply too high."]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238: The Starry Sky Hotel","paragraphs":["Liu Chef didn't want to put more pressure on Shen Wei.","He said to Shen Wei, \"I'll manage everything in the kitchen, you can leave it to me!\"","He said this through gritted teeth, thinking that if worse comes to worst, he still had his senior apprentice to rely on.","Indeed, his senior apprentice was still the most dependable.","Plus, now that he had Jiang Xun with him, things were much better than before, and he wouldn't be completely in the dark.","Mu Zhixing's little school bag had already been bought.","In addition, Yu Fei and Shi Xiaohu were also going to start primary school together. Regarding Shi Xiaohu's age, they had initially thought about letting him stay in kindergarten for another year, but this child was very ambitious.","He insisted on going to primary school.","Perhaps the memories of his life in the orphanage were still too fresh in his mind.","He just wanted to be together with everyone and didn't want to be separated at all.","There were many teachers at Starry Sky Kindergarten, and after testing, they found this child to be very intelligent.","Although he was slightly behind, the teachers at Starry Sky Kindergarten were actively giving him extra lessons.","Reaching the admission standard for first grade shouldn't be a problem.","Originally, there was only one primary school student, Mu Zhixing, but now there were three.","However, Qi Zhong was very pleased. He now had two precious apprentices in total.","At least they could look out for each other, and he also had his grand-apprentice Wang Dan, who would be starting fifth grade at primary school.","He was also going to Bright Virtue Primary School.","It would be perfect for him to take care of the younger ones.","Upper grade students looking after lower grade kids was like fighting with an overwhelming advantage.","As long as no one bullied them, it would be fine.","Teacher Qi Zhong was worried sick.","His colleagues joked beside him: looking at him was like seeing a single father.","Shen Wei found He Lingfeng and asked, \"Is the small software we developed this time ready?\"","The little guy nodded.","So it was released online, along with the kindergarten's enrollment video.","Within minutes of posting, there were already many comments when refreshed.","\"I saw it. Delete it immediately.\"","\"Great, finally waiting for Starry Sky Kindergarten's enrollment.\"","\"My goodness, how can there be so many people?\"","Because the number of people downloading the registration form could be seen online.","Within one hour, it showed 200,000 downloads.","After a day,","The download volume of the file had already broken through a terrifying 1.5 million.","Even Gu Qingyan was shocked, looking at Shen Wei and hardly daring to breathe: \"Are these 1.5 million all applying for Starry Sky Kindergarten?\" Her voice was trembling.","Shen Wei said, \"Probably not.\"","The enrollment information and prospectus were in the attachments. Some people just wanted to see their admission standards.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was so popular that many peers were also paying attention.","Not all of them were necessarily applicants.","Thinking of this, Gu Qingyan felt slightly relieved.","It's good that not so many people are applying, otherwise even ten kindergartens wouldn't be able to accommodate so many people.","Their originally planned enrollment was 300 people in 10 classes.","It was Shen Wei who suggested increasing the 300 to 500 people.","Although it's only an increase of 200 people, this adds 7 more classes.","In other words, this enrollment would have 17 classes, plus the 7 class spots previously given to developers, and one wealthy class, making it 25 classes in total. It was already a very large-scale kindergarten.","Moreover, this time with the land coming from the new district, the entire kindergarten had completely upgraded.","The kindergarten opened many functional areas.","Including indoor swimming for children.","A children's climbing gym.","A small courtroom for children and a science observation hall.","Computer multimedia classrooms.","And music instrument classrooms, this time with many instruments, to find out which children are truly interested.","The soundproofing was done to the standard of luxury practice rooms.","There were also various small stages.","These things hadn't been successively released yet.","Others would strike while the iron is hot in their promotions. Shen Wei, however, wanted to quietly lower the heat a bit.","For all people, those who want to apply need to fill out the form first, then upload it.","There are two days in total for uploading, and the remaining 8 days are for interviews.","Netizens all expressed hope that the judges would be the same as before.","\"Please, we can't do without Liu Chef.\"","\"I almost died laughing when Liu Chef was selecting kids last time, he passed almost every child!\"","\"He really makes me cry, who doesn't long for a grandfather like this. His eyes and heart are full of praise!\"","\"Liu Chef is our only connection in the kindergarten, at least his guaranteed vote will give children a lot of confidence.\"","\"But if Liu Chef is a judge, who will cook for us?\"","\"Do you guys want Liu Chef or do you want to eat?\"","\"Wait, why suddenly such a difficult choice question!\"","Netizens joked below: \"We want both Liu Chef and delicious food.\"","\"This time I almost got custody of my little niece, but was mercilessly suppressed by my brother and sister-in-law, they said they've been wanting to eat Starry Sky Kindergarten's food for a year.\"","\"No worries, you can still try to grab tickets for the pop-up store.\"","\"Are you kidding? The tickets for the pop-up store are almost as hard to get as my idol's concert tickets.\"","Everyone was already having a hard time getting tickets, and there were even scalpers.","Now, as long as you get a ticket, you can easily sell it for an extra 10,000 yuan immediately.","And it's instant purchase and payment, for fear that the seller might regret it. If someone wants to sell at a higher price, waiting a bit longer could fetch 20,000 yuan, and there would still be buyers.","These people saw the business opportunity and resolutely went to grab tickets.","There are 4 chances to grab tickets each month, one chance opened each week, and each time you grab tickets for a week.","Once you get a ticket and sell it at a higher price, it's equivalent to many people's monthly salary. This way, more people rushed in to grab tickets. Before, people could at least get to the payment page, but now many people got stuck for a moment, and then it showed sold out.","They simply couldn't get tickets, and some people had already given up.","Those tickets were extremely hard to buy, and just then, someone excitedly discovered: \"Quick, look! Starry Sky Kindergarten has released a new video.\"","The internet never lacks people who like to join in the excitement.","Immediately, they crawled along the internet to the other side: \"Wow!\"","Instant surprise.","It was as if Starry Sky Kindergarten knew exactly what they were thinking.","They directly released an announcement that a Starry Sky Restaurant had opened next to the new Starry Sky Kindergarten.","One day every week, Liu Chef personally takes charge of the kitchen.","Jiang Xun, the young chef who was most favored by everyone in the previous culinary competition, was confirmed to be the head chef at Starry Sky Restaurant.","Since Jiang Xun withdrew from the competition, many veterans in the culinary world had expressed regret, saying that Jiang Xun's skills were much better than theirs when they were young, and everyone was looking forward to seeing more. Unexpectedly, he withdrew from the competition.","Now being able to revisit this dream is really wonderful.","In an instant, everyone became excited: \"Finally, we can start eating now.\"","The comment section was full of words of jubilation."]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239: Too Many Sign-ups","paragraphs":["Just yesterday, Shen Wei had reassured Gu Qingyan that not many people would apply.","But by the next day, she couldn't laugh anymore.","Because the number of applicants showed 130,000, and it was still increasing.","Suddenly, everyone became serious.","By the time online registration ended on the third day, the number of applicants had reached 200,000.","It was simply inconceivable.","Not only could Shen Wei's team see the number of applicants, but online users could also see it. They were stunned by this figure.","\"Are you kidding? 200,000 people applying for a kindergarten that only accepts 500 children? That means only one out of every 400 applicants will be selected.\"","\"Is this the power of an internet-famous kindergarten?\"","\"The internet is always spreading rumors about low birth rates. I really thought there weren't many people left. But now look. There's no shortage of people, is there?\"","\"Everyone, go check it out! The news about Starry Sky Kindergarten receiving 200,000 applications is trending on social media.\"","Initially, only long-time fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten were shocked.","But then public accounts picked up the story.","Once it was posted online, it instantly attracted attention.","In a short time, the number of views broke 20 million, rising to the 15th spot on the trending list, and it was still climbing.","Shen Wei immediately posted a message in the kindergarten's group chat: Meeting.","During this period, they had been expanding recruitment for all positions, including security guards, school bus drivers, cleaning staff, preschool teachers, and teaching assistants.","When Shen Wei arrived at the largest conference room, it was packed with people.","The accountant said they now had over 400 full-time employees, not counting temporary workers.","Shen Wei hadn't held such a large meeting in a long time.","The departments were divided according to their functions, with Lin Rui as the supervising leader.","She had brought over her scientific management methods.","Whether it was hundreds or even thousands of people, she could manage them with ease.","Shen Wei only needed to communicate well with the team leaders.","They would then instruct the staff below them.","Now this was a big meeting.","Shen Wei felt a bit intimidated standing in front of such a large crowd of employees.","She only said a few words about the current favorable situation and encouraged everyone to work hard.","The benefits and treatment at Starry Sky Kindergarten were very good.","Everyone who came here already knew that.","Many had even given up decent jobs elsewhere to choose Starry Sky.","Now, Starry Sky was clearly a coveted workplace in the eyes of job seekers.","After Shen Wei spoke for a few minutes, she stepped down, and Lin Rui said a few words. Although there were many people at this meeting, it lasted less than half an hour.","Afterward, Shen Wei called over the team leaders and small managers from each department, about forty to fifty people, to a large conference room.","This time, there were relatively fewer people.","Almost all the core staff of Starry Sky Kindergarten were involved.","Now that the number of applicants had exceeded 200,000, what should they do?","Shen Wei was urgently discussing how to conduct the written test and interviews.","...","All the parents who had applied sprang into action.","In the following days, pre-exam training classes across the city were fully booked.","Many one-on-one tutoring sessions were completely unavailable.","Only group classes were available.","Even those who used to train students for art exams had been recruited.","It was evident how seriously parents were taking this.","The training institutions were busy, tired, and excited.","They loved institutions like Starry Sky Kindergarten that had such strong appeal.","When Starry Sky started recruiting, the entire training industry felt like it was celebrating New Year's.","They had never had business this good before.","Previously, they couldn't even attract students.","Now they were frantically pushing back appointments with clients.","Every teacher was working non-stop.","But in these ten days, they could earn as much as they did in a year before.","So all the institutions began to study Starry Sky Kindergarten's recruitment process.","The first round was a written test, followed by interviews.","A written test had been added.","So even cultural courses for preschool education began to be supplemented.","Many people thought there would only be an interview like last year.","They had neglected the written test aspect, and now they were rushing to catch up. They were terribly anxious.","Those parents who prided themselves on having started preparing since the first recruitment finally saw Starry Sky beginning to recruit for its second location.","They had wanted to sigh at their own foresight.","They had started training early.","It was certainly much more thorough than those who were cramming at the last minute.","But faced with 200,000 applicants, even they became nervous.","Even with early preparation.","This time, they might not even make it to the interview stage.","When they learned about Starry Sky's recruitment, their hearts felt like they were on a roller coaster, going up and down.","They knew Starry Sky Kindergarten was popular, but they hadn't imagined it would be this popular.","Now they could only hope their children would perform well.","After some time, an announcement was released: one day for the written test, ten days for interviews. Specific times were also provided.","This time, Starry Sky Kindergarten sought help from the new district.","The district was also closely watching Starry Sky Kindergarten's recruitment this time.","As soon as they saw Starry Sky Kindergarten's request for assistance, they immediately consulted with the bureau.","Subsequently, they dispatched a group of teachers and a school to specifically proctor the exam for the children on the weekend.","Proctoring an exam for kindergarten children.","This was a first for these primary and middle school teachers.","But it was quite novel.","They were curious about what kind of questions this internet-famous kindergarten would ask.","On the day of the exam, when they opened the document envelope and looked inside.","It was all simple Chinese language and math questions, along with some thinking questions.","These thinking questions were mostly multiple-choice and matching questions. For others, answers could be written in words or pinyin.","The questions were suitable for children aged 6 to 7 years old.","When these questions were made public afterward, parents were relieved.","They had been worried that Starry Sky Kindergarten might ask questions beyond the syllabus.","After all, everyone knew that Starry Sky Kindergarten had produced genius students before.","He Lingfeng was a child who could tutor middle school students when he was just five years old.","They were afraid Starry Sky might take an extreme approach and ask some very difficult questions.","But their worries didn't materialize.","They felt their children would definitely be able to answer these questions.","However, netizens were a bit concerned.","200,000 people had applied, but they only wanted 500.","If they couldn't differentiate the applicants enough.","It would be impossible to pass the interview stage later.","The teachers all had good judgment.","The Chinese language and math papers were straightforward to grade.","They had standard answers and were extremely easy to mark.","As for the thinking questions, there were many possible solutions.","Basically, all possible solutions were given as answers.","They could grade the papers quickly.","When the final results came out, many people couldn't believe it.","Adults found it simple because they had already gone through their learning phase.","But for children, these questions were quite challenging.","Who would have thought that such a simple written test would eliminate 180,000 people?","In the end, 20,000 people were selected.","Finally, each test paper was scanned and uploaded online.","By entering the child's ID information, parents could retrieve their child's test paper.","The answers had already been published online.","Parents could judge for themselves whether their child's disqualification was justified, and if they felt there was a misjudgment, they could appeal within three days.","After all, with so many papers to grade, there might have been some oversights.","But this move silenced many critics.","They made everything public and transparent, earning great praise from netizens.","They hoped all exams in the future could be like this.","Knowing where you got things right and where you went wrong.","A popular comment from netizens read: \"It's too intense. Do the staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten have eight hands each? How can they be so thorough in every aspect?\""]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240: Interview Begins","paragraphs":["The difference is probably what sets Starry Sky Kindergarten apart from other kindergartens.","Everyone thought Starry Sky Kindergarten was already exhausted. Just the mechanical task of scanning and uploading could wear people out. Two hundred thousand documents is no small number.","But Shen Wei used advanced technology, directly letting the system help with uploading and scanning.","Of course, using the system to work cost over 10,000 points.","Now only 45,000 points remain.","However, the system's efficiency is very high.","As a super algorithm, it only took less than an hour to do this task.","The next day, the live interview began.","Netizens were all waiting.","\"Even if there are only 20,000 people, they can't interview them all.\"","\"I saw in the admission brochure that each child should prepare a one-minute performance. They only have 10 days. Can they interview 2,000 people in one day?\"","\"Probably not, unless they're superhumans.\"","Just as netizens were guessing how Shen Wei would handle this, the selection method for this interview was announced. There were four groups of judges in total.","The first group of interviewers consisted of Shen Wei, the art teacher, music teacher, singing teacher, street dance teacher, classical dance teacher, and Liu Chef.","The second group was Lin Rui, Qin Shu, Teacher Tang, Guo Qing, and Tang Xiaowan.","The third and fourth groups were also people from Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They were all teachers, teaching assistants, and some teachers with special artistic skills.","For this live broadcast, they applied for several additional accounts.","Each group of judges was live streaming on different accounts.","This way, everyone could choose which group they wanted to observe.","And the selection was made on the spot.","They would directly say \"in\" or \"out.\"","This method was quite exciting.","Netizens were all fired up: \"I want to go to the first group, but I also want to see the other groups. What should I do?\"","\"Don't worry, all Starry Sky Kindergarten fans have this idea. Someone will definitely record it. I'll watch Shen Wei's group first, and when it's over and the recordings from other groups come out, I'll watch those.\"","\"Your idea is the same as mine.\"","\"I want to watch Teacher Tang's group. Teacher Tang is pregnant with such a big belly, will she be okay?\"","\"It should be fine. Last time a netizen left a message, and Teacher Tang replied that she volunteered for this.\"","\"It's not even my exam, why am I so nervous?\"","\"Me too.\"","With so many people, coordinating simultaneously was a huge challenge for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Fortunately, they had a dedicated security team.","And a logistics team.","All 400 people from Starry Sky Kindergarten were mobilized.","In addition, there were kitchen helpers.","And people from the district came to coordinate, totaling over a thousand people.","The live broadcast started on the second day.","Early in the morning, a large crowd had gathered at the entrance of Starry Sky Kindergarten in the new district.","They were all there for the interview.","There were so many people.","Even traffic police had arrived because there was nowhere to park.","Outside, there were various small streamers, holding up their phones to live stream this event.","Others had arrived early to comply.","They were waiting there for the live broadcast to begin.","This time, as an online live broadcast, it was in vertical screen format.","But it was split-screen, with one camera firmly focused on the contestant's performance, and another on the judges' reactions.","This way, by entering one live stream, you could see both the contestant's performance and the judges' reactions.","As for the 2,000 people on the first day.","They had been notified through various means which group and number they were, and what time to arrive at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Others could come at their designated time. They didn't need to wait here in vain.","There were four groups in total.","But the group with the most people was always Shen Wei's group.","When the first child came in.","Netizens were delighted to find that Starry Sky Kindergarten was so thoughtful.","This time, they had invited professional hosts to moderate the atmosphere.","The host for the first group was the wedding host they had invited for the culinary competition.","This wedding host had hosted many, many weddings and had honed his improvisational skills.","Moreover, he was quick-witted and likable.","Shen Wei directly signed a contract with him. As for the judges' side, Shen Wei invited internet celebrity hosts.","They were mainly known for being quick-witted and able to liven up the atmosphere.","This time, it was also a way for them to earn extra money.","Those internet celebrity hosts came over excitedly.","After all, being invited by Starry Sky Kindergarten undoubtedly increased their popularity.","It was a win-win situation, and netizens cheered when they saw this.","\"My favorite kindergarten and my favorite hosts are collaborating!\"","\"What a double delight.\"","\"So awesome.\"","\"Always cheering for Sister Shen Wei who never lacks money.\"","\"I really love her so much.\"","Then the first group of children came in.","Each group was to interview 500 children.","Everyone was very nervous, and it was thanks to the host who comforted them first.","Then, when it came time to perform, the children showed a bit of fearless spirit.","Being able to go first, the parents were also filled with anxiety and hope.","After all, the first group last year was admitted.","They hoped to start off well this year too.","This time, the admission required at least 5 out of 7 judges to pass.","They were only admitting 500 people. If the number exceeded, there would be a tiebreaker. If the number didn't exceed, those admitted were admitted.","Everyone wanted to win over these judges on the spot.","The first child's performance was average.","Actually, for their age, being able to complete these tasks was already good.","But among the children, it was ordinary.","This child wasn't admitted. The child was quite competitive and burst into tears on the spot.","Thanks to the host's praise, the child calmed down.","The sight of the child sobbing was quite pitiful.","Netizens all felt heartbroken.","\"I didn't expect kindergartens to be so competitive now. I thought the first child did pretty well. Can't believe they weren't selected.\"","\"The first child forgot several words during the recitation, probably because they were too nervous. The child's voice was trembling.\"","\"Reminds me of my first time on stage. That nervous trembling feeling is still vivid in my memory.\"","Soon, the second, third, and fourth groups started interviewing one after another.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's pace was very good.","Shen Wei was gentle yet firm, enthusiastically inviting those who were selected to come to Starry Sky, while offering comfort to those who weren't selected.","After just one morning, Shen Wei's voice was hoarse.","Gu Qingyan, watching the live stream, was very worried.","Finally, the other judges also started to exert themselves frequently.","Netizens watching were exhausted. At first, they were excited, but after watching for a while, they truly felt tired.","If even the viewers felt tired, not to mention Shen Wei who had to juggle maintaining a lively atmosphere, comforting children, scoring on the spot, and so on. Her mind must be under high tension, ten times more exhausting than just watching.","Netizens suddenly sighed: \"Having many people isn't necessarily a good thing.\"","\"I'll stop watching for now and wait for the edited highlights to come out.\"","Otherwise, it's really too exhausting."]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241: The Kids Who Come Are Amazing","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten's online viewership initially soared at 300,000.","Gradually it fell to around 50,000 - 60,000, with viewers dipping in and out of various live streaming rooms.","Some preferred to remain in a single room while others merely stayed for a while, eager to watch the highlights later.","But those who stayed on the scene were always left in disbelief.","What kind of exceptional kindergarten is Starry Sky? It seems every contestant here has a remarkably impressive background.","Just now, there came a participant who was the world champion in the children's Latin dance competition.","The little angel with her hair shining, danced with an explosive power and a fascinating texture.","She looked like a baby, but danced like a charging leopard, creating an incredibly strong impact.","Unlike most children who would introduce themselves first and then perform, this girl's strategy was to stun everyone with her dance and keep her title until the very end to avoid any bias.","Even those who knew nothing about dancing were shocked by the girl’s explosive energy.","Only when she revealed her achievement as a world champion at the end of her introduction, everyone gasped.","The live barrage comments were full of exclamations: \"How can anyone else win when the world champion is here?\" As expected, all the judges gave her a pass.","Both the classical dance and street dance teachers exchanged glances, their eyes glimmering.","Even Shen Wei contemplated hiring another Latin dance teacher.","It's surprising how such a young girl could dance with such gusto, making her stand out from the crowd.","Then came along a blonde-haired, blue-eyed foreign child.","He amazingly performed the Chinese art of crosstalk, clear in pronunciation, and bright in expression.","After his performance, Shen Wei curiously asked him, \"Are you of Chinese descent?\"","\"No, I'm pure foreigner. I learned Chinese after moving here with my parents when I was three.\"","His performance was outstanding. Combined with his foreign appearance, it created a significant impact.","With flawless spoken English too, he received unanimous approval.","There were many applicants with the judges only breaking for 10 minutes. Lunch was Starry Sky's special boxed lunch.","During the lunch break, Qi Zhong received a phone call.","It turned out to be a call to join the 3rd round from the vice president of the Art Association.","When Qi Zhong arrived, the Vice President excitedly said, \"Do you know who's here? The grandson of Master Shi.\"","He had come to specifically observe the gifted children in art.","A minute of drawing, the requirements for sketching are incredibly high.","However, this child managed to sketch a realistic image within a minute.","When the Vice President inquired, and found out the child's last name was Shi, he almost gasped.","This child was the grandson of Master Shi, a giant in the realm of painting.","It was said that his grandson had inherited his talents.","Previously, it was only hearsay but seeing is believing and he was genuinely excited.","He immediately called Qi Zhong when the interview was over.","Qi Zhong was also shocked, he lost his appetite for lunch and immediately rushed over.","But by the time he arrived, the next group of children were already performing.","However, the Vice President of the Art Association showed the previous artwork to Qi Zhong.","Creating such a perfect drawing in one minute. Indeed, like father, like son.","Qi Zhong praised it endlessly.","This time, the Vice President determinedly said, \"Mu Zhixing and Yu Fei are already here, this one must be mine.\"","He came to Starry Sky Kindergarten in hopes of finding some children with the talent for drawing.","Unexpectedly. The grandchild of one of the most respected figures in the art world actually came here, and he's certainly not going to pass up this opportunity.","Qi Zhong saw his grin spreading up to his ears, saying, \"Let's see who the child chooses.\"","\"The child will of course choose me.\" He didn't even think about his reply. Afterwards he said, \"You can't possibly take care of so many children, right?\"","He came here full of expectation about the education of the children.","Having the grandchild of a respected art figure come here made him feel that the trip to Starry Sky Kindergarten was totally worth it.","If he hadn't come here, he wouldn't have had this encounter.","The vice president of the art association let out a longing breath, and confidently returned to the judge's bench.","Although the viewers in the live streaming room did not know what they were talking about, they could vaguely guess from the praises of the vice president earlier that this must be another small genius.","The users online were unbearably curious and wanted to know the identities of these people.","This episode is too wonderful.","Another contestant who left a deep impression on everyone was a little girl who performs acrobatics.","She performed a uni-cycle while balancing dishes","Her act made all the viewers worry. She's just a seven-year-old girl, but she stacked dishes so high.","\"I'm really worried she'll fall.\" Everyone was on tenterhooks.","Even the netizens started to criticize, \"Are there really adults willing to let their children learn these dangerous skills?\"","\"I remember a star now who used to study acrobatics. It's the hardest and most painful of all the arts. It's also very dangerous.\"","\"Most families only have one child now, how could they bear to see their child suffer so much.\"","When they saw the little girl performing, some sensitive viewers started to cry.","After her one-minute performance, the little girl came down steadily.","All the dishes were also brought down.","Shen Wei asked, \"How long have you been learning, sweetie?\"","\"Two years.\"","She is 7 years old this year. She started learning since she was 5.","Seeing how steady this little girl was, they could only imagine how much she had suffered.","Then her family came up, appearing to be honest and simple farmers.","They were quiet and reserved, not sure what to say, after a moment, they asked, \"Can school fees be waived if the child comes here to study?\"","This child's family was not well-to-do and her parents were all sick and unable to take care of her.","She had no option but to live with her uncle in the city.","Luckily, her uncle was part of an acrobatic troupe, and he discovered that she was very gifted.","So, she studied for two years for free.","However, the current domestic acrobatic environment was not good.","Their troupe was also facing dissolution.","They were unsure how to settle themselves as adults, let alone the children.","Adding to that, she was still very young. They heard then about the Starry Sky Kindergarten was recruiting students for a monthly fee of 1600.","For ordinary people, that was like charity.","However, for this simple farmer, it was still quite a struggle.","Shen Wei said, \"If the family is in a difficult situation, we will make appropriate adjustments. We won't let the admitted children lack schooling.\"","Shen Wei herself is not lacking in money, and she has a soft spot for children.","Netizens praised Shen Wei relentlessly.","Even many netizens began to introspect, \"I really shouldn’t be so affluent. After spending so long online, I feel like a million is nothing. But in reality, many people can't even afford a few thousand.\"","\"A single penny can stump a hero.\"","\"Looking at the flustered expression of the child's father asking for a reduction in tuition fee, I inexplicably wanted to cry.\"","\"Fortunately, they came to Starry Sky Kindergarten, and fortunately, Sister Shen Wei really isn't short on money.\"","\"Can we open a donation channel? I want to sponsor this little girl.\"","“No need, after all, Shen Wei is famously rich.”","\"Regardless of anything else, thumbs up for Shen Wei.\""]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242: “The Boxed Meal Has Gone Viral Again”","paragraphs":["The food at Starry Sky Kindergarten has always been excellent.","This time, their boxed meals became an absolute sensation.","They prepared 5 different configurations, each with a large picture attached. You could simply go and take whichever one you wanted.","Each person was allowed only one box.","Typically, two parents and one child would take three boxes.","With 2000 people being interviewed in a day, they had to prepare 6000 boxed meals, plus meals for the helpers and teachers, totaling 7000 boxes.","Fortunately, Liu Chef had previous experience with this kind of task.","The large ladles in the kitchen were almost smoking from overuse.","Moreover, all the cooks were master chefs. The food they prepared was top-notch.","After cooking, the helpers began to serve the food, pack the boxes, working in a frenzy.","Chef Chen went out to smoke a cigarette.","His shoulders were still aching.","A chef who came to help today patted him on the shoulder and said, \"Old Chen, with your culinary skills, you could be a private chef for the wealthy. Countless rich people would be fighting to hire you. Why are you here at Starry Sky Kindergarten, wielding a big ladle and cooking in bulk?\"","Chef Chen replied, \"I enjoy it.\"","In the past, he had lived a carefree life like an old Beijing local.","He hadn't felt much different over time, but now at Starry Sky Kindergarten, he was exceptionally busy.","Yet, he felt particularly fulfilled. His previous insomnia problem had been cured.","Now he cooked and enjoyed the praise from everyone.","It was really wonderful, and he got to interact with young children.","The little ones would softly call him \"Grandpa Chen.\"","For Chef Chen, who had never married, this was a special experience.","However, today had really worn him out.","Using a huge ladle to stir-fry, with a spatula almost as big as a small shovel.","His arms ached from all the movement.","He had never smoked before, but today he was truly exhausted.","Too tired to mind others, he found a spot to smoke.","After a few puffs, he realized he still couldn't handle it, so he put it out.","But he felt much more energized and asked his friend, \"Want to come work at our Starry Sky Kindergarten?\"","The chef he was chatting with had been brought in by Liu Chef.","They had learned their craft together in the past.","Later, he had become a chef for wealthy families and was said to have retired to his hometown.","He hadn't even rested for two days before coming at Liu Chef's request.","Unexpectedly, just one day had worn him out completely.","Looking at Chef Chen again, hearing that every day was like this for him, he could hardly believe it.","In terms of culinary skills, Chef Chen was even slightly better than him.","\"You two could be master chefs, yet you're content cooking at a kindergarten. I really can't understand it.\" Their peers in the culinary world had discussed this, wondering what spell Starry Sky Kindergarten had cast on them.","Making them so utterly devoted.","Chef Chen said, \"It's really nice here. The relationships are simple, and people love the food we cook.\"","Moreover, they could cook without worrying about costs, making whatever they wanted.","Even if they wanted to make abalone or lobster in the large pots, dishes that exceeded the budget.","As long as they listed it on the order for the purchasing staff.","It would be bought and delivered properly.","In their spare time, they could grow some vegetables.","Every now and then, they could go fishing with old friends during their time off.","This life was even more promising than before.","Besides, Shen Wei never shortchanged them financially.","Chef Chen's salary here was already quite substantial.","During the last Chinese New Year, when year-end bonuses were given out, he received a six-figure sum.","With no worries about food or clothing, and a sense of accomplishment.","Who wouldn't like such a job?","Chef Chen was usually not one for small talk.","But after saying this,","His friend beside him also seemed a bit envious: \"It's just that your workload here is too heavy. It's fine for you regulars, but for old bones like mine, it's really too much.\"","Chef Chen said, \"Then go to Starry Sky Restaurant, it's not as busy there.\"","\"I'll think about it. One might think Starry Sky Kindergarten gave you shares, the way you're recruiting for them.\"","Chef Chen was taken aback, then said, \"It's up to you whether you come or not.\"","His friend laughed: \"We'll see. I'll rest for a couple more days, and if I get restless at home, I'll come join you guys. We learned our craft together when we were young, who would have thought we'd be working together in our old age?\"","Chef Chen's lips curved into a smile: \"You won't regret it if you come here.\"","As soon as he said this, Chef Chen was startled, because these were the exact words Liu Chef had said to him initially. He hadn't expected that after all this time, he would come to believe it himself.","...","Once again, the boxed meals from Starry Sky Kindergarten became a sensation.","Whether admitted or not,","Everyone could come and get a boxed meal.","Some people left directly, not caring for the free meal.","Others took the meal home to eat.","Thinking that even if they weren't admitted, at least they didn't lose out.","And some came specifically for the boxed meal.","Wanting to know if it was really as good as rumored. So they patiently queued up! Craning their necks to see ahead, curious about today's menu.","When they finally got to eat, they understood what all the fuss was about.","They used high-quality rice here, the cooked rice glistening with oil.","Large chunks of beef, smooth and tender egg custard. Perfectly cooked spicy stir-fried pork.","It was truly delicious. Although each family could only take three boxes, no more, each box was generous in both rice and dishes. When opened, the aroma wafted out. At first glance, it seemed like too much food to finish. But after a while, it was all gone.","How did Starry Sky manage to make every dish so delicious? There wasn't a single unpalatable item.","Even children who were usually picky eaters were gobbling it up.","Parents were stunned, realizing their children didn't dislike eating, they just disliked the unappetizing food at home.","There were so many people that various social media accounts were flooded again. Everyone was talking about how delicious the boxed meals were. Netizens were drooling as they watched.","\"I really want to eat it so badly.\"","\"When can we get to taste it?\"","\"Seeing everyone eat, I really felt what it means to 'inhale' food. Everyone's eating so fast, as if afraid someone might snatch it away.\"","\"I just saw a fashionable woman with big wavy hair, wearing high heels, eating with such relish. She didn't even care about her image anymore. It must be really delicious.\"","\"And there was a chubby little girl earlier, such a greedy little thing. After finishing her own, she wanted to eat her parents' food too. But her parents refused, and her expression was hilarious.\"","\"I really want to try it.\""]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243: Other Kindergartens Have No Temper","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten didn't finish their livestream until after 8 PM.","Many exciting segments had already been edited out in advance and caused quite a stir after being reposted on public accounts.","The other kindergartens in the city were particularly disheartened.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had 200,000 applicants for only 500 spots. In the group chats for kindergarten principals, everyone was complaining.","\"Where did they find so many people?\"","\"It's so hard to recruit students these days, yet they can afford to be picky.\"","\"Sometimes I really hate that I can read.\"","Everyone gathered together saying things like this.","Before, they could at least complain about not being able to recruit students.","But now they were too embarrassed to say that, as it would be too humiliating.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had 200,000 applicants, showing there were plenty of potential students. If they couldn't attract them, it was clearly their own problem.","Somehow, they had inadvertently started to gaslight themselves.","In the past, at least Noble Kindergarten could hold its ground for a while.","But ever since Noble Kindergarten fell from grace, Starry Sky Kindergarten had been unstoppable, with no rivals left in the kindergarten arena.","The other kindergartens were all envious of Starry Sky Kindergarten's popularity.","The gap was glaringly obvious.","Today, almost all the teachers and principals in the city watched the livestream, coveting all the promising students being selected.","This time, as soon as Starry Sky Kindergarten announced their wealthy class, it was immediately fully enrolled in less than half an hour.","The tuition fee of 20,000 yuan per month made many who managed to secure a spot feel lucky.","This time, children didn't have to compete with various world champions for spots.","Other parents who were late to the game complained about their husbands' slow reflexes, not being able to secure a spot in 30 minutes. They really had to blame themselves for this.","\"I told you to keep a close eye on Starry Sky Kindergarten's enrollment. This was a rare opportunity. According to Starry Sky's usual practice, the next chance won't come until next year.\"","The husband wore a bitter expression. He hadn't expected that taking his eyes off his phone for a moment would lead to missing out on such an important matter.","He then asked, \"So what do we do now?\"","They could afford to wait, but their child couldn't waste a year. He said, \"Why don't we just go to Noble Kindergarten?\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, his wife rejected the idea.","In the past, Noble Kindergarten had a decent reputation in the city, and their newly built equestrian center catered to noble young masters.","But ever since they insulted commoner students last time, everyone's impression of them had hit rock bottom.","Even though such incidents had decreased, Noble Kindergarten would no longer be anyone's first choice.","It was said that the very capable principal of Noble Kindergarten had resigned.","She had joined an unremarkable kindergarten.","His wife planned to inquire about it, after all, a woman who could once navigate between wealthy families must have some skills.","The place she chose might not be bad.","...","At this moment, the former principal of Noble Kindergarten, watching Starry Sky Kindergarten's all-day livestream, felt a mix of emotions.","She had served at Noble Kindergarten for over 10 years.","If not for her achievements, at least she had put in the hard work.","Moreover, Noble Kindergarten's most prosperous years were largely due to her ability to navigate between various wealthy families.","But recently, with Starry Sky Kindergarten's successive successes, the higher-ups were very dissatisfied. Coupled with several critical mistakes, her opponents in the unit finally joined forces with the shareholders to oust her.","After leaving, the principal initially wanted to rest for a few years.","Suddenly, she heard that her former employer regretted their decision and wanted her to sign a non-compete agreement, preventing her from working in this field. That wouldn't do - she didn't know how to do anything else after all these years.","So she immediately joined a new kindergarten.","She feared her old employer might make new moves.","Taking the initiative to strike first.","This new company also had some connections with Shen Wei.","The new boss was also from the second-generation rich circle. The boss's family was in the pharmaceutical business and quite wealthy.","When Shen Wei made Starry Sky Kindergarten successful, many people were surprised to discover that the kindergarten sector was a new and promising field.","It was essential for every family.","If managed well, it would bring great prestige.","These were all intangible assets.","So many second-generation rich people focused on starting kindergartens.","But from opening to closing, it only took about half a year.","This kindergarten had been operating for over a year and had hired many experienced teachers from the industry.","It was running steadily, if not spectacularly. It couldn't compare to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","It couldn't even reach 1/10 of Starry Sky Kindergarten's level.","So when they heard that Noble Kindergarten's principal had resigned, the boss hired her with a high salary, offering an annual salary of one million yuan.","Just as she joined and was planning to implement major reforms, she heard that Starry Sky Kindergarten had announced their enrollment. She suddenly felt dizzy.","It was a familiar feeling. That sense of helplessness in the face of absolute strength, when all other tactics become useless, and one can only step aside for Starry Sky Kindergarten. Otherwise, with her experience, she knew that going head-to-head would definitely not end well.","She then opened the large group chat for kindergarten principals, where many were wailing.","Every move Starry Sky Kindergarten made","Was like rubbing the other kindergartens' faces in the dirt.","The principal used to be quite good at judging people.","The only one she misjudged was Shen Wei.","She had predicted that Starry Sky Kindergarten wouldn't last two years, but instead, it grew more prosperous with each passing year.","In the edited versions online, she even saw Best Actor Song's daughter and Pop Star Zhou's son.","These two children had gained quite a following from that variety show back then.","They weren't even from this city, yet they bought houses here just to attend this kindergarten.","No wonder the new district treasured Starry Sky Kindergarten so much. Who wouldn't like something that could stimulate domestic demand like this?","She never imagined that someone she once didn't even consider a rival would inadvertently grow into such a behemoth.","Then her former confidant, Teacher Zhang, called her and said, \"Are you still hiring? If so, I'd like to come work for you.\"","\"What's wrong?\" the principal asked.","Teacher Zhang's voice was full of resentment: \"Those who used to be close to you are now being mistreated by the new leadership in various ways. Now they're talking about a rotation system, and this week it's my turn to clean the toilets. Isn't this just a way to torment people?\"","\"My family tells me not to resign, to let them fire me so I can get N+1 severance pay, but with my temper, I really can't stand it for even one day.\"","But that wasn't all Teacher Zhang wanted to complain about.","Since the principal had left, all those children from wealthy families had been withdrawn, saying they were going to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Back then, it took tremendous effort to attract even one child from a wealthy family.","Now, having angered these wealthy families and having them withdraw their children was a huge blow to the kindergarten.","Without these noble children, there would be no substantial investments.","It might not be apparent right now, but in the future, times would definitely be tough.","The principal said, \"But the place I've joined is a small unit. Your rank and salary are too high, they might not be able to afford you.\"","Teacher Zhang was somewhat disappointed and then hung up the phone.","She started inquiring about Starry Sky Kindergarten everywhere.","After all, she had been a key staff member at what was once the top Noble Kindergarten in the industry for many years.","If all else failed, she thought about joining Starry Sky Kindergarten.","However, Noble Kindergarten had previously cultivated a culture of looking down on others while elevating themselves.","Shen Wei had already informed everyone not to hire anyone from Noble Kindergarten.","So Teacher Zhang was once again firmly rejected."]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244: One-Handed Gossip","paragraphs":["The Starry Sky Kindergarten livestream lasted for exactly 10 days.","Every day was an overload of operations.","Finally, it ended, and Shen Wei gave the judges a five-day long vacation.","Originally, they were supposed to admit 500 children.","But somehow, there were 10 extra.","Thinking that with 30 children per class, it would make exactly 17 classes, those extra 10 were also admitted.","The extra 10 were all notified by phone.","The first person to be notified couldn't believe it.","Because during their one-minute performance, there had been a mishap.","Although the child performed perfectly afterwards.","Just because of this one point, they were originally rejected, and the whole family was very downcast.","\"It's okay, we don't have to go to Starry Sky Kindergarten,\" Grandpa and Grandmother said, \"Even if we don't go, other kindergartens will be fighting to admit us.\"","But other kindergartens weren't Starry Sky, and the parents had spent a long time preparing with the child.","They didn't expect the little one to get nervous at the last moment and make a mistake.","The child was even more teary-eyed and had cried several times.","Just when they didn't know what to do, suddenly they received a phone call: \"Hello, we're from Starry Sky Kindergarten. Your child has been admitted. Please come to register in a week.\"","\"Why? Wasn't it supposed to be announced in person before?\"","Shen Wei said, \"Because we added 10 more spots, and this child's overall score was the highest.\"","\"Is this real? You're not a scammer, are you?\" Big data is so powerful these days.","\"I am Shen Wei. If you don't believe me, just come to the kindergarten on registration day and you'll see!\"","When the Child's Mother hung up the phone, she was still in a daze.","Others asked, \"What did they say?\" The family had overheard bits and pieces, but it was too muffled to hear clearly.","\"They said we've been admitted after all!\"","\"Really?\" The whole family became overjoyed.","Shen Wei called each one to notify them.","The 10 people who received the news were all as if they had won the lottery.","They didn't know how to contain their happiness.","They posted this good news of their lucky break on various media platforms.","After Shen Wei finished the last of these 10 phone calls, Gu Qingyan brought her a bowl of pear soup: \"You've been working so hard lately!\"","Shen Wei had lost quite a bit of weight, having to talk so much every day that her voice had become hoarse.","It was thanks to Gu Qingyan's pear soups and bird's nest stews.","It made the people at Starry Sky Kindergarten want to laugh when they saw him.","Gu Qingyan's hobbies used to be no different from other rich kids.","Just bar-hopping, racing cars, and so on. Now he was cooking soups around the stove.","Everyone thought Shen Wei was amazing.","She could actually make a young master from a wealthy family willingly devote so much.","Even Shen Wei's father couldn't help but ask her when she would give Gu Qingyan a proper status.","Mainly because Gu Qingyan was so considerate.","When Shen Wei took the pear soup, she remembered what her father had said. Then her cheeks turned red.","Gu Qingyan thought Shen Wei had a fever, and his cool hand touched her forehead: \"Are you too busy these days? You should rest for a few days. How about I take you out for a trip?\"","Others thought Starry Sky Kindergarten was doing great business, being able to select students.","Only he was concerned about Shen Wei.","During this period, Shen Wei had been working almost non-stop.","Apart from the 12-hour long livestreams, she also had to deal with all kinds of business operations.","Even an iron man couldn't stand it.","Shen Wei, not knowing what she was thinking, then said, \"Okay.\"","After saying it, she was stunned, and so was Gu Qingyan.","Finally, Gu Qingyan's heart suddenly skipped a few beats. He looked at Shen Wei wanting to confirm, but afraid of disturbing the atmosphere, he stammered, \"You... you... you... do you really mean it?\"","Shen Wei had never been in a relationship before.","She wasn't cold-hearted either.","Faced with this young master born with a golden spoon, who was always wholeheartedly devoted to her, it was truly difficult to remain unmoved.","Moreover, the young master was exquisitely handsome.","Always flitting before her eyes.","Just as Shen Wei was mulling over what to say, suddenly a phone call came in.","Shen Wei had just picked up and said a few words: \"Really?\" Her tone obviously raised a few pitches, then she hung up the phone.","She was about to get up when she saw Gu Qingyan's mood had dampened, looking like an abandoned puppy.","Shen Wei said, \"We can't go on the trip now, something important has come up.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Tsinghua University and Peking University are here to compete for people!\"","The ones causing such a stir were naturally He Lingfeng and the local genius Zhao Jie.","They were Professor Liu's direct disciples.","They had attended many summits with their children and were recognized as geniuses by many bigwigs in the industry.","These two children had already learned university-level content and found it difficult to attend school with ordinary children.","Now they were receiving private tuition from Professor Liu, but that wasn't a permanent solution.","Shen Wei had originally planned to find a school for them after the Starry Sky recruitment was over.","Unexpectedly, before she could go out looking, people had come to find them first.","Earlier, when Shen Wei was busy, she didn't know that the two had taken Peking University's independent recruitment exam.","Both did very well, especially He Lingfeng.","He scored full marks in logic and mathematics.","They hadn't taken Tsinghua University's exam. But Tsinghua had caught wind of it and acted.","Gu Qingyan was also a bit shocked when he heard about it.","After all, when he took the university entrance exam, his family had hired quite a few famous teachers.","Even so, he only got into an undergraduate program.","Seeing Shen Wei was about to leave, he mustered up the courage and said, \"After this is over, can we go on a trip together? As boyfriend and girlfriend?\"","As soon as he said it, he regretted it, fearing Shen Wei would reject him.","Because they both knew clearly, once Shen Wei rejected him, he really wouldn't be able to shamelessly continue hanging around Shen Wei.","Gu Qingyan regretted countless times his youthful arrogance when he had to say in front of her camera that the engagement was off.","Now thinking back, he wished he could slap his past self hard a few times.","Shen Wei saw his anguished look and smiled: \"Mm-hmm.\"","Gu Qingyan was completely dumbfounded.","Shen Wei had agreed to him? Then he stared fixedly at Shen Wei.","Suddenly, five fingers waved in front of his eyes.","Gu Qingyan immediately came back to his senses. Shen Wei was long gone, and Liu Chef beside him said, \"What are you daydreaming about?\"","Gu Qingyan's smile was brilliantly radiant: \"I've been promoted to official status.\"","\"What?\"","Before Liu Chef could finish asking, Gu Qingyan had run off.","Liu Chef muttered to himself, what's wrong with young people these days?","Then he turned his head and saw Doctor Lu: \"Hey, what do you think Gu Qingyan meant by 'promoted to official status'?\"","Doctor Lu said, \"Nothing much.\" But as he turned away, he smiled meaningfully.","Another day of grasping first-hand gossip."]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245: “Universities Competing for Talent”","paragraphs":["The recruitment officers from Peking University and Tsinghua University arrived almost at the same time.","They each came in pairs.","The two female teachers from Peking University were dressed in casual clothes, looking very capable.","They appeared to be young and successful career women.","Tsinghua University sent a middle-aged man wearing glasses accompanied by a slightly younger woman.","At this moment, the two groups were eyeing each other with displeasure.","They had just arrived in this city.","Having barely caught their breath after landing, they had planned to rest at the hotel for a day before starting their search.","Who would have thought they'd run into their old rivals walking out of the hotel?","They had been ruthless in competing for students year after year.","Seeing that the others were heading out, the two teachers from Tsinghua University immediately dropped their luggage.","They rushed towards Starry Sky Kindergarten.","As fate would have it, they ran into each other again at the kindergarten entrance.","After a quick word with the security guard, the two groups started arguing outside.","Peking University shouted at Tsinghua University: \"How is this any of your business? These two young students participated in our independent recruitment program. It's not very ethical for you to come now, is it?\"","They were blatantly trying to snatch the students away.","The other side smiled and said: \"We trust your selection standards!\"","As old rivals, they naturally knew that as a top international institution, their selection process was very strict.","Over the years, there had been quite a few young geniuses.","But for the recruitment team to come out to compete, it must be for top-tier geniuses that the school valued highly.","The Peking University staff were annoyed, they had set out in secret.","How did the others find out?","Could there be a mole in their unit who had leaked their movements?","Seeing the obvious confusion in the Peking University teachers' eyes, the other side smiled and said: \"Don't worry about how I found out!\" He grinned smugly.","It was irritating to see.","At this moment, Shen Wei arrived with two children.","Gu Qingyan and Doctor Lu were also with them.","Today, as soon as it ended, everyone had left the kindergarten.","Shen Wei had also wanted to leave, but Gu Qingyan had held her back with pear soup and bird's nest.","Staying a bit longer, who would have thought they'd run into the recruitment teams coming to recruit.","As for Doctor Lu, he lived here anyway. Naturally, he had to welcome them for this matter.","So Shen Wei led the two groups directly to the small conference room.","Shen Wei quickly asked Doctor Lu to call the parents of the local genius, Zhao Jie.","Doctor Lu, being mischievous, knew this was huge news but deliberately didn't say so, just asking them to come to the kindergarten.","The parents usually left their child boarding here and only came to pick him up on weekends.","Now, receiving a call before the weekend, they immediately became worried, thinking something had happened.","So the father, mother, grandfather, and grandmother all rushed over.","When they arrived, they found that the recruitment teams from Tsinghua University and Peking University were here, wanting to admit their child early.","The family was stunned for a moment.","Zhao Jie's grandmother, known for her fiery temperament, suddenly slapped his grandfather hard.","His grandfather yelped in pain.","His grandmother, now awake from her daze, said: \"Oh my, it's not a dream!\"","As top universities in the country, they never imagined Tsinghua and Peking would have anything to do with their grandson.","They hadn't even dared to dream such an audacious dream.","How old was this child now? And yet he had such good fortune.","The recruitment team teachers, having encountered all sorts of people over the years of recruiting, now put on a mysterious air.","They maintained the dignity of their prestigious schools.","But in their hearts, they still felt very proud of their institutions.","Zhao Jie's parents kept thanking Shen Wei: \"It's all thanks to you.\"","Earlier, when Shen Wei had said their child had a talent for learning and suggested he study here,","they had thought their child was really amazing.","But they had no concept of how far it would go. They didn't expect such a big surprise.","At this moment, Zhao Jie's parents were at a loss for words to express their gratitude.","But they kept trying to convey their thanks. Their child's success today was truly thanks to coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","If their child had been in an ordinary kindergarten, his talent would have been buried.","Just then, the security guard suddenly called Shen Wei.","He said two more recruitment team teachers had arrived.","Shen Wei said to let them in directly, and then asked Gu Qingyan to go welcome them.","Peking University and Tsinghua University had been maintaining their image, but hearing Shen Wei's phone call, they immediately turned to look at their rivals: \"Your school sent more people?\"","\"No, it must be your school that sent more people, right?\"","They wondered if their schools had sent additional teachers after dispatching them, showing how much importance was placed on this matter.","But both groups had guessed wrong.","It wasn't Peking University or Tsinghua University sending more teachers, but recruitment teams from XiaMen University and Fudan University who had rushed over.","Peking University and Tsinghua University hadn't expected universities from such distant cities to come all this way.","Moreover, as far as they knew, these two children hadn't participated in their independent recruitment exams.","Peking University was truly speechless: \"You're all here to pick up the leftovers, aren't you?\"","They really needed to tighten things up at their school.","The school had organized a mysterious assessment test, but their backyard had been infiltrated like a sieve.","As soon as they heard about the admissions, other top universities immediately took notice.","There were now four universities present.","XiaMen University knew they couldn't compare with the top national universities, so they said: \"If these two children come to our junior class, we'll set up a special computer science class for them with very strong faculty!\"","The teacher from XiaMen University was previously a student of Professor Liu.","With such a connection, he naturally knew a bit about the situation.","This time, XiaMen University came with sincere intentions.","They directly said: \"If either of these two children comes to our school, besides waiving tuition and providing single-room accommodation, we'll also give an annual scholarship of 300,000 yuan.\"","XiaMen University was very ambitious about their junior class program.","They had recently recruited the top few children from the junior division of the \"Most Powerful Brain\" competition.","At that time, the recruitment teams from Peking University and Tsinghua University were under enormous pressure.","Fudan University calmly said from the side: \"We'll reward them with an apartment!\" Fudan University was located in Hu City.","The property prices there were comparable to Beijing.","Only Fudan University, being the favored child of Hu City, could make such an offer.","Giving an apartment was equivalent to giving several million yuan at once.","When XiaMen University had just mentioned the 300,000 yuan scholarship, they were still smiling.","But upon hearing Fudan University offer an apartment, their smiles instantly froze.","These old foxes were too ruthless.","They had gone all in, how could others compete now?","Peking University and Tsinghua University had thought the two young geniuses were in the bag.","If not theirs, then at least their old rival's.","Who could have imagined the latecomers would take the lead.","Offering money and apartments. The two were now completely dumbfounded.","They didn't have such high authority.","Then the two people in charge from Peking University and Tsinghua University said: \"Excuse us, we need to make a phone call.\"","The other two groups seized the opportunity to persuade the parents and children to accept their offers: \"We are top-tier key universities in the country. You can't even think about getting into our schools with a college entrance exam score below 640!\"","They also emphasized their advantageous disciplines and projects.","Now with scholarships and housing,","After finishing their studies there, they would become life winners, with both money and a house.","All they needed to do was study diligently.","Zhao Jie's parents looked at each other.","Their faces still wore dreamlike smiles.","Each of these schools was a dream for students, and now they had to choose.","This was too wonderful!!!"]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246: The Internet Son Has Grown Up","paragraphs":["Peking University and Tsinghua University spent very little time talking on the phone outside.","They didn't dare to linger outside, fearing that if they said a few more words, someone inside would intercept them.","When they came back, Peking University said beside them, \"No matter what, the kind of school a child can attend and the kind of alumni they can have are very important!\"","\"Our school has a hundred years of history and is famous both domestically and internationally. I hope the child won't give up their bright and brilliant future for some immediate benefits.\"","Tsinghua University nodded continuously beside them.","After all, their two schools were equally renowned.","Praising the other was equivalent to praising themselves.","No matter what, they first needed to squeeze out these two latecomers from the circle.","As for who would be chosen between them, that would depend on their own abilities.","The teachers from the other two universities were unhappy: \"What do you mean? What's wrong with our schools? We are also top universities in the country.\"","\"You can't just push others aside because you're century-old universities. Besides, our school can offer 300,000 yuan and provide housing. These are all based on the child's practical needs.\"","The atmosphere suddenly became tense, and they were about to argue.","Peking University steeled themselves and said, \"Our college is willing to offer a 50,000 yuan study grant and a 100,000 yuan housing subsidy!\"","150,000 yuan, this was already the limit.","Originally, they had planned to increase the offer bit by bit.","The less money used to close the deal, the better they would complete their task.","But the other side was aggressive.","So they had to go all-in at once.","Tsinghua University beside them had always known what kind of person their old rival was.","Seeing that they had shown their trump card,","They instantly felt that their superiors weren't supportive enough: \"We only have a 30,000 yuan scholarship, but our school's cafeteria is very good.\"","\"As long as you come to our school, we will also have one-on-one assistance. In addition, we will also provide an 80,000 yuan housing fund!\"","It wasn't that they were deliberately lowering the price.","This was the limit given by the higher-ups.","As top domestic universities,","Giving money and such were things that lower-tier schools liked to do.","They didn't really like doing it.","This time they were completely forced into it by other schools.","Finally, they heard the recruitment teacher from XiaMen University snort coldly, and immediately everyone looked over.","Then they saw Shen Wei say, \"So which school do you want to go to?\"","Instantly, all eyes turned to Zhao Jie and He Lingfeng.","Zhao Jie looked at his parents, not knowing what to choose.","But his parents were also caught in a decision paralysis.","They wanted to know what He Lingfeng would choose.","At this moment, He Lingfeng looked at Shen Wei and said, \"You help me choose!\"","He Lingfeng had completed his high school curriculum. He was very mature for his age and had his own ideas about many things.","Now letting Shen Wei make such an important decision for him showed that he truly regarded Shen Wei as his own.","Shen Wei knew that He Lingfeng's strengths were in mathematics and computer science.","Then she used the system to find out the domestic rankings of majors.","The first was Tsinghua University.","Tsinghua University said, \"If you're going to go, go to the strongest. This way you'll definitely never regret it.\"","Shen Wei said, \"If it were me, I'd choose Tsinghua University. But this is just for reference, the key is still your opinion.\"","Peking University beside them became anxious: \"Don't! Our programs are also very powerful, and our academic leaders are leading various national key projects. We also have international exchange students!\"","Ever since Shen Wei had said those words, Tsinghua University felt as if a weight had been lifted from their heart. They said, \"Everything you mentioned, we have too, don't worry.\"","He Lingfeng said, \"I choose Tsinghua University.\"","He trusted Shen Wei.","The feeling of being fully trusted by a child was truly heartwarming.","Shen Wei reached out her hand and the child threw himself into her arms.","He Lingfeng was picked up by Shen Wei. Actually, he was a child who got embarrassed easily.","Moreover, he inherently felt that he was an adult.","Only in front of Shen Wei would he show this childlike demeanor.","Seeing that He Lingfeng had chosen Tsinghua University, Zhao Jie also chose Tsinghua University.","His mother immediately agreed.","It wasn't for any other reason than for the children to look after each other.","Otherwise, the child was too young, and suddenly moving to a new place might be hard to bear.","If he could be with He Lingfeng, it would be much better.","Tsinghua University laughed heartily: \"You've made the right choice by choosing us, don't worry, you definitely won't regret it!\"","The others, seeing that they had been intercepted again, were all somewhat frustrated.","But they all left their business cards: \"If you regret it halfway, you can still contact us anytime. The housing and money we mentioned earlier are still valid!\"","\"As long as you haven't enrolled, we still have a chance.\"","The smile froze on the face of Tsinghua University's recruitment director.","These people really wouldn't give up until the last moment.","Then he said, \"When you come to Beijing, I'll take you around to play and handle the enrollment at the same time!\" This made these people completely give up hope.","Peking University was the most speechless: \"We were the ones who first discovered these good seedlings, and you just came and snatched them away. That's not playing fair.\"","\"Normal times are normal times, competing for talent is competing for talent. Don't say those useless things, we all follow the rules.\"","Seeing that this matter had come to an end, the group could only take separate taxis back.","Shen Wei said to He Lingfeng, \"Good boy, you're going away to school now. You must study hard, understand?\"","The little poor thing who once couldn't eat his fill had now grown into someone fought over by nationally renowned universities.","The child nodded quietly: \"I definitely will.\"","The next day,","Everyone who came to the office heard Doctor Lu vividly describing yesterday's talent war to them. After listening, everyone was thrilled.","They had heard about universities competing for students before, but had never actually seen it.","They never thought that a genius would emerge from their own workplace,","Actually causing such a phenomenal stir.","Someone had even leaked this incident online.","Netizens were immediately stunned.","\"I've really had enough of this life where I'm not as good as my elders or as good as the younger ones.\"","\"Peking University and Tsinghua University were always my childhood dreams. I only scored a little over 300 in the college entrance exam, but now my internet son has been admitted. My heart feels comforted.\"","\"Who said before that Starry Sky Kindergarten was hyping up geniuses? Do they think the university people are all fools? They must be competing for someone with real talent and learning.\"","\"My high school brother has already changed his phone wallpaper to He Lingfeng's photo, saying he wants to worship the God of Literature.\"","\"So our brother chose to become a chef while studying and working hard?\"","\"I knew investing in Starry Sky Kindergarten wouldn't be a loss.\""]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247: Happy Holidays","paragraphs":["He Lingfeng finalized his travel plans and returned with the admissions teacher.","First, they would tour the Capital, then handle the enrollment process.","This time, the university was pushing quite urgently.","Perhaps they were afraid of losing the students to other schools midway.","Once the children enrolled, they would enter the gifted youth program.","As reluctant as Shen Wei was, she had to entrust the child to Lin Rui's care.","Lin Rui and Qin Shu escorted him all the way to the Capital.","Shen Wei was still considering whether to assign him a guardian.","But the school said it wasn't necessary, as they had student companions.","Zhao Jie's mother had resigned from her job to accompany her child to study in the Capital.","Both of them had independent dormitory rooms.","Moreover, Zhao Jie's mother was deeply grateful for Starry Sky Kindergarten's nurturing of her child.","She promised to take good care of He Lingfeng.","And so, the little one was ready to set off.","Though going to school was a good thing, parting always carried a hint of sadness.","Shen Wei, being an adult, could hold herself together, but tears were already forming in the corners of Mu Zhixing's eyes.","He Lingfeng carefully wiped away her tears and said, \"Study hard, we'll all do well.\"","Both coming from similar backgrounds and having lived together at Starry Sky Kindergarten, their bond was deeper than that of ordinary children.","Mu Zhixing nodded firmly.","\"I'll come back whenever there's a holiday,\" He Lingfeng said.","Shen Wei replied, \"Make sure to call home during holidays, and we'll send someone to pick you up.\"","After all, the child was still so young.","He Lingfeng nodded, then left with Zhao Jie and the others.","His departure left even Professor Liu feeling quite shaken.","Professor Liu had completely resigned from his job at the third-tier institution.","Now he was at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Shen Wei looked at Professor Liu and asked, \"So what are your plans for the future?\"","Professor Liu replied, \"I plan to nurture two more individuals like Zhao Jie and He Lingfeng.\" He rubbed his hands together eagerly.","Shen Wei could only encourage Professor Liu not to give up.","Professor Liu spent his days like a treasure hunter, full of anticipation for new students.","Having encountered two top-tier geniuses in succession, Professor Liu felt incredibly powerful.","He was certain he could find obedient disciples like He Lingfeng among them.","Shen Wei was truly exhausted after finishing all of this.","While Shen Wei rested, Starry Sky Kindergarten still had people on duty.","Moreover, everyone at the kindergarten was now eager to make a name for themselves.","Whether Shen Wei was there or not made little difference.","After all, the most important task of selecting students had been completed.","Gu Qingyan had prepared a long list of travel itineraries early on and asked Shen Wei, \"What do you want to do for your break?\"","Shen Wei replied, \"Just rest somewhere else.\"","This period had been extremely tiring, her throat was hoarse, and her body was exhausted.","She just wanted to turn off her phone and find a place where no one would go.","Hearing this, Gu Qingyan immediately had an idea: \"Then listen to me!\" The two boarded a plane and flew to an island city.","It was a third-tier tourist city in China.","Now was the off-season, so there weren't many tourists.","When they arrived, the streets were full of fruit vendors.","Gu Qingyan had booked the best sea view room in advance.","The place was known as China's Hawaii.","From the room, one could gaze out at the sea.","Gu Qingyan had also booked the adjacent room.","Standing on the balcony, Gu Qingyan could see Shen Wei in the distance.","There were lounge chairs on the balcony, directly facing the beach.","Lying on the balcony's lounge chair, it felt as if they had the entire beach to themselves.","Gu Qingyan was a bit excited.","This was their first trip since confirming their relationship.","But he didn't dare to book the same room as Shen Wei.","He could only stand reluctantly in the adjacent room.","After a while, the doorbell rang outside.","Opening the door revealed a robot delivering chilled coconut water.","Shen Wei took it and had a sip.","As expected of an island city, the coconuts were freshly picked from the trees, with a faint coconut aroma and a refreshing sweetness.","It was a freshness rarely seen in inland cities.","From the tree to her mouth, it had only been a few hours.","And that included the chilling time.","Shen Wei glanced over and saw Gu Qingyan getting up from the lounge chair. Like a big puppy, he immediately walked over to Shen Wei's side: \"How is it? Is the coconut water I got for you alright?\"","His whole face was beaming with a smile, and Shen Wei said, \"It's very delicious, thank you.\"","Gu Qingyan bashfully said, \"There's no need for thanks between us.\" As he spoke, his face reddened.","Shen Wei couldn't help but smile and teased him: \"What kind of relationship do we have?\"","Gu Qingyan lowered his head, too shy to speak.","Then Shen Wei asked, \"Haven't you told anyone about this?\"","Every time Shen Wei showed him kindness, this guy would want to broadcast it to the world.","Shen Wei always knew.","This time when Shen Wei agreed to be with him, she thought she'd be bombarded by many people the next day.","Unexpectedly, no one said anything, and this guy had managed to keep it to himself for once.","Gu Qingyan said, \"We'll talk about it when we get back. Right now, I just want to enjoy a wonderful vacation with you.\"","Finally, the atmosphere became too awkward, so he suggested, \"Let's go play on the beach.\"","Shen Wei nodded in agreement.","Then they went to the beach.","On the beach, Shen Wei watched as Gu Qingyan rode a jet ski back and forth in front of her.","He also went surfing. For a rich second-generation kid, these were standard activities.","Gu Qingyan was like a peacock, showing off in circles.","He kept hovering right under Shen Wei's nose.","Shen Wei couldn't help but smile.","Gu Qingyan wore a floral shirt and board shorts, with sunglasses on, looking truly sunny and handsome.","He asked Shen Wei, \"Do you want to try?\" It was really quite enjoyable to be out playing.","Shen Wei said, \"Sure.\"","Originally, Gu Qingyan had just asked casually, not expecting Shen Wei to agree.","Hearing Shen Wei's answer, he was stunned at first.","Then his ears started to turn red.","He said to Shen Wei, \"Come on then,\" and reached out his hand to her.","Gu Qingyan rode the jet ski, with Shen Wei sitting behind him, her arms around his waist.","Gu Qingyan's heart was racing, and his smile stretched almost to his ears.","Then he said to Shen Wei, \"Hold on tight.\"","In a flash, they zoomed towards the middle of the sea.","Blue sky, white clouds, exhilarating waves, tightly embracing the boy's body.","A faint, fresh scent emanated from him.","It was a clean, crisp smell.","Without realizing it, Shen Wei had pressed against Gu Qingyan's back, able to hear his heart pounding so hard it made her ears hurt.","Shen Wei couldn't help but laugh.","Hearing Shen Wei's laughter, Gu Qingyan's heart raced even more, thump-thump-thump, non-stop.","Shen Wei said, \"Let's go sea fishing tomorrow.\" She rarely went out to play.","Now that they were here, they naturally wanted to experience everything.","For a few thousand yuan, they could rent a boat, go out to sea, cast nets and fish, and keep everything they caught.","As soon as Shen Wei mentioned it, Gu Qingyan immediately booked a boat.","The next day, they went out to sea with a captain and first mate.","Gu Qingyan kept staring at Shen Wei.","Shen Wei asked, \"Is there something on my face?\"","Gu Qingyan said no. But he kept sneaking glances.","The more he looked, the more he felt that his girlfriend was truly beautiful."]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248: Deep Sea Fishing Harvest","paragraphs":["Shen Wei had a bountiful seafood harvest that day.","Basket after basket of shrimp, along with two yellow croakers.","These two yellow croakers were said to be wild-caught and quite valuable.","If they wanted to sell them, they could directly sell them to the boat captain.","But they didn't sell, planning to keep them for themselves to eat.","They brought the seafood to the hotel and had the hotel process it, preparing for a full seafood feast.","The dishes here weren't as delicious as those made by Chef Liu.","But because the ingredients were so incredibly fresh, caught and eaten on the same day,","The seafood was exquisitely delicious.","Both of them ended up stuffing themselves successfully.","In the evening, they booked an aromatherapy spa. Their entire bodies experienced unprecedented relaxation.","Shen Wei put on a face mask and planned to catch up on a TV series.","But then came a knock on the door from Gu Qingyan outside.","Shen Wei opened the door to find Gu Qingyan holding a large bouquet of fresh flowers from who-knows-where.","Shen Wei was pleasantly surprised.","Gu Qingyan said, \"I didn't know what else to buy!\" Besides the flowers, he had also bought a necklace.","He had purchased it from a jewelry store on the small island.","They only had ordinary gold here. He had spent the entire afternoon carefully selecting it.","He had even secretly engraved their initials on it.","This little trick wouldn't be noticeable unless one looked closely.","Shen Wei said, \"Thank you!\"","Gu Qingyan was still a bit embarrassed: \"Next time, I'll get you a diamond one, or the biggest and best jade one!\"","For now, on this island, Shen Wei would have to make do with this.","Seeing that it was still early, Gu Qingyan said, \"Let's go watch a movie first, then go to the night market for some barbecue skewers.\"","That's what his travel guide had suggested.","\"Alright,\" Shen Wei agreed readily.","But this time, Gu Qingyan hadn't done his homework well.","The cinema was only showing old movies.","They had seen most of them, except for one horror movie.","Gu Qingyan was a bit scared.","Shen Wei noticed him keep glancing at the horror movie poster and said, \"Why don't we watch this one!\"","Gu Qingyan's face changed immediately, but not wanting to seem unmanly, he said, \"Okay!\"","He forced himself to watch.","When the movie started, there were only about a dozen people scattered around the theater, all sitting in front, behind, and to the sides of them.","Although they had paid for 2D tickets, the people around them experienced a 4D effect.","Because Gu Qingyan's screams were incredibly loud.","He was so nervous that he grabbed Shen Wei's hand.","It seemed like only this could give him a bit of courage.","But whenever a scary scene came up, he would start screaming loudly again.","When the movie ended, Gu Qingyan immediately stood up and pulled Shen Wei along.","The other moviegoers were trying to catch a glimpse of the man who had screamed the loudest while the lights were on.","Afraid of losing face, Gu Qingyan put on sunglasses and a hat as he left.","He didn't let go of Shen Wei's hand until they were outside.","This was a historic progress for him.","Although it was a bit embarrassing, being able to successfully hold hands made it all worth it.","After they came out, Gu Qingyan tried to save face: \"I'm not really that scared. I was just traumatized when I was little!\"","\"If you're afraid, I won't ask you to watch horror movies with me next time!\"","\"It's fine, practicing will make me braver.\" Gu Qingyan's thoughts wandered. If he could hold hands on the first try, wouldn't that mean he could hug her the second time? Thinking about this, horror movies didn't seem so scary anymore.","Gu Qingyan held Shen Wei's hand tightly.","Shen Wei wanted to let go.","But Gu Qingyan held on even tighter.","Through Gu Qingyan's red ears, one could see his current struggle and happiness.","The two of them went to the night market together.","They bought food from one end to the other, the items at the night market were very cheap, just a few dollars for many things.","The two shared the food, but still couldn't finish it all.","That night, Gu Qingyan took photos of everything.","When he got back, he lay in bed tossing and turning, unable to sleep. He really wanted to write a blog post.","He had made historic progress today. Not only could he eat Shen Wei's leftover snacks, but he could also hold hands with her and watch a movie.","It seems this vacation was indeed useful.","...","Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan had been on vacation and hadn't sent any messages to the Starry Sky Kindergarten group chat.","Previously, Shen Wei would at most take weekends off.","She had never been away from the kindergarten for so long, and everyone missed her.","Doctor Lu casually said, \"She's probably gone to relax. Gu Qingyan went too!\"","Someone nearby said, \"Oh, she's so tired, she should indeed have a good rest!\"","\"Sigh, I don't know how Shen Wei managed to persist, I couldn't handle it after just a day and a half!\"","\"The intensity of 10 days of live streaming was too high!\" Everyone quickly turned the topic to the fatigue of live streaming, discussing how tired they all were.","This completely diverged from the topic Doctor Lu was trying to guide them towards.","Why couldn't they understand?","The hint was already quite obvious: something was going on between those two.","But the others didn't get it.","Doctor Lu had to forcefully suppress his gossip-filled heart and casually asked, \"Hey, what's Gu Qingyan up to?\"","Gu Qingyan used to work in engineering and was often absent.","He would only come to deliver bird's nest soup and other supplements when Shen Wei was around.","Doctor Lu reminded everyone like this, hoping they would notice something unusual.","But everyone just looked around, noticed Gu Qingyan wasn't there, and said, \"Oh, he must be busy!\"","They didn't think anything of it.","Doctor Lu was truly speechless with these people.","Such a juicy piece of gossip was right in front of them, but no one could see it.","He really felt like he was the only sober one among a crowd of drunks.","Five days passed in the blink of an eye. Gu Qingyan was a bit reluctant to go back to work.","He said to Shen Wei, unwilling to part, \"Can I continue to ask you out to play?\"","Shen Wei said, \"If there's enough time, sure.\"","Only then did Gu Qingyan cheer up.","After returning, he posted all the photos from these days on his social media.","He could post a maximum of 99 photos at a time, so he posted several sets of 99 photos.","He also took a photo of him and Shen Wei holding hands, placing it as the last \"easter egg\" photo.","Gu Qingyan's followers already knew that when he posted, it was definitely to show off his time with Shen Wei.","But this time was special.","He posted all seaside scenery, sea motorcycles, and snack foods.","It looked too normal.","But the photos seemed endless.","So someone commented: \"We know you went on a trip.\"","\"You're wasting all our data on these photos, that's too much.\"","Gu Qingyan thought this wouldn't do, they hadn't seen his most crucial photo yet, so he re-edited the post, putting the hand-holding photo as the first one.","Sure enough, when the netizens saw it, they were immediately stunned: \"No way, bro. It's not what I think it is, right?\"","Gu Qingyan posted a smug emoji saying: It's exactly what you think.","The netizens couldn't believe that this steel-straight guy could find a girlfriend, especially someone as high-quality as Shen Wei.","Some netizens directly broke down: \"Rival in love, draw your swords!\"","Gu Qingyan sat happily in front of his phone, swaying back and forth, feeling the joy of a small scheme succeeding."]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249: Teacher Tang Gave Birth","paragraphs":["The news shocked everyone.","While people could see that Gu Qingyan was pursuing Shen Wei, Gu Qingyan had been too timid.","Everyone thought this situation would continue for a long time, but unexpectedly, he actually managed to win her over.","As a result, the internet buzzed with excitement.","Gu Qingyan's parents, brother, and sister were all following his Weibo.","As soon as they discovered the news, they immediately called Gu Qingyan.","But Gu Qingyan's phone was constantly busy.","They even called each other to inquire: \"Is it true? Did that silly boy really win her over?\"","\"Why is it so hard to believe?\"","\"Could it be a joke?\"","\"It shouldn't be. That boy wouldn't dare joke about something like this.\"","It was truly laughable. The Gu family was known for their good looks.","Both men and women in the family never lacked suitors.","Having a few relationships was normal, but who knew they'd end up with a pampered Gu Qingyan.","He was particularly avoidant of matters between men and women.","Everyone just thought he was spoiled and didn't pay much attention to it.","But then he met Shen Wei.","It was like an old house catching fire, unstoppable.","But to be fair, since Gu Qingyan met Shen Wei, the child became much more considerate.","He also started studying seriously.","It was much better than his previous image of not striving for progress. The power of love is great.","But the family was also worried.","They didn't know if this foolish boy could win over Shen Wei.","After all, Shen Wei was a hot commodity in the wealthy circles.","Many industry bigwigs praised Shen Wei highly.","Some second-generation and even first-generation rich kids in the city wanted to have a passionate romance with Shen Wei.","In comparison, Gu Qingyan was just good-looking, but his overall capabilities were far behind others in every other aspect.","The family was worried for him.","But in these matters, the elders couldn't help much, so they could only watch the younger generation's romance unfold.","The family's feelings were the same as the netizens': disbelief.","Gu Qingyan's father was happy but didn't dare to be too happy, fearing that something might go wrong and they'd be laughed at.","So he suppressed his inner feelings.","After a while, Gu Qingyan called back: asking what was the matter.","His father was so excited that the words on the tip of his tongue couldn't come out.","It was Gu's Mother next to him who grabbed the phone and said: \"Is it true about you and Shen Wei?\"","Gu Qingyan was a bit shy on the other end, just giving a soft \"Mm\" without saying more.","Usually, Gu Qingyan would talk endlessly about how good Shen Wei was to him.","But when it came to real important matters, he became bashful.","Gu's Mother said: \"Really? That's great! So when will you bring Shen Wei home for a meal? Shen Wei is a good child. If you're going to be with her, you must treat her well.\"","Gu Qingyan said: \"I know!\"","He didn't need to be told; he would take good care of Shen Wei anyway.","The family asked: \"We couldn't get through earlier, who were you talking to for so long?\"","Gu Qingyan said: \"Just childhood friends and other friends.\"","They were all asking about this matter too.","After all, Gu Qingyan winning over Shen Wei was too incredible.","Everyone couldn't believe it.","At this moment, he slightly regretted announcing it so publicly, because his phone was still showing incoming calls.","This news was quite shocking to everyone.","Gu Qingyan said: \"We'll talk about the meal later.\"","He was very concerned about Shen Wei's fatigue these days.","Then he heard Gu's Mother say: \"So when are you getting married? I want to help you prepare in advance. I'm planning to go to more auctions recently to buy some jewelry for your wedding!\"","\"Yes, yes, and we need to start custom-tailoring suits early. Those master-level handmade suits take at least a year to make. And the wedding dress too.\"","Gu Qingyan's cheeks turned red from his parents' words.","They had just confirmed their relationship, and here they were already talking about marriage preparations.","Gu Qingyan said helplessly: \"Alright, I'm hanging up now!\" Then he ended the call.","After Gu Qingyan hung up on his parents.","They said: \"Could it be that this child is feeling shy?\"","Gu's Mother couldn't understand. Now he remembers to be shy?","He wasn't shy when he was showing off the sneakers Shen Wei gave him before. Those sneakers are still displayed at his bedside.","Then Gu Qingyan's father couldn't help but say: \"This son, his personality is too twisted.\"","Gu's Mother replied: \"He takes after you.\"","Gu Qingyan's father was left speechless.","...","At the same time, Starry Sky Kindergarten also learned about Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei's official announcement.","Everyone gathered around Doctor Lu: \"Did you know about Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei?\"","Doctor Lu looked proud: \"I knew.\"","Everyone complained: \"Then why didn't you tell us earlier?\"","Doctor Lu gave them a look as if they were idiots.","How could he go around talking about such things?","But he had given plenty of hints.","At the time, no one understood what he meant.","So now everyone's shock was still very intense.","However, while this matter was unexpected, it was also understandable.","After all, Gu Qingyan was a pampered young master. For him to do so much for Shen Wei until now was already his limit.","When Gu Qingyan came over at noon, everyone started teasing with \"Ooh~\" and such.","Gu Qingyan's face immediately turned red.","At this moment, he didn't even know where to look.","People around said: \"Congratulations! When will we get to eat your wedding candy?\"","Both Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei were quite young.","There wasn't a clear boss-employee hierarchy at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They got along with everyone like friends.","Joking around was particularly smooth.","Gu Qingyan said: \"Stop it.\" Then he quickly said a few words and went to find Shen Wei.","When Shen Wei saw him, she knew he must have been teased quite a bit.","As Shen Wei was a girl, few people would joke with her directly, but Gu Qingyan couldn't escape it.","Gu Qingyan said: \"It's terrifying, these people even asked when we're getting married!\"","Shen Wei couldn't help but laugh: \"So how did you answer them?\"","Gu Qingyan blushed and said: \"You haven't said anything, how could I dare to speak carelessly?\"","Shen Wei smiled.","Gu Qingyan's face reddened even more: \"By the way, can I treat you to lunch today?\"","Since confirming their relationship, Gu Qingyan had become a bit bolder.","After all, he was now the officially announced boyfriend.","Naturally, he wanted to stick close to his girlfriend.","Shen Wei nodded.","Soon, an urgent phone ring sounded.","Then Shen Wei answered the call. She heard the joyful news from the security guard Li Yi that his wife had given birth.","Upon further inquiry, they learned that Teacher Tang had given birth to a baby girl weighing over 8 pounds.","Shen Wei was immediately delighted and then said to Gu Qingyan: \"Let's go to the hospital.\"","They had bought gifts in advance, so this time they just brought a fruit basket and a bouquet of flowers to the hospital.","After Teacher Tang's pregnancy progressed, once the student recruitment work was done, Shen Wei had insisted she rest at home.","She went into labor in the early hours of this morning.","At the time, Li Yi didn't tell anyone. It went on until now, almost noon, when she finally gave birth.","When Shen Wei arrived, others from Starry Sky Kindergarten had also heard the news.","They were all heading there around lunchtime.","Everyone took Teacher Tang's delivery very seriously. It was at a private hospital.","One of Gu Qingyan's family businesses.","Gu Qingyan had spoken to the hospital beforehand, so this time the hospital director performed the operation.","They had a very large private room.","When they went to see the baby, the child was over 8 pounds, chubby, and looked adorable.","Her little face was rosy, and you could tell she would be a beauty. So cute.","Teacher Tang was in good spirits and looked at her daughter beside her with a face full of love.","Shen Wei gave her six months of maternity leave to rest well and also transferred an 88,000 yuan red envelope for her to buy whatever she needed.","Li Yi was also a first-time father. At 40 years old, having his first child made him very excited.","He was also given six months off. The security company's staff would rotate to cover the doorman position.","Neither of them had parents to help, but fortunately, their salaries were high enough to hire professional postpartum caregivers and nannies, who were even more attentive than family members.","Moreover, Teacher Tang had arranged her work well in advance. She had carefully trained Tang Xiaowan.","Tang Xiaowan could now handle things independently and lead the class on her own.","Soon, other people from Starry Sky Kindergarten arrived as well.","They brought their own gifts and money, took a look, and then left.","After all, it was the first day, and the new mother was very tired. She needed plenty of rest.","They also mentioned that in a while, the baby could be sent to their kindergarten for school.","Children grow up very quickly, which made Teacher Tang feel a bit expectant."]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250: Moving Forward","paragraphs":["At Starry Sky Kindergarten, several children who were part of the first batch of enrollments are now starting first grade this year.","Seeing how popular Starry Sky Kindergarten has become, they're somewhat reluctant to leave.","Now, the conditions for entry into Starry Sky are extremely strict, with only one in a hundred being accepted.","The luxury class, costing 20,000 yuan per child, was instantly filled.","Being able to attend Starry Sky Kindergarten is something others look upon with envy.","After all, this kind of kindergarten isn't one you can just attend if you want to.","They've already enjoyed several months of being the envy of others.","Now that the children are facing school, parents don't want to hold them back.","But they're also reluctant to leave Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Parents are in a dilemma, and they discussed it with the teachers.","The teacher said, \"Children should follow the normal course. They should do what they need to do!\"","So, with regret, they took their children to enroll in primary school.","About forty to fifty of the earliest students have left.","The first batch of children had a small class.","Now that so many have left, they've started combining classes, and the extra teachers and assistants are going to help at the second branch of Starry Sky.","The most distracted person on the first day of primary school was undoubtedly Qi Zhong.","Both of his beloved apprentices had started school.","On the first day, he seemed as if he'd lost his soul.","By noon, he couldn't resist wanting to send a message to his apprentices' smartwatches, but he was afraid of disturbing them.","So he waited anxiously, every minute and second feeling like torture. Even Lin Rui couldn't help but tease him when she saw him.","\"What's wrong? You wish you could go to school instead of the kids? That's not possible.\"","Qi Zhong snorted, refusing to answer.","But his heart was full of anxiety.","Finally, the children came back from school. He had specially taken time off to pick up the little ones.","Bright Virtue Primary School is very close to the old district of Starry Sky Kindergarten. He waited at the school early.","When everyone came out, he indeed saw Mu Zhixing, Yu Fei, and Shi Xiaohu wearing their primary school uniforms.","\"How was it? Did anyone bully you at school?\" School bullying is so frightening nowadays.","Mu Zhixing said, \"No, we're all doing well here!\"","They had just started school, and all their peers were first-grade children. They hadn't gotten familiar with each other yet.","School wasn't as scary as she had imagined.","Moreover, they had already learned the things they were studying now back at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They just said that the food wasn't as good as Liu Chef's cooking.","Qi Zhong couldn't help but laugh, \"Of course, not many people can cook as well as Liu Chef.\"","When they returned, Liu Chef had saved some food for the children.","When Liu Chef heard that they hadn't eaten well at lunch, he immediately cooked another dish for them.","The children ate with gusto.","These were all children raised at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Liu Chef said with a smile, \"Eat more!\" Watching the children devour the food, he felt satisfied.","After they finished eating, Qi Zhong supervised them as they did their homework.","After finishing, he took the children to the art studio.","His mind had been distracted all day.","Now that he saw his two little apprentices return happily, he finally had the peace of mind to paint.","So he began to guide them.","Though he usually acted like a kind father, never saying a harsh word, he was really strict when it came to painting.","If a painting wasn't good, they had to do another one.","He was very strict about every detail.","But the little apprentices were already used to it.","So they started painting.","It goes without saying that these two little apprentices were exceptionally talented.","Soon, Qi Zhong's face showed some satisfaction.","Shi Xiaohu was painting alongside them.","But his paintings were just a mess.","The little one couldn't write much yet.","He used painting to express his experiences of the day.","The little guy was painting enthusiastically, although it wasn't clear what he was painting.","The entire Starry Sky had already closed for the day.","But there was still a light on in the kitchen. Shen Wei was about to leave after work.","She turned back when she saw the light in the kitchen and immediately returned.","She saw Liu Chef and Chef Chen chatting there.","Shen Wei went over.","The chefs immediately stood up.","Shen Wei said, \"Why aren't you going home? Should I drive you back?\" The shuttle bus must have already left.","Liu Chef, who couldn't hide anything, immediately said, \"Oh, no need. I specially wanted to come here when no one was around to catch my breath. I'm a bit nervous!\"","\"What?\" Shen Wei didn't understand.","Liu Chef said, \"Tomorrow, Starry Sky Restaurant is opening.\"","This time, it's Jiang Xun's show.","He knew that Jiang Xun was very capable.","He could master about 80-90% of his cooking.","Very impressive.","He was very talented among young chefs.","Even he wasn't as good as Jiang Xun when he was young.","But he didn't know if this young head chef could handle it well.","Shen Wei said, \"If you're so worried, why don't you go there tomorrow?\"","\"Can I?\"","\"Of course.\" Shen Wei also said, \"We've already arranged with the slaughterhouse to kill three pigs!\"","Their pigs, after a year of feeding, were all around 800 jin (400 kg) big pigs.","The meat was very fresh and delicious.","These were specially reserved for the restaurant's opening.","Hearing about killing pigs for the restaurant opening, Liu Chef immediately got excited: \"Then I'll go to the restaurant tomorrow!\"","Then he said to Chef Chen, \"You come too!\"","Although Chef Chen was usually quiet, he was quite responsible. He wanted to go but was worried about Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Shen Wei said, \"It's fine, we have other chefs here!\"","The other chefs had been working with Liu Chef for a while now, and they all cooked for each other usually, so it wouldn't be a problem if they left for a few days.","Liu Chef hadn't expected that the issue he'd been worrying about all day would be resolved so easily by Shen Wei. He was immediately overjoyed: \"Then I'll definitely go early tomorrow.\""]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251: Newcomers and Veterans","paragraphs":["The Starry Sky Restaurant had barely been advertised on the internet.","It was also located in the new district.","The restaurant's renovation alone cost two to three million.","There were over 200 tables spread across multiple floors.","Besides Jiang Xun as the head chef, there were also several pastry chefs.","The kitchen assistants were all highly skilled as well.","After all, with Liu Chef and Chef Chen around, their connections in the culinary world were quite extensive.","Moreover, Starry Sky had previously produced a cooking competition show, which allowed them to recruit a batch of promising talents.","Now was the perfect time to utilize them in the restaurant.","The Starry Sky Restaurant offered salaries about 20% higher than the industry standard.","The opening of this restaurant was cause for great celebration among Starry Sky's fan base.","People had been craving Starry Sky's cuisine for quite some time.","Previously, those who wanted to taste it could only visit a pop-up store.","But getting a reservation at the pop-up store was incredibly difficult.","Except for a few quick-fingered individuals who managed to snag a spot at the beginning,","Later on, it was purely a matter of luck.","Trying to compete with 100,000 to 200,000 people for just 400 to 500 tickets was extremely challenging.","Fans had been eagerly anticipating the day when Starry Sky Kindergarten would open a restaurant.","Now, it had finally happened.","Shen Wei was brimming with confidence on her end.","But Liu Chef couldn't sleep.","He treated Starry Sky Kindergarten as if it were his own home.","The more significant the event, the more nervous he became.","He had barely slept at all.","After tossing and turning for a while,","Hearing his wife's steady breathing beside him, he turned on the light and checked his phone - it was 3 AM.","He quietly got up.","He only turned on the lights once he reached the living room, then checked his phone again. Sure enough, Zhang Daming, the school bus driver, was already waiting outside.","They had previously arranged for Zhang Daming to take him to the slaughterhouse on the outskirts of the city between 3 and 4 AM.","He wanted to watch the pig slaughter and bring back the pig's blood and offal.","After getting dressed, Liu Chef went downstairs. As expected, Zhang Daming was waiting at the entrance of the alley.","Liu Chef felt a bit embarrassed: \"I'm really sorry for disturbing your rest.\"","Zhang Daming replied, \"It's no problem.\" Driving was part of his job, after all.","They then got into the car. Driver Zhang Daming steadily drove out of the city center. There were hardly any cars on the road in the early morning, making for a pleasant drive.","Liu Chef mentioned that he hadn't slept all night due to nervousness.","Strangely enough, as the former head chef of Jiangbei Restaurant,","He had catered for all sorts of grand banquets before.","He had never felt this nervous then, but now, he couldn't even understand why he was so anxious.","Zhang Daming commented from the side, \"No need to be nervous, many people have been looking forward to Starry Sky Kindergarten opening a restaurant.\"","While that was true, nervousness was something beyond control.","Liu Chef was the most familiar with what had happened in Zhang Daming's family. He said to Zhang Daming, \"I have some money on hand now. Do you need any? If you do, just say the word, don't be shy.\"","Zhang Daming replied, \"No need.\" At the mention of money, his heart was filled with gratitude.","He used to be a driver within the system.","Although his driving skills were universally praised within the entire system,","His salary wasn't high.","He only earned a few thousand yuan per month.","He had thought he would work within the system for his entire life and then retire.","Planning to go fishing with other old men after retirement.","He never expected that while he had always been honest and straightforward, his son would be so reckless.","His son had accumulated a huge amount of online debt, which couldn't be repaid even after selling their house.","Coming to work at Starry Sky Kindergarten was a big gamble for him.","The salary here was very high, 20,000 yuan per month plus a 100,000 yuan buyout from Xiao Xiang, and he had also sold two enrollment spots for 80,000.","His wife also worked here as a cleaner, earning five to six thousand a month.","The couple worked together for a while and finally managed to pay off all their debts.","After paying off the debts, their hearts felt lighter.","They even started smiling more.","Zhang Daming said, \"We've paid off all the debts, I'm really grateful to you!\"","It was Liu Chef who knew about his difficulties and helped him sell the enrollment spots.","Although Starry Sky Kindergarten's enrollment spots were valuable,","He really didn't know how to handle the transaction.","The buyer was introduced by Liu Chef, and the payment was made very quickly.","It was thanks to this that they were able to pay off the online loans.","Zhang Daming said, \"I've enrolled my child in the next term, but this time he won't be boarding. We chose day school to prevent him from falling back into old habits!\"","Liu Chef said, \"You're all hardworking people. Your future days will be good.\"","At the mention of this, Zhang Daming became quite happy.","He and his wife were both frugal people, eating all their meals at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This allowed them to save quite a bit.","They only spent about 1,000 yuan a month, and could save the rest.","Although they didn't have much money now,","With the salary from Starry Sky Kindergarten, it wouldn't be long before they would have some savings.","The two chatted and laughed, and soon arrived at the slaughterhouse.","The place was brightly lit.","When Liu Chef went in, he was surprised to find Chef Chen there too.","One look at Chef Chen's dark eye circles told him that, like himself, Chef Chen hadn't slept well all night.","This senior apprentice brother of his, who usually acted so cool, was actually just like him.","Neither could laugh at the other.","They waited for the pig slaughter at the slaughterhouse.","Two 800-pound pigs were slaughtered, and the blood was quickly collected in buckets.","Then the pork was swiftly butchered.","The snow-white fat, when cut, still steamed.","It was clearly genuine farm-raised pork.","The aroma of the meat was incredible.","Big pigs were indeed different.","Just two pigs, once butchered, looked like a mountain of meat.","They kept the pig's blood and all the offal.","There was a high-pressure water gun here, which directly cleaned out the dirt from the intestines, much more convenient than doing it by hand.","A small truck directly transported everything to the restaurant.","Chef Chen also inquired about the situation at the pig farm.","After all, the pig farm belonged to his relatives.","The pig farm staff, upon seeing Chef Chen, spoke enthusiastically: \"We don't know where these pigs came from. They're so easy to raise. They hardly ever get sick. They get fatter day by day. In all my years of raising pigs, I've never seen such good ones.\"","Now there were over 500 pigs on the farm.","Many were piglets born after breeding.","The only annoying thing was that they ate too much.","Pure farm-raised pigs were fed well, but it was expensive.","However, the quality of the pigs was undeniable. Several people from the slaughterhouse had come multiple times, offering high prices to buy the pigs.","But they hadn't been willing to sell.","The pig farm staff repeatedly told Chef Chen: \"Now that you've opened a restaurant, bring back the kitchen waste. I've already arranged with five restaurants for their kitchen waste.\"","Mixing this with the feed not only helped the pigs grow well but also saved some money.","Moreover, the kitchen waste from restaurants now contained oil, which made it easier for the pigs to fatten up.","Chef Chen said, \"That's no problem.\"","Then the pork and pig's blood were loaded onto the truck.","Chef Chen got into Zhang Daming's car.","When asked,","Chef Chen said he hadn't slept last night.","He had come by ride-hailing service.","He even had to pay extra in the middle of the night.","Zhang Daming said, \"Why didn't you tell me earlier? I could have picked you up!\"","Chef Chen replied, \"I didn't want to trouble you.\"","These chefs, when they saw good meat, couldn't take their eyes off it.","In the car, he excitedly gesticulated: \"Did you see that fat? It was three fingers thick. If you make braised pork with that, it would intoxicate people with its aroma!\"","People were still reminiscing about it after eating it just once."]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252: Hotel Beloved by the Group","paragraphs":["If it weren't for the grand opening of the Starry Sky Restaurant, they wouldn't have splurged like this.","\"Let's go and see what's happening at the restaurant,\" someone suggested.","They arrived in the city center around four or five in the morning.","The entire restaurant was brilliantly lit, with everyone already present.","The waitstaff were undergoing training at the front, while the cleaning crew was tidying up.","All the tables and chairs had been polished to a shine.","In the kitchen, various preparations were underway.","Liu Chef and Chef Chen had just arrived when they caught sight of the menu.","Part of it consisted of traditional dishes.","These included classics like braised pork belly, twice-cooked pork, and braised eggplant.","There were also Starry Sky specialties, such as iron plate beef tendon, Buddha Jumps Over the Wall, and fruit platters.","The menu was a dazzling array of options.","Jiang Xun, upon seeing the two chefs, immediately stood up and said, \"What brings you here?\"","Unlike Liu Chef and Chef Chen, who were tense from a sleepless night,","Jiang Xun was still young.","He possessed the fearless energy of a newborn calf facing a tiger.","Upon learning he would be the head chef, he was beyond excited.","Finally, he could showcase his skills.","He hadn't slept much yesterday either,","But today he didn't feel tired at all.","Half of the staff had come from the Starry Sky Kindergarten to help in the kitchen.","They were washing, chopping, preparing everything to avoid last-minute chaos.","\"How's it going?\" Liu Chef inquired.","Jiang Xun replied, \"Now that you're here, everything's even better!\"","Liu Chef then accompanied him to the back kitchen. Many semi-prepared dishes were already being made in an orderly fashion.","A little while later, workers began bringing in baskets of vegetables.","These came from the Starry Sky Vegetable Garden.","Shen Wei had invested 2 million yuan to build this vegetable garden.","The vegetables were growing exceptionally well.","There was enough to supply the kindergarten, pop-up store, and the Starry Sky Kindergarten Second Branch with plenty left over.","Now, the excess was perfect for the restaurant.","Their vegetables had a more authentic taste compared to those bought elsewhere.","When Jiang Xun learned he would be head chef, his top priority was securing vegetables from the Starry Sky Vegetable Garden.","But even with that, he feared it might not be enough, so he also ordered some from the market to mix in.","At this point, Liu Chef no longer dared to suggest giving excess vegetables to students' parents. Now, they could use every bit of produce they had.","Soon, the pork arrived as well.","Jiang Xun's smile grew even wider.","He had tasted the pork from Starry Sky's own pigs before.","It was fatty but not greasy, lean but not dry. The braised pork made from it was so delicious it made you want to swallow your tongue.","Even the staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten, who were used to good food,","Were accustomed to Liu Chef and Chef Chen turning cafeteria food into gourmet cuisine.","Plus, Liu Chef and Chef Chen had various top-tier chef friends who would come to cook at Starry Sky.","They had spoiled the kindergarten staff into becoming little food connoisseurs.","If they certified something as delicious, it was guaranteed to be exceptional.","Importantly, with the freshly slaughtered pig came fresh pig's blood. So, steamed blood cake was added to the menu.","This dish was a true delicacy for those who loved it.","Pig's blood mixed with eggs, then various seasonings added.","When steamed, it came out tender and smooth, without a hint of gaminess.","But it required high-quality pork.","The pigs raised at Starry Sky were, of course, perfect for this.","Even Jiang Xun felt that, as the restaurant's head chef, he was truly spoiled.","All the best ingredients were being sent his way.","It was clear that high hopes were placed on the restaurant. The best vegetables and meat were all being shipped here, and even Liu Chef and Chen Chef, the pillars of the kitchen, had come today.","Jiang Xun suddenly felt more confident.","He was now full of faith in the Starry Sky Restaurant.","They had to make a name for themselves right from the start. The thought made his blood boil with excitement.","The kitchen began to simmer the Buddha Jumps Over the Wall. A rich aroma wafted through the air, the golden broth reminiscent of the dish he had prepared during the culinary competition. This time, the ingredients were even better, and it was simmered for longer.","Everything had to be prepared in advance; no one could wait several hours just for one dish.","Whoever was lucky enough to taste this dish would find it well worth the wait. It was filled with the finest abalone, sea cucumber, fish maw, and cured meat.","A while later, Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan arrived as well.","Outside, there were numerous flower baskets from well-wishers.","After all, Shen Wei was now a rising star in the business world.","Everyone in the business circle wanted to be on good terms with her.","Even though Shen Wei hadn't notified anyone, these people had been paying attention and specially rushed to send flower baskets, showing great thoughtfulness.","It wasn't just one or two people who did this; there were so many flower baskets that they could barely fit outside.","Then came the massive crane, gripping thousands of firecrackers.","The Starry Sky Kindergarten had set the opening time for 8:18 AM.","They had been bustling about, and before they knew it, the time had arrived.","Jiang Xun and his team had been working since three or four in the morning.","It hardly felt like any time had passed.","Suddenly, they heard the thunderous sound of firecrackers outside.","The firecrackers continued for over ten minutes.","As the last cracker faded,","Only the shells remained.","The cleaning staff had been waiting, ready.","As soon as it ended, they immediately began sweeping up.","Shen Wei distributed pre-prepared red envelopes to each of the cleaners. She had prepared generous red packets, each containing 200 yuan. The cleaners were overjoyed. In the past, when doing such cleanup work, other restaurants would give red packets with just 10 or 20 yuan.","Shen Wei's red packets were equivalent to a day's wages for them.","This was a restaurant, after all.","No one came early in the morning.","The kitchen resumed its usual busy routine.","The meat had already been portioned in the kitchen.","The pork from the large pig was indeed very fatty.","They began rendering lard from the pork back fat and fatty cuts.","The yield was exceptionally high.","Soon, there was a large pot full.","The crispy bits left over weren't wasted either. They were used to make lard crackling buns.","The aroma was incredible, even more enticing than meat-filled buns.","By noon, the first batch of customers arrived, all loyal fans of Starry Sky. During the lunch hour, people started trickling in steadily.","For a new restaurant's first day, the occupancy rate reached an astonishing 80%.","Many had even crossed districts to come here.","As soon as they sat down, many people started ordering.","The kitchen began cooking immediately. Thanks to the advance prep work, the cooking process was very quick.","Besides the fixed menu items, there were also daily specials.","Today's specials were lard crackling buns, scallion oil noodles, and steamed blood cake.","All the customers were die-hard fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Naturally, they wanted to try all the new dishes.","The daily specials were a must-order.","After ordering, all that remained was eager anticipation."]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253: Crazy Diners","paragraphs":["The craziest thing Su Qianqian had ever done was probably driving for 40 minutes to bring her father to the Starry Sky Restaurant for a meal.","Her father was speechless.","He kept saying in the car, \"Couldn't we just eat downstairs? Driving for 40 minutes? We could cross into another city by train in that time. What food could possibly be so good?\"","Su Qianqian replied, \"Don't worry about it. I'll take you to try it, and then you'll understand.\"","Su Qianqian was a devoted fan of Starry Sky.","She had been following their livestreams, and as soon as she learned they had opened a restaurant, she immediately went.","As a long-time fan, she knew all too well Starry Sky's status in everyone's hearts.","If she didn't go now, it would be painful trying to get a spot later.","Her colleague could attest to this. At first, her colleague had managed to snag a ticket for the pop-up store.","But it was on a workday.","They had to work on weekdays, and the new supervisor was very strict about taking time off.","While hesitating and before even paying, she was kicked out after just 15 minutes.","When the first batch of reviews came out, they were all positive.","Everyone was saying how worth it the 400 yuan was.","They could immerse themselves in the experience for a day and enjoy a grand meal – either aspect alone was worth the ticket price.","But she hadn't gone at the time.","She regretted it so much.","Later, she found out that tickets for the Starry Sky pop-up store were being resold at high prices.","The more she thought about it, the more she felt she had missed out. It had almost become an obsession, always on the tip of her tongue.","Now that the restaurant was open, it was the old fans of Starry Sky who spread the news.","The restaurant hadn't made any grand announcements.","So as soon as she got confirmation,","She immediately drove over. Her father chattered non-stop along the way.","Saying they could eat anywhere, why did they have to go so far.","It was getting on her nerves a bit.","When they finally arrived at the restaurant, the air was filled with the smell of firecrackers.","Flower baskets were arranged outside, giving it a very impressive look.","As soon as they entered, she realized there were probably quite a few people like her.","By the time they sat down, more than 10 tables were already occupied before and after them.","Then they ordered. A round-faced waiter kindly asked, \"What would you like to eat, customers?\"","Su Qianqian glanced at the menu and ordered a dish of iron plate beef tendon.","She had been craving this dish since seeing it on the livestream, and could finally taste it.","She also ordered braised pork.","She had been using videos of Starry Sky's children eating braised pork with rice to whet her appetite every lunchtime.","There was also a specialty dish today – blood tofu.","It sounded a bit like a bizarre delicacy, so she wasn't planning to order it.","But her father's eyes lit up at the word: \"Oh, they have this good stuff? This is a seasonal dish – you can't get fresh ones without a pig slaughter!\"","He immediately ordered it, along with pork crackling buns.","They ordered two out of three specialty dishes.","With just two people, they also added a small cold dish.","Thinking they couldn't finish too much.","All of this only cost 158 yuan.","The food prices here weren't expensive.","The surrounding tables were just like them, and there were even streamers holding phones and livestreaming nearby.","Her father commented, \"So this is an internet celebrity restaurant?\"","Older people now scroll through short videos every day too.","They even know more popular phrases than young people sometimes.","Her father said, \"Internet celebrity restaurants are all scams, just marketing.\"","Su Qianqian didn't know whether to laugh or cry: \"Old man, you even know about this?\"","Her father raised his eyebrows and said, \"Don't look down on me! What don't I know? Your third uncle also mentioned an internet celebrity restaurant before, with extremely long queues and a two-hour wait for food. We thought it must be delicious, but it turned out to be just average.\"","Since then, he had no good feelings towards internet celebrity restaurants.","Su Qianqian was also feeling nervous.","Because her expectations were too high.","When expectations are too high, disappointment often follows.","Plus, she had brought her father along.","She was starting to regret not coming alone.","If the food really wasn't good,","She really wouldn't be able to face her father's criticism.","Soon, they could smell the aroma wafting through the air.","The neighboring table's food had arrived.","And they had arrived at the restaurant just moments apart.","She hadn't expected the food to come so quickly.","She immediately looked over. That table had ordered a full set of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall.","The golden soup looked rich, topped with Sichuan peppercorns, abalone, sea cucumber, dried bamboo shoots, and the like.","It looked delicious.","She immediately asked the waiter, \"How much is that?\"","She thought this dish shouldn't be cheap.","To her surprise, it was 58 yuan.","Su Qianqian said, \"We'll have one!\"","When it arrived,","Her father immediately ladled himself a small bowl.","The restaurant sold it cheaply, and the portion wasn't large. Each serving was about two small bowls.","When she tasted it, the fish maw was sticky and glutinous, without any fishy smell.","Taking a sip of the soup, it was so delicious it could make your eyebrows fall off.","Few people had ordered Buddha Jumps Over the Wall.","But after one table ordered it, other tables started adding it to their orders.","Some even ordered one serving per person.","It was too good.","One small bowl wasn't enough.","After a while, all their dishes arrived.","The food came quite quickly here.","Her father's eyes went straight to the blood tofu. He scooped up a spoonful, it looked like steamed egg custard.","As he ate it, it slid smoothly down his throat.","Then he started eating it spoonful after spoonful.","Su Qianqian, on the other hand, went for the braised pork and iron plate beef tendon.","The iron plate beef tendon had a slightly crispy skin.","It was soft, glutinous, and chewy when eaten.","It would be perfect with rice.","She then took a bite of the braised pork and looked surprised.","How did they make this braised pork?","How could it be so fragrant?","One bite was extremely satisfying.","Sure enough, many people around them started asking the waiters for rice.","It would be a waste not to have rice with such good dishes.","When she used to watch videos of Starry Sky's children eating, she thought they were wolfing down their food.","Even though there was so much, and no one was competing with them for it.","But when she ate it herself, she finally understood why.","Because it was impossible to control oneself.","Eating big mouthfuls of rice was incredibly satisfying.","Her father kept focusing on that plate of blood tofu.","It made her curious too. Overcoming her fear, she took a bite.","There wasn't any strange taste at all, it was smooth and tender.","Her father said, \"Back in the day, I wanted to eat this but couldn't!\"","Her father used to be a sent-down youth.","He said that in those poor times, when a pig was slaughtered, they would be given a little pig blood.","What they steamed themselves wasn't as delicious as this.","But it was still a rare delicacy in those days.","Now that living conditions have improved, it's rare to eat this dish.","He had intended to reminisce about the hardships of the past.","But he didn't expect it to be so delicious.","This small portion was only 16 yuan.","It really brought back memories of the past for him.","It was even fresher and more delicious than in the past.","Finally, he picked up a pork crackling bun and took a bite.","The fragrance of the pork cracklings combined with the cabbage filling was crisp and delicious.","Dipped in a bit of seafood soy sauce, vinegar, and chili oil,","He felt that just eating one of these big buns from the whole table of dishes would be enough.","Su Qianqian was eating non-stop.","Her father was devouring the buns, and she couldn't resist taking a bite.","Her father actually protected his food, lightly tapping her hand with his chopsticks: \"Eat the other dishes.\"","The more her father said this, the more Su Qianqian wanted to eat it.","She knew her father's little habits too well.","Her father wasn't usually like this, only when he ate something particularly to his taste would it trigger this food-protecting instinct.","After much persuasion, she took a bun and had a bite. It was truly delicious."]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254: Like to Eat","paragraphs":["Many people shared Su Qianqian's thoughts, and they were all eating heartily here.","Midway through, some people asked for additional steamed buns or rice.","Some even ordered a whole table full of dishes.","The waiters advised them to order less, but they said they'd take leftovers home.","A live-streaming host nearby originally wanted to introduce the flavors.","But he had brought two friends with him.","Those two friends couldn't stop eating.","It annoyed the host.","They were afraid of missing out on even a single bite.","Subsequently, as if forgetting about the camera, they started eating without saying a word.","This made the viewers in the live stream incredibly hungry.","\"Isn't the host supposed to be reviewing? When did this turn into an eating show?\"","\"This is also a trend, after all, the host is eating so deliciously.\"","\"I'm really envious of you local kids who can visit the Starry Sky Restaurant. We want to eat there too, but it's impossible to travel so far.\"","\"Is it really that delicious?\"","\"Of course it's delicious. I've been following this host for a long time, and he's reviewed many things, but he's never eaten so messily before. It seems he's completely immersed in the delicious food.\"","\"To be honest, everyone, I've just ordered takeout again. I can't resist anymore after watching this live stream.\"","The people in front kept eating, while those behind kept adding orders.","Plus, more people kept coming in.","The kitchen had prepared mountains of semi-finished products in advance, which were being consumed at a rapid pace.","They had previously made two large pots of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall.","Now they were all gone.","The waiter told them there were only 5 portions of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall left. They quickly crossed it off the menu.","Many people were craving the aroma of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall.","It was so impressive that with this dish, the other dishes seemed to pale in comparison.","This dish alone takes 6 hours to simmer.","There's no time to make it fresh now.","They thought they had enough to sell until evening.","Unexpectedly, before noon was over, Buddha Jumps Over the Wall was gone.","Sure enough, when the waiter announced this news, a wave of regretful voices could be heard.","Originally, people might not have wanted to order too much.","But the scarcer something becomes, the more people want to eat it.","So they started frantically ordering braised pork, and even those leaving wanted to take two portions home.","This braised pork could be reheated in the microwave and eaten with rice at home. They even wanted to take home several portions of the refreshing pickles.","Unexpectedly, on the restaurant's opening day,","The second item to run out was the refreshing pickles.","However, this was relatively simple to make.","Liu Chef and Chef Chen were making it on the side, preparing a large basin each time, which quickly ran out.","Mainly because their dishes were centered around meat and fish.","The fresh and crisp pickles could cut through the greasiness and allow people to eat more.","Just like that, the most unassuming side dish was actually made by the most skilled chef in the entire kitchen.","By the time Su Qianqian finished eating, she could barely walk straight.","The lard crackling buns had sold out early.","Her father kept complaining, \"If only we had packed 10 more to take home.\"","They make these lard crackling buns at home too.","But they can never make the filling taste this good.","The bun skin was soft and fluffy, while the filling was tight and compact.","It carried the fragrance of lard cracklings, and the cabbage was crisp and refreshing.","It was truly impossible to eat enough.","Plus, it had the unique sweetness of vegetables.","It was too delicious.","Su Qianqian had come with only two people, thinking they had ordered too much and wouldn't be able to finish.","Who would have thought that the Old Man, let alone the braised pork, even mixed the soup with rice and finished it all.","As for the beef tendon, he ate it without making a sound.","After finishing, when Su Qianqian caught her breath, she asked, \"How was it? Was this place okay?\"","The Old Man gave a thumbs up and said, \"Next time, I'll bring your third uncle to eat here. Your third uncle is a real foodie. If he knew about a restaurant like this, he'd drive 40 minutes, even an hour and 40 minutes to come here.\"","Su Qianqian saw people still coming in.","Even though it was past the usual mealtime.","But people kept coming, some even driving over 30 kilometers like her.","They were afraid of coming late and missing out.","Su Qianqian, like others, packed a portion of braised pork to take away.","She also asked for some of the refreshing pickles.","No wonder the Starry Sky Restaurant was so impressive.","Even the unassuming pickles were so refreshing and delicious.","Tomorrow, it would be perfect with porridge.","By the time they left, other customers had already taken their seats.","Seeing so many people, her father looked a bit worried, \"I want to come back to eat tomorrow!\"","Her father was now retired, with a decent pension.","Eating out was no problem for him, mainly because those lard crackling buns were so good, including the blood pudding, which was steamed to perfection.","It wasn't old at all, that's real skill.","It was smooth and delicious when eaten.","Even better than the delicacies in his memory.","On the way back, he told Su Qianqian, \"Don't advertise this place, or we might not be able to get a reservation next time!\" Her father was quite thoughtful.","But Su Qianqian looked at the constant stream of people coming in and said, \"Even if I don't say anything, it doesn't seem to matter!\"","The fans of Starry Sky Restaurant were always the most active.","Her father was left speechless.","On the way back, he kept praising her for finding such a good place.","Su Qianqian was also pleased with herself.","When she got back to the office, others gathered around asking, \"Did you eat at the Starry Sky Restaurant? Was it good?\"","Su Qianqian looked puzzled, what was going on? She originally didn't want to say anything, but how did everyone seem to know?","An older colleague from the office said, \"You don't know yet? There was a live streamer behind you, I clicked in and saw you there. I wanted to go too, but it seems like they ran out of braised pork and Buddha Jumps Over the Wall. So I didn't go!\"","When Su Qianqian heard that even the braised pork was gone, her first reaction wasn't that she had been live-streamed.","Instead, she felt lucky.","Fortunately, she had packed an extra portion before leaving.","Others asked if it was good, and she couldn't bring herself to lie, so she just nodded.","\"Let's go together tomorrow!\" her colleague sister said.","She felt a bit embarrassed and said, \"I can't, I've made plans with my dad tomorrow, the Old Man loves to eat too.\"","The office sister could only regretfully make plans with others. Having so many people go didn't discourage her at all, instead, it made her more determined.","Su Qianqian went today and was going again tomorrow, this frequency of restaurant visits showed that the place was truly delicious.","The office sister was particularly good at spreading the word, and soon the entire office knew that the Starry Sky Restaurant was delicious. They might not be interested in other topics, but when it came to food, they were all ears.","They all said they must go and eat tomorrow, to see what all the fuss was about."]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255: Not Enough Big Fat Pig","paragraphs":["The Starry Sky Restaurant requires three-layered pork belly for their braised pork dish.","Not just any cut of meat will do.","They use all the suitable meat for braised pork.","However, customers order as if money is no object.","They not only dine in but also take out when leaving.","With such frenzied ordering, the braised pork is all gone.","The sizzling beef tendon is also sold out.","Chef Chen watches the booming business and says to Liu Chef, \"Are you feeling reassured now?\"","This person had been so worried he couldn't sleep before.","It was all unnecessary.","Liu Chef, somewhat embarrassed, says, \"Oh, I've always been confident.\" Men, always putting on a brave face.","He tells Jiang Xun, \"Go take a break outside! I'll help you cook.\" It's just stir-frying, something he's used to.","Mainly because Jiang Xun is too busy.","He has a towel draped around his neck, soaked with sweat.","Hot, busy, and anxious.","This kind of pressure is a rite of passage to becoming a great chef.","He's still young, and having the guidance of seniors makes it a bit easier.","Jiang Xun then says, \"I'll go out for a smoke!\"","He doesn't usually smoke, but today he's just too exhausted.","He wants to have one to perk up.","He goes to an inconspicuous spot.","Everyone inside is busy.","He puts a cigarette to his lips, clicks the lighter twice, but fails to light it.","His fingers holding the cigarette are trembling.","In the end, he gives up on smoking.","Just as he's taking a break, his phone rings.","It's his former Junior Brother, who asks, \"What are you doing at the Starry Sky Restaurant now?\"","Although the Starry Sky Restaurant hasn't gone viral online yet,","It's highly regarded in the industry.","After all, Jiang Xun was a seed player in the culinary championship.","If he hadn't withdrawn, he could have competed for the top spots.","He gives a noncommittal \"Mm.\"","The voice on the phone says, \"Master says when you come back, all past issues will be forgiven. Master is getting old, maybe he was a bit misguided before.\"","Jiang Xun sighs and says, \"We'll talk about the future later. I'm really busy now, so let's not discuss this.\"","His Junior Brother didn't expect this response: \"Alright then, carry on with your work!\"","Jiang Xun stays outside for about 15 minutes before returning to work.","Jiang Xun's Junior Brother hangs up the phone. The Master, Si Jing, asks nearby, \"How did it go?\"","The Junior Brother replies, \"Senior Brother said we'll talk later, he's busy now.\"","Master Si Jing's face alternates between pale and flushed.","He truly regrets his actions.","Jiang Xun was his most talented disciple.","All because he wouldn't get along with his daughter?","This matter has been criticized by many in the culinary world.","It's as if his daughter couldn't get married otherwise.","Forcing a match has only led to a rift between master and disciple.","Letting Liu Chef pick up a bargain.","That boy is known for his gratitude, Liu Chef took him in when he was struggling.","It's obvious he'll stay and work there for a long time.","More and more people are angry at his inappropriate behavior.","Now he truly regrets it.","He wants to bring his disciple back.","But the other party no longer responds.","It's too late for regrets now.","Looking at his current disciples, none of them measure up to even half of Jiang Xun's skill. It's an indescribable feeling.","On the first day, the Starry Sky Restaurant was bustling with activity.","And this was without any advertising.","People kept coming in, until they almost ran out of dishes.","Towards the end, when people ordered, they were told to take whatever was available.","Thankfully, Chef Chen and Liu Chef were there throughout.","They had previously dealt with busy periods at the kindergarten and pop-up store.","They were used to this kind of hustle and bustle.","Fortunately, they managed. By the end, Jiang Xun couldn't even muster the strength to lift a bowl or chopsticks.","The two senior chefs who came to help were a bit worried, wondering if the young man would be alright for the next day after being so exhausted.","On the second day, both senior chefs came again. But they found him fully recovered. The resilience of youth indeed.","He was eager and ready to give it his all.","With the experience from the first day, they also opened up for delivery on the second day.","This way, many people could order through delivery platforms, easing some of the pressure in the restaurant.","So on the second day, a flood of orders came in.","Even experienced industry veterans like Liu Chef and Chef Chen were taken aback by the sheer volume of orders.","But the young staff became more and more excited.","The only request to Shen Wei was to ensure good logistics support.","Two pigs a day might not be enough.","They might need to increase to three.","The pig farm had been preparing large pigs for Shen Wei in advance.","They had intended to use good pigs to make a splash.","Who knew it would be so successful?","Two pigs weren't nearly enough.","Currently, they still have over 300 large pigs.","The rest are piglets.","Piglets need about a year to be ready for market.","Even this won't be enough for their consumption.","But Shen Wei said to start with three pigs a day and figure out the rest later.","As the Starry Sky Restaurant became popular,","Several other restaurants opened nearby.","On regular days, the Starry Sky Restaurant was packed.","The other restaurants stood empty.","The nearby barbers, who had become familiar with the other restaurant owners, couldn't help but ask, \"Why did you open here?\"","Before, not knowing was one thing, but clearly knowing there was a big restaurant here and still coming, that was their mistake.","The other restaurant owners just smiled and said, \"The Starry Sky has too much traffic, even a small overflow is enough for us.\"","After all, some people like to explore new places, and if they can't get a table at the Starry Sky during peak hours, they might try nearby restaurants.","It's good to be in the shadow of a big tree.","Even Doctor Lu's friends came to book tables.","Doctor Lu said, \"How come you're coming out for lunch during your precious break time at the hospital?\"","\"We're just too tempted, with such high pressure at work every day!\"","Doctor Lu replied, \"But I can't even book a table here!\"","In fact, he could have booked one.","But the restaurant was so popular.","He didn't want to add to their troubles, so he felt embarrassed to do so.","Doctor Lu wasn't the only one with this dilemma.","Almost everyone from the kindergarten had been pestered by friends and family in this way. But they all unanimously chose to refuse.","The restaurant was too busy, with 10 to 20 tables waiting for reservations.","Under such busy circumstances, to reserve a table in advance for them","Seemed a bit unreasonable.","As the Starry Sky became popular, Shen Wei had only one concern: not enough pigs.","Buying premium piglets through the system cost 5,000 points each.","The price was simply too high.","Shen Wei negotiated with the system to see if they could issue some tasks.","She wanted to be rewarded with a larger breeding farm, complete with pigs.","After all, having tasted the Starry Sky's premium pork, eating other pork from the market just didn't taste as good anymore."]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256: The Last Mission","paragraphs":["Then the system's mechanical voice sounded again.","\"Next mission: Aid 20 welfare institutions. Reward: One pig farm.\"","\"Reward: 20% plot reversal of the original story.\"","Adding to the previous 80%, completing this mission would completely overturn the entire plot of the original story.","Shen Wei was stunned for a moment.","This system task was truly very difficult.","Previously, it was just point-to-point assistance. Now it was based on welfare institutions as the basic unit, with each institution housing anywhere from dozens to hundreds or even thousands of people.","Providing aid would require enormous manpower, energy, and resources.","But Shen Wei still decided to accept this mission after some thought.","So Shen Wei went directly to Qin Shu.","Qin Shu was now working at a welfare institution.","He was one of the people most familiar with the workings of welfare institutions.","Subsequently, Shen Wei proposed wanting to aid 20 welfare institutions.","Qin Shu wasn't surprised at all.","Instead, he shared all the information he knew with Shen Wei.","Afterwards, Shen Wei called each institution one by one to make contact.","She asked what they needed, and most lacked essential study supplies.","They also needed warm clothes and staple foods like rice, flour, and oil.","Shen Wei spent a whole day making phone calls.","By the last call, her voice had gone hoarse.","She had a clear understanding of all the welfare institutions' needs.","Currently, she had over 50 million yuan at her disposal.","While 50 million seemed like a lot,","She had used up all her money recently.","The Starry Sky restaurant and its second branch had consumed a huge amount of money.","Fortunately, she had earned some money afterwards.","This 50 million was already very fast in terms of earning speed.","But to aid 20 welfare institutions would be extremely costly.","Divided by 20, each place would only receive about 2 million yuan in aid.","That wouldn't be enough to buy things for the children.","She wanted to provide some basic assistance to the children, ensuring their food, clothing, shelter, and transportation.","Moreover, given Shen Wei's background in running a kindergarten, she also had some requirements for the children's learning and entertainment.","So Shen Wei decided to sell two of the villas under her name.","Her father had been a nouveau riche.","And her father had a very good eye for buying houses.","He bought several back then, which have now increased in value dozens of times over.","Shen Wei was also a property tycoon, and she took out the two most valuable villas.","The most valuable aspect of these villas was their location.","After all, good locations are hard to come by nowadays.","The residents of this villa complex were either wealthy or noble, and even some minor celebrities came to buy houses here.","Being able to buy a house here was a symbol of status and prestige.","When her father bought her a house here initially, the price was already considerable.","But scarcity increases value, and with houses here being rare, their prices rose even as property values fell across the city. Now, if the two were auctioned together, the realtor said they could fetch up to 100 million yuan.","Shen Wei's requirement was to cash out quickly and sell fast.","After all, for such expensive houses, it would take at least a month to sell.","If things didn't go smoothly, it could even take a year or two. Shen Wei couldn't wait that long.","She told the realtor: She hoped to sell quickly, and there was room for negotiation on the price.","Besides these two villas, Shen Wei had other houses as well. But they weren't much.","However, as soon as the news was posted with the realtor, Gu Qingyan called Shen Wei.","\"Why are you selling the houses?\"","After all, the person selling the houses was Shen Wei.","Shen Wei was currently a hot commodity in the upper-class circles.","As soon as the houses were listed, several industry bigwigs knew about it. Naturally, the news reached the ears of Gu Qingyan, her official boyfriend.","Shen Wei said, \"I want to aid welfare institutions, but I don't have money now.\"","Gu Qingyan was silent for a moment, then said, \"I have a few tens of millions on hand, I'll transfer it to you immediately. And I also have several properties under my name, let's sell mine instead.\"","He couldn't bear to see Shen Wei sell her own houses.","Shen Wei said, \"No!\" This wasn't a small amount.","Gu Qingyan, however, was unusually firm: \"Using yours or mine is the same, we're family after all.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Shen Wei fell silent on the other end.","Gu Qingyan said, \"We are family, aren't we?\" He sounded a bit insecure.","Shen Wei said, \"But we still need to keep money matters clear!\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"Anyway, I have no use for that money. Before I met you, I was living a dissipated life every day. After meeting you, accompanying you to rescue and raise children, not only did it help me regain some confidence, but it also made me discover more meaning in life.\"","Indeed. It was like those who normally buy yachts for tens of millions.","Or commute by helicopter, living the same kind of life.","When a person's wealth reaches a certain level, it stagnates.","The rich have everything, but instead feel empty, wanting to find excitement in various places.","Now, what he wanted most, he had already obtained - becoming Shen Wei's boyfriend.","Being able to do charity work with Shen Wei was, in his view, a very cool thing.","Gu Qingyan then called the realtor, telling him not to sell Shen Wei's houses, but to sell his own instead.","Gu Qingyan's houses were in even better locations.","After all, developers initially reserved the best houses for top-tier heirs of wealthy families.","Shen Wei was only a nouveau riche back then, and although she could buy in, the location and area were much inferior.","Gu Qingyan's house was listed and immediately sold for 120 million yuan. Such houses were rare and highly sought after, with many wanting to buy but unable to. Usually, even if they were to be sold, they would be sold to close friends or brothers. It was rare for them to circulate externally.","The realtor was ecstatic. This house was extremely easy to sell. As soon as the news was out, someone wanted to buy it, paying on the same day. The realtor's commission for this single deal was in the high six figures. Colleagues around were green with envy.","If only all houses were this easy to sell.","Gu Qingyan received the money, added his own 30 million, and transferred a total of 150 million to Shen Wei.","Property matters have always been viewed seriously in wealthy families.","Even when young couples get married, they often have to do property notarization in advance.","Let alone when two people are just boyfriend and girlfriend.","Shen Wei said she didn't want it.","Gu Qingyan then looked at Shen Wei with a hurt expression, implying in every way that Shen Wei didn't consider him as one of her own.","Shen Wei had never encountered this kind of situation before, someone begging her to accept money.","But this amount of money was really too much.","Shen Wei even mentioned this matter to Gu Qingyan's family.","Only then did Gu Qingyan's parents realize that their son had sold two villas under his name.","But upon hearing about this, they didn't object. Instead, they said, \"If that boy is willing to give it to you, just accept it.\" They even added, \"If you need money, uncle and auntie also have some.\"","Shen Wei repeatedly refused and hung up the phone.","Gu Qingyan blinked beside her and said, \"They've long wanted to package me up and give me to you. Just accept this money with peace of mind. Even if we can't be together in the future, I will absolutely never ask you for this money back. It's my voluntary gift.\"","He even wrote it in the transfer.","He just wanted Shen Wei to accept it without any burden. After a moment of silence, Shen Wei said, \"Alright then.\"","Gu Qingyan immediately broke into a smile.","Shen Wei was also amused by him.","After laughing, she was filled with emotion."]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257: The Online Shop Owners Are Afraid","paragraphs":["Xu Wenwen ran an online store.","She had missed the internet's golden age, having entered the business a bit late.","But after years of diligent work, she had gradually gotten on track.","She sold children's stationery.","Her only frustration was that these young mothers asked far too many questions.","Her online store operated on a low-profit, high-volume model. Unable to afford professional customer service, she had recruited her cousin sisters to handle customer inquiries.","Those who only wanted refunds were, after all, the minority.","Most customers simply asked a few questions before making a purchase without hesitation.","If they could quickly confirm payment, it was like dealing with dream customers.","She had just finished shipping out yesterday's orders.","Her so-called online store \"office\" was actually just her living room, with a few desks set up.","Occasionally, she could hear the rapid typing of her cousin sisters.","Xu Wenwen took a sip of water, feeling somewhat tired.","After all, she was both the boss and the shipper, handling after-sales and customer service. But this month, coinciding with the start of school, stationery sales had been exceptionally good.","After deducting various expenses, she would take home nearly 30,000 yuan this month.","This was the first time her income had been so high.","Previously, in her best months, she had only earned about 10,000 yuan.","Now it had suddenly tripled. Xu Wenwen, only 25 years old, felt a surge of excitement seeing the income in her backend.","Just then, her Cousin Sister suddenly stood up with a loud noise, startling Xu Wenwen.","Xu Wenwen asked, \"What's wrong?\"","Her Cousin Sister said from the side, \"We just got a huge order!\" Her face had changed color from shock.","Xu Wenwen immediately got up to take a look, and even she gasped.","The pencils they had listed came in packs of 10.","Someone had just ordered over 12,000 packs.","She had been running her online store for several years now and had never encountered a situation like this.","Previously, the largest order had been for 20 or 30 packs, usually during website promotions or when discount coupons were available, making such purchases particularly economical.","But 12,000 packs?","Xu Wenwen broke out in a cold sweat all over.","Just yesterday, she had taken her cousin sisters out for dinner to celebrate breaking into the top 10 in sales for their stationery category.","Could it be that as soon as they entered the top 10, competitors had started to cause trouble?","She had heard of such things before.","Some people would place massive orders, then demand large-scale refunds.","If a store's credibility rating dropped low enough, it could lead directly to account suspension.","She had always heard about it but never witnessed it firsthand.","How could this be happening to her?","Everyone was stunned. This large order wasn't boosting the store's performance; instead, it felt like a death sentence.","12,000 packs was just too outrageous.","That's equivalent to 120,000 pencils.","Even a whole school wouldn't need that many!","At this point, her Cousin Younger Sister suggested, \"Could it be a child who got hold of their parent's phone and just kept clicking to buy?\"","\"That's possible!\" Xu Wenwen said.","She immediately returned to the chat window and typed: \"Dear customer, our store doesn't accept purchases from minors. Would you like us to process a refund for this order?\"","After sending the message, the other party's status remained unread.","Yet she couldn't take it upon herself to process a refund.","So she anxiously started calling the platform's customer service.","What should she do? She had never encountered such an urgent situation before.","Her online store was just starting to get on track, and if such a mistake occurred now,","all her previous efforts could be wasted.","But the website said: The account wasn't flagged as risky, so they advised her to ship the order and deal with any issues later.","Xu Wenwen relayed the website's response to her cousin sisters, and both were quite angry.","It was clear the platform didn't want to get involved.","What did they mean by dealing with it later? Where would she get so many items from?","Her warehouse stock was only about 4,000 to 5,000 packs.","Such a sudden large order meant she'd have to invest money upfront to restock.","If this turned out to be a prank,","she'd be stuck with a huge inventory, lose money on shipping, and damage her store's reputation.","Xu Wenwen was usually an introvert, not comfortable calling strangers.","But this time she had no choice and called the customer directly, but there was no answer.","Xu Wenwen was so scared that sweat appeared on her forehead, and her face turned pale.","Just then, she heard her Cousin Sister exclaim again: \"Oh my god, this person just ordered 12,000 erasers too!\"","If the first pencil order could have been a mistake,","12,000 erasers made her heart feel like it was being gripped by a giant, monstrous claw.","Tormenting her inside.","And it didn't stop there - the person also ordered 200 pencil sharpeners.","Their pencil sharpeners were very exquisite, so they were quite expensive.","Over 30 yuan each.","Usually, parents wouldn't splurge on such nice sharpeners for their children.","Typically, only art studios that needed to sharpen lots of pencils would buy one.","\"Could it be a bulk purchase? It's cheaper online!\" her Cousin Younger Sister suggested.","True, she did have connections in the pencil and stationery supply chain.","Her selling price was close to the wholesale price that second-tier distributors could get.","The profit margin was extremely thin, only earning a few cents per order.","It wasn't unheard of for people to come to her for bulk purchases before.","But their quantities were always much smaller, around a few dozen orders.","Those usually blended in with normal sales without standing out.","Thinking this might be the case, she immediately checked the shipping address provided by the buyer. It showed Starry Sky Kindergarten.","\"So it is a bulk purchase!\" She felt slightly relieved.","After her initial relief, she realized the name sounded very familiar.","But she couldn't quite place it at the moment.","She was too busy with daily tasks to pay much attention to online matters.","Seeing that the buyer had left a specific address in the neighboring city, she was still pondering whether to ship the order or not.","Just then, her phone rang. She answered to hear a pleasant female voice saying, \"Did you call me earlier?\"","Xu Wenwen immediately replied, \"Yes, I'm the store owner. You placed an order for 1,200 packs of pencils, 1,200 erasers, and 200 pencil sharpeners in our store. I wanted to confirm if you want us to ship this order?\"","\"Yes, please ship it as soon as possible,\" the voice replied.","Hearing this, Xu Wenwen felt even more at ease. The caller's tone exuded a comfortable aura. But to avoid any complications, she added, \"You're certain about this order, right? We'll be incurring significant costs.\"","The other party responded, \"Yes, I'm certain,\" and then hung up.","Her heart was racing. Fulfilling this order would earn her a gross profit of 30,000 yuan, not accounting for shipping costs.","\"So, are we going to ship this?\" her Cousin Sister, who had been following the situation closely, asked.","Xu Wenwen thought for a moment and said, \"Yes.\" She then borrowed some money from a lending platform and placed an order directly with the manufacturer.","Riding her electric scooter, she went to the suburban factory to pick up the goods herself, as it would be faster.","She had to recount such a large quantity of items multiple times. It took her an entire night.","She even threw in some extra ballpoint pens, erasers, and other items as freebies.","Given the weight of the package and the customer's urgency, she opted for the fastest air shipping. The shipping cost alone was 5,000 yuan.","She anxiously tracked the package. That night, Xu Wenwen could barely sleep.","She was terrified of hearing her computer ding, fearing the customer might request a refund!","Finally, after what felt like an eternity of waiting and paying the hefty shipping fee, the customer received the package.","Then she heard a 'ding' sound, and her heart tightened.","It felt like she was about to face judgment.","But when she looked, all the money had been transferred to her account.","Moreover, the customer had left a positive review, writing: \"The store owner is very nice, and the shipping was really fast.\"","Xu Wenwen finally felt the weight lift from her chest.","Then her computer started pinging constantly.","They were all orders for notebooks, pens, erasers, and such.","Even Xu Wenwen didn't understand what was happening.","It was her clever Cousin Younger Sister who figured it out: \"Wow, ever since we sold that huge order, we've suddenly shot to the top of the stationery category rankings.\"","The website used algorithms for recommendations.","Her store had directly entered the large traffic pool.","This meant more exposure.","Other people started flocking to buy from her store, all thanks to that big customer.","This was even better than paying for promotions.","She felt touched.","Later, she came across a livestream from Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Out of curiosity, she clicked to watch for a moment, and suddenly everything became clear.","No wonder the name had seemed so familiar.","Recently, Xu Wenwen had watched a livestream from Starry Sky Kindergarten and even seen some news about it: apparently, the neighboring kindergarten had become an internet sensation, with many celebrities sending their children there.","At the time, she had discussed it with her friends.","But then she quickly forgot about it.","Unexpectedly, she received a big order, and Xu Wenwen immediately followed Starry Sky Kindergarten on social media. After that, she became busy once again."]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258: Spark of the Stars","paragraphs":["Shen Wei had placed orders for rice, flour, and cooking oil from local suppliers.","She arranged for them to be delivered to the local welfare home.","She also called the welfare home in advance to inform them about the incoming donations.","Shen Wei chose large wholesale markets in the area for her purchases.","This way, she could buy things at a lower price.","Although Shen Wei had money, there were many places where it was needed.","She couldn't afford to spend it carelessly.","Previously, buying stationery, clothes, shoes, and snacks for the children had already cost her twenty to thirty million yuan.","She planned to spend the rest of the money wisely.","Having money didn't mean she could be wasteful.","So she found local wholesale markets and placed orders directly.","Usually, these local wholesale markets were supplied by smaller vendors and didn't offer delivery services.","Shen Wei said, \"Could you please help me with delivery? I'm buying a large quantity.\"","The grain store owner had heard this kind of request many times before: \"Sorry, we can't deliver no matter how much you buy!\"","The owner seemed a bit impatient, as there were quite a few customers in his shop. He said, \"Do you have any other business? If not, I'll hang up.\"","He had seen this type of customer before.","Not long ago, two girls said they wanted to buy a lot, and spent a long time haggling with him.","He finally gave in.","He thought they would buy a significant amount, but in the end, each of them only bought two bags of rice and three jugs of soybean oil.","They had managed to get a wholesale price and delivery for such a small order.","The wholesale owner learned his lesson and started rejecting such business afterward. He didn't have time for their games.","Hearing Shen Wei's voice, the owner was full of impatience.","But then Shen Wei said something.","The owner's attitude changed completely, and he immediately said, \"Alright, alright, I'll deliver to you even if we don't do it for others.\"","They added each other on WeChat, and Shen Wei sent over her order list.","After the owner quoted the price, Shen Wei immediately transferred the money.","The owner then started arranging for his staff to load the truck.","His wife said, \"Hey, it's so busy now, where are you going? Don't tell me you've met some young girl who called you 'brother' a couple of times, and now you're all confused!\"","When the boss's wife said this, the nearby customers couldn't help but let out friendly laughs.","This made the boss blush and say, \"You don't understand, this is a big order.\"","\"How big of an order?\" the boss's wife asked skeptically. Their shop was already bustling with activity, and they were set to sell over a hundred thousand yuan worth of goods in this period.","Some grain shops, although they didn't order much at once, placed frequent replenishment orders.","They had to prioritize these customers first.","There were also issues with new customers. Taking time out now to make a delivery seemed like misplaced priorities.","The boss said, \"This customer ordered one million yuan worth of goods.\"","His wife gasped, then grabbed the phone to look. She counted the zeros in the payment several times.","Then she looked at the order list: it included all kinds of grains, oils, and seasonings.","There was a ton of rice alone.","There were also local dried vegetables, which could be stored for a very long time.","The delivery destination surprised the boss's wife even more: \"It's the welfare home.\"","\"Exactly!\" the boss said. \"This is a kind-hearted person. You wouldn't refuse to deliver now, would you?\"","The boss's wife glared at her husband: \"Why didn't you say so earlier!\" Then she added, \"Since it's for charity, let's add another 50,000 yuan worth of goods, as our contribution.\"","The boss's face softened, and he said, \"My wife has such a good heart.\"","His wife would often tear up watching short videos online.","Although she could be sharp-tongued at times,","she never hesitated when it came to important matters.","So the boss's wife shouted, \"Quickly load up the truck for this kind person. I'll go along with the extra goods. Use the newest rice.\"","\"Boss's wife, are you trying to empty our warehouse?\" a worker joked.","The boss's wife retorted, \"Stop talking nonsense.\"","They had cooperating villages below them. If they needed rice, they could have it freshly milled.","The priority now was to satisfy this customer.","The boss's wife truly admired these charitable people.","She personally escorted the delivery to the welfare home.","It took almost half a day.","When they finally arrived, they handed over the list to the welfare home.","Although tired, they felt extremely satisfied.","The welfare home was shocked. They had received donations before, but never on such a large scale.","The grain store owner's wife said, \"We didn't make any profit on this order.\"","They only earned 50,000 yuan, but they had added extra goods worth that amount.","The old director of the home had tears in his eyes, constantly holding her hand and saying, \"Thank you. Thank you to kind people like you!\"","Then the boss's wife asked, \"Do you know who this kind person is?\"","The welfare home director said, \"I believe it's the owner of Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","The boss's wife's eyes lit up when she heard this: \"I've heard of Starry Sky Kindergarten.\" But she hadn't heard about them doing charity work quietly like this.","She felt truly moved. She had seen too many people who sought fame and praise.","Some people would do a small deed and want everyone to know about it.","But there were also people who quietly did good deeds.","Very few people knew about it.","The boss's wife felt she should post this on the internet.","To let everyone know about this act of kindness.","She believed the internet could still be a warm place.","Finally, the boss's wife wrote a post, added pictures, and shared it online, tagging Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had a large following.","When people saw it, they were deeply moved.","Xu Wenwen, the stationery store owner, came across this post and commented that Starry Sky Kindergarten had bought many pencils, erasers, and pencil sharpeners from her online store.","She guessed it was also for charity.","She also shared her thought process, thinking at first that she had encountered a scammer.","She sincerely apologized to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She also promised not to make a profit and to send the items as additional donations.","The internet users were truly touched.","\"No wonder it's called Starry Sky Kindergarten. A single spark can start a prairie fire.\"","\"Sister Shen Wei, how many more secrets do you have that we don't know about?\"","\"This must be the true meaning of being an internet celebrity.\"","\"I'm moved to tears.\"","\"So, fellow Starry Sky fans, let's take action too.\"","\"Charity isn't something that can be accomplished by one person alone. Don't neglect small acts of kindness. I've decided to start with myself.\""]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259: Influence","paragraphs":["Shen Wei's decision to support orphanages had a profound impact on her fans.","Shen Wei's business was thriving at an unprecedented rate. The second branch of Starry Sky Kindergarten was even influencing property prices in the new district. Not to mention the enormous effect of her live streaming.","If Shen Wei hadn't turned off the donation feature during her live streams, she could have easily earned millions. Moreover, Shen Wei had opened Starry Sky Restaurant, instantly satisfying fans across the city who had been craving Starry Sky's cuisine.","Everyone who dined there claimed there wasn't a single dish that wasn't delicious. Of course, specialty dishes like braised pork belly, Buddha Jumps Over the Wall, and sizzling beef tendon were harder to come by. These dishes weren't easily ordered.","However, Starry Sky Restaurant was a place where you could order blindly. There was virtually no risk of disappointment.","Add to that the fact that over a hundred thousand people were simultaneously vying for tickets to the pop-up store, creating an immersive day trip experience that felt like scrambling for concert tickets of a beloved idol.","In other words, in the eyes of Starry Sky Kindergarten's fans, Shen Wei excelled at everything she did.","Everyone had an exceptionally high brand awareness of Starry Sky. As long as Shen Wei was involved, people would rush in blindly.","This kind of reputation effect alone made many industry bigwigs green with envy. It was something money couldn't buy, earned by Shen Wei through consistent hard work.","Now, the fruits of her labor were abundant.","Just when Starry Sky was at its peak, Shen Wei decided to engage in charity work. Although it seemed a bit off-track from her business, it truly moved people. As the saying goes, \"When poor, one should cultivate oneself; when prosperous, one should help others.\"","Many people shared Shen Wei's charitable acts online.","Whether it was purchasing a million yuan worth of goods from wholesale markets, or buying clothes and toys online, even causing some sellers to suspect fraud due to the large quantities.","Buying such vast amounts of items and distributing them to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Subsequently, these items were allocated and transferred to local orphanages, with volunteers helping to coordinate.","Shen Wei had never publicized this; it was all spontaneous behavior online.","People were worried that Shen Wei had done so much without anyone noticing.","Good people should be praised.","So many volunteers spoke up online.","Over the years, they had participated in numerous activities.","They often sent items to nursing homes and the like.","But every time they held an event, they had to take many photos and promote it multiple times.","This was understandable, after all, people had actually donated money.","But they had never seen anyone like Shen Wei before.","Massive donations, covering essentially all aspects of the children's daily needs, yet she never promoted her actions.","What excited people the most was Shen Wei's announcement to provide educational support for children from twenty orphanages.","Normally, children have nine years of compulsory education.","Local policies cover this for orphanages.","But compulsory education only goes up to junior high school graduation.","High school is not included.","Even with partial tuition waivers, it's still a significant expense for an orphanage without a steady income source.","So in recent years, orphanage children who could go on to university were as rare as phoenix feathers and unicorn horns.","Now Shen Wei promised.","Anyone who could get admitted, she would sponsor them all the way through university graduation.","This would cost an unimaginable amount of money.","The children are still young now.","This means that for the next 15 years, there would need to be continuous, comprehensive support for them.","The orphanages were overjoyed.","Perhaps in single-child families in big cities, studying is no longer the only path to success.","All roads lead to Rome.","They have various ways to achieve an outstanding life.","But for those at the bottom of society like in orphanages, education is the only way to change their fate.","Usually, when companies donate, they pick a few children they like.","They won't provide such comprehensive support.","Only Shen Wei made such a grand gesture.","It shocked all the people in the orphanages and these volunteers.","After the news spread online, Starry Sky's fans were also stunned.","Starry Sky had never had an official fan group.","But there were quite a few unofficial fan groups, and at this moment, they were exploding with activity.","\"Sisters, I want to do charity work too, but I've never been involved before. Can anyone guide me? I'm not very well-off, but I can contribute my efforts. I'm free every weekend, and I'm willing to travel!\"","\"Add me, I just contacted a program teaching underprivileged students in a mountain area. The educational conditions there are poor. We can bring some food when we go. You don't need to buy anything, I've bought it all. Let's go together.\"","\"Count me in!\"","\"I want to go too, but our family business really can't spare me. How about this, I'll donate 50,000 yuan.\"","\"Me too.\"","At this point, a group admin chimed in: \"I know everyone has the urge to do good deeds, but we must be careful to verify at this time. Don't let scammers take advantage of the situation. It's best to give money to institutions you trust.\"","Others said: \"Wow, even these unofficial admins are so responsible. I'm in love!\"","\"Indeed, fans follow their idol's lead. It's so lucky to be a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"To meet so many like-minded people.\"","\"I'm going to start doing good deeds too.\"","\"Actually, some good deeds don't necessarily require money or effort. Even picking up a piece of paper from the roadside counts as beautifying the environment.\"","\"That's right, let's start an initiative, beginning with ourselves!\"","\"Quick, I've already set up a hashtag on Weibo. Let's go check in now. Post all kinds of good deeds in the group.\"","Thus, the spontaneous activities of the fan group once again topped the trending topics.","Netizens marveled at how proactive these people were.","This hashtag group brought new touching stories every day.","Some people were rescuing animals, some were keeping elderly company in nursing homes.","Some even started a sanitary napkin aid project for girls in mountain areas.","Everyone was shining in their own field.","Even Shen Wei's parents said: \"We should do charity work too in the future.\"","Now Starry Sky was gradually becoming very standardized under Lin Rui's leadership.","There were management personnel at every level.","Shen Wei's parents had always been unofficial members, but everyone loved them very much.","Because they always sent red packets to everyone in the group.","They often made delicious bread and desserts for everyone voluntarily.","They were extremely kind and amiable.","These two had a strong sense of belonging to Starry Sky Kindergarten,","But this time they decided to leave Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Also inspired by Shen Wei, they wanted to do good deeds.","Shen's Father said: \"We've been lucky enough these years!\"","He was able to accumulate wealth entirely because he happened to be in the right place during several rounds of demolition and relocation.","He felt that this money was all bestowed by heaven.","It wasn't earned through his own abilities in the cutthroat business world.","Now he enjoyed the simplest pleasures.","They had money and social status.","They wanted to pursue a deeper spiritual connection.","Seeing Shen Wei doing charity work also seemed very meaningful.","Plus, the two of them had survived a major illness.","Their cancer was completely cured. This added to their gratitude towards heaven. All of this transformed into motivation for charity work.","Once Shen Wei's parents said this, the two of them set off for the mountain areas.","These days, the gap between rich and poor is vast.","As soon as they arrived, they sent short videos to Shen Wei.","They said the area was surrounded by green mountains and clear waters, the environment was particularly good.","They had even rented a small courtyard.","Where they could grow some vegetables.","Shen Wei specially selected premium seeds from her system.","Even beginners could grow very tasty produce.","Shen Wei was a bit worried.","But Shen's Father said: \"This is my career from now on!\"","Hearing this, Shen Wei couldn't argue.","She let them be.","But fortunately, they video called Shen Wei every day.","Telling her how wonderful the children there were.","Moreover, they had supported a local Hope Primary School.","They hired many teachers from the city with high salaries to teach the children in the mountain village.","They even donated a local library and a large playground.","Building a rubber track field in a mountain village.","It cost a fortune, but seeing the children's joyful smiles made it all worthwhile."]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260: Something Fishy Inside","paragraphs":["Shen Wei's parents went to the mountain village.","This made Gu Qingyan's parents feel a bit restless too.","Both sets of parents were connected on WeChat.","Every day they saw posts in their friends' circle about raising chickens and ducks, and fishing.","Occasionally, they would go and tell stories to the children.","They watched the kids running and jumping around in the playground.","It was truly healing.","Anyway, Gu Qingyan's parents had also reached retirement age.","They had grown tired of attending various banquets day after day, and instead longed for this kind of rural life.","The first time they saw it, they were just envious.","The second time, they felt a bit of yearning.","But as time went on, it turned into a desire to follow in their footsteps.","So they secretly contacted Shen Wei's parents.","Shen Wei's parents said: \"It's so wonderful here, we eat wild vegetables from the mountains, and the students are very grateful to us. They often go up the mountain to pick various vegetables for us.\"","\"It's very fresh and delicious, you can't get this in the city.\"","Hearing this, Gu Qingyan's parents became even more eager, saying: \"Then I'll come over too, we can be neighbors again!\"","\"Come on over!\" Shen Wei's parents said.","So the Gu couple went there as well.","As soon as they arrived, they were warmly welcomed by the local leaders.","The main hope was that these large enterprise groups would come to invest and build factories.","As long as there were factories, the local young people wouldn't migrate away excessively.","It could also revitalize local tax revenue and development.","Unfortunately, they had nothing to offer here.","Many investors came, took a look around, and left.","This time was just a routine reception.","After all, the Gu Corporation was so famous, their selection criteria would definitely be stricter.","But unexpectedly, Gu's Father decided to invest in this area.","He told the locals: \"I'm not focusing on the conditions of this place, but I want to make this place better.\"","The first to become wealthy should help those behind to achieve common prosperity.","He was also inspired by Shen Wei's charitable work.","This part of the money didn't come from the Gu Corporation.","Instead, he used his personal savings to build a garment factory for 1,000 people.","The whole county was suddenly in an uproar.","The old man had the Gu Corporation send a few people over for management.","The rest would all be recruited locally.","This suddenly created over 1,000 job positions.","The local government was also very sincere, directly offering a large area for them to build the factory.","Including employee dormitories and such.","The locals could also understand this account, they started making money as soon as the Gu Corporation decided to build a factory here.","Just building the factory and dormitories was a large sum of money.","And it could also drive the surrounding small businesses.","After it's built, they would still need to recruit locally, which were all good things for revitalizing the area.","Actually, building a factory in this place didn't align with Gu Corporation's usual interests.","Because the investment was too large and the income too low.","But seeing the happy smiles of the local leaders and the enthusiasm of the local people, Gu's Father was truly moved.","He even said to Gu Qingyan: \"We should learn from you young people too, giving roses to others leaves fragrance in hand.\"","They had done charity before, but it wasn't the same as what Shen Wei did. Helping others is also a kind of happiness.","Gu Qingyan's eyes shone brightly as he said: \"That's what I think too.\"","Gu Qingyan's awareness had improved.","He was always around Shen Wei, helping her in every way.","Even the rich second generation felt that going out partying wasn't that interesting anymore.","People are easily influenced. They all started doing charity work too.","They even competed with each other on this, seeing who could do better and more.","Although they couldn't compare to Shen Wei, it was still not bad.","No one knows when it started, but Shen Wei, this nouveau riche daughter, suddenly overtook everyone.","Even the real wealthy young ladies and gentlemen took her as a role model.","Shen Wei never thought that her small flutter of wings would cause such a huge butterfly effect.","The higher-ups even specially gave her an honorary citizen title.","People from Starry Sky Kindergarten all started donating money.","Shen Wei said it wasn't necessary.","Doctor Lu said: \"This is everyone's heartfelt intention, and I don't allow them to donate more than half of their salary. It's all within an acceptable range, so just take it.\"","Seeing that this love was truly weighty.","Shen Wei had no choice but to accept.","...","Recently, Shen Wei has been aiding multiple welfare institutions, but with her limited energy, most of the work is done by volunteers.","However, there was something strange about the aid request from one welfare institution.","This welfare institution only had about 40 children.","But they applied for a large amount of aid.","At first, Shen Wei sent aid according to their needs, about 1 million yuan worth of supplies.","Plus various stationery, clothes and other things the children needed, which were also sent over gradually. At that time, too many things were being handled at once. There were bound to be oversights, but after reviewing, she felt something was fishy.","So she booked a ticket, wanting to go and take a look.","How could the aid requirements for these few dozen be the same as for several hundred people?","Just as Shen Wei was about to take action, Gu Qingyan immediately packed his things and came over with his suitcase.","Shen Wei said: \"What are you doing?\"","Gu Qingyan looked hurt: \"Are you not planning to take me along this time either? I know I'm useless, but I can help carry things!\"","He spoke so humbly that Shen Wei shamefully softened her heart, and then said: \"Alright, let's go together!\" She booked a ticket for him too.","After arriving, they contacted the local volunteers.","They went to the B City Welfare Institute together.","This time it was a surprise inspection.","They hadn't informed the welfare institute beforehand.","\"Do you think there's something going on here?\" Gu Qingyan said.","Shen Wei said: \"Most likely there is.\"","Gu Qingyan was stunned: \"Why didn't you say so earlier, I could have brought more people!\" It's said that even a strong dragon can't suppress the local snake.","Shen Wei said: \"Let's see the specific situation when we get there.\"","Gu Qingyan said with a solemn face: \"No matter what, I will protect you.\"","Shen Wei smiled.","Gu Qingyan then puffed up his not-so-robust chest."]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261: The Fat Teacher in the Welfare Home","paragraphs":["Shen Wei told the taxi driver to go to the welfare institute, leaving him looking utterly confused.","The driver said, \"I've been in this city for so many years and I've never heard of a welfare institute!\"","Shen Wei then gave him the address. After navigating back and forth, they were almost out of the city before finally finding a trace of the welfare institute on a hillside in the suburbs.","Even the driver who dropped them off said, \"Thank goodness for GPS navigation, otherwise we really wouldn't have been able to find this place.\"","As soon as Shen Wei got out of the car, she saw volunteers wearing dark blue vests.","Looking at Shen Wei, one of them said, \"There might really be something going on in there.\"","The female volunteer now wore an expression full of regret.","She had been here several times and had been responsible for all the liaison work.","This included personally escorting the 1 million yuan worth of aid supplies that had been delivered a while ago.","She had rarely seen such a generous donor of supplies as Shen Wei.","Moreover, Shen Wei simply wanted to do charity work.","It was very pure.","She also sincerely admired people like Shen Wei.","She never expected things to go wrong under her watch.","The volunteer immediately took off her vest and said she wanted to take Shen Wei somewhere.","She then led Shen Wei to climb a wild mountain. They weren't following any path; they were stepping on various tree branches to climb up.","The volunteer said, \"This is how I usually walk when I go to the mountain villages for volunteer teaching. You might not be used to it.\"","Shen Wei replied, \"It's alright, we can manage.\"","They went directly around to the back of the mountain, where the forest became increasingly dense.","From a distance, crouching in the woods, they spotted a small four-wheeled truck that was loading goods.","One by one, they were the rice, flour, and oil that they had donated earlier.","Moreover, this truck had words like \"So-and-so Grain Shop\" written on it.","The female volunteer was almost dying of shame: \"I really didn't think they were this kind of people.\"","The female volunteer had been puzzled when she heard that Shen Wei wanted to come alone today.","When she arrived, she found an empty truck from a grain shop going up the mountain, and she immediately felt something was wrong.","Following the wild path up, she discovered these people were actually taking away all the previously donated supplies.","By now, they had already loaded half a truck.","It was obvious they were selling the supplies donated by kind-hearted people to other places.","Wasn't this blatant fraud?","The volunteer took out her phone and filmed for a while, making sure to capture the license plate number clearly.","They couldn't let these people get too brazen.","She felt like she had let down Shen Wei's trust.","After finishing the video, she asked, \"So what do you plan to do?\" The volunteer truly felt it wasn't worth it for Shen Wei.","She had donated real money to do charity.","But they ended up encountering this kind of reselling.","How many people would want this kind of aid but couldn't get it?","Shen Wei said, \"Let's go over directly, but don't startle them yet!\"","The female volunteer had been at a loss, but hearing Shen Wei's words, she immediately felt like she had found a leader. She said, \"Alright, let's go together.\"","They then made their difficult descent down the mountain.","They went around to the front and knocked directly on the gate of the welfare institute.","The welfare institute had a large, long-neglected iron gate that looked very dilapidated.","There were even cobwebs on top of the iron gate.","After Shen Wei knocked on the door, they heard an impatient voice from inside saying, \"Who is it?\"","Then they heard the volunteer say, \"It's me, Little Jia.\"","Only then did the person on the other side open the door.","The one who opened the door was a fat woman who had undergone an eyebrow lift surgery, making her whole appearance look somewhat harsh.","Seeing the volunteer, and then glancing at Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan behind her, she said, \"Oh, and who might these two be?\"","The volunteer said, \"Oh, these are the kind-hearted donors who came to donate supplies a while ago. They've come to take a look this time.\"","When the fat woman heard that the donors had come, her expression immediately changed.","Everyone present knew why her expression had changed so drastically.","Because they were still loading their goods at the back door. At this moment, the fat woman became anxious and said, \"Why didn't you tell us earlier that you were coming?\"","The volunteer said, \"Is it inconvenient?\"","The woman was also quick-witted and said, \"Oh, it's not inconvenient at all. It's just that if you had told us earlier, we could have prepared a proper reception!\"","She paused and then added, \"Thanks to your generous donation, otherwise the children would have run out of food!\"","As she finished speaking, she wiped her eyes with her sleeve.","She managed to rub her eyes red.","The volunteer said, \"Well then, shall we go in?\" The fat woman, afraid they would walk to the back courtyard, squeezed her fat body to one side and led them forward.","Shen Wei took a look around. The children here were all thin and sickly, with lifeless eyes.","Then the volunteer introduced the fat woman's identity to Shen Wei: \"She's the cook here!\"","The fat woman, upon hearing this, added dissatisfiedly, \"And also a teacher.\"","\"Oh!\" Shen Wei responded carelessly, then asked, \"Where are the clothes I donated a while ago? I don't see the children wearing them.\"","She thought these children rarely bought new clothes.","Most of their clothes were donated by caring people in society.","She thought that children would be happier wearing new clothes. The clothes Shen Wei bought were all brand-name items.","The fat woman said, \"These children are very sensible. After receiving the new clothes, they didn't want to wear them. They said they wanted to save them for the New Year.\"","Seeing Shen Wei arrive, several children looked up.","Compared to the chubby, well-fed children at Starry Sky Kindergarten, these children looked very dull.","Shen Wei beckoned, and a little girl came over.","The fat woman introduced her, saying this little girl was already 12 years old.","Shen Wei was shocked, because the child in front of her looked extremely thin and weak.","She couldn't tell at all that this child was 12.","Finally, she asked, \"Where do they go to school?\"","\"They've never been to school.\"","Shen Wei was somewhat shocked.","The fat woman said, \"These children were all abandoned by their parents. They have extreme personalities. When they went to school, they were a bit light-fingered and were sent back. After that, they didn't want to go to school anymore!\"","Hearing the fat woman say this, the children didn't refute.","Shen Wei felt uncomfortable with her choice of words.","These children were also strange. At first, she wasn't sure why she felt uncomfortable.","But after a while, she realized.","These children were numb.","That's right.","The volunteer also asked, \"Is the supplies we donated last time still enough?\"","The volunteer asked this on purpose.","The fat woman's heart skipped a beat: \"It's still enough, still enough.\"","Her face wore a dry smile, and then she said, \"I'll ask the director to come back and properly entertain you!\"","Her composure was failing, and she was afraid that cold sweat would break out and give her away.","After saying this, she turned and left.","She also called over a few of the more quick-witted boys.","Seeing that Shen Wei, Gu Qingyan, and the volunteer didn't follow, the fat woman breathed a slight sigh of relief. Then she quietly said to these quick-witted boys, \"Later, no matter what they say, you must learn from me when you come back, understand?\"","These little boys said, \"Understood!\"","The fat woman continued, \"Make our situation sound more miserable. These people are rich.\"","The children here had been exposed to the darkness of society too early and understood a lot. Their young age was their biggest asset.","Usually, the fat woman gave them some small privileges, making them feel like little tyrants.","Getting privileges also meant paying a price, and the price now was obedience.","After the fat woman left, these little boys crowded around Gu Qingyan, reaching out for money.","They looked just like the little beggars who pester people outside scenic spots.","Gu Qingyan had indeed brought some cash when she went out. She then took out her wallet and gave each of these children 100 yuan.","These children usually couldn't even spend 10 yuan in their daily lives.","A hundred yuan was a large sum for them.","\"We want to go out for a while!\" The children were anxious.","They wanted to spend this 100 yuan. Buy some spicy strips, instant noodles, and so on. Once turned into goods, they would be theirs.","Later, they could tell the fat woman that others had asked them to buy these things.","If they didn't spend it now, it would end up in the fat woman's hands in the end.","Seeing the potential for profit, the children immediately forgot the fat woman's requirements.","\"Go ahead,\" Shen Wei said.","These tyrannical children scattered in an instant."]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262: What Is the True Face","paragraphs":["About 10 minutes later, the sound of a car engine roaring could be heard outside.","Clearly, the driver was pushing the accelerator to the floor.","The Director entered. He was a middle-aged man.","Upon entering, he immediately greeted Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan.","In truth, this middle-aged man had quite a talent for deception.","He began by expressing immense gratitude to Shen Wei.","\"We really can't thank you kind-hearted people enough. Without you, such a small place like ours would never get any attention.\"","\"You've been incredibly thoughtful. Everything you've donated is exactly what we need right now. The children are overjoyed.\"","His eyes brimmed with what appeared to be utmost sincerity as he spoke.","But Shen Wei felt not an ounce of fondness for him.","After all, she had witnessed with her own eyes how they had resold the donated supplies to a grain store.","She had also seen how the Fat Woman had treated them with suspicion, as if they were thieves.","And then there was the fact that the children in their care were so terribly thin and weak.","Even if their conditions were truly poor, with Shen Wei's donations, the children should have been much better off.","Shen Wei understood human greed, which is why she had deliberately avoided donating money.","She never imagined that despite all her precautions, things would still go wrong.","Shen Wei simply said, \"As long as the children are well, that's all that matters.\"","The Director replied, \"I'm so pleased you've come. I don't have much prepared, but I'll tell the kitchen to make a feast. Let's all have a good meal with the children.\"","He then added, \"Where are those few children?\" The Director knew that the mischievous little boys were the Fat Woman's informants. Their absence made him slightly uneasy.","Shen Wei said, \"We sent them to buy snacks at the store.\"","The Director laughed and scolded playfully, \"These kids, always so naughty. It's good they didn't cause you any trouble. Well then, shall I show you around?\"","Shen Wei, her interest waning, declined: \"That won't be necessary.\"","The Director, looking somewhat embarrassed, said, \"Our conditions here are indeed limited. Well then, I'll go to the kitchen and give some instructions, see what we can prepare.\"","\"Alright, please go ahead,\" Shen Wei replied.","The volunteers had maintained unfriendly expressions throughout.","Previously, they had looked down on the Fat Woman but considered the Director to be a good person.","They had felt a special sincerity about him.","But now it seemed he was involved in this mess too.","If he hadn't given his approval, the Fat Woman wouldn't have dared to make such big decisions on her own.","The Director went to the kitchen, where he found the Fat Woman chopping frozen chicken with loud, rhythmic thuds. Who knew how long it had been frozen; the chicken had changed color.","The Director immediately took charge: \"Take out the pork ribs and large shrimp we bought yesterday.\"","The Fat Woman was reluctant to part with them.","The Director quickly said, \"Do you know who those people in there are? Just the luxury clothes they're wearing are worth tens of thousands. What's a bit of food compared to that? They might even donate more money to us!\"","At the mention of money, the Fat Woman's eyes lit up. \"Well, that would be wonderful!\"","Suddenly, she saw Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei as foolish rich people.","Her enthusiasm for cooking increased dramatically.","The Director then asked in a low voice, \"How did things go in the back yard?\"","He was worried that someone might have discovered them reselling the donations.","The Fat Woman, still shaken by the close call, replied, \"Luckily it was all at the back door. These people didn't see anything. I sent them away after loading only half a truck.\"","The workers had been a bit disgruntled, having expected a full truck but only getting to load half.","The Director said, \"I told their boss we're good friends. It's fine, as long as they've gone.\"","He then added, \"You keep cooking. I'm going back.\" He was mainly concerned about leaving Shen Wei alone with the children.","As expected, these children had been conditioned to be extremely timid.","Shen Wei now found herself in a dilemma.","If she handed over the evidence she had recorded to the police, it would only result in a financial penalty.","But since coming here, she had discovered that the children were in terrible condition.","A simple economic punishment wouldn't faze the orphanage staff.","But what about the children? What would happen to them?","As Shen Wei pondered this predicament,","Suddenly, the 12-year-old Little Girl from earlier approached her. \"Please don't buy us clothes anymore. We never get to wear those expensive clothes anyway!\"","Shen Wei seemed to have a natural affinity with children, and being a kindergarten teacher, many children were drawn to her.","\"Why not?\" Shen Wei probed.","The Little Girl explained, \"The clothes you gave us before were all taken away by him and given to his relatives' children. He said we don't deserve to wear such nice things.\"","The volunteer, herself just a young woman, was so angered by this that she wanted to curse.","They never imagined that the Director, who always acted so proper, could do such things behind their backs.","The girl was about to say more when she looked up and saw,","through the transparent glass outside the room, the Director's enormous face.","The man was staring intently at her through the glass.","The girl swallowed her words.","The Director then pushed open the door. He put on a troubled smile and said, \"This child. I really don't know what to say.\"","He then asked Shen Wei to come outside, saying he had something to discuss. Gu Qingyan and the volunteer followed.","The Director said, \"I overheard that child telling you not to donate clothes. I'm really afraid you might misunderstand.\"","\"Children in this environment often develop a sense of rivalry. Just because the clothes we distribute are random and not to her liking, she cuts them up and spreads these lies!\"","\"She even accuses the teachers of favoritism. She's been adopted three times before, but always returned, all because of her habit of lying.\"","\"She probably saw that you were easy to talk to and started telling these stories again!\"","Shen Wei said lightly, \"Oh well, children will be children.\"","The Director studied Shen Wei's face intently.","Seeing that Shen Wei seemed genuinely unconcerned, he finally relaxed and said, \"We'll have a good meal today!\"","For lunch, the Fat Woman truly pulled out all the stops.","But Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan were used to Liu Chef's cooking. Their palates were already spoiled.","They barely touched the food here.","Instead, they kept adding dishes to the children's plates.","They gave the children the large black tiger prawns.","At first, the children didn't dare to eat them.","Finally, the Director said, \"Go ahead, eat up!\"","Only then did the children dare to pick up their chopsticks.","The Fat Woman was furious. Those black tiger prawns cost over 100 yuan per pound.","They were meant to impress the important guests.","She never expected these ungrateful brats to eat them. The very thought made her blood boil.","After the meal, the visitors left. The volunteers' expressions were grim. They told Shen Wei to contact them when she decided to take action.","They also sent Shen Wei the video of the orphanage reselling the donations.","Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei returned to their hotel.","Gu Qingyan hadn't said a word the entire way back.","After all, they had been in someone else's territory, and they didn't know who might have connections to the orphanage staff.","He had forcibly held his tongue the entire journey.","As soon as they reached the hotel, he burst out, \"What do we do now?\"","Even he had noticed that something was very wrong with that orphanage.","At that moment, Shen Wei accessed the system monitoring the orphanage in her brain.","Sure enough, after the guests had left, the Director and the Fat Woman teacher began to show their true colors.","And all of this was playing out in Shen Wei's mind."]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263: Under Surveillance","paragraphs":["At the welfare institute, after Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan left, the dean revealed his true face.","With a ferocious expression, he grabbed the 12-year-old Little Girl's hair and slammed her hard onto the ground.","The Little Girl fell sitting on the floor, but didn't dare to cry out.","Nearby, the Fat Woman had found a broom from somewhere. It had no bristles left, having long since been worn away.","The handle had faint dark red spots, as if blood had dried on it.","Moreover, they beat people completely openly, as if to make an example.","Everyone was in the classroom. Some timid girls even closed their eyes.","There were also some boys who were closer to this 12-year-old girl who wanted to rush forward, but were held back tightly by the smaller children around them.","They were too young.","Even if they rushed up, they couldn't save her, and would just get beaten for nothing. This kind of thing had happened before.","The Fat Woman's voice was extremely shrill: \"Well, talking nonsense in front of guests. Feeling important, are we?\"","\"You little bitch, don't think those few words can change others' impressions.\"","\"I think your skin is itching, three days without a beating and you're up to no good.\"","Finally, she said to the Male Dean: \"This kind of person just has cheap skin, if you don't give her a few licks she won't know who's boss.\"","Fear showed in the Little Girl's eyes, but she still managed to say firmly: \"What you're doing is wrong.\"","The Male Dean laughed. But his smile was full of gloom: \"Whether what I do is right or wrong, I don't need you to tell me!\"","He reached out his hand, and the broom was in it. Then he struck the Little Girl hard on her back.","Instantly there was a burning red mark.","The Little Girl was very thin and weak.","How could she withstand the beating of a grown man?","She fell to the ground with a scream of pain.","The surrounding children didn't dare make a sound. They all seemed frightened out of their wits.","The broom seemed to have eyes. It specifically targeted the most painful areas.","It fell heavily on her body again and again.","The girl had clearly been beaten before.","She only used her hands to protect her head.","\"Bitch!\" The Male Dean not only hit her himself, but also kicked her.","He was a full-grown man, and he kicked the child more than a meter away.","She crashed into the wall.","The child hung her head, as if dead.","But the Fat Woman beside him was not satisfied.","A big investor had come today.","This little bitch had almost ruined it with one sentence, so she said: \"Don't you fucking play dead!\" Then she pounced on her and twisted the inside of her thigh with her hand.","People who cook for years have strong hands.","It was just like a pair of pliers. The Little Girl had originally been beaten almost to the point of fainting.","But in the midst of this immense pain, she let out another cry of anguish.","No one present intervened.","After the two of them punched and kicked for a while,","Finally, the Male Dean's rationality returned, and he said: \"We'll let you off today.\"","The Fat Woman clearly hadn't had enough, feeling it was too lenient to let her off like this.","So she said: \"This little bitch talks nonsense. Why don't we cut out her tongue? To keep her from being so troublesome.\"","The Male Dean snorted coldly, then took out a cheap erythromycin ointment from his pocket and threw it into the crowd: \"Apply this to her later!\" Then he turned and left.","The Fat Woman followed him back, somewhat confused.","The Fat Woman then followed the Male Dean back to the office.","One look at the Male Dean's eyes, which had turned red, and she knew he was aroused at that moment.","He definitely needed to find someone to vent his urges on.","So the Fat Woman swayed her hips as she went over.","The two of them shamelessly did unspeakable things in the office.","Afterwards, the Male Dean directly took out 10,000 yuan from the office desk drawer and gave it to the Fat Woman.","The Fat Woman's face lit up with joy, and her gaze grew even more tender.","This Fat Woman's looks would be completely unremarkable in a crowd.","However, her body was incredibly soft, and being fat, the feeling was unbelievably wonderful.","Since becoming the Male Dean's mistress,","Not only did she experience supreme power,","But the Male Dean also gave her money from time to time, which made her extremely happy.","At this moment, after the two of them finished,","The Male Dean casually used a few sheets of paper to wipe himself clean.","He didn't bother at all with the woman who had just been entangled with him.","This Fat Woman didn't mind either. She put on her clothes by herself.","They both had their own families.","But this atmosphere, similar to stealing, seemed particularly exciting.","At this moment, the Fat Woman said: \"Why didn't we punish that little bitch more severely just now?\"","The Male Dean said: \"What do you know? What if the investor comes back and sees?\"","A hint of viciousness flashed in the Fat Woman's eyes: \"We could just say she was adopted and taken away. There are plenty of ways.\"","The Fat Woman used to be an ordinary person, not so cruel-hearted.","But since coming to this welfare institute, a secluded unit on the hillside,","Plus being surrounded by children who couldn't even tie a chicken,","She became like a mountain tyrant.","Over time, she felt unprecedented power.","She was slightly better to the boys, but always disliked the girls.","This 12-year-old Little Girl had caused trouble more than once.","Thinking of this, the Fat Woman hated her so much her teeth itched.","The Male Dean said: \"Although this child hasn't grown up yet, there are quite a few people who like this type. Let's keep her for now, she'll naturally be of great use later.\"","Hearing this, the Fat Woman's face broke into a smile: \"The dean really is clever!\" Her voice was sticky, believing herself to be very charming.","However, apart from doing the deed, the Male Dean found her unattractive face nauseating.","The Male Dean's eyes showed some disgust: \"No one is allowed to enter the office!\"","There were remarkable things in the safe in the office.","For example, those big bosses with special fetishes, each one someone he couldn't afford to offend.","\"Don't worry, I won't come when you're not here. It's just that Volunteer who's annoying. Always coming for no reason! Just donate things and leave quickly, why keep coming to see the children? I heard he's 28 and not married yet. He doesn't get married or have children himself, but keeps looking at other people's children all day. How is that any different from a hen that doesn't lay eggs?\"","The Fat Woman gossiped like a village auntie.","But the Male Dean couldn't be bothered to listen: \"Get out.\"","He always disowned people after pulling up his pants. The Fat Woman wasn't annoyed. She sauntered out with her 10,000 yuan.","All of this was livestreamed to Shen Wei by the System.","Shen Wei then consulted with the System, asking if it was possible to record both of the scenes she had just seen.","The System said: \"Yes, it will cost 5,000 points. Additionally, for 10,000 points, we can install cameras in the classroom and office for real-time monitoring!\"","Shen Wei thought for a moment and exchanged 10,000 points."]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264: Danger Approaches","paragraphs":["Gu Qingyan waved his hand in front of Shen Wei's face, finally bringing her back to reality.","Gu Qingyan looked at Shen Wei with concern and asked, \"What were you thinking about?\"","Shen Wei had clearly been lost in thought, her expression somewhat grim.","Shen Wei was at a loss for words.","The situation had suddenly become much more complicated.","She had initially thought it was just a simple case of embezzlement at the welfare home.","She never imagined it would uncover such inhumane activities.","Whether it was children being beaten or involved in special \"services\", these were things Shen Wei absolutely could not tolerate.","Now that things were getting more and more complex, Shen Wei said, \"I need to make a phone call.\"","The call she made was to the bodyguard of the young master of the Liu Family.","It was the same personal bodyguard who had successfully put on weight while at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He and Shen Wei had become quite close.","Shen Wei's security team had been chosen with his help.","He was very accommodating and had hired all tall, handsome men over 1.8 meters.","This had inadvertently made the kindergarten and pop-up store go viral again.","They were security personnel, but they also took on some special assignments.","Especially when working for wealthy families, their roles sometimes bordered on that of private investigators.","Shen Wei had never dealt with this aspect before.","When she contacted him now, he was quite confused.","Shen Wei said, \"I've run into some trouble while handling business out of town. Could you send me someone who's particularly skilled? I need them to help me with some special matters.\"","Upon hearing this, the bodyguard immediately became serious.","His professionalism was evident as he didn't ask for details, only inquiring about their location before saying, \"Someone will be there to find you in two hours!\"","He had always been the core of the security team.","Sending one person wasn't a difficult task.","Shen Wei didn't hide the phone call from Gu Qingyan.","Gu Qingyan was very anxious.","He knew something major must have happened.","But at the moment, he couldn't help.","So, suppressing his nervous feelings, he waited for an hour until they heard a knock on the door, announcing room service.","Shen Wei opened the door, and a young man in a hotel uniform entered, his first words being, \"I'm here to carry out the mission. What do you need me to do?\"","He had arrived an hour earlier than expected.","The young man was about 1.7 meters tall, with an utterly unremarkable appearance.","He had the kind of face you'd forget immediately after seeing it in a crowd.","But this made him perfect for the job.","He had been on vacation.","But he was urgently assigned a task by his superiors.","Shen Wei instructed him to infiltrate the welfare home on the hillside.","He was to open the safe in the director's office and photograph all the documents inside.","The man nodded quickly after hearing this.","Then he left.","Shen Wei was nervous and directly contacted Professor Liu, hoping to establish some connections with higher-ups through him.","Professor Liu immediately understood that something serious had happened and began searching through his contacts.","People of his national-level status could reach the highest levels of authority.","Although Shen Wei was an internet celebrity, this matter had already exceeded her capabilities.","Being out of town, they couldn't risk alerting anyone, but they still wanted to take action, making it very difficult to maintain the right balance.","After a while, Professor Liu replied with a string of numbers, only saying that the person's surname was Zhong.","He told her to contact this number directly.","Shen Wei didn't waste any time and called. Someone quickly answered: \"You must be Shen Wei, what's the matter?\" It was a middle-aged man. Shen Wei immediately explained the situation at the welfare home.","The face on the other end of the line gradually became serious.","He hadn't expected this kind of situation either.","Ever since Shen Wei had facilitated the development of the holographic gaming pod, she had become a key talent protected by the higher-ups.","Usually, they just kept a watchful eye on her from afar.","They never expected that Shen Wei's visit to a welfare home would uncover so many dark secrets.","The welfare home was involved in child trafficking, beating children, and even engaging in illicit activities in the office.","There were even some utterly unconscionable things being said.","Gu Qingyan listened from the side, his expression growing increasingly troubled.","If it weren't for Shen Wei being on the phone, he would have started cursing.","How could there be such inhuman beasts?","Shen Wei then added Mr. Zhong on WeChat and sent over two video clips.","One showed the male director viciously beating a child.","The recording was done by the system.","As expected of the most advanced AI, the recording was very clear.","All the sounds were captured.","The second clip showed the typical transaction between the fat woman and the male director.","This was no longer just about embezzlement at the welfare home.","It had escalated to a criminal level.","The most important thing was the chilling implications in his words.","Such as wanting to cut out children's tongues.","Or sending children to wealthy individuals.","Each and every one of these acts broke the moral bottom line of humanity.","The other party finally understood why Shen Wei had insisted on making this call.","If Shen Wei had reported this to the police, she didn't know how much influence the other party had locally.","Once alerted, it would become difficult to handle.","So it was better to go through the trouble.","By contacting the real higher-ups through someone else, the male director would be powerless.","Mr. Zhong, understanding all of this, also admired Shen Wei's courage and wisdom.","With these two pieces of evidence in hand, they could already convict those two.","He said to Shen Wei, \"Thank you very much for this evidence. It's very valuable. Don't worry, leave everything to me.\"","Shen Wei said, \"I've also sent someone to photograph the contents of their safe!\"","She hoped this matter could be resolved quickly.","She was really worried about the children in the kindergarten.","It was a den of wolves, every extra minute meant more danger.","The other party said, \"I understand your concerns. Leave this matter to us now. You've already done more than enough preparation. If you can get the evidence, that's great, but if not, it's okay too.\"","In just a few sentences, Shen Wei had cleared the path for the covert photography mission.","Then Shen Wei sent over the surveillance camera feeds she had set up there.","The other party received them like a treasure: \"On behalf of the children, thank you.\"","After hanging up the phone.","Gu Qingyan was almost furious: \"If we had known they were this kind of people, we should have dealt with them harshly from the beginning. It's so infuriating! What do we do next?\"","Shen Wei said one word: \"Wait.\"","...","The male director didn't know why, but ever since he had returned earlier, his right eye had been twitching.","As the old saying goes, left eye twitching means fortune, right eye twitching means disaster.","It felt as if danger was about to descend.","Usually, he didn't live there. It was the fat woman who stayed there, keeping an eye on the children.","But at this moment, he couldn't even focus on driving. It felt like a flame was burning in his heart.","He had a very strong sixth sense.","This sixth sense had helped him avoid many disasters in the past.","Now, wanting to find some protection for himself, he immediately called Mr. Xu from Feng Group, saying he had good merchandise to send over in the next few days.","Upon hearing this, the other party immediately started calling him brother and even transferred 500,000 yuan to his phone.","Only after receiving the money did he feel a bit more at ease.","Just then, suddenly, his phone started blaring an alarm.","The urgent beeping made him even more flustered.","The male director immediately pulled out his phone to check, and found that someone was tampering with his safe.","He had installed an infrared system on the safe.","It would send out an alarm if anyone approached.","As a cunning person, this was a safeguard he had set up for himself.","For years, it had been peaceful.","But today it suddenly went off, making him feel that something was wrong. He cursed, \"Damn it!\"","He immediately turned the car around and headed back to the welfare home."]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265: Death Comes to Those Who Do Evil","paragraphs":["The Male Dean floored the accelerator, pushing the speed to its limit.","To climb the mountain, the wheels of his SUV began to spin.","He had never driven so recklessly before. Finally, the car came to a steady stop at the back door.","The back door was closer to his office, which was how he had designed it. In case anything went wrong, it would be convenient for a quick escape.","The Male Dean's palms were sweaty. He unlocked the door and immediately rushed up the stairs, taking three steps at a time.","As soon as he entered his office, he noticed a dark figure inside.","In that instant, blood rushed to the Male Dean's head.","The intruder wore a large mask. Seeing him, they remained calm. His safe was open, and the intruder held a stack of documents from inside, tapping them casually.","The Male Dean's anger soared to the heavens. In that moment, he even forgot his own lack of physical strength.","He immediately drew a knife from his waist and lunged at the intruder.","His mind was focused on one thought: he absolutely could not let the intruder take these files.","The intruder had no desire for a prolonged fight, but didn't drop what was in their hands.","The Male Dean steeled himself, aiming to take the intruder's life.","Though the Male Dean was no professional, he had been working out over the years.","His strength was decent. Just then, he heard the Fat Woman's cursing voice from outside: \"Damn it, who the hell is up at this hour? I'll beat you little bastards to death if I find out.\"","The Male Dean felt a surge of hope.","He was struggling to control the thief on his own.","But with the Fat Woman's help, he was confident they could overpower the intruder.","At this moment, the Male Dean asked, \"Who sent you?\"","He quickly realized: \"Was it Shen Wei who sent you?\"","How coincidental that right after Shen Wei left, someone came to steal documents.","The key was that this particular file was top secret.","The Male Dean hadn't thought of Shen Wei initially, but could things really be this coincidental?","Thinking this, the Male Dean felt goosebumps all over his body.","The other party must have sensed something before leaving, coupled with what that damn girl had blurted out.","Even as the Male Dean was grappling with the masked man,","He could still spare a thought for other matters.","If he had known earlier, he should have killed that little girl.","She really was nothing but trouble.","Just then, suddenly, a voice broke through the door: \"Freeze!\"","Then a group of armed police officers rushed in.","The Male Dean's heart sank, and he instinctively raised his hands.","Then came a crisp sound of metal hitting the floor as the knife dropped.","The Fat Woman was so frightened by the situation outside that she nearly wet herself.","Trembling, she was escorted in by two police officers.","The Fat Woman said, \"I have nothing to do with this!\"","The Male Dean was nearly in despair. He couldn't let them get that document.","In a final desperate move, he charged towards the masked man, intending to tear up the paper and swallow it, just like in the movies.","The list of names on it was a matter of life and death.","Although his sudden burst of energy caught the other off guard,","The opponent was a security professional found by the team. A young man freshly discharged from the military, in his prime, there was no way the Male Dean could easily overpower him.","The earlier struggle was because he wanted to fully document the evidence, showing some restraint. In a real confrontation, even ten Male Deans wouldn't be a match.","So with one dodge, the Male Dean twisted his back. He tried to charge again.","But the opportunity was lost.","He was already considered a dangerous individual, so with a loud bang,","Accompanied by a scream of pain, a large hole appeared in his leg.","The police escorted the Male Dean and the Fat Woman out.","Outside, many cars were parked.","In an instant, the Male Dean's face turned ashen.","Shen Wei, Gu Qingyan, and the Volunteer arrived at the orphanage after receiving notification. It was already 1:30 AM.","The entire orphanage was brightly lit.","Gentle Female Police Officers were maintaining order here, while also taking care of the children.","To prevent the children from exhibiting any extreme behaviors.","However, their concerns were unnecessary.","These children were dazed and unresponsive, showing no reaction to the major events unfolding around them.","The Volunteer wanted to find the twelve-year-old Little Girl.","But was informed: \"That child has been taken to the hospital. She had multiple fractures and was covered in blood!\"","When the Female Police Officer carried the girl to the ambulance,","The girl's alarmingly light weight and her body covered in injuries made her want to beat the Male Dean to a pulp. He was hardly human.","Only now did the Volunteer learn of the enormous crimes committed at the orphanage.","It wasn't just about reselling goods.","There were also some gray industry practices.","Those things were unspeakable, particularly disgusting.","Besides that, there was child abuse, and the Male Dean and Fat Woman's monetary and sexual transactions, all criminal matters.","More importantly, they had obtained the dean's phone.","The contents of the safe were also retrieved. The Male Dean had kept leverage on the wealthy people he worked for.","To prevent them from betraying him. This had been his lifeline in the past.","Now it became evidence for the court.","The evidence was so solid that there was no room for argument.","More importantly, it implicated many well-known figures in the business world.","Each of them presented a highly respectable image on the surface, while engaging in these despicable acts behind the scenes.","The Volunteer's tears flowed quickly: \"I can't believe I didn't notice!\" She was the person who had visited the orphanage the most.","Before, she had only thought these children were introverted.","Possibly due to the special environment of the orphanage.","She had no idea these children had been living under the control of such scum for years.","The Volunteer raised her hand and slapped herself hard across the face.","The crisp sound made even those around her wince in sympathy.","Unsatisfied with just one slap, she raised her hand to strike again.","The first slap had already drawn blood from the corner of her mouth.","As she was about to deliver the second slap, Shen Wei caught her hand precisely: \"There are still many things to handle here, don't be too impulsive. Besides, this isn't your fault.\"","Hearing that there were still follow-up matters to attend to, the Volunteer regained her composure.","The next steps involved providing psychological treatment for all these children.","Trying to find adoptive families for them as much as possible.","If not, then finding foster families.","If all else failed, the children would be transferred to other orphanages.","The Volunteer said: \"Don't worry, this time I'll make sure every child is properly taken care of.\"","The Volunteer looked at Shen Wei with gratitude in her eyes. If it weren't for Shen Wei's intervention,","Even if she had known about this situation, she would likely have been powerless to change anything.","After all, this vicious Male Dean had formed a massive network with wealthy individuals.","They were untouchable.","Ordinary citizens would find it nearly impossible to shake their power.","Unexpectedly, Shen Wei came in and managed to blow the lid off everything.","Such a major discovery in just one day.","It was clear how much effort Shen Wei had put in behind the scenes.","The Volunteer's heart was full of gratitude.","It took an entire day to process everything.","That night, many high-level executives from various companies were taken away.","All their phones were confiscated.","The sudden turn of events led many to inquire online.","But no one knew exactly what had happened.","After three days, an announcement was finally made.","\"Following a report from concerned citizens, the orphanage dean Chen X, 45 years old, has been arrested by the police on suspicion of child abuse, fraud, sexual transactions, and other offenses.\"","This news was quickly buried in the vast sea of internet information.","The fewer the words, the bigger the matter.","People didn't think too deeply about it. But there were smart individuals in the companies whose bosses had been taken away and never returned. Everyone was vying for the vacant positions.","Although they didn't know what their bosses had done, there would be no place for them if they returned.","Corporate struggles are always merciless."]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266: Irony","paragraphs":["Shen Wei was busy for 20 consecutive days.","Only after settling the last child did she finally heave a sigh of relief.","At that moment, a series of mechanical sounds rang in her mind: \"Congratulations to Shen Wei for altering 20% of the original story plot and completely changing her fate.\"","\"Reward: A large-scale pig farm with 10,000 pigs in the enclosure.\"","\"After calculation, as of now, the system points balance is 25,874 points. It has been automatically converted to 100 million yuan and deposited into your bank account.\"","\"The Super kindergarten system has perfectly completed all tasks and is now unbinding from host Shen Wei.\"","\"Unbinding will be complete in 5 seconds.\"","\"5\"","\"4\"","\"3\"","\"2\"","\"1\"","\"Unbinding complete.\"","In an instant, Shen Wei felt a lightness throughout her body.","But her phone kept ringing.","As soon as Shen Wei answered the call, she heard the other end say: \"Hello, Boss Shen. I'm Factory Manager Liu, the current manager of the pig farm. Our old manager has transferred the entire factory to you. When would you like to come for an inspection? We have genuine, premium large white pigs here. They can grow up to 800 pounds in a year. We already have 2,000 large pigs and 8,000 piglets!\" He spoke with pride.","Shen Wei inquired about the location. The system had always been meticulous in its arrangements. This pig farm was right next to Shen Wei's original pig farm. The location was very close and convenient.","With this pig farm, the Starry Sky Restaurant wouldn't have to worry about meat supplies anymore.","Finally, she checked her phone again: there was a text message notification to open and view the bank account deposit of 100 million yuan.","Shen Wei had previously wanted to do charity work and donate to 20 welfare institutions.","At that time, Gu Qingyan had sold her two luxury homes for 102 million yuan.","Now that everything had settled, Shen Wei thought about buying that house back.","So she contacted a real estate agent.","Upon hearing this, the agent said: \"Those two houses were bought by someone else long ago, but there are two even better ones available. Speaking of these houses, you should have heard that they used to belong to the Lu Family.\"","The Lu Family had also seized an opportunity to buy luxury homes from others.","These two houses had established their status in the upper-class circle.","However, their family affairs were too troublesome.","Even the real estate agent knew about it, let alone the entire upper class.","It was said that Lu Zheng and Shen Qingqing often came to make trouble after she got pregnant, trying to seize the Lu Family's assets.","But the Old Man already had a child.","They almost fell victim to this couple's poisoning attempt.","The young wife had been frightened to tears several times.","The Old Man had no choice but to kick these two out completely.","He said even if they ended up on the streets, he wouldn't take them back.","These two were living rough outside, with poor food and clothing. Naturally, the child wasn't kept, and Shen Qingqing miscarried at 4 months.","This made Shen Qingqing even more deranged.","She mailed the miscarried fetus to the Old Man.","The Old Man was caught off guard and directly fainted from shock.","He's still lying in the ICU now.","The Old Man's life hangs in the balance.","The Old Man's young wife was already pregnant, and that child would be the future heir of the Lu Group.","A will had long been established, stating that everything would belong to this child.","The young wife wanted to give birth to this child safely.","Who knows what those two lunatics, Lu Zheng and Shen Qingqing, might do.","So she sold these two residences and fled abroad.","In the future, she would inherit the Lu Family's assets in peace.","These matters had already spread throughout the upper-class circle.","However, Shen Wei had been busy with charity work and had no time to care about their affairs.","She heard all this from the real estate agent's mouth. Shen Wei asked, \"How much?\"","These houses were good, but because of all these messy affairs, ordinary people didn't dare to buy them.","But the location was indeed excellent.","This time, the young wife was in a hurry to sell, so they could be bought for 100 million yuan.","Previously, the highest price for a single house was 100 million yuan.","How much had been saved this time?","Shen Wei quickly bought these two houses.","The sale of these houses was known throughout the upper class.","But no one knew exactly who bought them.","When Lu Zheng found out, he nearly went mad with anger.","It was their Lu Family's old mansion, such a glorious place.","It had actually been sold by that little tramp.","But just as he wanted to find someone, she had already fled abroad with the huge sum of money.","Even if Lu Zheng wanted to find her, it would be like searching for a needle in a haystack.","At this moment, he just wanted his father to wake up, to let him see this woman's true face.","But his father was already in the ICU, unconscious.","The doctor said, \"The Old Man is of such advanced age, he's received an extreme shock and is in a vegetative state. If he were younger, there might be a chance of waking up, but he's too old!\"","The implication was that he might remain like this forever.","Lu Zheng was on the verge of despair.","So he grabbed Shen Qingqing beside him and started beating her: \"It's all your fault for coming up with these rotten ideas. If you hadn't done such a disgusting thing, how would the Old Man have been scared to the point of not waking up!\"","Now he knew that the Old Man's will had left everything to that mother and child.","It had nothing to do with him anymore.","Unless the Old Man could wake up and rewrite the will.","Only then would he have a chance of inheriting.","But because of Shen Qingqing's actions, the Old Man was left in a state of living death.","All backdoors were closed.","The two of them hadn't been very loving lately.","Now with this incident, they had become mortal enemies.","In his rage, Lu Zheng beat Shen Qingqing black and blue.","Shen Qingqing had just lost her child and was physically weak. Now being domestically abused, she cried and wailed.","The entire floor was filled with her screams.","Finally, the hospital couldn't bear it and stopped them.","But audio recordings and videos.","Busybodies posted all sorts of things online.","They were semi-celebrities online.","Suddenly, it was full of mockery and sarcasm.","The most lamented was Lu Zheng, who used to be a rich young master.","Born with a golden spoon, now he had nothing.","If he had always had nothing, it would have been fine.","But he had enjoyed wealth before.","The next few decades would probably be spent in regret.","Lu Zheng still wanted to find Lin Rui to rekindle their relationship.","But he had failed even when he was still the young master of the Lu Family.","Let alone now when he looked like a pauper.","He couldn't even find her.","He had been beaten by the security guards of Starry Sky Kindergarten several times.","Showing even more how down and out he was.","He had no choice but to find a job paying around 10,000 yuan.","After all, he had a university degree.","Although the salary was high for ordinary people, it was very low for a young master like him.","Moreover, those managers would always say meaningfully: \"So this is the young master of the Lu Family!\"","Hearing this, he was filled with shame.","But he didn't dare to quit because apart from this job, others only offered jobs paying a few thousand yuan, and he needed this job to make ends meet.","Shen Qingqing was originally a pretty young woman.","But the miscarriage and domestic violence had made her look haggard, as if she had aged 10 years.","She had thought about leaving Lu Zheng and hooking up with another rich second-generation heir.","But Shen Qingqing's name had spread in the wealthy circles.","Who would dare to be with her?","She couldn't even find an ordinary man.","So somehow, even though they were bitter enemies, they still rolled around together every day.","However, both had very bad tempers.","When Shen Qingqing was unhappy, she would throw tantrums, completely abandoning her ladylike image.","As for Lu Zheng, he had developed a drinking problem. When angered, he would smash things and hit people.","They were celebrities in the city. Whenever they started fighting,","The neighbors upstairs and downstairs would start livestreaming.","Others could make some money by riding on their popularity, but they couldn't earn anything.","It was extremely ironic."]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267: Kindergarten Association","paragraphs":["The city was forming a kindergarten association for all kindergartens in the area.","Shen Wei was specially invited to attend at the convention center's banquet hall.","Shen Wei had always known about the large WeChat group for city kindergartens, which included many school operators.","But she had never been invited, nor was she in the group.","Initially, it was because her kindergarten was too new, and the others looked down on it.","Over the years, many kindergartens had opened, and many had closed just as quickly.","So the kindergarten group had set a rule: no one could join unless their school had been open for at least two years.","This kept a large number of people out.","There were even cases of people who invested over a million yuan but closed down before two years were up.","Who knew that Shen Wei would turn out to be such an anomaly in this situation?","Most kindergartens in the city tended to use foreign-sounding names, like \"bilingual kindergarten\" and such.","Some even named themselves after famous foreign universities.","Or they would simply call themselves \"Noble Kindergarten.\"","Starry Sky Kindergarten sounded rather plain in comparison.","But in just two years, it had become the industry leader.","The other kindergartens had mixed feelings about this.","This was the first time the city was taking the lead to form a kindergarten association.","Both the city leaders and the other kindergarten owners felt that Starry Sky Kindergarten should participate.","If she didn't participate, the whole project would seem rather amateur.","Shen Wei came with Gu Qingyan.","Shen Wei wore a long dress. She was already naturally beautiful, but having put in extra effort to dress up, she looked absolutely stunning.","Gu Qingyan wore a suit. As a young gentleman from high society, he was already quite handsome without any effort. With a bit of grooming, he was simply breathtaking.","They were the perfect picture of a talented man and a beautiful woman.","Their relationship was already common knowledge.","It seemed some people were truly born to be the center of attention.","The moment they appeared, it felt as if the entire convention center had brightened up.","Being good-looking certainly had its advantages.","The other kindergarten principals all felt inadequate in comparison.","They had dressed up for the occasion, but they simply couldn't compete with the youthful charm of this couple.","As soon as the organizer saw Shen Wei arrive, he immediately stood up and walked several steps forward to greet her, shaking her hand.","He exchanged pleasantries, saying, \"Oh, your Starry Sky Kindergarten is quite the sensation. Our colleagues in the new district all say that since Starry Sky moved in, the area has been booming. Colleagues from other districts are so envious, they're all hoping you'll open a branch in their area someday.\"","Shen Wei replied, \"We'll see about that in the future.\" Mainly because their current resources were limited.","The organizer added, \"Yes, if you were to open a kindergarten, people would flock to it in droves.\"","The other kindergarten owners listened intently.","At that moment, they felt a bitter taste in their mouths.","It was true, they struggled to recruit students, with no new enrollments coming in.","But when Starry Sky opened its second branch, they had over 200,000 applicants during their live stream enrollment event, slapping everyone else in the face.","It wasn't that there were no potential students; it was that the students weren't choosing them.","This realization dejected many of them.","But it was precisely that incident that made them truly respect Starry Sky.","Now at the meeting, they rehashed familiar topics: \"We must continue to strive for excellence. Kindergartens are the smallest unit of education. Children are not only the hope of their families but also the hope of our nation!\"","Suddenly, they were elevating the importance of their role.","The hope was that they would take comprehensive care of every child.","Beyond that, those with the ability should take on more responsibility. If they didn't have that sense of responsibility, they shouldn't be in this business.","Being in the same circle, they had heard through various channels about the recent incidents at the welfare institute.","They were all quite shaken by it.","Since then, waves of inspections had been initiated from the top down.","Welfare institute kindergartens, in particular, were key inspection targets.","As well as various charitable organizations.","There were strict inspections from top to bottom, to prevent such incidents from happening again.","Everyone had originally thought this kindergarten association meeting would just be about chatting and socializing.","They didn't expect to be severely lectured by the organizers in the end.","But sensing the change in atmosphere, the organizer added, \"Of course, I'm just laying out the hard truths upfront. But I believe that everyone who has been in this business for so many years must be full of passion and love for the kindergarten industry.\"","\"Next, I plan to elect a president for the kindergarten association, and then we'll go have dinner.\"","Shen Wei had thought she was just here to make an appearance.","When it came time to elect the president, she didn't even participate in the campaign. But everyone unanimously voted for her, wanting her to be the president.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was their competitor.","But gradually, it had already transcended their league.","They were running far ahead of the others.","Moreover, for an official association, if Shen Wei wasn't the president, it would be awkward for anyone else to take the position. Who else could manage Starry Sky?","Shen Wei was completely taken aback: \"I'm not up to the task. I believe there are many who are more capable, and I'm currently focusing on charity work. There might be times when I can't give full attention to kindergarten matters.\"","The organizer laughed heartily and said, \"It's precisely because your previous charity work has inspired many others to start doing charity as well. This is a very good phenomenon.\"","\"Besides, our association isn't that busy. We just have a meal together once a year. Since everyone trusts you so much, you shouldn't refuse anymore.\"","Others chimed in, \"That's right, that's right.\"","\"If Starry Sky doesn't become the president of the kindergarten association, who else has the ability to do it?\"","Perhaps Noble Kindergarten might have had a fighting chance before, but now they were also in decline.","\"Yes, yes, this position can only be filled by Starry Sky.\"","The people from Noble Kindergarten turned pale, but the tide had already turned.","Struggling against it would only invite ridicule, so they could only quietly try to hide in the background.","The rival they once looked down upon had now crushed them and become an even more formidable existence.","It really gave people an indescribable feeling.","So, under the persuasion of all her peers and the leaders, Shen Wei reluctantly accepted the position.","The organizer, as if afraid she might change her mind, quickly took photos. They had material to write about for this issue.","Shen Wei unexpectedly became a leader.","When she got back, she told Liu Chef.","Liu Chef looked proud. He had a filter when it came to Shen Wei.","He felt that Shen Wei excelled at everything she did.","In his opinion, they had found the right person by choosing Shen Wei as the president.","Shen Wei was both amused and exasperated by his confident attitude."]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268: Starry Sky Surroundings","paragraphs":["Lin Rui, being young, always had some wild ideas. This time, she suggested that Shen Wei should develop merchandise for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Bringing up this topic, Lin Rui said, \"Our fans have been suggesting it in the comments section, and I think it's a good idea. I happen to know a big manufacturer that produces merchandise. They usually do contract manufacturing for foreign celebrities and can give us the lowest price.\"","\"It's about making money.\"","Everyone at the kindergarten was worried about Shen Wei not making enough money.","After all, Shen Wei had made a bold promise that as long as the children from the orphanage could get into university, she would support them financially until they graduated.","This was about the future of hundreds, if not thousands, of people.","All the employees of Starry Sky Kindergarten hoped she could earn more money, especially Lin Rui.","Since the kindergarten was so popular, why not develop some merchandise and sell it?","Seeing Lin Rui's enthusiasm, Shen Wei thought for a moment and decided it was worth trying. She said, \"Alright then, I'll leave this matter to you!\"","Lin Rui had thought she would need to persuade Shen Wei several times before getting approval, but unexpectedly, Shen Wei agreed right away.","This was good news. Lin Rui said, \"Then I'll find designers to create the products.\"","Lin Rui was a person of action. She quickly found a team of designers and spent several hours discussing ideas in the meeting room.","Doctor Lu was the biggest gossip in the unit. At this moment, she pretended to casually pass by the meeting room several times.","When she learned about the background of the designers, Doctor Lu was absolutely shocked.","She knew Lin Rui had resources and was from a wealthy family, but this still exceeded her expectations.","These designers were top-tier jewelry designers in the country.","It was such a big production just for merchandise.","But then again, this was exactly the kind of thing Lin Rui would do.","She always liked to do things on a grand scale.","Like when she wanted to organize an art exhibition for Mu Zhixing.","Who would have thought that after going abroad, she would directly engage in marketing through local radio stations, including foreign forums, and various large-screen projections? It was extravagant to the extreme.","Now, with the merchandise, she was once again showing her extraordinary approach.","Doctor Lu excitedly told Shen Wei about what was happening, and added, \"I knew Lin Rui could make things happen.\"","Shen Wei had turned off all her notification alerts.","When it was time to release the merchandise, she went online and found that her account had grown to 10 million followers.","In such a niche field as kindergartens, she had somehow managed to squeeze into the ranks of major internet celebrities.","She then posted a long image with text announcing the merchandise.","Many fans had set her as a special follow.","As soon as Shen Wei posted, they immediately noticed.","Starry Sky Kindergarten announced that they would be releasing three types of merchandise.","All the items were covered by huge question marks, concealing the actual product images.","But the prices were already listed.","Refrigerator magnets for 59 yuan, bracelets for 199 yuan, and a 3-in-1 necklace, ring, and brooch set for 199 yuan.","Sure enough, many people started commenting: \"Ah, once you become a big internet celebrity, you start selling merchandise. What kind of merchandise can a kindergarten possibly sell?\"","There are all kinds of people on the internet, so it's not surprising to see such comments.","But the fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten weren't having it: \"I'm willing to let her make money, what's wrong with that?\"","\"All internet celebrities can sell merchandise. Why can't she? At least when Starry Sky Kindergarten makes money, it's spent on improving the quality of the buildings, children's education, and the future of orphanage kids.\"","\"Even if it was 1990 yuan instead of 199, I'd still be willing to buy it.\"","Many people below said: \"I can't believe it, why bring fan culture into kindergartens? This trend is really bad.\"","People started arguing below, \"Mind your own business, no one's forcing you to buy.\"","Times have changed, and Starry Sky Kindergarten's fan base has grown.","Many of them were livestream fans, refined through countless internet battles. Their fighting spirit was very strong, and these passersby could only make a few sour comments before moving on. It didn't cause much of a stir.","The merchandise went online at 8 PM that evening.","Many people were quite curious about what styles would be available.","Many even set their alarms for 8 PM, waiting to rush in and buy as soon as the link opened.","Time ticked by second by second, and finally, it was 8 o'clock.","This time, the designers had created merchandise based on a star theme.","The refrigerator magnet was a large star, surrounded by a circle of American diamonds, very dazzling.","And this star could rotate.","Both the inside and outside could rotate.","After scanning with AI, a dialogue would appear.","It was children's innocent words, recorded by various kids, about what they hoped to be when they grew up. The children's naive and innocent voices were truly heartwarming.","Each scan revealed a different child, like opening a mystery box. This content was collected online with compensation, named \"Children's Dreams.\"","Although what the children said was very simple, after watching, one's eyes would become moist. It was like seeing oneself through the children.","Moreover, the actual product was incredibly shiny.","The fans originally wanted to help Shen Wei make money.","But this product far exceeded their expectations.","\"To be honest, I could play with this thing all day. It's so interesting to keep rotating it, and there's even a layer of small diamonds inside. It's so beautiful.\"","\"Even a refrigerator magnet has the brilliance of jewelry, I'm sold.\"","\"My cousin's girlfriend, who isn't even a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten, said she must buy it after seeing this.\"","\"Those who love collecting refrigerator magnets are in luck, who could resist this?\"","\"Has everyone forgotten that meme? Shen Wei's side businesses are even more impressive than her main business.\"","\"There's a rumor that the reason why Shen Wei's restaurant food tastes so good is because they selected the best large white pigs. Many rich bosses went to the pig farm with money, but they wouldn't sell. Don't ask me how I know, my uncle is a wealthy boss and he's gone crazy wanting to buy them.\"","\"Caught a big foodie, hilarious. So you're saying if Shen Wei sold pork, she could become the number one seller in the country? What a strange yet reasonable scenario.\"","\"If you want to eat it, just order takeout from Starry Sky Restaurant. Whenever I crave it now, I just place an order. If it's far, I just call for a delivery service. It makes me so happy.\"","\"To the person above, consider the feelings of us fans from other places. Your bragging is too much.\"","\"Wait, haven't you all seen the two items below? How can you get stuck on just the refrigerator magnet? That bracelet is absolutely amazing.\"","\"The design is exactly what I find aesthetically pleasing!\"","The bracelet was woven with pure silver wire, three layers inside and out. The spacer beads in the middle were made with glass art. There were only a few spacer beads, making it look good on both men and women, and it could be stacked beautifully with jade or gold bracelets.","Everyone knew Starry Sky's capabilities.","They trembled as they clicked on the third image.","It was the 3-in-1 ring, brooch, and pendant.","At first glance, there was a large main stone on top, labeled as a lab-grown diamond, surrounded by small diamonds that sparkled with fire. It truly embodied the theme of \"gathered as one flame, scattered as stars across the sky.\"","It looked stunning from every angle.","Moreover, the ring box was an antique European-style box.","The box was very small.","But when opened, it revealed a thin exterior with a rich interior.","The moment it was opened was breathtaking.","This stone could be used in three ways, looking beautiful whether worn on the hand, around the neck, or pinned to clothes.","\"To be fair, I'm not a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten, but what they've produced is really beautiful. Even as a passerby, I really want to buy it.\"","Long-time fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten rushed to buy, afraid they might miss out.","\"I only realized after buying that they hadn't set a purchase limit.\"","\"Suddenly feeling happy, after completing one order, I placed two more.\"","There were even people who bought more than 10 sets.","The enthusiasm of the internet users was so high that not only did people interested in kindergartens pay attention, but even jewelry sellers were affected.","Many jewelry livestreamers came to take a look after hearing about it and were shocked by the quality of the items.","Someone even noticed a hidden detail.","\"I saw the letter Y hidden in each design. Could it be that these were designed by Y, the most mysterious jewelry designer in the country?\"","Then people started explaining that this designer had won the highest award in the design world.","They had their own jewelry brand and had done collaborations with various luxury brands.","Usually, luxury brands directly write the materials on their products, selling the design itself.","Those things are very cheap, like mother-of-pearl, malachite, or even glass, but can be sold for thousands or tens of thousands.","But here, they used lab-grown diamonds.","How can something with such a great design and quality materials only cost a little over 100?","When everyone examined the design with a magnifying glass, they truly saw Y's design logo.","This sent not just the accessories world, but the entire jewelry industry into a frenzy.","It wasn't just a luxury designer creating merchandise; this was a whole new level of competition.","It's not just about a master descending from on high.","It's left others at a loss for what to do.","Moreover, uninformed fans are putting down other big brands in comparison.","If it's not Starry Sky Kindergarten, what kind of powerhouse is this? Are they always this aggressive?","Various industry insiders are starting to lose their composure.","Internet users are laughing heartily.","Among them, the happiest are the other kindergarten operators in the city.","Finally, someone understands how they felt back then.","The fear they experienced when Shen Wei, that formidable force, crushed them in tears, and the dread they felt at the mere mention of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Presumably, after today, the jewelry industry will be able to relate to this feeling too.","In a word: satisfying!"]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269: The Grand Finale","paragraphs":["The peripheral design for this event was already excellent.","With the addition of the exposed designer, the quality materials, the design, and the nostalgic appeal of Starry Sky, it created a triple boost that led to an explosive sale.","Lin Rui knew these items would sell well.","But she didn't expect them to sell this well.","The next morning, she saw that the items were taken off the shelf.","She thought there might have been some violation causing the removal.","But she was told they had sold out. When she listed them, she didn't set a limit, but the website had a default limit of 1 million orders.","1 million orders, sold out overnight.","Because there was no quantity limit, people later started ordering in batches of 30 or 50.","Especially those niche antique shops.","They were practically coming to stock up.","Those personalized small shops love designer items the most.","Even if it's not a designer item, buyers could sell them for several thousand yuan at high prices.","Not to mention this was from a famous designer.","As they bought in large quantities, the stock rapidly decreased, making others anxious.","Passersby also started impulse buying.","When Lin Rui was tallying the accounts, she was completely stunned.","Because they were selling on a short video platform, it stated that goods must be shipped within 48 hours.","At the time, they had prepared 100,000 sets in advance.","Lin Rui was confident that even facing a big promotion, this inventory would be enough.","Who would have thought it would explode in sales like this?","Now they had an excess of 900,000 orders.","Even if the factory urgently increased production, they couldn't ship within 48 hours.","And if they couldn't ship, they would be penalized.","If only she had been more careful when setting it up and marked it as a pre-sale.","Fortunately, Miss Lin had money. She thought that if there were any losses, she would bear them herself. Consider it tuition paid.","Subsequently, Lin Rui urgently posted a notice.","Saying there wasn't enough stock and they would ship according to the order sequence.","Netizens responded: \"We knew that no matter what Starry Sky does, it's always about giving benefits to the family.\"","\"I ordered three sets! Today I felt I didn't order enough. When I tried to order more, they were gone.\"","\"Sister above, you should be content. I was working overtime yesterday and didn't go online at all. I didn't even know they released merchandise here. By the time I got online today, everything was gone. Please save this child, overtime workers have it tough. Work is already tiring, and now I can't even get the things I love. It's too hard for me.\"","\"I was hoping they could restock in time, but seeing the announcement they posted, I'm completely devastated.\"","\"Looks like the earlier orders have piled up into a mountain. How will they ship the later ones?\"","\"The sister above who couldn't get an order can try to buy one on a second-hand platform. Yesterday, many people bought dozens of sets to resell, you should be able to get one for a slightly higher price.\"","\"Wait a minute, I just realized, they didn't set it as pre-sale and will be penalized if they don't ship within 48 hours. Please, can we not let the platform deduct money from them?\"","\"Exactly, they're already collaborating with a famous jewelry designer on these items. Using lab-grown diamonds is already giving everyone a great deal, and the money they earn goes back to society, helping children in welfare homes. At this point, if they get money deducted because of shipping issues, I'll really cry.\"","\"That's right, can those who can't wait just return the items? Don't make it difficult for Starry Sky.\"","\"Starry Sky is really an honest, silly child. This item could easily be priced at 1000, but they priced it at 199. Now that it's oversold and they can't ship out the goods, I'm so worried.\"","\"Don't worry, those above. I've already called the platform and reported this situation to customer service. I hope they won't deduct money from them.\"","\"Wait for me, I'm going to call too. What's the number?\"","\"Count me in.\"","\"Me too.\"","After less than two hours, the platform called Shen Wei to explain the situation.","The platform even issued a special announcement saying: Shen Wei can delay shipping for up to 15 days. The fee for delayed shipping will be temporarily waived.","Another round of rejoicing erupted below.","Some people said: \"These fridge magnets are so exquisite, I want to collect one set and use one set. But can we have a few more of just this one fridge magnet? That AI animation makes me cry every time I see it.\"","\"Yes, make it a series.\"","\"From now on, I'll only trust Starry Sky for jewelry and accessories.\"","Other jewelry and accessory competitors were really annoyed, but there was nothing they could do.","What can you do when the other party is rich enough to collaborate with famous domestic designers?","Being crushed by a kindergarten really gives a sense of powerlessness and grievance. With such talent, why open a kindergarten? Isn't it a waste of abilities?","...","Ever since Lin Rui started this merchandise venture, she walked with a spring in her step.","These guaranteed sales could create millions in profit for the kindergarten.","Nowadays, domestic lab-grown diamonds have entered a mature stage.","It's just that diamonds still maintain a high-end, high price position.","Most designers still use real diamonds.","There's an ample supply of lab-grown diamonds, excellent raw materials, plus outstanding design - it would be hard not to make money.","Lin Rui directly told Shen Wei: \"Leave the money matters to me from now on!\" Her initial trial was a great success, instantly boosting her confidence.","Business taxes are heavy, but Starry Sky's charity proportion was so high that the authorities waived their taxes with a wave of the hand.","This delighted and surprised everyone at Starry Sky.","When Shen Wei first started, she didn't think so much.","She just wanted to do some good.","She didn't expect there would be unexpected gains.","When Shen Wei found Gu Qingyan, she directly gave him the keys to two villas.","\"Back then, you sold your house to support my charity work. Now that things have improved, I've bought you back two even better ones!\"","These two were the Lu Family's ancestral homes, unparalleled in both location and influence.","All the interior decorations were done by master designers, with the renovations alone costing several tens of millions.","Gu Qingyan was pleasantly surprised and then said: \"Is this an engagement gift?\"","After saying it, he felt a bit embarrassed.","But his eyes were bright, constantly looking at Shen Wei.","Shen Wei nodded and said: \"I suppose so.\"","Then Gu Qingyan's face suddenly turned red: \"In that case, why don't we hold an engagement party?\"","This way, he could announce to the whole world that Shen Wei was his fiancée.","Shen Wei said: \"Alright.\"","Instantly, Gu Qingyan was so happy he almost fainted. He immediately called his father.","He shared this joyous news with his parents.","Gu Qingyan's parents were with Shen Wei's parents at the time.","At this moment, all four elders became excited.","They didn't care about anything else and drove straight back to the city.","They wanted to talk to Shen Wei and the others immediately.","They knew Shen Wei was thoughtful and had her own opinions. The fact that she agreed to talk about engagement made the whole family very happy.","Gu Qingyan's parents were so excited they could barely speak coherently. They had thought their silly son, who had never even dated before and was too honest, might not be appealing to girls.","Who would have thought that it was this very honesty that set him apart from other young masters.","At least he seemed fresh, without any of the sleaziness of a spoiled rich kid.","\"I'll definitely throw you a grand engagement party.\"","Shen Wei said: \"Let's keep it small.\" She wanted to invite her colleagues from Starry Sky Kindergarten.","As for others, just invite a few close friends.","Seeing Shen Wei's suggestion, the Gu family was fully cooperative.","But on Shen Wei's engagement day, there were too many people.","These wealthy heirs somehow got the news and came uninvited.","Originally, they had only booked a small banquet hall.","But for the Gu family's reception, the hotel had already been fully booked.","Now that so many heavyweight figures had arrived, they had no choice but to ask the manager to open the largest exhibition hall. Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan got engaged in front of all these witnesses.","Shen Wei was quite composed, but Gu Qingyan was extremely excited.","Like a little tail, he followed Shen Wei wherever she went.","Shen Wei was the darling of the circle.","Among the rich second generation, there were also Shen Wei's fans who felt she could find someone better.","But someone nearby couldn't help saying: \"You're clueless, that's the famous Gu family!\"","With this reminder, those around finally realized.","The Gu family's influence was immense.","It's just that Gu Qingyan seemed too immature, making people forget he was truly born with a silver spoon in his mouth.","Among all the young talents present, all of them combined might not match up to Gu Qingyan.","Moreover, this young master had both money and power, and crucially, he listened to everything Shen Wei said.","What a golden bachelor he is - handsome, from a wealthy family.","The rich second-generation fan said, \"Yes, just trust Shen Wei.\"","They both look very attractive.","Seeing them standing together now, they truly make a talented and beautiful couple.","It's said they were betrothed as children, making them seem even more like a match made in heaven.","At this moment, everyone started complimenting Gu's Father, praising his foresight as the formidable business tycoon who had dominated for over 30 years.","Back then, when Shen Wei didn't have her current status, he was still able to arrange such a marriage for his son. Truly remarkable.","Gu's Father beamed with pride at the compliments. Indeed, finding such a wonderful daughter-in-law was partly his accomplishment.","As the drinking and dining continued, Shen Wei quietly slipped away to the balcony, feeling the breeze and gazing up at the stars.","After a while, Gu Qingyan brought over some sobering soup and said, \"You must be tired.\"","They had only planned to invite a few people, but didn't expect such a turnout.","Gu Qingyan still felt sorry for Shen Wei, having to keep up appearances while being so exhausted.","Shen Wei replied, \"It's alright.\"","Gu Qingyan stared at her lips and, as if possessed, asked, \"Can I kiss you?\"","Shen Wei's face immediately turned red.","Gu Qingyan was also surprised by his own boldness. It was too daring.","Shen Wei said, \"You're my boyfriend, why are you asking me?\"","Hearing this, Gu Qingyan felt encouraged.","His heart was pounding so hard it felt like it might burst out of his chest.","The air around them seemed to thin.","He leaned in and gave Shen Wei a gentle kiss. It was incredibly soft, fragranced, and intoxicating.","Though it was just a fleeting peck, Gu Qingyan felt as if his entire chest was about to explode.","He felt it was the most exhilarating moment of his life.","Shen Wei was quite nervous too, but seeing Gu Qingyan's flushed cheeks and his eyes darting about, looking so innocent, it was hard to believe he had been so brave just moments ago. Her nervousness suddenly dissipated, replaced by a smile.","Having a younger boyfriend could be quite interesting after all."]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270: Extra 1: Buying Holographic Chambers","paragraphs":["On an ordinary Thursday morning, the eyes of commuters radiated a lifeless glow. Counting on their fingers, they realized that after enduring today, there was just one more day until the weekend.","Colleagues were exchanging pleasantries, chatting about trending topics and things they had seen while surfing the internet yesterday. That's how coworkers are. Warm and friendly at work, but not even exchanging a single message on WeChat after hours.","As everyone was chatting, suddenly someone nearby jumped up and shouted, \"Holy crap!\"","In an instant, everyone's drowsiness vanished, and they all looked over, asking, \"What's wrong?\"","Those around sensed keenly that there was some juicy gossip to be had.","Looking around, the person who was so excited turned out to be Qi, the office nerd.","At that moment, his hand holding the phone was trembling slightly, and his face was somewhat distorted due to excessive excitement.","Everyone around was asking what had happened.","Though their words expressed concern, their eyes sparkled with the light of gossip.","Qi said, \"Quick, check social media. This news is already trending at number one.\"","Everyone simultaneously pulled out their phones and began searching. Soon, exclamations of \"Holy crap!\" echoed throughout the office.","Opening the top trending topic, it read clearly: \"The country's first holographic gaming pod goes on sale at 10:05. The sale price is 138,888.\"","\"This device has full sensory capabilities. It comes with 20 built-in games including shooting games, farming games, fishing games, strategy games, martial arts games, and more...\"","\"Available for purchase on the National Scientists' website.\"","As soon as the news broke, all netizens were stunned.","\"Holographic gaming, is it what I think it is?\"","\"Science fiction has truly become reality. Remember when the first prototype of this game was revealed at Starry Sky Kindergarten? The whole society was searching for the scientist who designed this game, but unfortunately, they disappeared without a trace. Thankfully, Shen Wei from Starry Sky Kindergarten donated all the design blueprints to the Academy of Sciences.\"","\"I remember that too! But in the end, there was no news, and I thought the whole thing had fizzled out. Who would have thought they were working on something this big?\"","\"No pre-release hype, just straight to launch?\"","\"Isn't 138,888 a bit expensive? That's enough for an electric car.\"","\"In our small city, that could be a down payment on a house. But this is a holographic gaming pod! There's nothing like it internationally. If you own one, you'll be among the first to experience holographic gaming.\"","\"I've already begged my wife. If she agrees to buy it, I'm willing to wash dishes, scrub floors, cook, and give massages for a full 10 years.\"","\"The guy above is willing to sell 10 years of happiness for a gaming console. Bro, that's a pretty steep price.\"","\"I'm an 18-year-old guy, 6'2\", with abs. To be honest, I'm looking for some sugar. I just want a holographic gaming pod, sister.\"","\"To that young man, as far as I know, only Gu Qingyan can trade looks for a holographic pod. But he looks the way he does. If you want to trade for a gaming pod, you'd first have to beat Gu Qingyan in looks.\"","The person immediately fell silent. It was no joke - not just in the real world, but even in the entertainment industry, it would be hard to find someone more handsome than Gu Qingyan.","Gu Qingyan really did have a lot of fans who adored his looks.","In Gu Qingyan's comment section, there was often a phrase: \"Just say the word, and I'll immediately promote you to become an idol with millions of fans.\"","Gu Qingyan would arrogantly reply: \"I don't need that. I only need Shen Wei.\"","Fans would express their frustration: \"Just take him already, look at how 'eager to marry' he is.\"","There was also inexplicable envy: \"Sister, if not, then write a book. We want to know how you managed to tame him to be so obedient.\"","\"What if I like both Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan? Can't we all be together?\"","\"I don't mind, add me in too, let's make it four.\"","\"Aren't we supposed to advocate monogamy? I just want the two of them.\"","\"Wow, the person above wants to have their cake and eat it too.\"","Although Gu Qingyan didn't do much marketing, every time he posted on social media, it was about how Shen Wei praised him.","He was just like a silly puppy - any kindness Shen Wei showed him, he would immediately jump out to show it off.","This behavior, though a bit childish, was really adorable.","Somehow, his followers had grown to over 3 million.","Some people even edited short videos of him and posted them online. Everyone had seen Gu Qingyan's breathtaking beauty.","While Gu Qingyan was popular among girls, with the release of the gaming pod, he now became popular among guys too.","People below started commenting: \"I just came to see what the first person to own a gaming pod looks like.\"","\"So you really can make a living off your looks, huh.\"","Gu Qingyan's fans were unhappy with this. They hadn't provoked anyone, so why the sarcastic remarks? They immediately retorted: \"Gu Qingyan isn't just good-looking, he's also rich. He's the young master of a multi-billion dollar company, born with a silver spoon in his mouth. Jealous much?\"","\"Even if he's rich, he's not eating your rice. Why are you being so hostile?\"","\"Sister Shen Wei loves to spoil him, what's it to you?\"","Everyone chatting didn't forget to keep an eye on the time.","They were all waiting for the gaming pod to go on sale.","This time, everyone was a bit nervous.","Mainly because they didn't know how many units the officials would be selling.","It seemed that for something as complex as the gaming pod, there probably wouldn't be many available.","They were worried that their reaction speed wouldn't be fast enough to snag one.","Ever since learning about this news, everyone had been as restless as ants on a hot pan.","Finally, as 10 o'clock arrived, everyone immediately logged onto the Scientists' website.","It was their first time on this website. It had photos and introductions of various scientists, a bit like a university official website.","It somehow felt both serious and tense.","Time ticked by second by second.","The countdown had begun.","Everyone's hearts were in their throats.","Finally, after \"5\", \"4\", \"3\", \"2\", \"1\", the direct purchase button turned blue, indicating it was clickable. Everyone immediately clicked.","In an instant, the website froze like a PowerPoint presentation.","Everyone started cursing: \"Is this how you treat people?\""]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271: Extras 2: White List Protection","paragraphs":["Seeing the webpage freeze, everyone's heart sank.","Quickly, they kept refreshing the page, praying to every god they could think of.","Finally, they managed to get inside, there was one holography cabin still available for purchase, they immediately clicked on purchase.","The sweat was pouring off their palms as they entered their purchase password.","Afterward, they saw a holography cabin waiting to be shipped.","Their hands were so sweaty that the phone was almost slipping: \"I got it!\"","Overwhelmed with excitement, their body was trembling slightly.","At the same time, many people were posting on social media: snagged one.","Numerous positive updates kept popping up.","It seemed it was really easy to snatch this holography cabin.","Suddenly, someone said: \"I didn't get it.\"","From then on, everyone was posting about not getting one.","Checking the time, the first person to post about not getting one was 1 minute and 55 seconds after the sale.","Those who missed out were fuming: \"Who designed this crappy webpage? Can we get a decent software please? It has been nearly unresponsive since the moment it began, and as soon as it started working again, the cabins were sold out.\"","\"How many of them were actually for sale? Did anyone really get one?\"","\"Stop complaining, look at how many people online are saying they got one.\"","Hearing this, the man clicked out, indeed, full screen showed posts of people who got one.","Some were so excited that they didn't even cover their address and phone number, their personal information, when they posted.","Those who missed out were driven mad.","\"It's not fair, why there are so many people who got one, why can't I have one? Just how many were for sale?\"","This became a massive issue.","The social media server even crashed for more than two minutes.","This is the biggest event besides celebrities' announcements or houses collapsing.","After a while,","The scientist's website software updated a new announcement.","Answering everyone's questions: \"This round we released 10 million units, they were all sold out in about 1 minute and 30 seconds.\"","\"We regret that many of you didn't get to purchase, however, our factories are working overtime. Soon, the second batch will be on presale! We're going to make it better, please stay tuned.\"","After this announcement, the underneath comments started to copy and paste: “When will the second presale be?”","Others pondered: \"It turns out that I am the only one who's poor.\"","It costs 138,000, not 13,800. They throw away their money without blinking an eye.","Within various gaming squads, these geniuses, with their fast hands, each managed to snag a unit, and they excitedly posted on social media to share their joy with their fans.","Originally, they thought everyone would praise them.","Who would've thought, this time the fans' comments differed slightly: \"So it was you professional players who were competing with us.\"","\"Can there be a limit to this next time, or can the officials intervene?\"","\"What's the difference between them and machines with their incredible speed? And what's more outrageous is that each of you gets one. It's too much. Give the extras out for fans to win.\"","\"Agree +1.\"","\"Agree +2.\"","\"Agree +10086.\"","The person who posted on Weibo was complained by the whole team, this is a full immersion game, it might fundamentally change the landscape of the gaming circle.","Anyone who got it wouldn't willing to give it out.","The person who made that post on Weibo was immediately met with harsh criticism and quickly deleted the message with a heavy heart.","Enraged netizens started to question the other gaming teams if they managed to snag one.","All other teams were silent as lambs.","Indeed, they had gotten it, but they didn't dare say.","At this point, the online community was like a lit fuse.","Whoever got it would become the public enemy.","But there were exceptions.","Among the main team members, there were those who were unlucky and didn't get it, but their trainees did.","It turned into a bidding war, coupled with the prospect of letting them play and score points on regular occasions, almost like a deceptive trick. However, they flatly refused.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had previously been visited by the ace team.","Since then, those few people had been constantly talking about the holographic game.","They spoke about it with such mystique, their hearts couldn't help but feel a longing.","They hadn't had the conditions before, but now they finally had the opportunity to experience it. Who would give up this type of moment?","Online news of increased prices surfaced, driving people nearly insane.","Less than an hour after going on sale, the price skyrocketed to 270,000 yuan, nearly double the original price.","Unfortunately, there was a purchase limit enforced during the initial sale - everyone could only buy one copy.","And the ones who snagged a copy were definitely not willing to sell.","Now their rare commodity was in great demand.","Sell it and you might regret it later, as the holographic game could be worth even more.","Netizens, enraged, stormed onto the Weibo page of the official website.","If they hadn't been delayed by just a few minutes, they would have gotten it.","They had plenty of time, over a minute and a half!","This was totally unfair. They had been monitoring the countdown the entire time, waitlisted alongside people who were holding out for the final countdown.","Why did this have to happen?","So, the pent-up anger was vented on the official account.","The sweat dripped down the face of the person in charge of operations.","Programmers were questioned by the higher-ups.","\"We have the most powerful purchasing software available on the market. But compared to the official business platform, we're nothing. They have their own servers,\" said the programmers.","A massive influx of two billion people came in at once.","It truly frightened them.","It only lagged for about 30+ seconds.","This is, in fact, an extremely powerful software.","But the users won't listen. This 30-second lag was the difference between getting it and not.","Moreover, the programmers felt wronged.","Because of maintaining the webpage, they couldn't even secure a copy for themselves.","It's a holographic game, after all.","The bosses didn't blame them, gave their programmers a pat on the back and sent them home.","Originally, they thought the holographic game would only create a slight ripple in the domestic market.","Unexpectedly, it was a hit overseas.","Due to the proliferation of sci-fi movies, the concept of holography is not unfamiliar.","Many countries are researching it.","But no one could really create a holographic system that integrates all senses.","This time, they not only developed the gaming pod, but also more than 20 games.","How could they create this within such a short period?","Rumours and conspiracy theories started to circulate on overseas online platforms.","When repatriated, the domestic netizens, their mouths as poisonous as snakebites, gave them a taste of what online fury really was.","They had been bemoaning the lack of an outlet for their pent-up energy, and now these foreigners were directly in their crosshairs.","So, the foreign internet was utterly bombarded with criticism.","There were even overseas netizens asking for a \"daigou\".","They had previously heard about daigou, which is the buying and shipping service for overseas products. Now that the holographic game was advanced by over a decade,","They finally got a taste of what daigou really means.","Even people within the country can't purchase it, let alone those overseas.","With overseas participation, the price has been driven up again, now at a minimum of 330,000.","It's utterly outrageous!","Since the release of this game capsule, everyone has been exceptionally busy.","Shen Wei is fine.","But she just got 50 million credited into her account.","She then received a phone call: \"This is the first batch of dividends. Starting from now, you'll receive a share every month, the amount will depend on the sales!\" This is the benefit the scientists have negotiated for her initially.","Thanks to her donated design, and her initial \"help\" in advancing the research of this holographic capsule, she contributed greatly to the nation.","This alone has made many financial giants green with envy.","They invested a massive amount of money into it, but were not able to acquire even 10% of the shares through R&D.","Shen Wei didn't expect to earn so much in dividends right off the bat.","Given the current hype on the internet, the money is bound to keep rolling in.","\"There won't be any danger, right?\"","A tenfold wealth can tempt people to risk it all, not to mention when it's a hundredfold or thousandfold.","Shen Wei's words made the person on the other end of the line laugh: \"You probably don't realize, but up top, you're on a whitelist. You have special people protecting you.\"","Who would be so foolish as to try to snatch the shares or money from Shen Wei at such a critical time?","They would have to be begging for death.","Shen Wei felt a lot more reassured.","...","Ever since Gu Qingyan managed to secure the first brand new game capsule from Shen Wei just by his looks,","Before the others even received their delivery,","All the guys were overcome by jealousy, beneath Shen Wei’s comment section were all men offering themselves.","This made Gu Qingyan extra cautious.","He acted almost like a puppy guarding its precious treasure.","Gu Qingyan was so mad his eyes were red: \"Shameless, these men are utterly shameless.\"","\"...\""]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272: Extra 3: Mu Zhi Star Is Truly an Angel","paragraphs":["Xu Yingying is only six years old this year. She is a prized student of the Xinyi Art Studio Teacher.","This child started practicing with him at the age of four, progressing from children's drawings to where she is now.","Her sketching skills are even comparable to those of high school art exam students.","And this has only taken two short years.","But today, with tearful eyes, she told the Teacher, \"I can't learn anymore.\"","The Teacher was shocked and quickly asked, \"What happened?\"","Although the Teacher at the art studio primarily works for money, they are all young people with a passion.","They also hope to cultivate some truly talented children while teaching students.","Xu Yingying is rarely praised openly, but the Teacher often talks about her in private.","This child's talent is truly unprecedentedly high.","Her grasp of large-scale drawing is very precise.","Just her initial drafts have already surpassed many people.","Now she says she can't learn anymore, which is a heavy blow to the Teacher.","Xu Yingying said, \"But my family has no money!\" and then started crying.","This child was already his beloved student.","When his beloved student cried, his heart broke, and he immediately said, \"Don't worry, I'll call your parents!\"","He then called the parents and found out that they were already overwhelmed, saying it was because of poor business.","They had lost over a million yuan in investments, couldn't cover the losses, and might have to mortgage their house.","It was already good enough that the child could attend regular school.","As for interest classes and hobbies, they had to stop.","The Teacher said, \"But the child is so talented, she should continue learning.\"","The parents spoke with dejection, \"If she could learn, would I stop her? But in our current situation, it's embarrassing to say, but even eating meat is difficult. How could we let the child continue learning art?\"","The Teacher wished he could say he would waive the tuition for the child.","But after all, he was just a substitute teacher, earning a salary.","He wasn't a partner or owner of the art studio.","At this moment, he could only say, \"I'll try to negotiate for you. If we can reduce the tuition, I hope the child can continue!\"","The parent on the other end of the phone was full of gratitude, \"No matter what, thank you!\"","The Teacher finally went to the boss.","Employees are always nervous when meeting the boss.","At this moment, he explained Xu Yingying's situation to the boss and asked if they could waive some of the tuition, if not, deduct part of it from his salary.","The boss was usually stingy, after all, he was running a business, not a charity.","The Teacher expected the boss to refuse.","But unexpectedly, the boss said, \"Okay.\"","The Teacher was surprised and widened his eyes.","The boss said, \"There's good news you don't know yet. Have you heard of Mu Zhixing?\"","The Teacher said, \"Who hasn't heard of Mu Zhixing!\"","That was a prodigy in the art world, famous and well-known.","He had watched Mu Zhixing's live broadcasts before and was amazed by the child's incredible artistic talent.","The boss said, \"Mu Zhixing donated an art studio to teach children to draw, all for free. The association even asked us to send a Teacher to teach there, and we're sending you. Xu Yingying can go to that studio to learn, and you can select a few more talented children, all tuition-free. All expenses are sponsored by Mu Zhixing.\"","The Teacher was a bit surprised, \"But, Mu Zhixing is so young.\"","\"You don't understand, one of her paintings is now worth seven figures.\"","The Teacher was dumbfounded and went back to tell Xu Yingying the good news. Xu Yingying was indeed happy.","He couldn't sit still and immediately investigated the matter, and as soon as he took out his phone, he saw many messages discussing it.","The local art groups were already buzzing.","\"How can there be such an angelic child.\"","\"A child with money still goes to teach other children to draw. Oh my! My heart is melting.\"","\"Do you remember what this child went through before? Drawing helped her cope with her original family issues, so she wants to give back to others.\"","\"I didn't expect to be moved by a child.\"","\"I told my boss I wanted to go, even if it meant no salary, I wanted to be part of this charity. But I was replaced by a Teacher with ten more years of experience.\"","\"Heaven knows that drawing can soothe the soul, so it sent a little angel to save other talented children.\"","Everyone's hearts were filled with love and emotion. This was something many adults couldn't do, but a child did it.","The Teacher couldn't help but tell everyone about Xu Yingying almost dropping out.","Thanks to Mu Zhixing, she might really save a hopeful artist.","These artists usually have a bit of an aloof attitude.","They all seem unique.","But they also have a pure heart.","Because of Mu Zhixing's spark, the kindness of the artists was connected.","Everyone eagerly signed up, wanting to go teach children for free.","It was even heard that many industry bigwigs were involved.","The most anticipated was that Mu Zhixing's Teacher, Qi Zhong, would personally go to teach.","He was a genius among his peers.","A leading young artist.","The black history that once surrounded him had long been cleared.","Now he was making a comeback.","Many Teachers in the same industry were excited and thrilled.","They wanted to go and exchange ideas, so the number of applicants increased.","Unexpectedly, the competition was fierce, as strict as applying for a university art Teacher position.","Xu Yingying's Teacher got in through the institution's recommendation.","When he got in, he realized that his proud drawing skills were nothing in front of these bigwigs.","Other colleagues were envious.","This thing even required connections.","Actually, he just took advantage of the priority registration.","He was supposed to teach.","But he ended up attending many master classes.","These masters were usually elusive.","Now he could interact with them face-to-face.","He could also show his creations to these masters.","Just getting a few words of advice from them was enough for him to digest for a long time.","A master is a master.","......","At this moment, Mu Zhixing was still at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Shen Wei asked her if she wanted to go to the newly built art studio.","This child had 20 million yuan from participating in a variety show before. With the principal and interest, it was quite a sum.","Now this child had donated 20 million yuan.","She still had tens of thousands left.","Her daily needs were all provided by Starry Sky, so she didn't lack money.","The geniuses in the art world were all proud of their talents, but seeing such a young child donating a building for other children to learn to draw, they were all moved.","Many bigwigs admired her.","But this child was introverted.","Every time she was praised, she would hide in Shen Wei's arms.","\"This time you did a great job!\" Shen Wei told her, \"You are a hero to many people. Many children can go back to drawing because of your donation.\"","Mu Zhixing raised her little face and said, \"I like to let more people draw.\""]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273: Extra 4: Cuties from Kiss Kiss Kindergarten","paragraphs":["This temperament alone made many industry bigwigs feel inadequate in comparison.","So some of the big names wanted to meet Mu Zhixing in person.","Such high talent, coupled with the heart of a child.","They suddenly realized that children are truly the teachers of adults.","This time, Shen Wei's phone was filled with WeChat messages from painting world bigwigs.","They expressed their gratitude to Shen Wei for her dedication.","For raising such a well-mannered child.","It showed that the caretaker had indeed put her heart and soul into nurturing.","This included their participation in variety shows.","Many parents would pocket their children's labor income for themselves.","Let alone in a situation where they weren't even related.","Shen Wei gave everything to Mu Zhixing, allowing the child to freely manage it.","Shen Wei's regular charitable acts left a deep impression on the children's hearts.","As a result, the children followed suit.","Mu Zhixing had done something that was considered a major initiative in the painting world.","Regardless of this child's future path,","This small act had essentially cemented her status as the darling of the painting community.","Shen Wei said, \"This child is truly wonderful!\"","Mu Zhixing had always been soft-hearted and exceptionally kind from a young age.","Everyone adored her, except for her own parents.","Fortunately, painting gave her confidence.","It also brought her the love of many painting masters and fans.","Gradually, this healed Mu Zhixing.","Now the child was lively and cheerful, and had done so many meaningful things.","Shen Wei was a very democratic guardian. As long as the child was happy, anything was fine.","So Shen Wei also praised Mu Zhixing.","Mu Zhixing buried her head in Shen Wei's embrace: \"Sister, please stop!\" She was incredibly shy.","But this made her even more adorable.","Shen Wei couldn't resist giving the little one a kiss.","This child, already in first grade, considered herself a big girl and didn't particularly like being kissed and hugged by others.","But Shen Wei's kisses and hugs made her feel comfortable and loved.","Children are the most easily influenced.","Since Mu Zhixing donated 20 million for an art studio,","He Lingfeng sponsored a children's computer program, also donating 20 million at once.","This gesture, combined with the brilliance of his natural talent, made him go viral online once again.","The little darling was already quite handsome, usually wearing a cool expression.","Unexpectedly, the cool guy had quite a soft heart.","Once again, netizens of Mantianxing were moved to tears.","\"As expected of my internet son and daughter, they really make me cry.\"","\"It's true that you can see a person's character from a young age. Being so kind at such a young age, they are the hope for the future.\"","\"Am I the only one who finds it shocking that children so young can manage 20 million?\"","\"I guess this is the difference between people.\"","\"There are many rich people in the world. I won't be jealous of kids who are a few years old. But compared to others being rich, I'd rather Mantianxing and them be rich.\"","\"Me too.\"","Song Ping An didn't have that much money.","But living in Mantianxing,","He knew about the initiatives of his little brother and sister. So he took his piggy bank and went to find Shen Wei.","Inside were all the pocket money Shen Wei had given the little one.","The little guy usually couldn't bear to spend it, and the piggy bank was already full.","At this moment, Shen Wei was live streaming, when she saw an adorable little baby rush in with a piggy bank, boldly handing it to Shen Wei saying, \"I, donate money.\"","Shen Wei was surprised: \"Isn't this all of your savings?\"","The little one, probably due to his wild upbringing and the trauma of past hunger, was a bit protective of his food and other possessions. He really liked this piggy bank and usually didn't let anyone touch it.","It was stuffed full of money. When shaken, you could hear the jingle of coins.","Shen Wei said, \"If you donate money to the little ones, you won't have any left!\"","A flash of reluctance crossed the little one's face, but then he said firmly, \"I still want to donate. I can't fall behind sister Mu Zhixing and brother He Lingfeng!\"","Shen Wei said, \"I appreciate your intention. How about I donate on your behalf?\"","Song Ping An refused, insisting on donating himself. He opened the piggy bank and took out all the money. When counted, it amounted to over 10,000 yuan.","The child solemnly handed the money to Shen Wei.","Netizens were melting from the cuteness.","\"That's all he has. I heard from people at the kindergarten that he usually doesn't spend a single cent. How long must he have saved for this?\"","\"The way he donated just now was so domineering, I love it.\"","\"As a mother, I just want to know how Mantianxing raised these kids to be so good.\"","\"Please, Shen Wei, write a book about it.\"","\"More than that, I'm envious of Song Ping An being kissed by Shen Wei. His little round face was squished from the kiss. So good to squish, so cute.\"","\"No exaggeration, with such an adorable baby, I could kiss him all afternoon.\"","\"Me too.\"","\"Count me in.\"","\"Me as well.\"","..."]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274: Extra 5: Holographic Gaming Leads Internationally","paragraphs":["The game pods have started to be shipped out gradually.","They're really quite large.","Everyone who received one has recorded an unboxing video.","Those who couldn't get one are even more envious now.","As for those who managed to get one, they've all reverted to a primal state, as excited as monkeys in the mountains.","They're just short of howling out loud.","Many live streams of people playing have begun.","Internet users are watching eagerly.","Many people are experiencing holographic games for the first time. The ultra-realistic imagery is really making the gamers jump and start.","It's completely different from playing mobile or computer games.","They haven't adapted yet.","They look a bit clumsy playing.","But they're having so much fun. After finishing a round, they come out of the game pod.","Many internet users are eager to ask: \"Is it fun?\"","\"It's so much fun, I didn't expect it to be this realistic.\"","Players who managed to buy one are giving rave reviews.","\"I love this game so much, the developers truly deserve to be enshrined in the ancestral temple.\"","\"Who can relate, family? My Dad is fighting me to play, he's already caught over 200 fish in a short time! He won't let me play, I'm so angry!\"","\"What, your Dad can catch over 200 fish? Send me the coordinates and bait recipe, please, I'm begging you!\"","\"Yeah! My Dad asked me to ask if your Dad can livestream, he wants to learn.\"","\"My Boyfriend now won't even go out when his buddies call him, he just stays at home playing in the game pod!\"","\"I love playing too, before my family said it was too expensive, now the whole family is fighting over it. Strongly recommend that Jianghu game, who didn't dream of living the life of a wandering knight when they were young, it's like experiencing another life.\"","\"I'm a steady Young Man who's never been a fan of celebrities or gotten excited about anything, but now I'm crazy about the game pod, it's too much fun.\"","It's almost 100% positive reviews.","Other people are getting even more restless.","\"I thought 138,888 was too expensive at first and didn't buy it. Now I really regret it.\"","\"You're confused, 138,888 to experience the latest holographic games, and if you don't like it you can still sell it second-hand, now all the second-hand platforms are buying them up, with a minimum price of 200,000, even if you just flip it it's worth it.\"","\"And this is a full holographic game system, I heard foreign Tycoons spent millions to build something that's not even fully immersive, compared to that this is dirt cheap, the motherland really loves its fans.\"","\"Don't say anymore, I regret it so much my guts have turned green, so when will the second batch be released?\"","\"Please, I want to play so badly.\"","Overseas purchasing agents have even become popular domestically.","But the authorities have issued a ban, prohibiting the export of game pods.","This has angered people overseas, who have raised the issue at international conferences, asking why they won't sell to them.","There are even conspiracy theories saying the new game is a scam, that fully immersive holographic games are impossible.","Internet users say: \"Ah, yes yes yes, you're so right, we'll just play with these things ourselves.\"","\"That's right, you still think you're Foreigners, we just won't play with you, die mad about it, bleh bleh bleh.\"","These sarcastic comments were relayed back, triggering overseas internet users.","The overseas AI labs are currently the most advanced internationally.","All the researchers are top talents who have studied AI and holographics for over 10 years.","Previously at international conferences.","They were always the star attractions.","Their papers alone could indicate the direction of AI development.","They held a very high position in international scientific research.","But now all the members of this AI lab have submitted their resumes to China.","It's like the gods descending to China.","Even domestic researchers trembled when they saw the list of names.","They're all top experts in the field.","The kind of people who can make the whole AI circle shake with a stomp of their foot.","How could these people be coming here, is this a joke?","They couldn't help but clean their glasses several times, still in shock.","They don't know what they're thinking.","They made some phone calls to make contact.","They heard the other side say: \"We're very interested in your country's holographic development, we've researched for over ten years but haven't cracked this fully immersive technology, we want to know how you've done it. To show our sincerity, we're willing to relocate our lab to your country. We can collaborate on development!\"","Their research field benefits all of humanity, no matter which country they work for.","The things they've researched for over 10 years, many patented technologies.","In this field, apart from full immersion, they're far ahead.","But the problem they couldn't solve after much thought, the Eastern superpower has solved. Just this alone is enough to make them scratch their heads in bewilderment.","These people immediately received high-level attention from China.","After all, in many scientific research fields, there are still areas that depend on them.","So it was a perfect match.","Thus the entire AI research group resigned and went to China.","This caused a huge shock overseas.","The foreign countries even tried to strictly control them.","But these people were determined to leave.","After a full six months of struggle, they finally made the arduous journey to China.","They experienced it deeply for themselves.","Everyone's voices were full of disbelief.","It can actually simulate to this degree, even the feeling of the fishing rod being pulled in the fishing game is exactly the same.","Even the fishy smell on the water's surface, pulling up the rod, the fish's struggle, it's all the same.","It's so realistic, if you don't use the right force, the crafty fish will fall back into the water.","Or when unhooking the fish, the tail slapping their face, that stinging pain. And the slimy smell from the fish tail is the same.","They're so curious how it was done.","Many international friends said their decision to come to China was impulsive and foolish, but after deeply experiencing their holographic game pods they feel it was so worth it.","They want to devote their lives to China's scientific research.","So they all signed confidentiality agreements.","The agreements are for 20 years.","Foreign countries have always blocked our technology, hearing this news almost made them spit blood in anger.","They even labeled this behavior as treason.","But the holographic game pods are too alluring.","When this news was reposted by public accounts online, the whole country was laughing with joy.","With their joining, AI in various fields and the Internet of Everything will become a reality.","It's exciting just thinking about it.","But while many people are excited, they all want to play. They're urging for the second batch to go online quickly.","They want to play so badly.","Finally, an official announcement came out: \"We're working overtime to produce them, but the order demand is too high, to avoid disappointing everyone again by not having enough stock for the second release, we've decided to accumulate enough stock before releasing together.\"","\"IDs that bought before are restricted and can't buy again.\"","Many people expressed dissatisfaction: \"Can't you release some first for us to play for a few days?\"","\"Don't complain, last time the programmers were scolded terribly, this time they don't even dare to go online!\"","Just at this moment, suddenly a piece of insider information quickly rose to the top of the trending topics: \"The country's only holographic game pod internet cafe is about to open, called Starry Sky Internet Cafe, 100 yuan for half an hour. Those who couldn't buy one can go there to experience it.\"","Starry Sky Internet Cafe?","Hearing this name, everyone's hearts tightened, another day of being dominated by Starry Sky.","Is it true or false?","Soon, everyone went to find various channels to inquire.","The new district leader's phone rang non-stop from 8 am to 5 pm.","Repeating over and over: \"It's true!\"","Indeed, a windfall of fortune has descended on their new district.","Now it's hard to get even one machine.","Many Tycoons who couldn't buy want to pay a premium, but there's no channel for this.","They can't even buy one, let alone buy multiple to open an internet cafe!","Only Shen Wei has this capability.","Shen Wei submitted the blueprints, making a huge contribution.","This time the authorities specially approved 100 units for them, given to Shen Wei.","The business license was specially approved by the new district.","It was all settled at one window.","100 yuan for half an hour, that's 200 yuan an hour, it sounds very expensive.","But these people have been teased for a full six months.","Every day someone says: this game is so much fun.","But the 138,000 is still difficult for many people.","However, 100 yuan to experience for half an hour, this is doable.","So after inquiring.","They began to eagerly wait for the internet cafe to open.","100 machines, only Shen Wei could be so wealthy and generous.","Fully self-service booking on the mini program. Pay online, come play directly with the verification code.","Shen Wei didn't advertise the opening of the internet cafe, but netizens promoted it voluntarily.","There were even internet celebrities livestreaming outside.","Many of those who came to experience it had never played before.","When they finished and came out, everyone was still in a daze.","An internet celebrity interviewed people outside: \"How was it? Was it fun?\"","\"It was fun! So much fun. I'll definitely buy one next time.\"","Half an hour was only enough to play one game. There were twenty games inside, and people were eager to experience them all.","The internet cafe was packed every day.","Other internet cafes looked on enviously.","These days, every household has a computer.","The term \"internet cafe\" had almost become a relic of the past.","But Shen Wei's Family's internet cafe was different! They had gaming pods.","Other internet cafes wanted to follow suit, even if they couldn't have many, just one or two to attract customers would be fine, but they couldn't buy any.","They could only watch helplessly as the Starry Sky Internet Cafe made money.","They couldn't help but recall that classic phrase online: \"Just be grateful that those things are Starry Sky's side business, otherwise, none of us would survive.\"","Now: They finally understood what it meant, and it was terrifying!"]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275: Extra 6: Final Chapter","paragraphs":["Shen Wei's days were always packed full with various activities.","It had been a long time since she had heard any news about Shen Qingqing.","This time, the news came because Shen Qingqing's parents had gone to Shen Wei's parents to apologize and admit their mistakes.","The two families had long since fallen out.","Shen Qingqing thought she was above everyone else after getting involved with Boss Lu.","Who would have thought their noisy relationship would end up like this?","Now Shen Qingqing had gone insane.","She was being treated in a mental hospital.","The Shen family was completely out of money.","Their house had been mortgaged due to failed investments.","Their savings were gone too.","Their only daughter had gone mad.","They wanted to find Lu Zheng, but couldn't locate him at all.","Boss Lu hated their family to death.","The old couple had no choice but to rent a place.","They ended up begging Shen Wei's parents for help.","Now Shen Wei was in high demand, donating large sums to charity each year.","Moreover, they were relatives.","So Shen Qingqing's parents came, crying and sniveling, describing their hardships.","But Shen Wei's parents showed no sympathy: \"You weren't saying this when you were doing well. It's too late for regrets now.\"","Shen Qingqing's mother said, \"Could you ask Shen Wei to visit her? This child went astray because of her strong jealousy. Her last wish is for Shen Wei to see her!\"","She even knelt down before Shen Wei's parents as she spoke.","When Shen Wei learned of this, she thought about it and decided to go.","She never expected that someone as strong and shameless as Shen Qingqing would go insane!","When Gu Qingyan found out Shen Wei was going to visit Shen Qingqing, he became nervous, fearing that the madwoman might do something harmful to Shen Wei.","He insisted on accompanying her, no matter what.","But when they arrived at the psychiatric ward, they discovered Shen Qingqing's hands and feet were restrained to the bed.","The doctor nearby explained, \"This patient has violent tendencies. We can only restrain her like this for two hours at a time.\"","Indeed, when Shen Qingqing saw Shen Wei, her eyes widened, and she made guttural sounds, as if she wanted to devour Shen Wei's flesh.","Just the sight of her was particularly repulsive.","But no matter how much Shen Qingqing struggled, she couldn't break free.","Finally, Shen Qingqing said, \"Make them all leave. I have something to say to you!\"","Shen Wei agreed.","After all, she was restrained and couldn't do anything.","After everyone left, Shen Wei said, \"What do you want to say?\"","Shen Qingqing looked at Shen Wei. Though she wore no jewelry, her demeanor was her best adornment.","Shen Qingqing's eyes were full of intense resentment: \"It shouldn't be like this. You should be dead. Everything your family owns should be mine. Lu Zheng and I should be living happily together.\"","Shen Wei suddenly realized that this person might have been reborn.","Shen Qingqing was talking about the plot from the original story.","But her rebirth at this point was truly devastating.","Her lover had nothing.","While Shen Wei's Starry Sky Kindergarten was thriving.","Shen Qingqing was locked up in a mental hospital for violent behavior.","She was even restrained to prevent self-harm or harming others.","Lying on the bed without dignity, looking up at others.","Shen Wei said, \"Too bad, that's not the case. Stop dreaming. Sucking other people's blood and flesh to nourish yourself, how are you any different from a leech?\"","Shen Qingqing's pupils suddenly constricted: \"You've been reborn too, haven't you? That's why things are like this!\"","\"I don't know what you're talking about. Your misery is of your own making.\"","If she hadn't caused trouble, it wouldn't have come to this.","After all, Lu Zheng still had some romantic notions.","He had even broken ties with his family for Shen Qingqing.","Unfortunately, she acted like a madwoman.","When Shen Wei opened a kindergarten, she had to open one too.","When Shen Wei opened a pop-up store, she opened a game center.","After repeated failures, she and Lu Zheng kept fighting, pulling each other's hair. They became a laughingstock in the upper-class world.","Later, she even angered Lu Zheng's father to death.","Completely cutting off Lu Zheng's path back to his wealthy family.","Obviously, Shen Qingqing knew all of this. But her demeanor became even more frenzied: \"It's not true. Qin Shu is my man. He helps me return to high society, helps me do business, helps me make a lot of money. Did you steal everything from me?\"","Her voice grew louder and louder.","Shen Wei called for the doctor. The doctor looked at her with furrowed brows and said, \"She's developed schizophrenia!\" The doctor administered a sedative.","Shen Qingqing unwillingly fell into a slumber. Her last words were still: \"I'm Mrs. Lu, I'm a wealthy daughter-in-law! You're all dead, all the property is mine. It's all mine...\"","Shen Wei left the room.","Gu Qingyan was waiting just outside the door. He quickly grabbed Shen Wei's hand, afraid she might have been frightened by the madwoman.","Gu Qingyan's handsome face said, \"I'll protect you. Don't come see this person who drove herself mad again.\"","Shen Wei nodded, \"It's all in the past now.\"","Shen Wei reflected on how cruel fate had been to Shen Qingqing.","Allowing her to be reborn only to witness everything she had turn to ruins.","However, all of this was her own doing.","Shen Wei walked out of the mental hospital's main entrance, moving forward. There was light ahead, and the person she loved by her side.","Everything was just right."]}]);
